�脢id�fd6bed9f70dd�body�ٜ内镜把微型摄像头送入消化道，直接观察黏膜、取活检，并可在早期发现息肉或肿瘤，是筛查消化道疾病的重要手段。ٓEndoscopes carry a tiny camera into the gut to view the lining, take biopsies and catch polyps or tumors early - key tools for digestive screening.�ans��src��.美国胃肠内镜学会（ASGE）《内镜》�AAmerican Society for Gastrointestinal Endoscopy (ASGE): Endoscopy��id�med_24_009�body���有科学依据。2020年发表于Nature的小鼠研究证实,应激使交感神经过度激活,释放的大量去甲肾上腺素会促使毛囊隆突部的黑色素干细胞异常增殖并流失,干细胞库耗竭后,新长出的毛发就永久失去颜色。人类的急性应激同样可能影响毛发色素,所谓「一夜白头」部分是黑发集中脱落、白发显出来的视觉效果。��There is solid evidence. A mouse study in Nature in 2020 showed that stress overactivates the sympathetic nervous system, and the surge of norepinephrine pushes melanocyte stem cells in the hair-follicle bulge into abnormal proliferation and depletion; once that reserve is spent, newly grown fur stays unpigmented. Acute stress appears capable of influencing human hair pigment too, while overnight whitening partly reflects pigmented hairs selectively falling out and revealing white ones.�ans��src��tZhang B等论文《Hyperactivation of Sympathetic Nerves Drives Depletion of Melanocyte Stem Cells》,Nature,2020年�mZhang B et al., Hyperactivation of Sympathetic Nerves Drives Depletion of Melanocyte Stem Cells, Nature, 2020��id�med_26_010�body���关键在于两种技术感知水分状态的方式不同。脑血管闭塞后数分钟内,缺血细胞能量耗竭发生细胞毒性水肿,水分子扩散受限,在DWI序列上立即呈高亮信号,数小时即可勾勒出梗死核心;CT依赖组织密度差异,超早期梗死区密度尚未改变,常需24小时左右才显影。因此DWI承担超早期定性诊断并支撑溶栓取栓决策,CT则主要负责快速排除脑出血。�$The difference comes down to how each modality senses water. Within minutes of vessel occlusion, ischemic cells exhaust their energy supply and develop cytotoxic edema that restricts water diffusion, so the infarct core turns bright on DWI almost immediately and becomes delineated within hours. CT depends on density differences that barely change at onset, often needing around twenty-four hours to become visible. DWI thus anchors hyperacute diagnosis and reperfusion decisions, while CT mainly serves rapid exclusion of intracranial hemorrhage.�ans��src��YOsborn AG专著《Osborn's Brain: Imaging, Pathology, and Anatomy》第2版,Elsevier 2017�[Osborn's Brain: Imaging, Pathology, and Anatomy, 2nd edition, Anne G. Osborn, Elsevier 2017��id�1ff1291f82a0�body�ٽ严格对照研究并未发现糖直接导致多动；家长的预期和聚会环境等更易造成“看起来更兴奋”的偏差。当然，限制添加糖对长期健康仍有必要。ٸControlled studies don't show sugar directly causes hyperactivity; parental expectation and party settings bias the impression. Limiting added sugar is still wise for long-term health.�ans��src��_《默克家庭医学手册》Merck Manual Home Health Handbook 中译版,人民卫生出版社�8The Merck Manual Home Health Handbook, Chinese ed., PMPH��id�257d06ca87e6�body���ACE 抑制剂阻断把血管紧张素 I 转为强缩血管物质血管紧张素 II 的酶；ARB 则直接阻断血管紧张素 II 与受体结合。二者都舒张血管、减轻心脏负担，但作用环节不同。��ACE inhibitors block the enzyme converting angiotensin I to the vessel-constricting angiotensin II; ARBs block angiotensin II from binding its receptor. Both dilate vessels and ease the heart's load, but at different steps.�ans��src��B王庭槐 主编,《生理学》第9版,人民卫生出版社,2018�OWang Tinghuai ed., Physiology, 9th ed., People's Medical Publishing House, 2018��id�369eb9b67cfe�body���在完全无菌环境中长大的动物缺乏菌群，常出现免疫发育不全和肠道异常，证明微生物组对正常发育不可或缺；这类研究帮助理清菌群的因果作用。��Animals raised germ-free lack a microbiome and often show impaired immune development and gut abnormalities, proving the microbiome is essential for normal development; such studies help establish causal roles.�ans��src��E葛均波 等主编,《内科学》第9版,人民卫生出版社,2018�<Ge Junbo et al. eds., Internal Medicine, 9th ed., PMPH, 2018��id�6d735ade490d�body�ٴ反刍是反复纠缠负面想法的循环，会放大抑郁和焦虑。打断方法包括把注意力拉回当下感官、转为具体行动，或限定一个“担忧时段”。ٷRumination is looping on negative thoughts, amplifying depression and anxiety. Break it by grounding attention to senses, switching to concrete action, or scheduling a 'worry window'.�ans��src��L李凌江 陆林 主编,《精神病学》第3版,人民卫生出版社,2015�=Li Lingjiang and Lu Lin eds., Psychiatry, 3rd ed., PMPH, 2015��id�7600609c7649�body���自噬是细胞用膜把受损蛋白和老旧细胞器包裹成“自噬体”并送到溶酶体降解回收的过程，像内部的保洁系统；它参与抗衰老、抗感染和代谢调控。��Autophagy wraps damaged proteins and old organelles in membranes (autophagosomes) and sends them to lysosomes for breakdown and recycling—an internal cleanup system involved in aging, infection defense, and metabolism.�ans��src��B王庭槐 主编,《生理学》第9版,人民卫生出版社,2018�OWang Tinghuai ed., Physiology, 9th ed., People's Medical Publishing House, 2018��id�7cb8a580edf3�body���阿尔茨海默病大脑中 β-淀粉样蛋白异常聚集形成斑块，可能触发 tau 蛋白缠结和神经元死亡；但“淀粉样蛋白假说”仍在被修正，淀粉样变只是复杂拼图的一块。��In Alzheimer's, abnormal β-amyloid clumps into plaques that may trigger tau tangles and neuronal death; but the “amyloid hypothesis” is being refined, and amyloid is just one piece of a complex puzzle.�ans��src��B王庭槐 主编,《生理学》第9版,人民卫生出版社,2018�OWang Tinghuai ed., Physiology, 9th ed., People's Medical Publishing House, 2018��id�83b2832e8410�body�ٜ肠道菌群发酵膳食纤维产生短链脂肪酸（如丁酸），可滋养肠道细胞、调节免疫和减轻炎症，并与代谢和脑健康相关。ٱGut bacteria ferment fiber into short-chain fatty acids (e.g., butyrate) that nourish colon cells, tune immunity, and reduce inflammation, linking to metabolic and brain health.�ans��src��E葛均波 等主编,《内科学》第9版,人民卫生出版社,2018�<Ge Junbo et al. eds., Internal Medicine, 9th ed., PMPH, 2018��id�a3cd891cc892�body���iPSC 是把成年体细胞“重编程”回类似胚胎干细胞的状态，能再分化为多种细胞。它绕开了胚胎干细胞的伦理争议，并可用于个体化药物测试和疾病建模。ٸiPSCs are adult cells reprogrammed to an embryo-like state, able to become many cell types. They avoid embryo ethics concerns and enable personalized drug testing and disease modeling.�ans��src��zTakahashi 与 Yamanaka《诱导多能干细胞》(Cell, 2006)；Yamanaka《iPS 细胞》(Nobel Lecture, 2012)；美国 NIH�}Takahashi & Yamanaka, 'Induction of pluripotent stem cells' (Cell, 2006); Yamanaka, 'iPS cells' (Nobel Lecture, 2012); US NIH��id�d7cc470f0e6f�body���FMT 把健康捐赠者的粪便菌群移植到患者肠道，主要用于复发性艰难梭菌感染，能重建被抗生素破坏的菌群；其他用途仍在研究，且需严格筛查供体。��FMT transfers stool microbes from a healthy donor into a patient's gut, mainly for recurrent Clostridioides difficile infection, restoring flora wrecked by antibiotics; other uses are experimental and donors are rigorously screened.�ans��src��E葛均波 等主编,《内科学》第9版,人民卫生出版社,2018�<Ge Junbo et al. eds., Internal Medicine, 9th ed., PMPH, 2018��id�med_26_007�body���这说明血管炎症本身是动脉粥样硬化的独立干预靶点,降脂并非唯一路径。IL-1β经斑块内NLRP3炎症小体激活后释放,维持慢性血管炎症并使斑块易损;卡纳单抗阻断该通路后,高敏C反应蛋白显著下降,复合终点事件明显减少,而血脂水平保持不变。CANTOS为炎症假说提供了人体级证据,也推动了心肌梗死后残余炎症风险评估的发展。�<It demonstrated that vascular inflammation is an independent therapeutic target in atherosclerosis, with lipid lowering not the only route. Interleukin-1 beta is released upon NLRP3 inflammasome activation inside plaques, sustaining chronic vascular inflammation and making plaques vulnerable. Blocking this pathway markedly lowered high-sensitivity CRP and reduced the composite endpoint while cholesterol remained unchanged. CANTOS delivered human evidence for the inflammation hypothesis and spurred assessment of residual inflammatory risk after myocardial infarction.�ans��src�ِRidker PM等论文《Antiinflammatory Therapy with Canakinumab for Atherosclerotic Disease》,New England Journal of Medicine 2017(CANTOS研究)نRidker PM et al., Antiinflammatory Therapy with Canakinumab for Atherosclerotic Disease (CANTOS), New England Journal of Medicine 2017��id�med_26_014�body���关键在于各自的最大杀菌参数与抗生素后效应不同。β内酰胺类几乎无PAE,疗效取决于游离药物浓度超过MIC的时间占给药间隔的比例(fT>MIC),通常需40%以上,延长滴注或加密给药最有效;氨基糖苷类为浓度依赖性,杀菌速度随Cmax/MIC升高而加快且有较长PAE,单次足量给药维持高峰值,谷浓度回落期还能降低肾耳毒性,管理策略据此制定优化方案。�The key is which parameter predicts killing best and how strong the post-antibiotic effect is. Beta-lactams show almost no PAE, so efficacy tracks the fraction of the dosing interval with free drug above the MIC (fT>MIC, usually 40% or more), favoring prolonged infusions or shorter intervals. Aminoglycosides are concentration-dependent: killing accelerates as Cmax/MIC rises and a sustained PAE lets one large daily dose hold peaks high while low troughs limit nephrotoxicity and ototoxicity - the basis of stewardship dosing strategies.�ans��src�٫Craig WA论文《Pharmacokinetic/Pharmacodynamic Parameters: Rationale for Antibacterial Dosing of Mice and Men》,Clinical Infectious Diseases 1998年(威斯康星大学)ٰCraig WA, 'Pharmacokinetic/Pharmacodynamic Parameters: Rationale for Antibacterial Dosing of Mice and Men', Clinical Infectious Diseases, 1998 (University of Wisconsin-Madison)��id�med_26_018�body��因为两类病原触发的细胞因子环境对该基因的开关作用相反。细菌内毒素及IL-1β、TNF-α、IL-6等因子诱导肺、肠、脂肪等甲状腺外组织表达CALC-1基因，大量释放降钙素原；病毒感染以干扰素应答为主，IFN-γ直接阻断这条转录通路，故PCT几乎不升。加之其半衰期约一天、感染控制后迅速回落，医生可依据降钙素原动力学判断感染类型并指导停药，随机对照试验已证明这样能安全缩短抗菌疗程。��Because the cytokine environments the two pathogen classes create switch the same gene in opposite directions. Bacterial endotoxin together with interleukin-1 beta, TNF-alpha and IL-6 drives extra-thyroid tissues such as lung, gut and fat to express CALC-1 and release abundant procalcitonin, whereas the interferon-dominated antiviral response - chiefly IFN-gamma - directly blocks that transcription, keeping levels flat. With a half-life near twenty-four hours and a swift fall once infection is controlled, procalcitonin dynamics let clinicians judge infection type and guide cessation; randomized trials show this safely shortens antibiotic courses.�ans��src�ٶBecker 等,《Procalcitonin assay in systemic inflammation, infection, and sepsis: Clinical utility and limitations》,Critical Care Medicine,2008 (DOI: 10.1097/ccm.0b013e318165babb)ٷBecker et al., 'Procalcitonin assay in systemic inflammation, infection, and sepsis: Clinical utility and limitations', Critical Care Medicine, 2008, DOI: 10.1097/ccm.0b013e318165babb��id�82cbcdf9fbc1�body�ٷ一些研究发现肥胖者的菌群组成与瘦者不同，特定菌群可影响能量提取和炎症；但因果复杂，菌群只是众多因素之一，并非“胖瘦开关”。��Some studies link distinct microbiome compositions to obesity, with certain microbes affecting energy harvest and inflammation; but causality is complex, and the microbiome is one factor among many, not a simple on/off switch.�ans��src��E葛均波 等主编,《内科学》第9版,人民卫生出版社,2018�<Ge Junbo et al. eds., Internal Medicine, 9th ed., PMPH, 2018��id�9b54b9053df9�body���这类疫苗把肿瘤特有的“新抗原”对应的 mRNA 注入体内，训练免疫系统识别并攻击表达这些抗原的癌细胞；目前多用于黑色素瘤等恶性肿瘤的个性化辅助治疗。��These vaccines inject mRNA encoding tumor-specific “neoantigens” so the immune system learns to recognize and attack cancer cells carrying them; they are studied mainly as personalized adjunct therapy in cancers like melanoma.�ans��src���Karikó、Weissman 等《RNA 修饰抑制 Toll 样受体激活》(Immunity, 2005)；Pardi、Weissman 等《mRNA 疫苗》(Nature Reviews Drug Discovery, 2018)；美国 CDC《新冠 mRNA 疫苗》��Karikó, Weissman et al., 'Suppression of RNA recognition by Toll-like receptors' (Immunity, 2005); Pardi, Hogan, Porter & Weissman, 'mRNA vaccines' (Nature Reviews Drug Discovery, 2018); US CDC, 'mRNA COVID-19 Vaccines'��id�df8045620f5a�body�٭One Health 强调人、动物和环境的健康相互关联，主张跨领域合作防控传染病、抗生素耐药和食品安全，因为许多威胁源自三者交界。��One Health recognizes that human, animal, and environmental health are linked, advocating cross-sector cooperation on infectious disease, antibiotic resistance, and food safety, since many threats emerge at their interface.�ans��src��_《默克家庭医学手册》Merck Manual Home Health Handbook 中译版,人民卫生出版社�8The Merck Manual Home Health Handbook, Chinese ed., PMPH��id�0131b3dde54b�body���正常工作时相线流出的电流应完全经零线返回，两者矢量和为零。漏电保护器把相线和零线一起穿过一个电流互感器，一旦有电流经人体或潮湿墙体流入大地，两线电流不再相等，互感器就检出这个差值。差值超过约三十毫安时脱扣机构在几十毫秒内切断电源，避免电流引起心脏纤维性颤动。��In normal operation all current leaving through the live wire returns through the neutral, so their vector sum is zero. A residual current device passes both conductors through one current transformer, and if some current escapes to earth through a person or damp wall the two no longer match and the transformer detects the difference. When the imbalance exceeds about thirty milliamps the trip mechanism cuts power within tens of milliseconds, before the current can cause heart fibrillation.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�02d9aba12be6�body�ٷROS（机器人操作系统）不是真正操作系统，而是一套用于机器人开发的通信框架与工具库，提供话题、服务、硬件抽象等，便于模块复用。٠ROS (Robot Operating System) is a middleware and toolset, not a true OS, offering topics, services and hardware abstraction that ease modular robot development.�ans��src��=Quigley 等《ROS：开源机器人操作系统》(2009/2014)�GQuigley et al., ROS: The Open-Source Robot Operating System (2009/2014)��id�034ace96e931�body���依次是进气（吸入空气燃油混合气）、压缩（活塞上行使混合气受压）、做功（火花点燃膨胀推动活塞）、排气（排出废气）。曲轴每两圈完成一个循环，四个步骤各占半圈。ٺThey are intake (draw in air–fuel), compression (squeeze it), power (spark ignites and expansion drives the piston), and exhaust (push out gases). The crankshaft turns twice per cycle.�ans��src��Heywood，《内燃机基础》�2Heywood, 'Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals'��id�03a8eac3405a�body���反馈控制不断测量实际温度并与设定值比较，用差值去调节加热器或空调，使温度回到目标附近。因为依据结果修正，所以能抵消干扰、保持稳态。پFeedback control keeps measuring the actual temperature against the setpoint and uses the error to adjust the heater or cooler, holding the target. Correcting by result rejects disturbances.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�04826fc716eb�body�ٽ梁桥是最简单的桥型，由平直的梁横跨在两岸桥墩上承受荷载。车辆重量通过梁传到桥墩再进入地基。它适用于中小跨度，施工简单、造价低。�A beam bridge is the simplest type, with a straight beam spanning between piers or abutments to carry loads. The weight of traffic passes through the beam to the piers and then into the ground. It suits small to medium spans and is cheap and simple to build.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�08ace81b106b�body���长城是中国古代为防御北方游牧民族而修建的连续军事工程，总长超过两万公里。它因地制宜用土、石、砖砌筑，含关隘、烽火台。今天主要是明代遗存。�The Great Wall is a continuous military fortification built in ancient China to defend against northern nomads, over 20,000 km in total length. It used local earth, stone, and brick with passes and beacon towers. What remains today is mainly from the Ming dynasty.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�090e9a9fca87�body�ٽ一类藏有微胶囊，破裂时流出修复剂在裂缝处固化；另一类用可逆化学键，受热或光照就能重新接上断键。像皮肤结痂一样，把损伤自动补上。��One type hides microcapsules that release healing agent to solidify in the crack; another uses reversible bonds that re-link under heat or light. Like skin scabbing, damage is mended automatically.�ans��src��dWhite 等，《聚合物复合材料的自主愈合》，《自然》409卷，794–797页（2001）�VWhite et al., 'Autonomous healing of polymer composites,' Nature 409, 794–797 (2001)��id�094ad656f3da�body��P启动瞬间转子静止，没有反电动势，绕组上只有很小的阻抗限制电流，起动电流可达额定值的五到七倍。这会造成电网电压跌落、开关跳闸和机械冲击。工程上采用星三角切换、自耦降压启动、软启动器或变频器逐步升压升频，把电流限制在可接受范围。��At the instant of starting the rotor is still, there is no back-EMF, and only the small winding impedance limits current, so inrush can reach five to seven times rated current. This causes grid voltage dips, tripped breakers and mechanical shock. Engineers use star-delta switching, autotransformer starting, soft starters or variable-frequency drives that ramp voltage and frequency up gradually to keep current within acceptable limits.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�0c0d4f85fd1d�body��G协作机器人和人共享工作空间，没有围栏保护，唯一的安全屏障是自身的功率与力限制。相关安全规范给出了人体不同部位可承受的压力与力阈值，机器人必须把速度、力矩和接触面压强控制在阈值以内。这也是协作臂通常负载小、动作慢的原因。��Collaborative robots share workspace with people without fences, so their own power and force limits are the only safety barrier. Safety standards specify pressure and force thresholds that different parts of the human body can tolerate, and the robot must keep speed, torque and contact pressure below them. This is why collaborative arms usually have modest payloads and move slowly.�ans��src��_ISO 10218-1《机器人与机器人装备 工业机器人安全要求 第1部分：机器人》�jISO 10218-1, 'Robots and robotic devices — Safety requirements for industrial robots — Part 1: Robots'��id�0c78e03963e5�body���面板里的半导体（通常是硅）吸收光子后把电子激发出来，形成可被导线收集的电流，这就是光伏发电。阳光越强、照到的面积越大，发出的电就越多。��The panel's semiconductor (usually silicon) absorbs photons that free electrons, forming a current collectable by wires—photovoltaic generation. More sunlight and area mean more electricity.�ans��src��@Luque & Hegedus，《光伏科学与技术手册》（第2版）�MLuque & Hegedus, 'Handbook of Photovoltaic Science and Engineering' (2nd ed.)��id�0cd676284d10�body�ٺ吹入的空气把氧气送进水里，让好氧微生物活起来，它们靠吃掉污水中的有机物来净化水质。氧气不足时这些细菌会死亡，处理效果就变差。ٳThe bubbled air dissolves oxygen so aerobic microbes stay alive and eat the organic pollutants, cleaning the water. Without enough oxygen those bacteria die and treatment worsens.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�0d8b9bceb20d�body���直流电方向和大小基本不变，电池就是直流；交流电的方向和大小周期性反转，家用插座就是交流。交流易于用变压器升降压、远距离输电更经济，所以电网普遍用交流。��DC flows in one steady direction, as from batteries; AC reverses direction periodically, as in wall outlets. AC is easily stepped up or down by transformers and is cheaper to transmit far, so grids use AC.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�0e1d03b448a8�body�ٓCAD负责设计零件的三维模型，CAM则把模型转换成刀具路径和加工指令，二者衔接实现设计即制造的自动化流程。�CAD models the part; CAM converts that model into toolpaths and machine instructions, linking design directly to manufacturing.�ans��src��<Kalpakjian《制造工程与技术》；CAD/CAM（Groover）�GKalpakjian, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; CAD/CAM (Groover)��id�111a0d8c1df5�body�ي多为注塑：把塑料粒加热熔化射进钢模，冷却定型后开模顶出；模具决定形状，可大批量、低成本复制。�zInjection molding melts pellets, injects them into a steel mold, cools, and ejects the part, great for cheap mass copying.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�114b63046d14�body�ٻ兵马俑是秦始皇陵陪葬的陶制军队，约八千件真人大小的俑，各面容不同。它们用模具与手塑结合烧成，原本有彩绘。1974年被农民打井发现。�The Terracotta Warriors are a pottery army buried with Qin Shi Huang's mausoleum, about 8,000 life-size figures each with a different face. Made by combining molds and hand shaping then fired, they were originally painted. They were found in 1974 by farmers digging a well.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�11f33fa4b7ef�body���地铁是建在城市地下、按班次运行的大运量轨道交通，由电力驱动、专用线路独立运行。它不占地面道路，能缓解城市拥堵。车厢无人驾驶或司机驾驶均可。��A subway, or metro, is a high-capacity rail transit built mainly underground in cities, running on dedicated tracks powered by electricity. It does not use surface roads and helps relieve urban congestion. Trains may be driver-operated or driverless.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�122fecfb964f�body�٨摩擦力是两个接触表面相对运动或试图相对运动时产生的阻力。摩擦既会浪费能量并造成磨损，也能帮助汽车刹车和人们行走。��Friction is the resistance that arises when two surfaces are in contact and move or try to move relative to each other. Friction both wastes energy and causes wear, yet it also enables car braking and human walking.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�13bbbddf9fc5�body�ٙ它通过改变四个电机转速差产生俯仰、横滚、偏航和升降；对角螺旋桨反向旋转以抵消反扭矩，靠转速差实现偏航。٭It varies the four motor speeds to produce pitch, roll, yaw and thrust; diagonally opposite rotors spin opposite ways to cancel torque, and yaw comes from speed differences.�ans��src��1Seddon《直升机空气动力学基础》；NASA�+Seddon, Basic Helicopter Aerodynamics; NASA��id�14f7d5dbda24�body���碳足迹是一个人、产品或活动在整个生命周期中直接和间接排放的温室气体总量，通常用二氧化碳当量表示。它能帮助比较不同选择对气候的影响。ٻA carbon footprint is the total greenhouse gases emitted directly and indirectly by a person, product, or activity, usually in CO2 equivalents, helping compare climate impacts of choices.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�164cbb00e311�body��l约11.2 km/s，是物体摆脱地球引力束缚、飞离地球所需的最小速度，也称逃逸速度。�cAbout 11.2 km/s, the minimum speed to escape Earth's gravity entirely, also called escape velocity.�ans��src��SBate, Mueller & White《天体力学基础》；NASA 轨道力学；开普勒定律�[Bate, Mueller & White, Fundamentals of Astrodynamics; NASA orbital mechanics; Kepler's laws��id�168f28dd7c82�body�م数控机床主要用G代码（G-code）控制刀具的运动轨迹、转速与进给，由CAM软件根据零件模型自动生成。ًCNC machines are mainly driven by G-code, which sets toolpath, spindle speed and feed, usually generated by CAM software from a part model.�ans��src��,ISO 6983（G 代码，RS-274）；CNC 编程�*ISO 6983 (G-code, RS-274); CNC programming��id�169bd06808af�body�ٴ水力发电用水库高处的水落下推动水轮机发电，是最成熟的可再生能源。它能快速调峰，配合风光互补。但建坝会淹没土地并影响生态。�Hydroelectric power lets water from a high reservoir fall and spin a turbine to generate electricity; it is the most mature renewable source. It can ramp up quickly for peak shaving and pairs well with wind and solar. But dams flood land and affect ecology.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�16b4dc8b91df�body���焊接通过加热（或加压）使连接处金属局部熔化并冷却成一体，形成接近母材强度的永久接头；胶粘和螺栓是可拆或局部连接，强度与密封性通常不如焊接。٭Welding melts and fuses the joint into one piece for a near-parent-strength permanent bond; adhesive and bolts are removable or partial joins, usually weaker or less sealed.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�179857d131f8�body��n电传操纵把驾驶杆位移变成电信号，由飞控计算机解算后驱动作动器，中间没有沉重的钢索和滑轮，减重且布线灵活。计算机可以在指令中加入包线保护、自动配平和阵风减缓，让飞行员不易把飞机操纵到危险状态。代价是必须有多重冗余通道和软件适航验证，避免单点失效。��Fly-by-wire converts stick movement into electrical signals that a flight control computer interprets before driving the actuators, removing heavy cables and pulleys and saving weight while easing routing. The computer can add envelope protection, automatic trim and gust alleviation so the pilot cannot easily take the aircraft into a dangerous state. The price is multiple redundant channels and rigorous software certification to eliminate single-point failures.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�185ebc30b3a2�body��M数字输入引脚如果什么都不接，电位是不确定的，容易被干扰而随机翻转。上拉电阻把引脚经过一个较大阻值连到电源，默认为高电平；下拉电阻连到地，默认为低电平。按键按下时把引脚拉到另一端，就能得到确定的高低变化，同时电阻限制了电流。�xA digital input pin left unconnected sits at an undefined potential and can flip randomly from noise. A pull-up resistor ties the pin to the supply through a fairly large resistance so it defaults high, while a pull-down ties it to ground so it defaults low. Pressing a button pulls the pin to the other rail, giving a definite transition, and the resistor limits the current.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�18f7d1e16087�body�ٮ地基是建筑物底部把荷载传递到土层或岩层的承重结构。稳固的地基能防止房屋下沉、倾斜或开裂，是保障建筑安全的第一道防线。��A foundation is the bottom structure of a building that transfers its loads to the soil or rock beneath. A solid foundation prevents settling, tilting, or cracking and is the first line of defense for a building's safety.�ans��src��8Das《土力学与基础工程》；ACI/API 桩基规范�JDas, Principles of Geotechnical Engineering; ACI/API pile foundation codes��id�1982e50a5db5�body��x无砟轨道平顺性好、沉降小、几乎免维护，才能满足350公里时速对平顺与稳定的严苛要求。ٌBallastless track is smoother, settles less and needs almost no maintenance—essential for the strict smoothness and stability at 350 km/h.�ans��src��;UIC Code 720；中国《高速铁路设计规范》TB 10621�=UIC Code 720; China High-Speed Railway Design Code (TB 10621)��id�1a8d41aaa899�body��{细长流线型降低空气阻力，并削弱进出隧道产生的压缩波（微压波噪声），更安静也更省电。فThe long streamlined nose cuts drag and tames the compression wave (micro-pressure wave) at tunnels—quieter and more efficient.�ans��src��2Anderson《空气动力学基础》；流动控制�4Anderson, Fundamentals of Aerodynamics; flow control��id�1ae732108022�body�ٖ它把平滑路面变成突起，车轮压过时车体和悬挂被迫快速起伏，乘员不适促使驾驶者减速；本质是用冲击劝你慢。�~The bump forces the suspension to jolt, making riders uncomfortable so drivers slow down; it trades comfort for speed control.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�1be1c93eae7c�body���电子电路最容易稳定地区分两种状态（如高/低电平、通/断），用二进制只需处理『是/否』两种信号，抗干扰强、制造简单，所以所有数据最终都编码成0和1。ٰCircuits most reliably tell two states apart (high/low, on/off); binary needs only yes/no signals—robust against noise and simple to build—so all data ends up as 0s and 1s.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�1c8af06ae315�body���松开油门或踩下刹车时，控制器让驱动电机进入发电状态，车轮拖着转子旋转，电机产生的反电动势通过逆变器整流后给电池充电。发电所需的机械功率表现为阻碍车轮转动的制动力矩，于是减速与充电同时完成。低速时回收效率下降，且回收力矩有限，因此仍需机械制动配合并做协调控制。��When the driver lifts off or brakes, the controller puts the traction motor into generating mode; the wheels drive the rotor and the resulting back-EMF is rectified through the inverter to charge the battery. The mechanical power needed to generate appears as a braking torque opposing wheel rotation, so deceleration and charging happen together. Recovery efficiency falls at low speed and the available torque is limited, so friction brakes must still be blended in by a coordinated control strategy.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�1ca6e7dbd189�body���机器人是一种能够感知环境、根据程序做出决策并自动执行任务的机器。它由传感器、控制器和执行机构组成，可用于制造、医疗和家庭等许多领域。��A robot is a machine that can sense its environment, make decisions by program, and automatically carry out tasks. It is made of sensors, a controller, and actuators, and is used in manufacturing, medicine, and homes.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�1cc7616f093d�body�ٮ不锈钢含铬，铬在空气中与氧反应在表面形成一层极薄且致密的氧化铬保护膜，把内部金属和水分、氧气隔开，从而阻止继续腐蚀。ٟStainless steel contains chromium, which forms a thin, dense chromium-oxide film in air that seals the metal from water and oxygen, stopping further corrosion.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�1cfcd5716c77�body�ٿ开模具要先设计加工钢模，往往几周几万块；3D打印直接按电脑图一层层堆出来，几小时就能拿到实物。改个形状也只需改文件，不用重做模具。ټA mold needs design and steel machining—often weeks and tens of thousands of dollars; 3D printing stacks the part from a file in hours. Changing a shape only edits the file, no new mold.�ans��src��@Gibson、Rosen & Stucker，《增材制造技术》（第2版）�HGibson, Rosen & Stucker, 'Additive Manufacturing Technologies' (2nd ed.)��id�1df2a6b0b56b�body�٨拱把上面的压力顺着曲线传向两侧基石，主要产生压力而不是弯曲，而石头和砖最擅长抗压，所以拱能跨越大跨度而不易折断。ٴAn arch routes the load down its curve to the supports as compression, and stone or brick resist compression far better than bending, so arches span wide openings without breaking.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�1f09297a5761�body���承重墙是承受楼板、屋顶等上方重量的墙体，是建筑结构的一部分。它不能随意拆改，否则会削弱整体稳定性甚至引发坍塌。装修前必须确认墙体是否为承重结构。�8A load-bearing wall is a wall that supports the weight of floors, roofs, and other loads above it as part of the building structure. It must not be removed or altered carelessly, or the building's stability can be compromised and collapse may occur. Always confirm whether a wall is structural before renovation.�ans��src��b中国《混凝土结构设计规范》GB 50010；《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009；ACI 318�nChina Code for Design of Concrete Structures (GB 50010); Load Code for Building Structures (GB 50009); ACI 318��id�209f32d6bfb6�body���陶瓷是用黏土等无机物经高温烧结成的硬脆材料，耐高温、耐磨、绝缘。传统用于砖瓦器皿，先进陶瓷用于切削工具和航天隔热。缺点是脆、抗冲击差。�1Ceramic is a hard, brittle material made by firing clay and other inorganic substances at high temperature; it is heat-resistant, wear-resistant, and insulating. Traditional uses are bricks and tableware, while advanced ceramics serve cutting tools and aerospace heat shields. Its drawback is brittleness.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�21766d4d5cde�body�ٍ汗液和尿液被再生为饮用水，电解水供氧，二氧化碳经萨巴蒂尔反应还原成水和甲烷，闭环率高、补给少。ٿSweat and urine are recycled into drinking water; electrolysis makes oxygen; CO2 is reduced via the Sabatier reaction back into water and methane. The loop is highly closed, cutting resupply.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�26e47a142f9b�body�ٍ天然漏斗形洼地省去大量挖填土方，喀斯特透水减少积水，且当地偏远电磁环境宁静，利于接收微弱信号。ّThe natural funnel shape saves huge earthworks, karst drains well to avoid pooling, and the remote area is radio-quiet—ideal for faint signals.�ans��src��9Nan 等《中国科学》2006 / 国家天文台（NAOC）�ONan et al., Science in China (2006); National Astronomical Observatories (NAOC)��id�2a7ea40dced9�body��S低轨卫星每绕地球一圈就有三分之一左右时间进入地球阴影，太阳能板发不出电。这段时间由蓄电池供电，出影后太阳能板一边供电一边给电池充电。因此电池的充放电循环次数极多，寿命设计和热控是关键，深空探测器距离太阳太远时则改用同位素电源。��A low-orbit satellite spends roughly a third of each orbit in Earth's shadow, where its solar arrays produce nothing. Batteries carry the load during that period, and once back in sunlight the arrays both power the spacecraft and recharge the batteries. The batteries therefore endure a very large number of charge-discharge cycles, making life design and thermal control critical, while deep-space probes too far from the Sun use radioisotope power instead.�ans��src��+Clarke 1945（地球静止轨道）；Wertz�AClarke (1945, geostationary orbit); Wertz, Space Mission Analysis��id�2babf468c4b3�body�ٍ高速列车车厢密封保压，开窗会破坏气密、引发强风噪声和耳压不适，甚至危及行车安全，所以固定密封。�zSealed coaches maintain pressure; opening windows would break airtightness, cause noise and ear pressure, and risk safety.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�2e2a16cdd652�body�ٮ水加热到一百度变成蒸汽跑掉，而食盐的沸点远高于水，常温下是固体颗粒，不会汽化。所以蒸汽冷凝后基本是纯水，盐留在锅里。��Water turns to vapor at 100 degrees C and leaves, but salt's boiling point is far higher and it stays solid at room temperature, so it doesn't vaporize. The condensed steam is nearly pure water; the salt remains in the pot.�ans��src��AMcCabe、Smith & Harriott，《化工单元操作》（第7版）�MMcCabe, Smith & Harriott, 'Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering' (7th ed.)��id�300af2c44b13�body���让电流通过一片半导体薄片，若有垂直的磁场穿过，运动电荷受洛伦兹力偏转，会在薄片侧面积累电荷形成横向电压，这就是霍尔电压，其大小与磁场强度成正比。在转轴上装磁钢，传感器每转过一次就输出一个脉冲，数脉冲即得转速。它无接触、无磨损，广泛用于无刷电机换相、车速检测和电流钳。��When current flows through a thin semiconductor plate and a magnetic field passes through it perpendicularly, the Lorentz force deflects the moving charges so charge piles up on the sides, creating a transverse Hall voltage proportional to field strength. Fitting a magnet to a shaft makes the sensor emit one pulse per revolution, and counting pulses gives speed. Being contactless and wear-free, it is widely used for brushless motor commutation, vehicle speed sensing and clamp current meters.�ans��src��<Streetman & Banerjee，《固态电子器件》（第7版）�@Streetman & Banerjee, 'Solid State Electronic Devices' (7th ed.)��id�30b41106d943�body�ٽ发动机通常指将燃料燃烧产生的热能转化为机械能的内燃机。电动机则是把电能转化为旋转运动的装置，没有燃烧过程，结构更简单也更安静。��An engine usually refers to an internal combustion engine that converts the heat from burning fuel into mechanical work. A motor, by contrast, converts electrical energy into rotary motion and has no combustion, making it simpler and quieter.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�31782a71392c�body��V那是静电放电刷。飞机在云中和空气摩擦会积累大量静电，若从机身尖端随机放电，会在无线电频段产生噪声，干扰通信和导航。放电刷用许多细小尖端把电荷平稳地释放到空气中，让电流走可控路径。它并不能防雷击，防雷靠的是机身导电壳体和搭接设计。��They are static discharge wicks. Flying through cloud and air builds up considerable static charge, and random discharge from a sharp airframe edge creates radio-band noise that disturbs communication and navigation. The wicks use many fine points to bleed the charge smoothly into the air along a controlled path. They do not protect against lightning; that relies on the conductive airframe shell and bonding design.�ans��src��2Anderson《空气动力学基础》；流动控制�4Anderson, Fundamentals of Aerodynamics; flow control��id�32c96b3d7c97�body���执行机构接收控制器的指令，直接对受控对象施加动作，比如电动机、阀门和液压缸。它把微弱的控制信号变成实际的力或运动，是控制的“手脚”。��An actuator receives commands from the controller and acts directly on the controlled object, such as motors, valves, and hydraulic cylinders. It turns weak control signals into real force or motion, the hands and feet of control.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�34e4c1673c11�body���早期工厂控制全靠继电器接线实现逻辑，电气工程师熟悉的是触点串并联的电路图。PLC取代继电器柜时，为了让这些工程师无需重新学习，就把程序画成两条电源轨之间的横向梯级，用常开常闭触点和线圈符号表示逻辑。这种表示直观、易于现场排查，因此至今仍是工业界主流编程语言之一。��Early factory control implemented logic entirely with wired relays, and electrical engineers were fluent in diagrams of series and parallel contacts. When PLCs replaced relay cabinets, programs were drawn as horizontal rungs between two power rails using normally-open and normally-closed contact and coil symbols so those engineers needed no retraining. The notation is intuitive and easy to troubleshoot on the floor, which is why it remains one of the mainstream industrial programming languages.�ans��src��VIEC 61131-3（PLC）；ISO 3691-4（AGV 安全）；Groover《自动化生产系统》�zIEC 61131-3 (PLC); ISO 3691-4 (AGV safety); Groover, Automation, Production Systems, and Computer-Integrated Manufacturing��id�37a675ceba9d�body��数字孪生是物理对象在电脑里的实时动态镜像，靠传感器不断喂入真实数据来校准和更新，而传统仿真多是一次性的理想化计算。孪生体因而能反映设备当前的真实健康状态，而不只是理论表现。��A digital twin is a live, dynamic mirror of a physical object, continuously calibrated by sensor data, whereas a traditional simulation is usually a one-off idealized calculation. The twin thus reflects the asset's real current state, not just theory.�ans��src��SGrieves，《数字孪生：通过虚拟工厂复制实现制造卓越》（2014）�\Grieves, 'Digital Twin: Manufacturing Excellence through Virtual Factory Replication' (2014)��id�389cbbdeff97�body�٥它把物联网、信息物理系统（CPS）与智能工厂结合，让设备、产品和系统互联并自主决策，实现定制化、柔性化的高效生产。٢It links IoT, cyber-physical systems and smart factories so machines, products and systems interconnect and self-decide, enabling flexible, customized production.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�3a4475aa9100�body���变压器利用电磁感应，通过两个匝数不同的线圈来升高或降低交流电的电压。输入线圈和输出线圈的匝数比决定了电压变化的倍数，变压器几乎不消耗能量。�A transformer uses electromagnetic induction through two coils of different turn counts to raise or lower alternating voltage. The ratio of turns between the input and output coils determines the voltage change, and the device itself wastes almost no energy.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�3a9146affe2c�body���轴承支撑旋转或直线运动部件，把滑动摩擦变为滚动摩擦，显著降低摩擦与磨损，让轴能平稳、低阻力地转动。常见有滚动轴承和滑动轴承两类。پBearings support rotating or moving parts and turn sliding friction into rolling friction, cutting resistance and wear so shafts spin smoothly. Common types are rolling and sliding bearings.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�3e1d8b8833f1�body�ٮ铸造是把熔融金属倒入模具型腔，冷却凝固后获得零件的方法。它适合形状复杂、大尺寸或批量大的件，如发动机缸体和齿轮毛坯。٢Casting pours molten metal into a mold cavity and lets it solidify into a part. It suits complex, large, or high-volume shapes like engine blocks and gear blanks.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�3e8514aa9b60�body�٢铸造是把熔融金属倒入模具冷却成型的方法，能做出复杂形状。常见有砂型铸造和压铸。发动机缸体和井盖多用铸造生产。��Casting pours molten metal into a mold and lets it cool into shape, able to make complex forms. Common methods are sand casting and die casting. Engine blocks and manhole covers are often cast.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�3f5072dd1bda�body���赵州桥是中国隋朝李春建造的石拱桥，距今约1400年，是世界上现存最古老的敞肩石拱桥。它在主拱两侧开小拱以减轻重量并泄洪。其结构至今仍基本完好。�The Zhaozhou Bridge is a stone arch bridge built by Li Chun in China's Sui dynasty about 1,400 years ago, and is the world's oldest surviving open-spandrel stone arch bridge. Small side arches lighten the weight and help discharge floodwater. Its structure remains largely intact today.�ans��src��jLehner《完整的金字塔》；Jackson 等《PNAS》2013（罗马混凝土）；中国《赵州桥志》�cLehner, The Complete Pyramids; Jackson et al., PNAS (2013, Roman concrete); Zhaozhou Bridge Records��id�415877683ffe�body�ف火灾可能断电困人，电梯井像烟囱把烟和热快速抽上去；应使用防烟楼梯间下行，电梯留给救援。�oFire may cut power and trap people, and shafts act like chimneys for smoke; use smoke-protected stairs instead.�ans��src��ENFPA 101《生命安全规范》；ASME A17.1《电梯安全规范》�5NFPA 101, Life Safety Code; ASME A17.1, Elevator Code��id�41cf0d106021�body���变压器利用电磁感应：原边线圈的交变电流产生交变磁场，穿过副边线圈感应出电压。匝数多的线圈电压高，匝数少的电压低，因此可实现升压或降压而不改变频率。��A transformer uses electromagnetic induction: alternating current in the primary makes a changing magnetic field that induces voltage in the secondary. More turns means higher voltage, stepping up or down without changing frequency.�ans��src��TAlexander & Sadiku,《电路基础》(Fundamentals of Electric Circuits),McGraw-Hill�BAlexander & Sadiku, Fundamentals of Electric Circuits, McGraw-Hill��id�427d8843ca2d�body���PM2.5是空气中直径不超过2.5微米的细颗粒物，能深入肺部甚至进入血液，关联哮喘、心肺疾病。它来自燃烧、扬尘和二次反应生成，是空气质量核心指标。��PM2.5 are fine particles up to 2.5 micrometers that penetrate deep into lungs and blood, linked to asthma and heart/lung disease. From combustion, dust, and reactions, it is a key air-quality metric.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�42a592cea1f9�body���金字塔是古埃及法老的巨型石砌陵墓，以胡夫金字塔最大，约230万块巨石堆成。其底面方正、对准方位极为精确。它展现了古代惊人的组织与运输能力。��Pyramids are giant stone tombs of Egyptian pharaohs, the largest being Khufu's, built from about 2.3 million blocks. Its base is square and aligned with remarkable precision. It shows ancient organizational and transport prowess.�ans��src��jLehner《完整的金字塔》；Jackson 等《PNAS》2013（罗马混凝土）；中国《赵州桥志》�cLehner, The Complete Pyramids; Jackson et al., PNAS (2013, Roman concrete); Zhaozhou Bridge Records��id�4587c1354f6b�body�ٴ核能来自原子核裂变时释放的巨大能量，一座反应堆控制裂变速度产生热能。这些热把水变成蒸汽推动汽轮机发电，且不排放二氧化碳。��Nuclear energy comes from the huge energy released when atomic nuclei split, and a reactor controls the fission rate to produce heat. The heat turns water into steam that drives a turbine to generate electricity, with no carbon dioxide emissions.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�4621ca8d9e75�body��G电子皮肤是把柔性压力、温度、接近觉传感单元阵列做在可弯曲基底上，像皮肤一样覆盖机器人表面。它让机器人知道自己身体哪里被碰到、力有多大，从而实现全身避碰和更安全的人机接触。难点在于大面积布线、耐磨以及海量信号的实时处理。��Electronic skin is an array of flexible pressure, temperature and proximity sensing cells built on a bendable substrate that covers a robot's surface like real skin. It tells the robot where on its body it is being touched and how hard, enabling whole-body collision avoidance and safer physical contact with people. The challenges are wiring large areas, surviving wear, and processing a huge number of signals in real time.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�4665667eb325�body���几十亿晶体管挤在指甲盖大小里，功耗变成大量热，温度一高漏电流飙升、会自动降频甚至烧毁。散热片、风扇和液冷就是把这团热带走，保住性能和寿命。��Tens of billions of transistors pack into a fingernail, turning power into heat; high temperature spikes leakage, triggers throttling or burnout. Heatsinks, fans and liquid cooling carry that heat away to protect performance and life.�ans��src��.Incropera，《传热学基础》（第7版）�=Incropera, 'Fundamentals of Heat and Mass Transfer' (7th ed.)��id�491d4a28f1fd�body��航空煤油在管道和过滤器中高速流动会产生静电，油罐车、软管与飞机之间的电位可能相差上千伏，若在加油口附近放电，那里恰好可能处于油气可燃浓度范围，极易点燃。搭接线把飞机与加油设备（必要时还有地面）连成等电位，让电荷沿导线缓慢均衡而不是以火花方式释放。规范还要求限制加油流速、允许使用静电消散添加剂，并在过滤器下游留出足够的静置时间，以降低电荷积累。�=Jet fuel flowing fast through pipes and filters generates static charge, so tanker, hose and aircraft can differ by thousands of volts, and a spark near the filler port sits exactly where fuel vapour may be within its flammable range. A bonding cable ties aircraft and fuelling equipment, plus ground where required, to the same potential so charge equalizes slowly through the conductor instead of jumping as a spark. Standards additionally limit flow velocity, permit static-dissipator additives and require relaxation time downstream of filters to limit charge build-up.�ans��src��2NFPA 407《Standard for Aircraft Fuel Servicing》�0NFPA 407, 'Standard for Aircraft Fuel Servicing'��id�49462a3b68d1�body���地球内部的热量加热地下水和岩石，可通过钻井抽取高温蒸汽或热水直接供暖，或推动汽轮机发电。它稳定可靠、不受天气影响，但受地质条件限制。پEarth's internal heat warms underground water and rock; wells draw hot steam or water for direct heating or to spin turbines for power. It is steady and weather-independent but site-limited.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�49a539a5592e�body��2钢罐是铁磁材料，机器人在轮子或履带中嵌入永磁体，靠磁力把自身压在壁面上，摩擦力便足以支撑重量。它带着超声测厚探头爬行，可以在不搭脚手架的情况下检查腐蚀和减薄。设计时要平衡吸力和行走阻力，吸力太大会爬不动。��Steel tanks are ferromagnetic, so the robot embeds permanent magnets in its wheels or tracks; magnetic attraction presses it against the wall and the resulting friction carries its weight. Carrying an ultrasonic thickness probe, it crawls over the surface to check corrosion and wall thinning without erecting scaffolding. Designers must balance holding force against rolling resistance, since too much attraction stops the robot from moving.�ans��src��O磁吸附爬壁机器人（《Robotics and Autonomous Systems》）；ISO 10218�SMagnetic-adhesion wall-climbing robots (Robotics and Autonomous Systems); ISO 10218��id�49d55a2e0a64�body���光耦内部一侧是发光二极管，另一侧是光敏三极管或光敏管，两者之间只有透明绝缘材料，没有电气连接。输入电流点亮LED，光穿过绝缘层被接收管转换成电流，信号就传过去了，而两侧的地可以完全独立。这样能承受数千伏的隔离电压，常用于工业输入输出、开关电源反馈和高压侧驱动。��Inside an optocoupler an LED faces a phototransistor or photodiode across nothing but transparent insulating material, with no electrical connection between them. Input current lights the LED, the light crosses the insulator and the receiver turns it back into current, so the signal passes while the two grounds stay completely separate. Such devices withstand thousands of volts of isolation and are common in industrial I/O, switching-supply feedback and high-side gate drive.�ans��src��U王兆安 刘进军 主编,《电力电子技术》第5版,机械工业出版社,2009�VWang Zhaoan and Liu Jinjun eds., Power Electronics, 5th ed., China Machine Press, 2009��id�4e1c0a4826ce�body��8飞机机翼上表面弯曲、下表面较平，气流经过时机翼上方流速更快、压强更低，从而产生向上的升力。更准确地说，机翼的迎角与环量使气流被向下偏转，根据牛顿第三定律产生反作用升力；当升力超过飞机重力时，飞机就能离地升空。�tAn airplane wing is curved on top and flatter below, so air moves faster over the top and creates lower pressure there, producing upward lift. More precisely, the wing's angle of attack and the circulation around it deflect the airflow downward; by Newton's third law this produces a reaction force. When lift exceeds the plane's weight, the aircraft can leave the ground.�ans��src��WAnderson《空气动力学基础》（Fundamentals of Aerodynamics）第5版,Wiley,2017�FJ. D. Anderson Jr., Fundamentals of Aerodynamics, 5th ed., Wiley, 2017��id�4ef236eb75e5�body�ٽ城市地下管线密、土层松，明挖或先做竖井再暗挖能先支护好四周再往下走，避免塌方影响地面楼和路。深坑像给隧道先做个安全的“盒子”。��Urban underground is full of pipes and loose soil; cut-and-cover or shaft mining lets workers brace the sides before going down, avoiding collapses that would hurt surface buildings and roads. The deep pit is a safe 'box' for the tunnel.�ans��src��A美国陆军工程兵团，EM 1110-2-2502《挡土与防洪墙》�GUS Army Corps of Engineers, 'EM 1110-2-2502, Retaining and Flood Walls'��id�544fde139585�body���3D 打印是一层一层把材料堆起来的增材制造，不需要模具或刀具切削。只要电脑模型画得出来，悬空、镂空、内部通道等复杂结构都能直接成型，传统工艺很难做到。��3D printing is additive, laying material layer by layer without molds or cutting tools. Any shape in the digital model—overhangs, hollows, internal channels—can be formed directly, which is hard for traditional methods.�ans��src��@Gibson、Rosen & Stucker，《增材制造技术》（第2版）�HGibson, Rosen & Stucker, 'Additive Manufacturing Technologies' (2nd ed.)��id�5b306acd85d9�body�ٖ大坝把水抬高，放水时高处的水冲下带动水轮机旋转，水轮机连着发电机就发出电，相当于把水的落差变成电能。وA dam raises water, and as it falls it spins a turbine connected to a generator, turning the water's height difference into electricity.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�5c245741510e�body�٫自行车刹车靠刹车块压紧车轮边缘或碟盘，借助摩擦力把滚动的动能转化为热能耗散。捏紧把手力越大，摩擦力越大，减速越快。ٺA bicycle brake presses pads against the wheel rim or disc, using friction to turn rolling kinetic energy into heat. Squeezing the lever harder raises friction and slows the bike faster.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�5d499ca7ce5a�body��S巡航高度的气压只有地面的四分之一左右，直接呼吸会缺氧。座舱把发动机压缩来的空气增压，使舱内相当于海拔两千米上下的气压，乘客可正常呼吸。舱内外压差会让机身承受循环载荷，所以机身按增压次数计算疲劳寿命，并设有多个泄压活门保护结构。��At cruise altitude the outside pressure is only about a quarter of sea level, too little to breathe safely. The cabin is pressurised with air compressed by the engines so that conditions inside correspond to roughly two thousand metres of altitude, which passengers tolerate normally. The pressure difference loads the fuselage cyclically, so its fatigue life is counted in pressurisation cycles and several relief valves protect the structure.�ans��src��}Anderson，《Fundamentals of Aerodynamics》（第6版）；FAA《Airplane Flying Handbook》(FAA-H-8083-3C) 高空运行章�|Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.); FAA 'Airplane Flying Handbook' (FAA-H-8083-3C), high-altitude operations��id�5edb66898321�body���地基承载力是地基土单位面积能安全承受的最大压力。超过它，建筑会不均匀下沉甚至失稳，所以设计前必须通过勘察确定土层能承受多大重量。ٶBearing capacity is the maximum pressure the soil can safely support per unit area. Exceeding it causes uneven settlement or failure, so engineers must test the ground before design.�ans��src��8Das《土力学与基础工程》；ACI/API 桩基规范�JDas, Principles of Geotechnical Engineering; ACI/API pile foundation codes��id�65f9ebaaac5f�body�ِ它是安装在机械臂最前端的手，如两指夹爪、真空吸盘、焊枪或喷涂头，决定了机器人能完成什么具体操作。ـIt is the hand at an arm's tip, such as a gripper, suction cup, welder or spray head, and determines what task the robot can do.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�66293b27fca1�body�ٴ可编程逻辑控制器（PLC）是工业现场的实时控制计算机，读取传感器与按钮信号，按梯形图等程序驱动电机、阀门，抗干扰、稳定可靠。٥A programmable logic controller reads sensors and buttons and drives motors and valves per a program (e.g., ladder logic), rugged and reliable for real-time control.�ans��src��/IEC 61131-3（可编程控制器编程语言）�'IEC 61131-3 (PLC programming languages)��id�6649483c1023�body���合金是由两种或两种以上金属（或金属与非金属）熔合而成的材料，性能往往优于纯金属。例如黄铜是铜和锌的合金，不锈钢是含铁、铬、镍的合金。�␀An alloy is a material made by combining two or more metals, or a metal with a non-metal, usually by melting together, and its properties often beat pure metals. Brass is an alloy of copper and zinc, and stainless steel contains iron, chromium, and nickel.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�669e2f6a2ac9�body�ٴ排水系统是收集并排除雨水、污水等废水的管网设施，防止地面积水和环境污染。它包含管道、检查井、泵站和污水处理厂等组成部分。��A drainage system is a network that collects and removes wastewater such as rainwater and sewage, preventing surface flooding and pollution. It includes pipes, manholes, pumping stations, and treatment plants.�ans��src��&《室外排水设计标准》GB 50014�,Code for Design of Outdoor Drainage GB 50014��id�6748819b3052�body���一种是用电总功率过大或线路短路，电流超过额定值，由空气开关的热元件和电磁元件动作断开，保护电线不过热起火。另一种是漏电，电流经人体或绝缘破损处流走，由漏电保护器检测相零电流差动作，保护人身安全。此外还有过压欠压保护模块。分清跳的是哪一路，才能判断是插座过载还是电器绝缘出了问题。�AOne cause is excessive total load or a short circuit driving current above the rating, which the thermal and magnetic elements of the miniature circuit breaker detect, opening the circuit so the wiring cannot overheat and ignite. Another is earth leakage, where current escapes through a person or damaged insulation, detected as an imbalance between live and neutral by a residual current device that protects people. Some panels add over- and under-voltage modules. Noting which device tripped tells you whether a socket is overloaded or an appliance's insulation has failed.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�676a7c38a5bd�body��\那是铁氧体磁环，套住电缆后对线束里同向流动的共模高频电流呈现较大阻抗，而对一去一回的差模信号影响很小。它相当于给共模噪声串了个高频电阻，抑制电缆当天线向外辐射，也阻挡外界噪声灌入。因为只在高频起作用，它不会影响正常的数据或电源传输。��It is a ferrite core, and clamping it around a cable presents high impedance to common-mode high-frequency current flowing the same way in all conductors while barely affecting the differential signal that goes out and back. In effect it adds a high-frequency resistance to common-mode noise, stopping the cable from radiating like an antenna and blocking external noise from entering. Because it only acts at high frequency it does not disturb normal data or power transmission.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�681dda49342e�body���环岛是车辆绕中央岛逆时针（靠右行驶地区）环行、让行合流的小广场式路口。它比红绿灯连续通行、事故率较低。进入车辆需让行环道内车辆。��A roundabout is a circular intersection where vehicles go around a central island and yield when merging. It flows more continuously and has fewer accidents than signalized junctions. Entering drivers must yield to those already in the circle.�ans��src��wB. W. Robinson 等《Roundabouts: An Informational Guide》（FHWA-RD-00-067），美国联邦公路管理局，2000年�pB. W. Robinson et al., Roundabouts: An Informational Guide, FHWA-RD-00-067, Federal Highway Administration, 2000��id�689b4f78af12�body�ٴ交通信号灯用红、黄、绿三种颜色指挥车辆和行人有序通行，避免路口冲突。它通过分时放行不同方向，显著提高道路安全和通行效率。��A traffic light uses red, yellow, and green to direct vehicles and pedestrians in an orderly way and avoid conflicts at intersections. By giving different directions separate time slots, it greatly improves safety and flow.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�69939185512c�body�ٜ轮子在平地又快又省力，适合厂房和马路；腿能跨过台阶、石头和不平地面，适合救灾或野外，但控制更难、更费电。��Wheels are fast and efficient on flat ground, good for factories and roads; legs can step over stairs, rocks and rough terrain for rescue or field use, but are harder to control and cost more energy.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�69a0ebd3376b�body�٘它是一套以数据驱动的质量改进方法，目标是把缺陷率降到每百万次机会不超过3.4次，通过DMAIC流程减少过程波动。ٖSix Sigma is a data-driven quality method aiming for fewer than 3.4 defects per million opportunities, reducing process variation via the DMAIC cycle.�ans��src��^Six Sigma（Pyzdek & Keller）；ISO 9001；机器视觉检测（Davies《Machine Vision》）�YSix Sigma (Pyzdek & Keller); ISO 9001; machine vision inspection (Davies, Machine Vision)��id�6efc88ac0d6c�body�ٷ混凝土是水泥、砂、石子和水拌在一起硬化成的石头状材料，便宜、可塑形、抗压好，能浇成各种形状，所以广泛用于房屋、道路和桥梁。��Concrete is cement, sand, gravel and water mixed into a stone-like mass; it is cheap, moldable and strong in compression, so it is poured into countless shapes for buildings, roads and bridges.�ans��src��/Neville，《混凝土的性能》（第5版）�+Neville, 'Properties of Concrete' (5th ed.)��id�6f1b84089934�body��)高空空气稀薄，同样速度下阻力小得多，发动机耗油率也更低，所以经济性最好。那里通常在对流层顶附近，天气系统和颠簸较少，飞行平稳。再高则空气太稀，发动机推力不足且飞行包线变窄，所以存在一个最佳高度区间。�}Air is thin at high altitude, so drag at the same speed is far lower and the engines burn less fuel, giving the best economy. That level is near the top of the troposphere, where weather systems and turbulence are less frequent, making the ride smooth. Going much higher leaves too little air for engine thrust and narrows the flight envelope, so there is an optimum altitude band.�ans��src��:Anderson《空气动力学基础》；ICAO 巡航高度层�<Anderson, Fundamentals of Aerodynamics; ICAO cruising levels��id�7265f724bede�body�ِ它利用科里奥利力：当微型振动质量随载体旋转时，会产生与角速度成正比的横向力，由电容变化检测出来。ِIt uses the Coriolis effect: a vibrating micro-mass experiences a sideways force proportional to angular rate, detected as a capacitance change.�ans��src��nYazdi, Ayazi, Najafi,《Micromachined inertial sensors》,Proceedings of the IEEE,1998 (DOI: 10.1109/5.704269)�lYazdi, Ayazi, Najafi, 'Micromachined inertial sensors', Proceedings of the IEEE, 1998, DOI: 10.1109/5.704269��id�72ed2fadbc11�body���合金是由两种或多种金属（或金属与非金属）熔合而成的材料，例如钢是铁加碳。通过调配成分，可以比纯金属更硬、更耐腐蚀或更轻，以满足不同用途。��An alloy is a material made by combining two or more metals, or a metal with non-metal, like steel (iron plus carbon). Tuning the mix yields harder, more corrosion-resistant, or lighter materials than pure metals.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�73543336b392�body���电网送来的是方向和大小周期性变化的交流电，而手机电池和内部电路需要方向恒定的直流电才能稳定充放电。充电器里的整流电路先把交流变直流，再降压到合适的电压。��The grid supplies alternating current that reverses direction, but a phone battery and its circuits need steady direct current. The charger rectifies AC to DC, then steps it down to the right voltage.�ans��src��-Nilsson & Riedel，《电路》（第11版）�0Nilsson & Riedel, 'Electric Circuits' (11th ed.)��id�750a35359019�body���卫星以很高的速度绕地球做圆周运动，地球的引力恰好提供它转弯所需的向心力。由于高空空气极其稀薄，几乎没有阻力让卫星慢下来，所以它能长期停留在轨道上。��A satellite moves around Earth at high speed so that Earth's gravity exactly provides the centripetal force needed to curve its path. Because the upper atmosphere is extremely thin, almost no drag slows it down, so it stays in orbit for a long time.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�7a83bc42638c�body�٥先垂直上升是为了尽快穿过稠密、阻力大的低层大气；之后倾斜是为了获得绕地球飞行所需的高速水平方向，最终进入轨道。ٕGoing straight up first quickly clears the dense, drag-heavy lower atmosphere; then it tilts to build the horizontal speed needed to orbit the Earth.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�7a88f3dfc572�body��组件发电量与阳光入射方向和板面法线夹角的余弦成正比，倾角大致取当地纬度时，全年正午前后的入射角最小、年发电量最高。北半球朝正南（南半球朝正北）能让上午与下午的出力曲线对称、峰值最大；朝东或朝西会削掉一部分峰值，但可以把发电挪到早晚用电高峰。若更看重冬季供电，可把倾角调大以迎合冬日太阳高度低的特点，平屋顶还要在倾角与阵列前后遮挡、积灰冲洗和抗风载荷之间折中。�]Output scales with the cosine of the angle between sunlight and the module normal, so a tilt roughly equal to site latitude minimizes that angle around solar noon and maximizes annual yield. Facing true south in the northern hemisphere (true north in the southern) makes the morning and afternoon curve symmetric with the highest peak, while east or west orientations trade peak energy for output shifted toward morning or evening demand. A steeper tilt favours winter generation when the sun is low, and on flat roofs the chosen tilt must also balance inter-row shading, soiling washoff and wind loading.�ans��src��4NREL《PVWatts Calculator》官方技术参考手册�ANREL — 'PVWatts Calculator' official technical reference manual��id�7d5f952a3b48�body�ٮ可再生能源是来自自然界能不断补充的能源，如太阳能、风能、水能和生物质能。它们取用后不会枯竭，且通常比化石燃料更清洁。ٻRenewable energy comes from natural sources that replenish continuously, such as solar, wind, hydro, and biomass. They are not depleted by use and are generally cleaner than fossil fuels.�ans��src��U王兆安 刘进军 主编,《电力电子技术》第5版,机械工业出版社,2009�VWang Zhaoan and Liu Jinjun eds., Power Electronics, 5th ed., China Machine Press, 2009��id�7e7148c7b11c�body��z19世纪园艺师莫尼耶先以水泥裹钢筋做花盆，后推广到楼板管道；现代钢筋混凝土由此起步。ي19th-century gardener Monier first reinforced concrete with iron for planters, then slabs and pipes, launching modern reinforced concrete.�ans��src��8Hennebique 1892 专利；Billington《塔与桥》(1983)�EHennebique patent (1892); Billington, The Tower and the Bridge (1983)��id�7fd50ee36991�body���钢筋混凝土是在混凝土中埋入钢筋，让两种材料取长补短的复合材料。混凝土抗压能力强但抗拉弱，钢筋抗拉能力好，二者结合使构件既能承压又能抗弯。它是现代建筑最常用的结构材料之一。�ZReinforced concrete is a composite material made by embedding steel bars inside concrete so the two materials complement each other. Concrete is strong in compression but weak in tension, while steel excels in tension, so together they resist both bending and compression. It is one of the most common structural materials in modern construction.�ans��src��b中国《混凝土结构设计规范》GB 50010；《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009；ACI 318�nChina Code for Design of Concrete Structures (GB 50010); Load Code for Building Structures (GB 50009); ACI 318��id�80662ce7396c�body�ٙ车进环岛要绕圈慢行、互相礼让，把容易撞车的直角交叉变成温柔的绕行，车速更低、冲突点更少，事故也就更少。ٛDrivers slow and yield while circling, turning harsh right-angle crossings into gentle merges with fewer conflict points and lower speeds, so crashes drop.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�80caac4f3408�body�٢船体是中空的，排开的水重量等于船的重量时就浮着；只要船的平均密度比水小，再重也能浮，就像一块空心铁盒子能漂。٭A ship is hollow, so it displaces water weighing as much as itself and floats; if its average density is less than water, even a heavy hull stays up, like a hollow iron box.�ans��src��.Tupper，《船舶原理导论》（第5版）�6Tupper, 'Introduction to Naval Architecture' (5th ed.)��id�820b36e2fa8d�body���斜拉桥用一排斜拉的钢索把桥面直接拉在塔柱上，钢索像扇骨一样展开。它比悬索桥更适合中等到大跨度。钢索承受拉力，塔柱受压，整体刚度较好。�A cable-stayed bridge uses a fan of steel cables running directly from towers to the deck to hold it up. It fits medium to long spans better than many other types. The cables carry tension while the towers take compression, giving the bridge good stiffness.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�821d86e93ef4�body���悬索桥的主缆两端锚固、靠巨大桥塔支承，再由吊索挂梁；斜拉桥的拉索一端直接连在桥塔、另一端连梁，力更直接。斜拉桥适合中等大跨，悬索桥适合超大跨。��A suspension bridge hangs the deck from cables slung between towers and anchored at ends; a cable-stayed bridge has stays running directly from tower to deck. Stayed bridges suit medium spans, suspension bridges the longest.�ans��src��QHibbeler《结构分析》；AASHTO 桥梁规范；悬索桥工程（Leonhardt）�fHibbeler, Structural Analysis; AASHTO bridge specifications; suspension bridge engineering (Leonhardt)��id�822bbef5a5a2�body��b开环控制按预定指令动作，不检查结果，比如定时洗衣或按时长烧水，简单便宜但无法应对干扰和参数漂移。闭环控制测量实际输出并与目标比较，用偏差调整控制量，能自动补偿负载变化和外部扰动。代价是需要传感器，还要考虑稳定性问题，反馈过强反而会振荡。�Open-loop control follows a preset command without checking the result, as in washing for a fixed time or heating water for a set duration; it is simple and cheap but cannot cope with disturbances or drifting parameters. Closed-loop control measures the actual output, compares it with the target and adjusts the input based on the error, automatically compensating load changes and external disturbances. The price is the need for sensors and attention to stability, since excessive feedback gain causes oscillation.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�826ebafbe88b�body�ل透水砖和透水基层让雨水直接下渗补给地下水、减少径流和内涝；孔隙堵了需维护，否则也会失效。�{Permeable bricks and base let rain infiltrate, recharging groundwater and cutting runoff; clogged pores must be maintained.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�828cb8404026�body�م机器视觉可100%全检、速度快、标准一致，能发现人眼易漏的微小缺陷，并实时反馈给产线调整工艺。ٝMachine vision inspects 100 percent of parts at speed with consistent criteria, catches tiny defects humans miss, and feeds results back to tune the process.�ans��src��5Groover《自动化生产系统》；ISO 柔性制造�CGroover, Automation, Production Systems; ISO flexible manufacturing��id�83faf5839005�body�ٜ铁和水、氧气一起发生化学反应生成疏松的铁锈，会越烂越大。刷漆、镀锌或涂油能把铁和空气水分隔开，就能防锈。٩Iron reacts with water and oxygen to form flaky rust that keeps spreading; painting, galvanizing with zinc, or oiling blocks contact with air and moisture to prevent it.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�84b1552a9618�body�ي明代常用糯米灰浆（糯米汁混合石灰），粘结力强、抗裂又耐水；再加上选址排水得当，寿命大大延长。٢Ming bricks often used lime mortar tempered with sticky-rice juice—strong, crack-resistant and water-durable. Good siting and drainage also extended their life.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�865a33cd1da1�body�ٷ立交桥让不同方向的车流在不同高度交叉，互不干扰地通行。它用匝道连接各方向，避免平面上红绿灯等待。城市快速路和高速出口常见。��An interchange lets traffic in different directions cross at different heights without interfering. Ramps connect the directions so vehicles need no traffic lights at grade. They are common on urban expressways and highway exits.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�8815ee57dc4b�body�٢可再生能源如阳光、风、水，用不完、会自然补充；不可再生能源如煤、石油、天然气，是几亿年形成的，用一点少一点。ٲRenewable sources like sun, wind and water replenish naturally and won't run out, while non-renewable coal, oil and gas took millions of years to form and deplete as we use them.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�8835c90a1ad7�body��副翼在机翼后缘，左右差动改变升力，使飞机绕纵轴滚转。升降舵在水平尾翼上，控制机头上下俯仰。方向舵在垂直尾翼上，让机头左右偏转。真实转弯通常是副翼滚转加方向舵配合，避免侧滑。�dAilerons sit on the wing trailing edge and move differentially to change lift, rolling the aircraft about its longitudinal axis. The elevator on the horizontal tail controls pitch, raising or lowering the nose. The rudder on the vertical fin yaws the nose left or right. A real turn normally combines aileron roll with coordinated rudder to avoid sideslip.�ans��src��9Anderson《空气动力学基础》；Roskam 飞行力学�@Anderson, Fundamentals of Aerodynamics; Roskam, flight mechanics��id�8942c3733b75�body�٫执行器是把控制信号转化为实际运动的部件，例如马达、液压缸和气动元件。它相当于机器人的“肌肉”，负责真正去完成动作。��An actuator converts control signals into actual motion, such as motors, hydraulic cylinders, and pneumatic elements. It acts like a robot's muscles, responsible for actually performing actions.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�8986afa86f75�body�ٺ混凝土由水泥、砂、石和水拌合后硬化而成，抗压好但抗拉差。它便宜、可塑性强，是用量最大的建筑材料。常配钢筋形成钢筋混凝土使用。��Concrete is made by mixing cement, sand, gravel, and water that hardens; it is strong in compression but weak in tension. It is cheap and highly formable, the most used building material. It is often paired with steel as reinforced concrete.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�89f5a3e7d4d1�body��}量程是传感器能正常测量的最小到最大范围，超出会饱和甚至损坏。精度描述读数与真值的接近程度，通常以满量程的百分比表示，包含线性度、重复性和温漂等误差。分辨率是它能分辨的最小变化量。分辨率高不等于精度高，比如一台仪表可以显示到零点零一度，但整体误差仍有半度。��Range is the span from minimum to maximum that a sensor can measure properly, beyond which it saturates or is damaged. Accuracy describes how close the reading is to the true value, usually expressed as a percentage of full scale and covering linearity, repeatability and thermal drift. Resolution is the smallest change it can distinguish. High resolution does not imply high accuracy: an instrument may display hundredths of a degree while its overall error is still half a degree.�ans��src��0《传感器技术》（机械工业出版社）�,Fraden, Handbook of Modern Sensors, Springer��id�8c71076c869c�body���土木工程是设计、建造和维护基础设施的工程分支，包括道路、桥梁、水坝、供水和建筑物。它直接关系公众安全和日常生活质量，是历史最悠久的工程学科之一。�	Civil engineering is the branch of engineering that designs, builds, and maintains infrastructure such as roads, bridges, dams, water supply, and buildings. It directly affects public safety and daily quality of life and is among the oldest engineering disciplines.�ans��src��L《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012,中国建筑工业出版社,2012�hLoad Code for the Design of Building Structures GB 50009-2012, China Architecture & Building Press, 2012��id�8f504f1257dc�body�ٱ自动控制系统能在没有人持续干预下，根据测量结果自动调节设备以达到设定目标。空调恒温、电饭煲控温都是常见的闭环控制例子。��An automatic control system adjusts a device to a set goal based on measurements, without continuous human intervention. Thermostat air conditioning and rice-cooker temperature control are common closed-loop examples.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�90321e0f9202�body���二极管的核心是 PN 结，其两侧形成耗尽层。正向偏置时耗尽层变窄、电流得以通过；反向偏置时耗尽层变宽、阻挡载流子，因此只在一个方向导通。��The heart of a diode is the PN junction, which forms a depletion region. Forward bias narrows this region so current flows, while reverse bias widens it and blocks carriers, so conduction occurs in only one direction.�ans��src��O电气与电子工程师协会（IEEE）；Neamen《半导体物理与器件》�1IEEE; Neamen, 'Semiconductor Physics and Devices'��id�92e3731a7d21�body�ٱ电阻是导体对电流流动的阻碍作用，单位是欧姆。根据欧姆定律，电压等于电流乘以电阻，电阻越大，在同样电压下通过的电流越小。��Resistance is the opposition a conductor offers to the flow of current, measured in ohms. By Ohm's law, voltage equals current times resistance, so a larger resistance passes less current for the same applied voltage.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�949bc058f963�body��SPWM是脉宽调制，用固定频率的方波，通过改变高电平占整个周期的比例来控制平均输出功率。灯和电机的响应比开关速度慢得多，看到的是平均效果，所以亮度和转速随占空比连续变化。开关管只在通和断两种低损耗状态之间切换，效率远高于用电阻降压。��PWM stands for pulse width modulation: a square wave of fixed frequency whose high-level fraction of each period, the duty cycle, sets the average delivered power. Lamps and motors respond much more slowly than the switching rate, so they see the average, and brightness or speed varies smoothly with duty cycle. The switch only sits in the low-loss on or off states, making it far more efficient than dropping voltage across a resistor.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�96775e34f59d�body���钢是以铁为主、加入少量碳（通常低于2%）的合金，强度高且可焊可锻。它是建筑、汽车和机械最重要的结构材料。按成分可分为碳素钢和合金钢。�Steel is an alloy based on iron with a small amount of carbon, usually under 2%, giving high strength and good weldability and formability. It is the most important structural material for buildings, cars, and machines. It is divided into carbon steel and alloy steel by composition.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�968d96ad3b3e�body�ِ白炽灯靠灯丝发热发光，约九成能量变热；LED用电致发光直接出光、发热少，同样亮度用电更少、寿命更长。�yIncandescents waste about 90% as heat; LEDs emit light directly with little heat, so they use less power and last longer.�ans��src��<Streetman & Banerjee，《固态电子器件》（第7版）�@Streetman & Banerjee, 'Solid State Electronic Devices' (7th ed.)��id�972ad320caa7�body���风力发电用风推动叶片带动发电机转动产生电。风机越高风速越大、效率越高。海上风电因风稳且强而发展很快。风能是增长最快的可再生能源之一。�␀Wind power uses wind to spin blades that drive a generator to make electricity. Taller turbines meet stronger, steadier wind and higher efficiency. Offshore wind is growing fast because of stable, strong winds. Wind is among the fastest-growing renewables.�ans��src��(Burton，《风能手册》（第2版）�(Burton, 'Wind Energy Handbook' (2nd ed.)��id�98040307cf87�body�ٽ音障是飞机接近音速时遇到的空气阻力急剧增大的现象，曾被认为难以突破。现代飞机通过后掠翼和强劲发动机可以超过音速，即超音速飞行。��The sound barrier is the sharp rise in aerodynamic drag an aircraft meets as it approaches the speed of sound, once thought impossible to break. Modern planes with swept wings and powerful engines can exceed the speed of sound in supersonic flight.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�9e59794350d3�body��Y襟翼从机翼后缘向下伸出，增大机翼弯度和有效面积，从而在低速下提供更大升力，同时增加阻力帮助下降。缝翼在前缘打开一道气流通道，把高压气引到上翼面，推迟气流分离，提高可用迎角。二者配合使飞机能以更低的速度安全起飞和着陆，缩短跑道需求。��Flaps extend down and back from the wing trailing edge, increasing camber and effective area so the wing makes more lift at low speed while the extra drag helps the descent. Slats open a slot at the leading edge that channels high-pressure air onto the upper surface, delaying flow separation and raising the usable angle of attack. Together they let the aircraft take off and land safely at lower speed, shortening the runway needed.�ans��src��+Roskam《飞机设计》；FAA 飞行手册�*Roskam, Airplane Design; FAA Flight Manual��id�9ffd6c17e380�body�٫大多数塑料是以石油或天然气为原料，通过化学反应聚合成长链高分子制成的。这种高分子链赋予塑料轻便、可塑和耐腐的特点。��Most plastics are made from petroleum or natural gas through chemical reactions that polymerize long-chain molecules. These polymer chains give plastics their light weight, moldability, and resistance to corrosion.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�a025a5ee16b0�body��>螺旋桨在中低速下推进效率很高，因此涡桨在每小时五六百公里以下比涡扇更省油。但桨尖速度接近声速后效率骤降，限制了它的巡航速度上限。支线航线航程短、爬升下降占比大，速度优势不明显，涡桨的低油耗和短跑道能力反而更划算。��Propellers are very efficient at low and moderate speeds, so a turboprop burns less fuel than a turbofan below roughly five to six hundred kilometres per hour. Efficiency falls sharply once the blade tips approach the speed of sound, which caps cruise speed. On regional routes the legs are short and climb and descent dominate, so speed matters less and the turboprop's low fuel burn and short-field capability win out.�ans��src��3Anderson《空气动力学基础》；Jane's 飞机�GAnderson, Fundamentals of Aerodynamics; Jane's All the World's Aircraft��id�a1bd88048ecf�body�ٴ焊接是用加热或加压把两块金属永久连接在一起的工艺，如电弧焊和激光焊。它比铆接更轻更密封。桥梁、船舶和汽车制造都离不开它。پWelding permanently joins two metal pieces by heat or pressure, such as arc welding and laser welding. It is lighter and more sealed than riveting. Bridges, ships, and cars all depend on it.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�a1d288a9fe6b�body�ٓ地感线圈或雷达、摄像头检测到车辆，系统核对车牌或已缴费后驱动电机抬杆；线圈靠金属扰动、雷达靠回波。�mA loop, radar, or camera detects the car, and the system raises the barrier after verifying payment or plate.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�a4384e123058�body�٨最底下压实土基，往上铺碎石排水承重，再铺沥青或混凝土面层。分层让雨水排走、把重量均匀分散，路才不容易坑洼和塌陷。ٲA compacted soil base, then a stone layer for drainage and support, then asphalt or concrete on top; layers shed water and spread weight so the road resists potholes and sinking.�ans��src��0Huang，《路面分析与设计》（第2版）�/Huang, 'Pavement Analysis and Design' (2nd ed.)��id�a4b3804df062�body�ٖ山顶和山脚有轮子绕着一根钢缆转，缆绳紧紧抓住钢缆被带着走，电机在上方拉绳，所以再陡的坡也能稳稳上下。٧Wheels at top and bottom loop a steel cable, the car grips the cable and is carried along while a motor up top pulls the rope, so even steep slopes are climbed safely.�ans��src��7Vuchic，《城市轨道与公交系统》（第2版）�=Vuchic, V.R., 'Urban Public Transportation Systems' (2nd ed.)��id�a572f4c0a21a�body���悬索桥用主缆悬挂在塔架上，再由吊索把桥面吊起，主缆的两端锚固在地面。它能以较轻的结构跨越很大的距离，是世界上跨度最大的桥型之一。��A suspension bridge hangs its deck from main cables draped over towers, with the cable ends anchored to the ground. It spans very long distances with a relatively light structure and is among the longest bridge types in the world.�ans��src��QHibbeler《结构分析》；AASHTO 桥梁规范；悬索桥工程（Leonhardt）�fHibbeler, Structural Analysis; AASHTO bridge specifications; suspension bridge engineering (Leonhardt)��id�a637fe995621�body�ل触觉传感器检测接触力与压强分布，让机器人知道是否抓稳、用力是否合适，防止滑落或捏碎物体。ٚTactile sensors measure contact force and pressure distribution, telling the robot whether it has a stable, appropriate grip without slipping or crushing.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�a6db6ad8082d�body���无人机可以算作一种飞行机器人，因为它能依靠程序或遥控自动飞行和完成任务。许多现代无人机具备自主导航和避障能力，符合机器人的定义。��A drone can be considered a flying robot because it flies and performs tasks automatically by program or remote control. Many modern drones have autonomous navigation and obstacle avoidance, fitting the definition of a robot.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�aaae8b7a4701�body�ٱ简单机械是最基础的力学装置，用来改变力的大小、方向或作用点。常见的六种简单机械包括杠杆、滑轮、斜面、楔子、螺旋和轮轴。��A simple machine is the most basic mechanical device used to change the magnitude, direction, or point of application of a force. The six classical simple machines are the lever, pulley, inclined plane, wedge, screw, and wheel and axle.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�ac4a6adea8c7�body��D发动机带动主旋翼旋转时，按作用力与反作用力，机身会被反向扭矩推着向另一边转。尾桨产生侧向推力形成反扭矩，把机身按住，同时通过改变桨距控制机头朝向。共轴双旋翼或纵列双旋翼直升机让两副旋翼反向旋转互相抵消，就不需要尾桨。�vWhen the engine spins the main rotor, reaction torque tries to spin the fuselage the other way. The tail rotor produces a sideways thrust that counters this torque and holds the body steady, and varying its pitch also steers the nose. Helicopters with coaxial or tandem rotors turn two rotors in opposite directions so the torques cancel, removing the need for a tail rotor.�ans��src��1Seddon《直升机空气动力学基础》；NASA�+Seddon, Basic Helicopter Aerodynamics; NASA��id�ae5bbb5e9781�body�ي光伏发的是直流电，家里电器用交流，逆变器把直流变成合规交流电并跟踪最大功率点，多余的可上网。�oPanels make DC but homes use AC; the inverter converts it, tracks maximum power, and feeds surplus to the grid.�ans��src��2NREL 光伏系统手册；IEC 62109（逆变器）�/NREL PV systems handbook; IEC 62109 (inverters)��id�af4694bea3ef�body�ٜ圆顶把重量顺着弯曲的表面滑向边缘的墙，不像平顶那样中间要被向下拉弯，所以同样的材料圆顶能撑住更大的面积。ْA dome slides weight along its curve to the edge walls instead of letting the middle sag, so with the same material it can cover more area safely.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�b1f2ed6851d6�body�ٽ轨道交通是车辆在固定钢轨上运行的公共运输方式，包括地铁、轻轨和火车。它运量大、准点、能耗低，是城市和大区域骨干交通的重要形式。��Rail transit is public transport with vehicles running on fixed steel rails, including metro, light rail, and trains. With high capacity, punctuality, and low energy use, it is a backbone of urban and regional transport.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�b2c8b324bb9a�body�ي壶盖下的蒸汽通道把沸腾蒸汽引到双金属片或蒸汽开关，受热变形切断电源；水没开时温度不够不会跳。�eBoiling steam reaches a bimetal or steam switch that bends and cuts power; below boiling it stays on.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�b403b67d02a0�body�ِ机器人重复定位精度高、可连续工作且参数稳定，焊缝质量一致，适合大批量、长焊缝和有害环境下的作业。�}Robots weld with high repeatability and stable parameters, giving consistent seams and suiting high-volume or hazardous work.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�b81477cfe477�body�ٌ它基于以太网提供更高带宽和更快实时性，并可用统一网络承载控制、视频与IT数据，简化工厂网络架构。ٓIt offers higher bandwidth and faster real-time performance over one network carrying control, video and IT data, simplifying factory architecture.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�b9a0ca6639c8�body�ٖ这是杠杆原理：力矩等于力乘以力臂。手柄越长，力臂越大，用同样的力气就能产生更大的旋转力矩来松开螺丝。ٯIt's the lever principle: torque equals force times lever arm. A longer handle gives a bigger lever arm, so the same effort produces more rotational torque to loosen the bolt.�ans��src��7Hibbeler，《工程力学：静力学》（第14版）�5Hibbeler, 'Engineering Mechanics: Statics' (14th ed.)��id�bb06a19c6650�body���不同桥型适合不同跨度和地形：悬索桥用主缆把桥面吊起，适合几百米到上千米的大跨越；拱桥把荷载沿拱压向两侧桥台，适合两岸坚固、中等跨度的山谷或河道。��Bridge types suit different spans and terrain: suspension bridges hang the deck from main cables, great for spans of hundreds to over a thousand meters; arches push loads down the curve to abutments, good for firm banks at medium spans.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�bdc076c16024�body���摩尔定律是戈登·摩尔1965年的观察：单块芯片上的晶体管数约每两年翻一番，推动计算能力指数增长。如今受物理与散热极限制约，这一增速已放缓。��Moore's law is Gordon Moore's 1965 observation that the number of transistors on a chip doubles roughly every two years, driving exponential growth in computing power. It has now slowed due to physical and thermal limits.�ans��src��C电气电子工程师协会（IEEE）；G. Moore《电子学》1965�VIEEE; G. Moore, 'Cramming more components onto integrated circuits,' Electronics, 1965��id�bf736849c7e7�body��w任何高速开关电路都会向外辐射和沿电源线传导电磁噪声，可能干扰收音机、医疗设备甚至航空通信。电磁兼容测试一方面限制产品自身的骚扰发射，另一方面考核它在外界干扰、静电放电和浪涌下能否正常工作。工程手段包括金属屏蔽、滤波器、良好接地和缩小高频电流回路面积。��Any fast-switching circuit radiates electromagnetic noise and conducts it along power lines, potentially disturbing radios, medical equipment or even aviation communication. EMC testing limits the emissions a product makes and also checks that it keeps working under external interference, electrostatic discharge and surges. Engineering fixes include metal shielding, filters, solid grounding and minimising the loop area of high-frequency currents.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�bff22d7f51ff�body�ٜ电池内部发生化学反应，把化学能存起来；接通电路时反应反向进行，电子从一端流到另一端形成电流，电就用掉了。ٮA battery stores energy in chemical reactions; when connected, the reaction runs the other way and electrons flow from one terminal to the other as current, delivering power.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�c056b6c005af�body�ٺ梁是承受横向荷载、主要发生弯曲的细长结构构件，常见于楼层和桥梁。它把屋顶和楼板的重量传递到柱子和墙体，是建筑骨架的重要部分。��A beam is a slender structural member that carries transverse loads and bends, common in floors and bridges. It transfers the weight of roofs and slabs to columns and walls and is a key part of a building's skeleton.�ans��src��L《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012,中国建筑工业出版社,2012�hLoad Code for the Design of Building Structures GB 50009-2012, China Architecture & Building Press, 2012��id�c2119ac4c47d�body�ٽ太阳能光伏用半导体把太阳光直接变成电，常见材料是晶硅。它清洁无噪声，可装在屋顶或沙漠电站。阴天发电会减少，需要储能或并网互补。��Solar PV uses semiconductors, usually crystalline silicon, to turn sunlight directly into electricity. It is clean and quiet and can be mounted on roofs or in desert power plants. Output drops on cloudy days, so storage or grid balancing is needed.�ans��src��@Luque & Hegedus，《光伏科学与技术手册》（第2版）�MLuque & Hegedus, 'Handbook of Photovoltaic Science and Engineering' (2nd ed.)��id�c7071904ed4b�body�ٙ整流罩在发射初期包裹并保护卫星等有效载荷，使其免受气动加热与声振损伤，飞出稠密大气层后抛掉以减轻重量。ٚThe fairing encloses and protects the payload from aerodynamic heating and vibration during ascent, then is jettisoned after leaving the dense atmosphere.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�c802cb406363�body��e保险丝靠一段低熔点金属在过流时熔断，动作快、成本低，但一次性使用，熔断后必须更换。空气开关内部有热双金属片和电磁线圈，分别应对持续过载和瞬时短路，跳闸后可复位重复使用，还能兼作手动开关。在需要极快分断的半导体保护场合，仍然使用快速熔断器。��A fuse works by melting a low-melting-point metal link when current is too high; it acts fast and costs little but is single-use and must be replaced. A circuit breaker contains a thermal bimetal strip and an electromagnetic coil that handle sustained overload and instantaneous short circuit respectively, and it can be reset and reused as well as serving as a manual switch. Where extremely fast interruption is needed to protect semiconductors, fast-acting fuses are still used.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�c905420d8fcc�body�ك线路用大半径曲线并设'超高'（外轨抬高），让离心力被重力的分量抵消，乘客几乎感觉不到侧倾。نGentle curves with 'superelevation' (outer rail raised) let gravity's component balance centrifugal force, so riders feel little sway.�ans��src��LR. C. Hibbeler,《Engineering Mechanics: Statics & Dynamics》Pearson 多版�VR. C. Hibbeler, Engineering Mechanics: Statics and Dynamics, Pearson, various editions��id�c9ac75e94b53�body���剪力墙是建筑中抵抗水平力（如风力和地震）的竖向墙体，常用钢筋混凝土做成。它像一道坚固的挡板，能防止高楼在侧向力下过度晃动和倒塌。��A shear wall is a vertical wall, usually reinforced concrete, that resists horizontal forces like wind and earthquakes. Acting like a stiff shield, it stops tall buildings from swaying or collapsing under lateral loads.�ans��src��L《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012,中国建筑工业出版社,2012�hLoad Code for the Design of Building Structures GB 50009-2012, China Architecture & Building Press, 2012��id�c9e3d127a1e1�body��z自由度指机器人可以独立运动的方向数目。要让末端工具在空间中到达任意位置并保持任意姿态，需要三个位置量加三个姿态量，共六个自由度。六轴机械臂正好满足这一需求，因此成为工业标配。七轴机器人多出的一个自由度用来绕开障碍或避免奇异位形，代价是求解和标定更复杂。��Degrees of freedom means the number of independent directions in which a robot can move. Placing a tool at an arbitrary position in space with an arbitrary orientation requires three position values plus three orientation values, six in total. A six-axis arm meets exactly that need, which is why it is the industrial standard. A seven-axis robot uses the extra freedom to dodge obstacles or avoid singularities, at the cost of harder inverse kinematics and calibration.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�ca0c304bd188�body�ٖ主要原料是二氧化硅砂子，加热到很高温度熔化成液态，再快速冷却不让它结晶，就得到了透明、硬而脆的玻璃。٣The main ingredient is silica sand, heated until it melts, then cooled quickly so it does not crystallize, giving a transparent, hard, brittle solid we call glass.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�ca60d209ee0a�body���急停必须在控制器死机、程序跑飞或通信中断时依然有效，所以不能依赖软件执行。工程上把急停按钮串入安全继电器或安全控制器的硬线回路，直接切断驱动器使能和动力，路径尽可能短。按钮采用常闭触点，断线或接触不良同样会触发停机，这种失效导向安全的设计是安全回路的基本原则。��An emergency stop must still work when the controller crashes, the program misbehaves or communication drops, so it cannot depend on software. In practice the button is wired into the hard-wired circuit of a safety relay or safety controller that directly removes drive enable and power, keeping the path as short as possible. The contacts are normally closed so a broken wire or bad contact also triggers a stop, and this fail-safe orientation is a basic principle of safety circuits.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�cb3507d6d5e9�body��V医生操作主手柄，机器人按设定比例缩小动作幅度，例如手移动一厘米、器械只走两毫米，误差同时被缩小。控制系统还会滤掉生理性手抖的高频成分，并支持远心不动点约束，保证器械绕切口转动。这样在狭小腔体内可以完成更精细、更省力的缝合与分离。��The surgeon moves a master handle and the robot scales the motion down by a set ratio, so a one-centimetre hand movement may become two millimetres at the instrument, shrinking errors along with it. The control system also filters out the high-frequency components of physiological tremor and can enforce a remote centre of motion so the instrument pivots about the incision. The result is finer, less tiring suturing and dissection inside confined cavities.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�cd54ff1fd271�body���开环控制按固定程序输出而不检查实际结果，比如定时开关的路灯。闭环控制不断测量输出并和设定值比较来纠正偏差，比如空调根据室温自动调节。�Open-loop control acts by a fixed program without checking the actual result, like a timer-switch streetlight. Closed-loop control keeps measuring the output and compares it with the setpoint to correct error, like an air conditioner adjusting to room temperature.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�cf0911ee4dc3�body���短路是火线与零线或地之间出现极低电阻的意外通路，电流会骤增到极大，产生大量热和电弧，可能烧毁设备甚至引发火灾，所以电路都要装保险或断路器。پA short circuit is an unintended low-resistance path that lets current surge, generating intense heat and arcs that can destroy equipment or start fires—so circuits need fuses or breakers.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�cf10cdf52169�body���电解电容依靠电解液在铝箔表面形成的极薄氧化膜作介质，这层膜只有在正确极性电压下才能维持。反接或过压会破坏氧化膜，漏电流骤增、电解液气化，内压升高就把顶部的防爆槽顶起，形成鼓包甚至喷液。高温会加速电解液挥发，因此它的寿命对温度极其敏感，也常成为电子设备的故障源。�An electrolytic capacitor relies on an extremely thin oxide film formed on the aluminium foil by the electrolyte as its dielectric, and that film is only maintained under voltage of the correct polarity. Reverse or excessive voltage breaks the film, leakage current soars and the electrolyte vaporises, raising internal pressure until the scored vent on the top bulges or bursts. High temperature accelerates electrolyte loss, so its life is very sensitive to heat and it is a frequent cause of equipment failure.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�cfbcaea58db5�body��w常见的四环电阻前两环是有效数字，第三环是乘数即在后面添多少个零，第四环表示允许误差。颜色按黑零、棕一、红二、橙三、黄四、绿五、蓝六、紫七、灰八、白九的顺序对应数字。例如棕黑红金就是一零乘一百，即一千欧，误差百分之五。五环电阻多一位有效数字，精度更高。��On a common four-band resistor the first two bands are significant digits, the third is a multiplier telling how many zeros to add, and the fourth gives the tolerance. Colours map to digits in the order black zero, brown one, red two, orange three, yellow four, green five, blue six, violet seven, grey eight, white nine. So brown-black-red-gold means ten times one hundred, that is one thousand ohms, with five percent tolerance. Five-band resistors add one more significant digit for higher precision.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�cff7d8f094d4�body�ف主要是约定俗成，右旋螺纹配右手发力更顺；统一方向避免装反，少数左扣用于防松脱的特殊轴。ٚRight-hand threads became standard because they suit right-handed tightening; uniformity prevents mistakes, with left-hand used rarely to avoid loosening.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�d13660ae9487�body��~它每天在相近地方时过顶，光照角度一致便于前后对比；近极地轨道还能覆盖全球大部分地区。َIt passes overhead at nearly the same local time daily, giving consistent lighting for comparison, and a near-polar path covers most of Earth.�ans��src��(Curtis，《轨道力学》（第4版）�>Curtis, 'Orbital Mechanics for Engineering Students' (4th ed.)��id�d33177e68e53�body��u中性氢会发出21厘米特征谱线，FAST大口径高灵敏，可探测极远的星系分布和暗物质结构。ىNeutral hydrogen emits a 21-cm spectral line; FAST's huge aperture and sensitivity trace very distant galaxies and dark-matter structure.�ans��src��^Ewen 与 Purcell,1951年,Nature,168卷356页:银河系1420兆赫中性氢辐射的首次探测�hEwen & Purcell 1951, Nature, 168, 356 - Observation of a line in the galactic radio spectrum at 1420 MHz��id�d38aec58c7c6�body�ل卷收器里的棘轮在猛拉时锁死限制伸出，平时可自由拉动；预紧器还会在碰撞瞬间先收紧消除松弛。�mThe retractor's ratchet locks under sudden pull but lets you move normally; pretensioners snug it in a crash.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�d52efd80b672�body��钢筋与混凝土的热膨胀系数相近，且混凝土硬化后与钢筋表面产生粘结力，使二者变形协调、共同受力。混凝土擅长受压，钢筋擅长受拉，二者结合形成钢筋混凝土，弥补了混凝土抗拉弱的缺点。�Steel and concrete have similar coefficients of thermal expansion and concrete bonds to the roughened steel surface, so they deform together and share load. Concrete carries compression while steel carries tension, so reinforced concrete overcomes concrete's weakness in tension.�ans��src��G美国钢结构学会（AISC）与 ACI 318；Hibbeler《材料力学》�_American Institute of Steel Construction (AISC) and ACI 318; Hibbeler, 'Mechanics of Materials'��id�d61b9d02f64a�body�ٳ传统加工是从一整块材料上切掉多余部分（减材），3D打印则按数字模型逐层堆积材料成形，几乎不做废料、能做复杂内部结构的零件。ٴConventional machining removes material from a block (subtractive); 3D printing builds layer by layer from a digital model, wasting little and enabling complex internal structures.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�d84ad1f833a3�body�ٲ欧姆定律指出，在常温下的导体中，电压等于电流乘以电阻（V=IR）。电压越高或电阻越小，电流越大，是电路分析与设计的基本公式。ٷOhm's law states that voltage equals current times resistance (V = IR) for many conductors. Higher voltage or lower resistance gives more current—the basic rule of circuit analysis.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�d85539eac0ad�body�ٮ三角形是最稳定的几何形状之一。桁架用大量三角形把车辆和自重产生的荷载分散、传递到桥墩，避免梁结构发生弯曲或扭曲变形。��The triangle is one of the most stable shapes. A truss uses many triangles to spread the loads from traffic and self-weight and transfer them to the piers, preventing the beams from bending or twisting.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�dac254fe9539�body��M左翼尖是红灯，右翼尖是绿灯，尾部是白灯，这套航行灯沿用了航海的规则。夜间只要看到灯的颜色组合，就能判断对方飞机的相对朝向，例如同时看到红绿说明它正朝你飞来。此外还有防撞的红色闪光灯和高强度白色闪光灯，用于提高被发现的概率。��The left wingtip carries a red light, the right a green one and the tail a white one, a convention inherited from maritime navigation. At night the combination of colours reveals another aircraft's relative heading; seeing both red and green together means it is coming toward you. Aircraft also carry red anti-collision beacons and high-intensity white strobes to make themselves easier to spot.�ans��src��,FAA 飞行手册；ICAO Annex 2 航空灯语�/FAA Flight Manual; ICAO Annex 2 aircraft lights��id�db48f7fa351d�body�ي里面设备电压极高，误入会触电或被电弧灼伤；围栏和标识既防人畜进入，也减少电磁暴露和外力破坏。�tEquipment carries lethal voltage; fences and signs keep people out to prevent electrocution, arcs, and interference.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�dbfe783ce491�body���质量分布偏心会让转子转动时产生离心力，转速越高这股力越大，引起振动、轴承磨损和噪声，甚至断轴。动平衡通过加重或去重把偏心降到允许范围。��Off-center mass creates centrifugal force that grows with speed, causing vibration, bearing wear, noise and even shaft failure. Dynamic balancing adds or removes weight to bring eccentricity within limits.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�de14f447d59e�body���ETC通过车上的电子标签与路边天线短距通信，自动扣费让车辆无需停车即可过收费站。它减少排队拥堵和尾气排放。现在很多高速全面启用ETC车道。��ETC uses a transponder in the vehicle to communicate with roadside antennas, automatically deducting fees so cars pass toll booths without stopping. It reduces queuing congestion and emissions. Many highways now run ETC lanes throughout.�ans��src���《Nonstop automatic charge collection system ETC (Electronic Toll Collection) 4. ETC car-loaded terminal technique.》,The Journal of The Institute of Electrical Engineers of Japa,1999 (DOI: 10.1541/ieejjournal.119.604)��'Nonstop automatic charge collection system ETC (Electronic Toll Collection) 4. ETC car-loaded terminal technique.', The Journal of The Institute of Electrical Engineers of Japa, 1999, DOI: 10.1541/ieejjournal.119.604��id�def252e5bde1�body�ٺ能量转换效率 = 有用输出能量 / 输入能量。光伏电池把太阳光转为电能，商用晶硅电池约20%–23%，受肖克利—奎伊瑟单结极限（约33%）制约。��Energy conversion efficiency equals useful output energy divided by input energy. A solar PV cell converts sunlight to electricity; commercial silicon cells reach about 20%–23%, limited by the Shockley-Queisser single-junction limit of about 33%.�ans��src��@Luque & Hegedus，《光伏科学与技术手册》（第2版）�MLuque & Hegedus, 'Handbook of Photovoltaic Science and Engineering' (2nd ed.)��id�df3323d3898e�body��b反推装置通过可动整流罩或阻流门，把发动机涵道内向后的气流挡住并导向前方，使推力方向部分反转，帮助飞机减速。它主要分担刹车负担、缩短湿滑跑道上的着陆距离，而不是全部制动力来源。为安全起见，反推只能在起落架承力、飞机确认在地面时才允许打开。��A thrust reverser uses translating cowls or blocker doors to intercept the rearward flow in the engine duct and redirect it forward, partly reversing the thrust to slow the aircraft. It mainly shares the load with the wheel brakes and shortens landing distance on wet runways rather than providing all the braking. For safety it can only deploy when the landing gear is compressed and the aircraft is confirmed on the ground.�ans��src��4Roskam《飞机设计》；发动机反推（ICAO）�/Roskam, Airplane Design; thrust reverser (ICAO)��id�e038e2f84df0�body�٩pH衡量溶液的酸碱性，数值等于氢离子浓度的负对数。pH为7是中性，小于7偏酸，大于7偏碱。它影响化学反应、土壤和人体消化。ٱpH measures acidity or alkalinity as the negative log of hydrogen ion concentration. Seven is neutral, below is acidic, above is basic, affecting reactions, soil, and digestion.�ans��src��)Atkins，《物理化学》（第10版）�'Atkins, 'Physical Chemistry' (10th ed.)��id�e0cda3b58463�body�ٖ金属避雷针立在最高处，通过粗导线把雷电引到地下，让巨大电流安全地导入大地，而不是击穿房顶或引发火灾。١A metal rod at the highest point channels lightning through a thick wire into the ground, safely dumping the huge current into Earth instead of through the roof.�ans��src��-Nilsson & Riedel，《电路》（第11版）�0Nilsson & Riedel, 'Electric Circuits' (11th ed.)��id�e25ada4b300c�body�ٻ自由度指物体能独立运动的方向数：三维空间中的刚体可有3个平移和3个转动，共6个。工业机械臂达到6自由度就能让末端到达空间任意位姿。��A degree of freedom is an independent direction of motion; a rigid body in 3D has three translations and three rotations—six total. A 6-DOF arm can place its end at any position and orientation.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�e2fc734236db�body���塑料是以高分子树脂为主、可塑制成型的合成材料，质轻、耐腐蚀、绝缘好。它来自石油或可再生原料，用途极广。但难降解，带来白色污染问题。�Plastic is a synthetic material based on polymer resin that can be molded; it is light, corrosion-resistant, and a good insulator. Derived from petroleum or renewable feedstocks, it is used almost everywhere. But it is hard to degrade, causing white pollution.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�e45fcd6e8eed�body�ٺ冲压用模具和压机把金属板快速冲剪、弯曲成零件，效率高、适合大批量。汽车车身覆盖件主要靠冲压。它需要昂贵的模具但单件成本极低。��Stamping uses dies and presses to cut, bend, or form sheet metal quickly, with high efficiency for mass production. Car body panels are mainly stamped. It needs costly dies but gives very low per-part cost.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�e4ea9c58496e�body�ه机器视觉相机配算法能毫秒级识别划痕、尺寸和错装，稳定不疲劳；适合高速重复检验，人眼易漏检。�wMachine vision spots scratches, dimensions, and misassembly in milliseconds without fatigue, suiting high-speed checks.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�e572c8d2dd24�body�ٙ电流是电荷在导体中的定向流动，通常用安培来计量。电池、发电机和太阳能板都可以提供推动电荷流动的电动势。��Electric current is the directed flow of electric charge through a conductor, measured in amperes. Batteries, generators, and solar panels all provide the electromotive force that drives charge to flow.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�e586ef8eb972�body�ٽ传动比是两个啮合齿轮齿数之比，等于它们转速的反比。大齿轮带小齿轮会提速，小齿轮带大齿轮会增力减速，是机械变速与省力的主要手段。٫Gear ratio is the ratio of tooth counts, equal to the inverse ratio of speeds. A big gear driving a small one speeds up; a small driving a big one trades speed for torque.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�e7c2bf066e60�body�ٞ数据采集与监控系统（SCADA）从远端设备采集数据并下发控制指令，广泛用于电力、水务、油气等基础设施的集中监控。ٜSupervisory Control and Data Acquisition gathers data from remote devices and sends commands, used to centrally monitor power, water and oil infrastructure.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�eba580e662fa�body�٨开环控制按预定指令执行、不测输出，简单但不抗干扰；闭环控制测输出并反馈比较，能自动纠偏，所以多数精密系统用闭环。ٱOpen-loop acts on preset commands without measuring output—simple but disturbance-prone. Closed-loop measures output and feeds it back to correct, so precision systems use it.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�ed10d3fd792b�body�ل扔掉烧空的燃料箱能大幅减重，质量比决定能否达到轨道速度；单级火箭很难把有效载荷送进轨道。مJettisoning empty tanks cuts mass sharply; the mass ratio decides whether orbital speed is reachable. A single stage rarely suffices.�ans��src��2Sutton《火箭推进原理》；NASA 发射系统�7Sutton, Rocket Propulsion Elements; NASA launch systems��id�ed4682f98200�body��M负反馈把输出的一部分反相送回输入，使系统偏离目标时产生纠正作用，误差自动被压缩。它还能降低系统对元件参数变化、温度和负载的敏感度，扩展带宽、提高线性度。正反馈则会放大偏差，只在需要振荡或快速翻转的比较器和振荡器中有意使用。��Negative feedback returns part of the output inverted to the input, so any departure from the target generates a corrective action and the error is automatically squeezed down. It also makes the system less sensitive to component variation, temperature and load, while widening bandwidth and improving linearity. Positive feedback amplifies deviation instead, and is only used deliberately where oscillation or fast snap action is wanted, as in comparators and oscillators.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�ed7869c09347�body���电池通过内部化学反应把化学能变成电能供设备使用。它由正极、负极和电解质组成，可充电电池能反复使用。手机、电动车和储能站都依赖它。��A battery converts chemical energy into electricity through internal reactions. It consists of a positive electrode, a negative electrode, and an electrolyte, and rechargeable types can be used many times. Phones, EVs, and storage stations all rely on it.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�eng_24_003�body��1940年11月7日,这座主跨仅268米、断面纤细的悬索桥在约19米每秒的风中扭转失稳,路面像拧麻绳般翻滚直至断裂。罪魁不是风的推力本身,而是气动自激颤振:H形断面抗扭刚度低,风引起的扭转又反过来改变桥面受到的气动力,形成正反馈,能量持续注入使振幅指数增长——这是扭转颤振,而非简单的涡激共振。事故催生了风洞试验制度与流线型断面设计,此后大跨度桥梁都必须先证明自己不会重演这场灾难。��On 7 November 1940 the slender suspension bridge, with a mere 268-metre main span, went torsionally unstable in roughly 19 m/s winds, the deck wringing itself apart like a rope. The culprit was not steady push but aerodynamic self-excitation: the shallow H-shaped section had little torsional stiffness, and wind-driven twist in turn reshaped the aerodynamic forces acting on the deck — positive feedback injecting energy until amplitudes grew exponentially. This is torsional flutter, not plain vortex resonance. The disaster made wind-tunnel verification routine and pushed streamlined deck design; every long-span bridge must now prove it will not repeat the dance.�ans��src��:Billington,《The Tower and the Bridge》,Basic Books,1983�=D. P. Billington, The Tower and the Bridge, Basic Books, 1983��id�eng_24_006�body��不违反,因为它是热泵而非热量的单向搬运工。制冷循环四步:压缩机把低压气态制冷剂压成高温高压气体;冷凝器中向室外空气放热凝结成液体;膨胀阀骤然降压降温;蒸发器在室内侧沸腾吸热,带走房间热量。电力的作用不是制造冷,而是把热量从低温处泵到高温处——这正是热力学第二定律允许的,功就是过路费。能效比COP可达3到5,远超电阻加热,同一原理反过来用就是冬天供暖的空气源热泵。�XNo — a heat pump moves heat rather than making cold. Four steps: the compressor squeezes low-pressure refrigerant gas into hot high-pressure gas; the condenser dumps its heat outdoors as it condenses; the expansion valve drops pressure and temperature; the evaporator boils it indoors, absorbing room heat. Electricity pays the toll for pumping heat against its gradient, exactly what the second law permits. Coefficients of performance reach three to five — one kilowatt-hour moves three to five worth of heat, beating resistive heating; run in reverse, it becomes a winter air-source heat pump.�ans��src��:ASHRAE,《Handbook — Fundamentals》,ASHRAE Atlanta,2021�7ASHRAE Handbook — Fundamentals, ASHRAE, Atlanta, 2021��id�eng_26_003�body���直答：铝盐的水解产物中和了胶体表面的负电荷并提供吸附架桥，脱稳后的颗粒一经碰撞便互相黏结长大。机理：天然水体胶体因双电层静电排斥而长期稳定;硫酸铝数秒内水解生成带正电的多核羟合铝配合物，压缩双电层、吸附电中和使ζ电位趋零，投量较高时新生氢氧化铝还能网捕卷扫颗粒。缓慢搅拌提供有效碰撞机会，絮体长大后经沉淀或气浮分离。��Alum hydrolysis products neutralize the negative colloid surface charge and bridge between particles, so once destabilized the particles stick together on every effective contact. Natural colloids persist because electric double-layer repulsion keeps them apart; dosed alum hydrolyzes within seconds into positively charged polynuclear hydroxo-aluminum species that compress the double layer and neutralize charge, driving the zeta potential toward zero, while at higher doses freshly formed aluminum hydroxide sweeps particles down en masse. Gentle flocculation mixing supplies the collisions until flocs grow large enough to settle or float out.�ans��src��vW. Stumm, C. R. O'Melia,《Stoichiometry of Coagulation》,Journal AWWA,1968 (DOI: 10.1002/j.1551-8833.1968.tb03579.x)�wW. Stumm and C. R. O'Melia, 'Stoichiometry of Coagulation', Journal AWWA, 1968, DOI: 10.1002/j.1551-8833.1968.tb03579.x��id�eng_26_010�body��直答：并非凭经验估定，经典设计用Webster公式求延误最小的最优周期C0=(1.5L+5)/(1-Y)，其中L为一周期内各相位损失时间之和，Y为各相位关键流量比之和。机理：周期过短时损失时间占比过高，交叉口很快饱和;周期过长则红灯等候被整体拉长，平均延误反而上升。Webster以交叉口平均延误最小为目标推导出上式，再按各相位流量比分配有效绿灯时间，这一框架至今仍是定时配时设计的起点。�Not trial and error: the classic Webster formula yields the delay-minimizing cycle C0=(1.5L+5)/(1-Y), where L totals the lost time of all phases per cycle and Y sums the critical flow ratios. A too-short cycle lets lost time dominate and saturates the junction, while a too-long cycle stretches every red wait and pushes average delay back up. Deriving from minimal mean intersection delay, Webster then splits effective green in proportion to phase flow ratios — a framework that still anchors fixed-time signal design today.�ans��src��fF.V. Webster《Traffic Signal Settings》，Road Research Technical Paper No.39，HMSO伦敦，1958年�^F.V. Webster, Traffic Signal Settings, Road Research Technical Paper No.39, HMSO, London, 1958��id�eng_26_013�body���直答：环锭纱内纤维沿近似圆锥螺旋线排列，伸直平行度高，受拉时绝大多数纤维共同承载；转杯纱结构分层且含大量缠绕纤维，强力先天受限。机理：环锭加捻依靠钢丝圈张力使纤维内外转移，两端握持、张力连续，拉断前多数纤维先后断裂；转杯纱纤维在凝聚槽内呈单侧握持状态，外层缠包纤维仅起捆扎作用、芯层捻度不足，拉伸时滑移纤维占比高，成纱强力通常低一到两成。�uRing-spun fibers lie along near-conical helixes, straightened and parallel, so under tension nearly all of them carry load together; rotor yarns are layered structures laced with wrapper fibers that cap strength from the outset. Ring twisting uses traveler tension to migrate fibers inward and outward with both ends gripped under continuous tension, so most fibers must break before the yarn fails. Rotor fibers are gripped from one side only in the grooved channel: outer wrappers merely lash the bundle, the core carries little twist, and slipping fibers dominate under load, leaving strength some ten to twenty percent lower.�ans��src�ُ郁崇文主编《纺纱学》，中国纺织出版社，2014年 ; 另见: C.A. Lawrence, Fundamentals of Spun Yarn Technology, CRC Press, 2003ّC.A. Lawrence, Fundamentals of Spun Yarn Technology, CRC Press, 2003 ; see also: 郁崇文主编《纺纱学》，中国纺织出版社，2014年��id�eng_26_019�body���直答：冻干在水的三相点以下运行，降压使冻结的冰直接升华为水汽被真空系统抽走，物料全程保持低温冻结状态。机理：热风干燥中水分经液相蒸发，高温加长时间会破坏维生素、色素与挥发性香气成分，蛋白质还易变性；冻干同时避开液态水和高温这两个损伤来源，冰晶原位留下的孔隙使干燥层疏松多孔，复水后组织接近新鲜状态，代价则是真空与长周期操作带来的高能耗。�uFreeze-drying operates below water's triple point, where reduced pressure sends frozen ice directly off as vapor carried away by the vacuum pumps while the product stays cold and solid throughout. Hot-air drying evaporates liquid water, and its pairing of heat with long exposure wrecks vitamins, pigments, volatile aroma compounds, and often denatures proteins besides. Freeze-drying dodges both damage sources — liquid water and high temperature — and pores left where ice crystals once stood give the dried layer an open sponge-like structure that rehydrates close to fresh, at the price of energy-hungry vacuum operation.�ans��src���华泽钊、李云飞、刘宝林编著《食品冷冻冷藏原理与设备》，机械工业出版社，1999年 ; 另见: A.S. Mujumdar, Handbook of Industrial Drying, 4th ed., CRC Press, 2014��A.S. Mujumdar, Handbook of Industrial Drying, 4th ed., CRC Press, 2014 ; see also: 华泽钊、李云飞、刘宝林编著《食品冷冻冷藏原理与设备》，机械工业出版社，1999年��id�f04b40d1e6e7�body���CPU核心少但每个很强，擅长串行、复杂的逻辑任务；GPU有成千上万个小核心，擅长把同一种计算并行铺开，因此特别适合图形渲染和人工智能训练。ٜA CPU has few powerful cores for serial, complex logic; a GPU has thousands of small cores that parallelize the same task, suiting graphics and AI training.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�f0dfa1dc09dc�body�ٜ增益高并不意味着凭空放大功率，而是把辐射能量更集中地投向某个方向（方向性更强），等效于在该方向看得更远。�zHigh gain doesn't create power; it focuses radiation into a narrower direction, effectively reaching farther in that beam.�ans��src��"Balanis《天线理论》(第4版)�!Balanis, Antenna Theory (4th ed.)��id�f375916ba858�body�ِ滚筒高速旋转产生离心力把水从衣服和筒壁小孔甩出，衣服被筒壁挡在里面；若不平衡，传感器会降速纠偏。ٕThe spinning drum's centrifugal force pushes water out through tiny holes while the wall keeps clothes in; an imbalance sensor slows it to rebalance.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�f7903cc604f0�body�ف编码器测量电机转角和转速，提供位置反馈，使伺服系统形成闭环控制，知道转了多少、转多快。ِAn encoder measures rotation angle and speed, giving position feedback so the servo runs in closed loop, knowing how far and how fast it turned.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�f91aea5b0361�body���放热反应是产物总能量低于反应物、向环境释放热量的反应，如燃烧；吸热反应则需要吸收热量才能进行，如石灰石煅烧。理解热效应对安全和能效很重要。��Exothermic reactions release heat because products hold less energy than reactants, like combustion; endothermic ones absorb heat, like limestone calcination. The heat effect matters for safety and efficiency.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�fa5a42982f28�body���弯道路面倾斜后，车辆转弯时路面的支撑力有一部分指向圆心，帮忙提供转弯所需的向心力，减少靠轮胎摩擦力硬扛，于是过弯更稳、更不容易侧滑。��Banking tilts the road so part of the normal force points toward the center, helping supply the centripetal force for turning and reducing reliance on tire friction, making cornering steadier and less prone to sliding.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�fb08a23c3547�body�٫大多数卫星展开太阳能帆板将太阳光转为电能，并配蓄电池在阴影期（如地影）继续供电，少数深空探测器用放射性同位素电源。َMost satellites deploy solar arrays and store energy in batteries for eclipse periods; a few deep-space probes use radioisotope power instead.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�fc700b6b4054�body��x绿化屋顶隔热降温、滞蓄雨水减轻排水、隔音并延长防水层寿命；夏天还能缓解城市热岛。�sGreen roofs insulate, retain stormwater, dampen noise, and extend membrane life while easing the urban heat island.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�fd843d682843�body���装配线把产品拆成多道工序，工件沿流水线移动、每站只做一件事，大幅提高产量。福特汽车1913年率先用于造车。它奠定了现代大规模制造的基础。��An assembly line breaks a product into stations; the workpiece moves along and each station does one task, greatly raising output. Ford first used it for cars in 1913. It founded modern mass manufacturing.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�fdbdb2a600df�body��E那是触感警示，由规定直径、高度和间距的截头圆锥凸点组成，作用是在坡道与车行道交界处给视障者一个脚下和盲杖都能感知的明确信号，提示前方即将进入车行道。缘石坡道本身是为轮椅、婴儿车和拉杆箱消除高差的，纵坡通常限制在约 1:12，坡顶还要留出平台、两侧做过渡；但坡道抹平了原本靠缘石高差提供的边界线索，所以必须用凸点把这个提示补回来。规范还要求凸点区域与周围铺装有明显的明暗对比，让低视力者也能看清。��Those are detectable warnings, truncated domes of specified diameter, height and spacing that give blind and low-vision pedestrians an unmistakable underfoot and cane-detectable signal where the ramp meets the roadway. The ramp itself removes the level difference for wheelchairs, strollers and rolling luggage, with running slope generally limited to about 1:12 plus a level landing at the top and graded flares at the sides. Because flattening the curb erases the tactile edge cue the curb used to provide, the domes restore it, and standards additionally require visual contrast with the surrounding paving so people with low vision can see it.�ans��src��=美国司法部《2010 ADA Standards for Accessible Design》�FU.S. Department of Justice, '2010 ADA Standards for Accessible Design'��id�ff0cc3d20de8�body���它可加氢制成合成燃料和甲醇，用于增强采油，或注入混凝土养护加速硬化，也能做成塑料和化学品原料。把碳“圈”在产品中比单纯封存更有经济价值。��It can be hydrogenated into synthetic fuels and methanol, used for enhanced oil recovery, injected into concrete to speed curing, or made into plastics and chemical feedstocks. Locking carbon in products is often more valuable than mere storage.�ans��src��BAresta 编，《二氧化碳作为化工原料》（Wiley, 2010）�FAresta, M. (ed.), 'Carbon Dioxide as Chemical Feedstock' (Wiley, 2010)��id�03a747447421�body�٨它们是可吸收缝线，由身体能分解的材料做成，伤口长好后就被体液慢慢溶掉。这样既缝住了伤口，又省了去医院拆线的麻烦。ٮThey are absorbable sutures made of material the body can break down; once the wound heals, body fluid dissolves them. They hold the cut closed and spare you a removal visit.�ans��src��_Ratner、Hoffman、Schoen & Lemons，《生物材料科学：医用材料导论》（第3版）�lRatner, Hoffman, Schoen & Lemons, 'Biomaterials Science: An Introduction to Materials in Medicine' (3rd ed.)��id�5659a9ee32c0�body�ٱ污水里的细菌在阳极“吃”有机物并释放电子，电子经外电路流向阴极形成电流，同时净化水质。相当于让微生物当免费的发电工人。��Bacteria at the anode 'eat' organics and release electrons that flow through an external circuit to the cathode, making current while cleaning water. It is like hiring microbes as free power workers.�ans��src��-Logan，《微生物燃料电池》（2008）�$Logan, 'Microbial Fuel Cells' (2008)��id�60f82150e1f8�body�ٱ那是顶推或拖带船队，把多艘驳船串起来由一艘拖轮带着走，比各自分开更省油、更好指挥。就像公路上的列车，一次运一大串货物。��That is a towed or pushed barge train, linking several barges behind one tug to move them together—more fuel-efficient and easier to command than separate trips. Like a train on water hauling a long string of cargo at once.�ans��src��.Tupper，《船舶原理导论》（第5版）�6Tupper, 'Introduction to Naval Architecture' (5th ed.)��id�20502120472f�body���高楼越高风越凶，风洞能测出楼表面的风压分布、会不会被吹得扭转抖动。工程师据此改楼体形状、加凹角或开洞，让风乖乖绕开，减少晃动和噪声。��Taller buildings meet fiercer wind; a wind tunnel measures pressure on the facade and whether it twists and oscillates. Engineers then reshape the body—notches, openings—so wind slips around, cutting sway and noise.�ans��src��:Simiu & Scanlan，《风对结构的作用》（第3版）�7Simiu & Scanlan, 'Wind Effects on Structures' (3rd ed.)��id�71e2d8c3923f�body���植物和根上微生物能吸收、降解或固定重金属和营养盐，像天然滤网把脏水变干净，同时护岸防风。它们不是真“吃”污染，而是把污染物拦下、转化或锁住。��Plants and their root microbes take up, degrade or trap heavy metals and nutrients, acting like a natural filter that cleans water and protects shores. They do not truly 'eat' pollution but intercept, transform or lock it away.�ans��src��.Mitsch & Gosselink，《湿地》（第5版）�(Mitsch & Gosselink, 'Wetlands' (5th ed.)��id�7eef3d4f04cb�body�ٌ舱外是真空、温差可达±150℃、还有辐射和微流星，航天服要加压供氧、隔热并防撞，等于一艘微型飞船。٢Outside is vacuum with ±150°C swings plus radiation and micrometeoroids; the suit must pressurize, supply oxygen, insulate and shield—it is a tiny spacecraft.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�aff2966c1c52�body�ٔ它采用斜拉桥加高桥墩，一跨跨越深V形峡谷，既缩短路线又避免盘山展线；钢桁梁和高墩减轻自重、抗风抗震。��A cable-stayed design with very tall piers spans the deep V-shaped gorge in one leap, shortening the route and avoiding mountain switchbacks. Steel trusses and high piers cut self-weight while resisting wind and quakes.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�c716d66bbf56�body���机械臂头顶或手上的3D相机拍出零件的形状和深度，视觉算法认出它的种类和朝向，再换算成抓取坐标。所以换一批不同零件，它也能自己找准下爪。��A 3D camera on or above the arm captures each part's shape and depth; vision algorithms recognize its type and orientation, then convert to grasp coordinates. So even a new batch of different parts gets picked accurately.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�eng_24_009�body���高速下阻力几乎全来自空气(功率随速度三次方增长),牵引需求集中在持续大功率,电动机功率密度与全速域扭矩远胜内燃机,且再生制动能把制动能量回送电网三成上下。供电靠架空接触网:变电所每几十公里一站,把27.5千伏单相电经受电弓喂给车顶;回流经钢轨与回流线闭合。长编组高速动车组峰值功率在一两万千瓦量级,相当于一个小城镇的用电负荷。�+At speed, drag dominates — power grows with velocity cubed — so traction needs sustained megawatts where electric motors outclass diesels in power density and full-range torque, plus regenerative braking returns about thirty percent of braking energy to the grid. Power arrives via overhead catenary: substations every few tens of kilometers feed single-phase 27.5 kV through the pantograph, returning through rails and return conductors. A long-formation high-speed EMU peaks in the ten-to-twenty megawatt class — the electric load of a small town.�ans��src��OIwnicki 主编,《Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics》第2版,CRC Press,2019�NS. Iwnicki ed., Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics, 2nd ed., CRC Press, 2019��id�0212addf742c�body�٫机器人身上装着摄像头、超声波等传感器，像眼睛和耳朵一样收集信息。电脑把这些信息比对后，就知道前面是墙、是人还是球。ٸA robot carries sensors like cameras and ultrasonic beacons that act as eyes and ears. Its computer compares the data and tells whether the object ahead is a wall, a person, or a ball.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�03979a5de5ae�body�٨自行车的齿轮大小不同，换到小牙盘配大飞轮时，每踩一圈轮子转得少但更用力。这样把力气放大，上坡就不用使那么大的劲。��A bike's gears differ in size; shifting to a small front gear with a large rear one means each pedal turn spins the wheel less but with more force. The force is magnified, so hills feel easier.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�05fb89033ec6�body�ي金字塔底面又宽又大，重量稳稳压在低处。石块彼此挤压，越往下越结实，所以能扛住风吹雨打这么久。ٶA pyramid has a huge wide base with weight pressed low to the ground. The stones squeeze against each other, getting stronger toward the bottom, so they survive millennia of weather.�ans��src��MMark Lehner,《金字塔全史》(The Complete Pyramids),Thames & Hudson,1997�fM. Lehner, The Complete Pyramids: An Illustrated Guide to the Pyramids of Egypt, Thames & Hudson, 1997��id�0ddf9d549ff5�body��
每个承重关节的电机尾部都装有失电制动器（抱闸）：线圈通电时弹簧被吸开、关节可自由转动，断电后弹簧立刻把摩擦片压紧锁住关节，属于故障导向安全的常闭式设计。抱闸只用于静态保持，不能当行车刹车反复使用，急停时一般先由驱动器做可控减速再落闸。安全标准要求这类保持机构在动力失效时仍能保住负载，因此拆装机械臂前必须先支撑臂体，否则手动释放抱闸会造成坠落伤人。�5Each load-bearing joint carries a spring-applied, power-off brake on the motor: energizing the coil pulls the spring back so the joint can turn, and losing power lets the spring clamp the friction disc, a fail-safe normally-closed arrangement. The brake is a holding device rather than a service brake, so a controlled stop normally decelerates through the drive before the brake engages. Safety standards require such holding means to retain the load when power fails, which is why an arm must be physically supported before technicians release the brakes by hand.�ans��src��_ISO 10218-1《机器人与机器人装备 工业机器人安全要求 第1部分：机器人》�jISO 10218-1, 'Robots and robotic devices — Safety requirements for industrial robots — Part 1: Robots'��id�13c57d68fca9�body�٦传质是物质因浓度差而发生的迁移过程。菲克第一定律指出扩散通量 J 与浓度梯度成正比，即 J = −D∇c，其中 D 为扩散系数。��Mass transfer is the movement of species driven by a concentration difference. Fick's first law states that the diffusion flux J is proportional to the concentration gradient: J = −D∇c, where D is the diffusion coefficient.�ans��src��BBird, Stewart & Lightfoot《传递现象》；J. Crank《扩散》�ZBird, Stewart & Lightfoot, 'Transport Phenomena'; J. Crank, 'The Mathematics of Diffusion'��id�2aedae57c27a�body�٥滑翔机有又长又宽的翅膀，向前滑时空气从翅膀上下流过产生升力。遇到往上吹的热气流，它会跟着盘旋上升，就能飞很久。ٯA glider has long wide wings; as it moves forward, air flowing over them creates lift. Catching rising warm air currents, it circles upward and can stay aloft for a long time.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�2f2e9a4b8bef�body�ٞ鱼嘴分水堤利用弯道环流：枯水走内江灌溉，洪水走外江排走；飞沙堰溢洪排沙，宝瓶口控制进流量，全靠'因势利导'。��The fish-mouth levee uses bend circulation—low water goes to the inner river for irrigation, flood water to the outer river. The Feishayan spillway dumps sediment and the Bottle-Neck controls inflow, all by working with nature.�ans��src��E联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《青城山—都江堰》�NUNESCO World Heritage Centre, Mount Qingcheng and Dujiangyan Irrigation System��id�30ee8aefaafc�body�ِ你按的按钮变成电信号，告诉机器要第几排第几个格子。机器转动小马达推开那格的弹簧，零食就掉下来了。٠Your button press becomes an electric signal telling the machine which row and slot you chose. A small motor turns a coil that pushes the snack out of its spot.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�3ac27bd62413�body�ٍ大坝用厚厚的水泥和石头做成结实的墙，底部最宽最重。水的推力被墙和地基一起分担，水就被稳稳拦住。٨A dam is built as a thick wall of concrete and rock, widest and heaviest at the base. The water's push is shared by the wall and its foundation, holding the water back.�ans��src��E刘鸿文 主编,《材料力学》第6版,高等教育出版社,2017�NLiu Hongwen ed., Mechanics of Materials, 6th ed., Higher Education Press, 2017��id�3d7bc37a9779�body�ٍ电磁炉通电流后产生看不见的磁场，让铁锅自己里面产生电流发热。锅热了菜就熟了，炉面本身却不太烫。ٿAn induction cooktop sends current that makes an invisible magnetic field, which drives current inside an iron pan so the pan heats itself. The food cooks while the surface stays fairly cool.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�433ef5d91de1�body��错缝让每块砖跨在下层两块砖之上，局部荷载可以沿约四十五度向外扩散到更大面积，整片墙像一个整体协同受力。若竖缝上下对齐，砂浆缝就形成一条贯通的薄弱面，砂浆的抗拉抗剪远低于砖块，裂缝会顺着这条通缝直接开裂，墙体也失去砖块之间的咬合抗剪能力。因此传统砌法和规范都要求丁顺搭接、错缝长度不小于砖长的四分之一左右，转角与交接处还要用整砖咬砌来保证整体性。�oStaggered bonding makes each brick bridge two bricks below, so a local load spreads outward at roughly 45 degrees over a wider area and the wall acts as one composite element. Aligned vertical joints instead create a continuous plane of mortar, which is far weaker than the units in tension and shear, so cracks run straight down that line and the wall loses the interlock that transfers shear between bricks. Masonry practice and codes therefore require overlapping patterns with laps typically at least about a quarter of a brick length, and corners and intersections are toothed with whole bricks to preserve continuity.�ans��src��VBrick Industry Association，《Technical Notes 10: Bonds and Patterns in Brickwork》�QBrick Industry Association, 'Technical Notes 10: Bonds and Patterns in Brickwork'��id�46b0e5e03d44�body��C主流举高消防车的工作高度多在五十到七十米，大约十几到二十几层，再高就受车辆稳定性、臂架强度和场地条件限制，所以高层建筑必须自带消防能力。规范要求设置室内消火栓系统、自动喷水灭火系统、消防水泵、高位消防水箱和转输水泵，消防员可在着火层下一层的消火栓接口取水并携带水带上楼扑救。同时用防烟楼梯间、消防电梯、避难层和防火分区限制火势与烟气蔓延，室外还设水泵接合器，让消防车向室内管网加压补水。��Most aerial appliances work to about 50–70 m, roughly the teens to low twenties of storeys, beyond which vehicle stability, boom strength and site access take over, so tall buildings must carry their own firefighting capability. Codes require interior standpipes with hose outlets, automatic sprinklers, fire pumps, a high-level fire water tank and transfer pumps so crews can connect hoses at the standpipe one floor below the fire. Smoke-proof stairs, firefighter lifts, refuge floors and compartmentation limit fire and smoke spread, while fire department connections outside let engines boost pressure and water into the building's own piping.�ans��src��A中国《建筑设计防火规范》GB 50016-2014（2018年版）�eChina National Standard GB 50016-2014 (2018 revision), 'Code for Fire Protection Design of Buildings'��id�4e64b98a5fa6�body��逃逸系统必须在探测到异常后不到一秒内点火，固体逃逸发动机在两三秒内产生数十吨推力，把乘员舱以大约 7–10g 的加速度拉离数百米以上，随后抛掉塔架、展开降落伞完成海上或陆上着陆。之所以这么急，是因为液体火箭一旦发生爆燃，火球扩展只需几秒，而低空逃逸还必须留出足够高度让降落伞充分张开。1983 年联盟 T-10-1 在发射台起火时逃逸系统成功救出两名航天员，是这套设计最直接的实战验证。��An abort system must ignite within a fraction of a second of detecting failure, with solid motors delivering tens of tonnes of thrust for two or three seconds to accelerate the capsule away at roughly 7–10g and several hundred metres clear before the tower is jettisoned and parachutes deploy for a water or land landing. Such urgency exists because a liquid rocket deflagration expands into a fireball within seconds, and a low-altitude abort must still leave enough altitude for canopies to inflate. The 1983 Soyuz T-10-1 pad fire, where the escape system saved both crew members, remains the concept's clearest practical demonstration.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�4f1d3c0fe5b0�body�ِ挡土墙用结实的混凝土和钢筋做成，斜斜地顶住土坡。墙后的排水孔把水放走，土变轻了就不容易把墙推倒。٭A retaining wall of concrete and rebar leans firmly against the slope. Drain holes behind it release water so the soil gets lighter and is less likely to push the wall over.�ans��src��E刘鸿文 主编,《材料力学》第6版,高等教育出版社,2017�NLiu Hongwen ed., Mechanics of Materials, 6th ed., Higher Education Press, 2017��id�4fc643adeacd�body��R圆印是顶针留下的：制品冷却收缩后会抱紧模芯，开模时需要顶针从背面把它推出，接触处压力集中便留下顶针印，所以顶针位置通常安排在非外观面，直径也要与壁厚匹配以免顶白或顶穿。侧壁的斜度叫脱模斜度，一般每侧半度到两度，用来让制品脱模时侧壁迅速与钢件分离、减小摩擦和拉伤，没有斜度可能顶不出来或表面被拉花。分型线（两半模具的合缝痕）和浇口痕同样是工艺留下的必然特征，设计时只能安排它们的位置而无法完全消除。��The round marks come from ejector pins: as the part cools it shrinks onto the core, so pins must push it off from behind at mould opening, and the concentrated contact pressure leaves a witness mark, which is why pins go on non-cosmetic faces and are sized to the wall to avoid blush or push-through. The wall taper is draft, usually half a degree to two degrees per side, letting the wall break away from the steel quickly and reducing friction and drag marks; without it the part may refuse to eject or come out scuffed. Parting lines from the two mould halves and gate vestiges are similarly unavoidable process signatures, so designers choose where they fall rather than eliminating them.�ans��src��ERosato 等，《Injection Molding Handbook》（第3版，Springer）�?Rosato et al., 'Injection Molding Handbook' (3rd ed., Springer)��id�659d00357c69�body��u地下很深处有滚烫的岩石把水烧热成蒸汽。蒸汽推动涡轮机转动发电机，就发出电来了。�~Deep underground, hot rock turns water into steam. That steam spins a turbine connected to a generator, producing electricity.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�66af3379f00a�body�ي它由数千块带促动器的小面板组成主动反射面，可实时微调成抛物面，把不同天区的电磁波聚焦到馈源。ٰIts active surface has thousands of small panels driven by actuators that retune into a paraboloid in real time, focusing signals from different parts of the sky onto the feed.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7d148b485374�body�ٍ火箭越往上飞越轻，把烧完的空燃料箱扔掉能省力气。每扔一节，剩下的部分就更轻，更容易冲出大气层。٢As a rocket climbs it gets lighter, and dropping empty fuel tanks saves effort. Each stage let go makes the rest lighter, helping it break through the atmosphere.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�80dd3f159fb3�body�ٍ探测器飞近大行星时，会被它的引力拉一把并拐个弯。借力后速度更快，能省下很多燃料飞向更远的星球。ٚAs a probe swings past a big planet, the planet's gravity tugs and bends its path. The boost speeds it up, saving huge amounts of fuel for farther worlds.�ans��src��(Curtis，《轨道力学》（第4版）�>Curtis, 'Orbital Mechanics for Engineering Students' (4th ed.)��id�8242a39e7188�body��x灯塔做成上窄下宽的圆塔，重心很低很稳。波浪打上来会从圆身上滑开，不容易把塔推倒。١A lighthouse is a round tower narrow at top and wide at base, with a low steady center of gravity. Waves glance off its curved shape instead of knocking it down.�ans��src��L《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012,中国建筑工业出版社,2012�hLoad Code for the Design of Building Structures GB 50009-2012, China Architecture & Building Press, 2012��id�9665936f51df�body��{弯弯的船底把水轻轻分到两边，减少阻挡让船跑得更快。它也让船在水里更稳，不容易侧翻。ٌA curved hull slices water to the sides, cutting drag so the boat moves faster. The shape also keeps the boat steady and less likely to tip.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�97eb022302dc�body�ٙ自动扶梯的台阶连在两条循环的链条上，马达带着链条转。台阶到了顶或底会平着收进去，再绕回另一头接着载人。١Escalator steps are fixed to two looping chains driven by a motor. At the top or bottom the steps flatten and slip around to the other side to carry more people.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�9af667db7abf�body��g这是多级粘度标号：W 前的数字对应低温性能，用规定低温下的启动与泵送粘度上限分级，数字越小表示低温流动性越好；后面的数字对应 100 ℃ 时的运动粘度区间以及高温高剪切粘度要求。冷启动时机油若太稠，油泵来不及把油送到轴瓦和凸轮，发动机磨损主要就发生在这几十秒里，所以严寒地区选 0W 或 5W。高温档也不能随意降低，否则油膜太薄承载不了轴承比压；随着行驶里程增加，添加剂耗尽和剪切变稀会让油品跌出等级，这正是需要按里程换油的原因。��It is a multigrade designation: the number before W is a low-temperature class defined by limits on cranking and pumping viscosity at specified cold temperatures, so a smaller number means better cold flow, while the second number sets the kinematic viscosity band at 100 °C plus high-temperature high-shear requirements. On a cold start, oil that is too thick keeps the pump from reaching bearings and cams, and most engine wear happens in those first tens of seconds, which is why 0W or 5W grades suit severe winters. The high-temperature grade cannot simply be lowered either, since a thinner film may not carry bearing pressure, and additive depletion plus shear thinning eventually push used oil out of grade, which is what oil-change intervals address.�ans��src��1SAE J300《Engine Oil Viscosity Classification》�/SAE J300, 'Engine Oil Viscosity Classification'��id�a374829bfbca�body���吸盘靠内外压差把工件压在密封唇上，可提供的力约等于真空度乘以有效吸附面积，因此必须先建立并维持一个密闭腔。多孔材料和粗糙、弯曲的表面会持续漏气，真空泵的抽气量跟不上泄漏量，压差建立不起来，抓取力迅速衰减。对这类工件通常改用磁力吸盘、机械夹指或针刺式夹具，或者先贴一层柔性密封垫，人为造出可密封的接触面。�A suction cup holds a part through the pressure difference across its sealing lip, and the available force is roughly the vacuum level times the effective sealed area, so a closed cavity must exist first. Porous foams and rough or curved surfaces leak continuously; once leakage exceeds the pump's flow capacity the pressure difference never builds up and holding force collapses. Such parts are handled with magnetic, mechanical-finger or needle grippers instead, or by adding a compliant sealing pad that creates a sealable contact face.�ans��src��8Monkman 等，《Robot Grippers》（Wiley-VCH，2007）�2Monkman et al., 'Robot Grippers' (Wiley-VCH, 2007)��id�a3e45b79134a�body�ٓ地震时地面来回晃，楼也会跟着摆。楼里装上像大摆锤或橡胶垫的减震器，能吃掉摇晃的力气，让楼少受损伤。٤In a quake the ground shakes and the building sways with it. Devices like giant pendulums or rubber pads soak up that shaking, protecting the structure from damage.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�a70cbb1ad693�body�ٖ高空气压很低、氧气也少，所以飞机把机舱密封起来往里打气。舱内保持像地面一样的气压，人就不会觉得难受。ٮHigh altitude has low pressure and little oxygen, so the plane seals its cabin and pumps in air. Keeping cabin pressure like ground level lets passengers breathe comfortably.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�abfc206ccb08�body�ٍ卫星在高空接收地面发来的无线电信号，再转身转发给别的地方。这样信号能跨过大洋和山脉，送到很远。ٝHigh above, a satellite catches radio signals from the ground and beams them elsewhere. This lets signals cross oceans and mountains to reach faraway places.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�c1ff193aaa0b�body�٥螺丝上的纹路如果摊平，就是一条绕圈上升的斜坡。转螺丝时就像推着东西沿斜坡往上走，所以能用小力气拧进很硬的材料。٥If you unroll a screw's ridge, it becomes a ramp that coils upward. Turning the screw is like pushing along that ramp, so a small twist drives it into hard material.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�ca97c889e825�body�ٜ把多个滑轮串成滑轮组，绳子要绕更长的路，重量就被分到更多段绳子上。每段只扛一小部分，人拉起来就轻松得多。��Stringing several pulleys into a block-and-tackle makes the rope travel a longer path, spreading the load across more rope sections. Each section holds only a small part, so pulling feels much easier.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�cb128abe1d00�body�ٙ这种船底下有像小翅膀的水翼，速度越快水流过水翼产生的升力越大。升力把船身托离水面，阻力变小就跑得飞快。ٶThese boats have wing-like foils underneath; the faster they go, the more lift the flowing water creates. The lift raises the hull out of the water, cutting drag so they speed along.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�cf8230dc5d44�body�ٖ撬棍是一根长杠杆，把支点放在靠近石头的地方。手在另一头轻轻一压，远端的力就被放得很大，石头就松动了。ّA crowbar is a long lever with its pivot placed near the rock. A small push at the far end becomes a much larger force at the rock, loosening it.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�d99e644a42ed�body��v导线的发热功率等于电流平方乘以电阻，而电阻与截面积成反比，所以截面减半时同一电流的发热大约翻倍；散热能力却大致只随表面积增长，远慢于发热的增加。载流量就是让导体稳定温度不超过绝缘允许温度（例如 70 ℃ 或 90 ℃）的最大电流，规范据此按截面、绝缘材料、敷设方式和环境温度给出查表值，多根线共管或高温环境还要乘折减系数。这也是为什么长期过载会先让绝缘老化碳化再引发短路火灾，以及断路器额定值必须与导线截面配套，而不能只看电器功率。��Heating in a conductor equals current squared times resistance, and resistance is inversely proportional to cross-section, so halving the area roughly doubles the heat at the same current, while heat rejection grows only with surface area. Ampacity is the current at which steady conductor temperature just reaches the insulation rating, such as 70 or 90 °C, and codes tabulate it by size, insulation type, installation method and ambient temperature, with derating factors when several cables share a conduit or surroundings are hot. That is why sustained overload first ages and carbonizes insulation before causing a short-circuit fire, and why a breaker must be matched to the conductor size rather than chosen from appliance ratings alone.�ans��src��DNFPA 70《National Electrical Code》表 310.16（导体载流量）�HNFPA 70, 'National Electrical Code', Table 310.16 (conductor ampacities)��id�dc2f460428ba�body�ي倒数把加注、系统检查、瞄准发射窗口等步骤同步起来，留出有序准备和安全冗余，出问题可随时暂停。ٔThe countdown synchronizes fuelling, checks and the launch window, giving orderly preparation and safety margin so any problem can halt the process.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�e4abd756d465�body�ف防洪才是首要效益，发电和航运次之；汛期它拦蓄洪峰、削减下游威胁，才是最重要的设计目标。ٶFlood control is the primary purpose, with power and navigation secondary. In flood season it stores peak flows to protect the middle and lower reaches—that is the key design goal.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ed8320f9b904�body�ف火车把水烧成蒸汽，蒸汽力气很大往筒里冲，推动活塞来回动。活塞带动车轮，火车就开起来了。ِThe train boils water into steam, and the forceful steam pushes a piston back and forth. The piston turns the wheels, and the train rolls along.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�eef695965c66�body��e水泥水化是持续进行的化学反应，强度随龄期增长但速率递减，普通硅酸盐水泥在标准养护条件下约 28 天已发展到长期强度的大部分（常在八成以上），此后增长明显放缓。28 天因此被选为兼顾『接近稳定』与『工期可接受』的验收龄期，标准据此规定试件尺寸、养护温湿度和加载速率，使不同工地的数据可以互相比较。工期紧张时会同时留 3 天、7 天试件推算发展趋势；掺矿渣或粉煤灰的混凝土早期强度偏低而后期继续增长，必要时按 56 天或成熟度法评定。��Cement hydration is an ongoing reaction whose strength gain decelerates with age, and ordinary Portland cement concrete under standard curing typically reaches most of its long-term strength — often over eighty percent — by 28 days, after which gains slow markedly. That age was adopted as an acceptance compromise between near-stable strength and tolerable construction schedules, and standards fix specimen size, curing temperature and humidity and loading rate so results are comparable between sites. When schedules are tight, 3-day and 7-day specimens project the trend, and slag or fly-ash concretes that keep gaining later may be assessed at 56 days or by maturity methods.�ans��src��zASTM,《Test Method for Compressive Strength of Cylindrical Concrete Specimens》,ASTM C39 (DOI: 10.1520/c0039_c0039m-15a)�wASTM, 'Test Method for Compressive Strength of Cylindrical Concrete Specimens', ASTM C39, DOI: 10.1520/c0039_c0039m-15a��id�eng_25_013�body��D那是警醒装置(死人开关):司机必须在设定时间内周期性踩踏或操作,证明自己清醒。一旦超时无动作,系统判定司机失能,自动触发紧急制动让列车停下。航空、高铁、货运列车的驾驶室都有类似设计——再可靠的机器也要防备最不可控的人为失误。�1It is a dead-man switch vigilance device: drivers must press within set intervals proving alertness. No action past timeout means the system judges the driver incapacitated and slams emergency brakes. Cockpits and freight cabs share such designs — even reliable machines must guard against human lapses.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�eng_25_014�body��m早期机器人乱撞式清扫漏扫严重;现代机型用激光雷达或摄像头扫描房间轮廓,边沿先走一圈记住边界,再按弓字形路径一格一格覆盖,像割草机的作业图。定位靠传感器里程计加上特征匹配,即使被抱到另一个房间也能重新定位继续未完成的区域。算法把家务变成了数学覆盖问题。�POlder robots wandered randomly missing spots; modern ones scan room outlines by lidar or camera, trace edges once, then sweep back-and-forth rows covering every cell like mower plans. Localization blends wheel odometry with feature matching — moved mid-job they relocate and resume. Algorithms turned chores into coverage mathematics.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版电子与信息分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�lTen Thousand Whys: Electronics and Information volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�01a679a90788�body�ٙ制冷时室内机蒸发器很冷，空气中的水汽冷凝成水珠排出；室外机滴水通常是排出的冷凝水或化霜水，属正常现象。�yCooling condenses indoor humidity into water that drains out; outdoor drips are usually that condensate or defrost water.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�05d80eef05d3�body��l救生衣里塞着很轻的泡沫，比水轻很多。它把人往上托，让人头露出水面好呼吸。ٓA life jacket is stuffed with light foam that weighs far less than water. It pushes the person up so their head stays above the surface to breathe.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�071604e5b504�body�ٜ它把IMU、GPS、摄像头、激光雷达等多源数据结合，得到比单一传感器更可靠的位置与状态估计，常用卡尔曼滤波实现。َIt combines data from IMU, GPS, cameras and lidar to produce more reliable state estimates than any single sensor, often via Kalman filtering.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�09138f37cada�body�ف人工岛是桥与海底沉管隧道转换的支点，让隧道和桥梁平稳衔接，并作为通风、救援和运维基地。ٰThe islands are pivot points where the bridge meets the immersed-tube tunnel, letting road and tube connect smoothly while serving as ventilation, rescue and maintenance bases.�ans��src�ٱBickel、Kuesel 与 King《隧道工程手册》(Tunnel Engineering Handbook)，第 2 版；国际隧道与地下空间协会(ITA)《隧道掘进机(TBM)推荐与指南》(2000)ٵBickel, Kuesel & King, 'Tunnel Engineering Handbook' (2nd ed.); International Tunnelling Association (ITA), 'Recommendations and Guidelines for Tunnel Boring Machines (TBMs)' (2000)��id�0a4e1b913928�body�ٷ太阳能电池板里的半导体材料在光照下把光子转化为电子流动，形成直流电。许多电池片串联组成板，再经逆变器变成家里可用的交流电。��The semiconductor material in a solar panel converts photons into flowing electrons under light, producing direct current. Many cells are wired in series into a panel, and an inverter then turns it into the AC power used at home.�ans��src��@Luque & Hegedus，《光伏科学与技术手册》（第2版）�MLuque & Hegedus, 'Handbook of Photovoltaic Science and Engineering' (2nd ed.)��id�13ee653a1ee2�body��+头盔的核心是发泡聚苯乙烯内衬，它靠自身被压碎、永久变形来削减撞击的峰值加速度，这个吸能过程是一次性的，压溃后的泡沫不会弹回原状。外壳只是薄薄一层塑料，用来分散局部压力并保护泡沫，所以泡沫内部的压实和微裂往往被外壳挡住，肉眼很难判断。头盔认证测试正是用规定高度的落锤冲击并限制头模的加速度峰值，一旦泡沫的吸能能力已被消耗，再次撞击时能提供的缓冲明显下降，因此摔过就该更换。�mA helmet's protection comes from its expanded polystyrene liner, which crushes and deforms permanently to cut the peak acceleration of an impact, and that energy absorption is one-shot because crushed foam does not spring back. The shell is only a thin plastic skin that spreads local pressure and protects the foam, so compacted or micro-cracked foam underneath is easily hidden from view. Certification tests drop the helmet from a specified height and cap the headform's peak acceleration, so once the liner has been used up the cushioning available in a second impact is much reduced and the helmet should be retired.�ans��src��X美国消费品安全委员会 16 CFR Part 1203《Safety Standard for Bicycle Helmets》�`U.S. Consumer Product Safety Commission, 16 CFR Part 1203, 'Safety Standard for Bicycle Helmets'��id�1c2bd8f87dd2�body�ٙ铝很轻又耐腐蚀，而且容易加工成型。它强度重量比高，所以既适合做轻便的饮料罐，也适合要求减重的飞机机身。��Aluminum is light, corrosion-resistant, and easy to shape. Its high strength-to-weight ratio makes it ideal both for lightweight drink cans and for aircraft bodies where weight saving matters.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�1e651a864074�body��r洗衣机把衣服和水、洗衣粉一起翻来翻去。水和肥皂把脏东西松开来，再被水流冲走。�wA washing machine tumbles clothes with water and soap. The soap loosens the dirt and the flowing water carries it away.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�2311e38a33ec�body�ـ因为它'无坝引水、乘势利导'，顺着岷江的水文来分水排沙，而不是硬去堵水，所以很少被冲毁。ٔIt uses dam-free diversion that follows the river's natural flow to split water and expel sand, rather than blocking it—so it is rarely destroyed.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�2b4a7e37e93c�body��@链条每进出一次链轮，销轴和套筒之间就要相对转动一次，润滑油在这里形成承载油膜并把泥沙带走；缺油时金属直接摩擦，阻力和磨损急剧上升，还会加速链轮齿面损坏。所谓抻长并不是钢材被拉伸，而是销轴与套筒接触面被磨掉材料，每个节距变大一点，几十个节距累积起来链条整体变长。节距变大后链条与齿形不再匹配，出现跳齿掉链，因此维修用链条检测尺量伸长率，超过约百分之零点五到一就换链条，以保护更贵的飞轮。�rEvery time a link enters or leaves a sprocket the pin rotates inside its bushing, and oil there provides a load-bearing film and flushes grit away; without it metal rubs metal, friction and wear rise sharply and sprocket teeth suffer too. A chain does not literally stretch — material is worn away at the pin-and-bushing contact so each pitch grows slightly, and the small increments add up over dozens of links. Once the pitch no longer matches the tooth profile the chain skips and drops, which is why mechanics use a chain-wear gauge and replace it at roughly 0.5 to 1 percent elongation to protect the costlier cassette.�ans��src��]Budynas 与 Nisbett，《Shigley's Mechanical Engineering Design》（第11版）链传动章�]Budynas & Nisbett, 'Shigley's Mechanical Engineering Design' (11th ed.), chain drives chapter��id�2c20c78ed1f3�body��u水比油重会沉底并瞬间沸腾把燃着的油溅开，火更大；应盖锅盖断氧或用灭火毯、干粉。�mWater sinks under hot oil and flashes to steam, splashing burning oil; smother with a lid or blanket instead.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�302fc7568b5e�body��z它们用双轴驱动持续调整朝向，因为轨道每约90分钟绕地球一圈，只有跟踪才能最大化发电。هThey use two-axis drives to keep facing the Sun, since the station orbits Earth about every 90 minutes—only tracking maximizes power.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版航空与航天分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�gTen Thousand Whys: Aviation and Aerospace volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�3585f97e6483�body���木材由沿树干方向排列的管状细胞组成，细胞壁里的纤维素微纤丝也大致顺着这个方向，顺纹受拉时力沿着强度很高的纤维传递。横纹方向靠的是细胞之间较弱的木质素粘结和细胞壁的横向支撑，抗拉强度往往只有顺纹的几十分之一，裂缝顺着细胞界面很容易延伸。木工因此让承重梁的纹路顺着跨度方向，胶合板则把奇数层薄板交错九十度叠放，用互相垂直的纹理弥补横纹的弱点。�RWood is built from tube-like cells aligned with the trunk, and the cellulose microfibrils in their walls run roughly the same way, so pulling along the grain loads very strong fibres directly. Across the grain the load must pass through weaker lignin bonding between cells, so tensile strength perpendicular to the grain is often a small fraction of the parallel value and cracks run easily along cell boundaries. Carpenters therefore align beam grain with the span, and plywood glues an odd number of veneers at ninety degrees to each other so crossed grain compensates for the weak direction.�ans��src��`美国农业部林务局，《Wood Handbook: Wood as an Engineering Material》（FPL-GTR-282）�SUSDA Forest Service, 'Wood Handbook: Wood as an Engineering Material' (FPL-GTR-282)��id�3c171770ce4b�body��~避雷针把雷电引到自己，通过引下线和接地网把电流安全泄入大地，保护建筑不被直击雷烧损。�xThe air terminal intercepts lightning and routes the current safely to ground, sparing the building from direct strikes.�ans��src��,NFPA 780《防雷保护标准》；IEC 62305�6NFPA 780, Standard for Lightning Protection; IEC 62305��id�3dd7610eb97d�body�ه空间站在很高很高的天上，以很快的速度往前冲。地球的引力把它拉弯成圆圈，它就一直绕着地球跑。َThe space station is very high up and races forward fast. Earth's gravity bends its path into a circle, so it keeps looping around our planet.�ans��src��(Curtis，《轨道力学》（第4版）�>Curtis, 'Orbital Mechanics for Engineering Students' (4th ed.)��id�44ac92613bdd�body�ٍ差速两轮靠左右轮速差转向，不能横向移动；全向轮（如麦克纳姆轮）可沿任意方向移动，适合狭窄空间。٩Differential two-wheel bases turn by speed difference and cannot move sideways, while omnidirectional wheels (e.g., Mecanum) move in any direction, suiting tight spaces.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�54d4831450b6�body�ف大楼用的是钢化玻璃，先加热再快速冷却，变得很结实。就算破了也会碎成小圆粒，不容易伤人。ٔBuildings use toughened glass that is heated then cooled fast, making it very strong. If it breaks it crumbles into small dull bits that rarely cut.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�5a102c69b3d6�body���舵机内置反馈与减速机构，常用于限定角度（常见0到180度）的位置控制；步进电机靠脉冲逐步转动、可连续旋转且无内置反馈，更适合需要大范围旋转的开环场合。��A servo has built-in feedback and gearing for limited-angle position control (often 0 to 180 degrees), while a stepper moves in discrete steps and can rotate continuously without feedback, suiting open-loop, wide-range motion.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�63e4e1317d0b�body���高楼里有钢铁骨架互相拉住，形状也设计得能卸掉风力。有些楼的高处还挂着大摆锤一样的减震器，风一吹它就反向轻轻晃，抵消摇晃，楼就不会倒。��Tall buildings have steel frames that hold together and shapes that let wind pass by. Some even hang a giant pendulum-like damper high up; when wind blows, it sways the opposite way to cancel the motion, so they stay up.�ans��src���《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012，中国建筑工业出版社，2012年 ; 另见: Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria for Buildings and Other Structures, ASCE 7-16, American Society of Civil Engineers, 2017��Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria for Buildings and Other Structures, ASCE 7-16, American Society of Civil Engineers, 2017 ; see also: 《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012，中国建筑工业出版社，2012年��id�673835063af2�body�ٴ高速公路通过全封闭、出入口控制和立体交叉，让车流各行其道、互不干扰。车辆不必在路口停下等待，因此能保持高速、连续地行驶。��Highways keep traffic separate through full access control, limited entries, and grade-separated interchanges, so flows do not conflict. Vehicles need not stop at intersections and can keep moving at high, continuous speed.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�680478e5f858�body�ِ发动机把空气吸进去，和燃料一起烧成高温气体，再从后面猛地喷出。气体向后喷的力气，就把飞机向前推。ٍThe engine sucks in air, burns it with fuel into hot gas, and blasts it out the back. The backward push of that gas drives the plane forward.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�6b1d08e0d431�body��o电动车靠大电池供电，电让马达转起来带动车轮。没有排气管，跑起来也安安静静。ىAn electric car runs on a big battery; the electricity spins a motor that turns the wheels. With no exhaust pipe, it moves along quietly.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�70ad03338641�body�ٙ传送带像一条会动的长桌子，把零件从一个工位送到下一个工位，大家站在两边依次装配，又快又不容易丢三落四。٘A conveyor is a moving long table that carries parts from one workstation to the next, so everyone assembles in turn, quickly and without losing pieces.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�74d05b26e4c2�body��x刹车片紧紧夹住车轮上的圆盘，制造摩擦。摩擦把车子跑的力气变成热，车就慢下来停下。نBrake pads squeeze a disc on the wheel and create friction. The friction turns the car's motion into heat, so the car slows and stops.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�751f9774b845�body�ٽ传感器是把温度、光、压力等物理量转换成电信号的装置，相当于系统的“感觉器官”。手机里的加速度计、温度计里的热敏电阻都是传感器。��A sensor converts physical quantities like temperature, light, and pressure into electrical signals, acting as a system's sense organ. The accelerometer in a phone and the thermistor in a thermometer are both sensors.�ans��src��pW. Bolton,《Mechatronics: Electronic Control Systems in Mechanical and Electrical Engineering》第7版,Pearson�nW. Bolton, Mechatronics: Electronic Control Systems in Mechanical and Electrical Engineering, 7th ed., Pearson��id�7971aad362e9�body�ل气垫船向下吹出一大层空气，在船底和地面之间造出气垫。船浮在空气上，所以贴着水面飞却不沉。ٗA hovercraft blows a thick layer of air downward, making a cushion between its base and the ground. Riding on air, it skims over water without sinking.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�7ce5ff0cc6ee�body�ٙ齿轮通过相互啮合的轮齿传递旋转运动和动力。它们可以改变转速、改变转动方向，或者放大或缩小所传递的力矩。٪Gears transmit rotational motion and power through interlocking teeth. They can change rotational speed, reverse direction, or increase and decrease the torque delivered.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�82da132e3389�body��c风吹动叶片转动连着的发电机。发电机把转动的力气变成电，送到家里用。ـWind turns the blades, which spin a generator inside. The generator changes that spinning motion into electricity for our homes.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�870f7221a3f2�body��o车突然停下时，人还会往前冲。安全带把人牢牢拉住，不让人撞到前面，就少受伤。ُWhen a car stops suddenly, your body still wants to keep moving forward. The belt holds you back so you don't slam into the front and get hurt.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�888416cff5f3�body���燃料电池车在电池里让氢和氧直接发生电化学反应发电驱动，不受热机效率上限束缚；氢内燃机只是把氢当汽油烧，仍受卡诺效率限制，能量浪费更多。��A fuel-cell car makes electricity by electrochemically combining hydrogen and oxygen, free of the heat-engine efficiency ceiling, while a hydrogen engine just burns hydrogen and is still limited by Carnot efficiency, wasting more energy.�ans��src��>Larminie & Dicks，《燃料电池系统解析》（第2版）�9Larminie & Dicks, 'Fuel Cell Systems Explained' (2nd ed.)��id�8a9d947aaaad�body��o斧头刃是尖尖的楔子，砸下去时把木头往两边推开。力集中到尖头，木头就裂开了。�{An axe blade is a sharp wedge that pushes wood apart as it is swung down. The force gathers at the tip and the wood splits.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�940b970b6cd1�body�ٷ金属粉末既是原材料也是支撑介质，每熔好一层就铺上新粉再熔下一层，这样悬空和复杂结构才不会塌陷。未熔的粉末还能回收重复使用。��The metal powder acts as both feedstock and support: each melted layer is covered with fresh powder for the next, so overhangs and complex shapes will not collapse. Unmelted powder is recovered and reused.�ans��src��jGibson、Rosen & Stucker，《增材制造技术：从快速原型到直接数字化制造》（第2版）�{Gibson, Rosen & Stucker, 'Additive Manufacturing Technologies: Rapid Prototyping to Direct Digital Manufacturing' (2nd ed.)��id�960fa13cba0e�body�ٱ混凝土由水泥、砂、石子和水按一定比例混合后硬化而成。水泥与水发生化学反应把砂和石牢固地粘结在一起，形成坚硬的人造石材。��Concrete is made by mixing cement, sand, gravel, and water in suitable proportions, then letting it harden. The cement reacts chemically with water to bind the sand and stone into a hard, stone-like material.�ans��src��/Neville，《混凝土的性能》（第5版）�+Neville, 'Properties of Concrete' (5th ed.)��id�96d03ef7ee32�body�٫电脑主要在屏幕里处理信息，而机器人还长着身体：有传感器去感觉、有马达去动，能在真实世界里做事情，比如扫地或抓东西。ٳA computer mostly processes information on a screen, while a robot also has a body: sensors to feel and motors to move, so it can act in the real world like vacuuming or grabbing.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�98b765579878�body�ٔ靠'闸河'——逐级船闸与引水工程把水位一段段抬升，在分水岭设'水脊'调控南北双向水流，船随闸室升降而过。��It used lock canals: a series of ship locks and diversion works lifted water step by step, with a watershed 'ridge' dividing north- and south-flowing water so boats rose and fell between chambers.�ans��src��?联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《中国大运河》�-UNESCO World Heritage Centre, The Grand Canal��id�9a742510a97b�body��{螺丝身上有斜斜的纹路，转进去时像走斜坡一样往里钻。纹路咬住材料，东西就被牢牢锁住。مA screw has a slanted ridge that drills inward like a ramp as you turn it. The ridge bites into the material and locks things firmly.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�a9aa9f7fb594�body��{轮胎上的花纹能咬住地面，让车不容易打滑。下雨时花纹还能把水排开，车就不会漂在水上。ُThe grooves grip the road so the car does not slip easily. In rain they also push water away, stopping the car from sliding on a film of water.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�a9b5f7b3de39�body�ل遥控器按下时发出看不见的红外线光，电视上的小眼睛收到信号。它听懂了指令，就换台或调声音。ٜWhen you press it, the remote sends invisible infrared light that a small sensor on the TV receives. The TV reads the command and changes channel or volume.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�ae16b730606d�body�ٱ火箭依靠向后高速喷出气体，根据作用力与反作用力原理获得向前的推力。它自带燃料和氧化剂，因此不需要空气也能在太空中工作。��A rocket is propelled by ejecting gas backward at high speed, gaining forward thrust by Newton's action-reaction principle. It carries both fuel and oxidizer, so it works in space where there is no air.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�b7bcfaa09ab1�body��r门把手其实是个小轮轴，转动时带动里面的机关。轻轻一转就把锁舌拉开，门就开了。مA doorknob is really a small wheel-and-axle; turning it works the latch inside. A gentle turn pulls the bolt back and the door opens.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�b7d2e352a99f�body��{微波炉发出看不见的微波，让食物里的水分子快速抖动。摩擦生热，食物就从里面热起来了。ىA microwave sends out invisible waves that make water molecules in food shake fast. The shaking makes heat, warming the food from inside.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�b85c3b10e4ea�body���它能实时显示桥里每根钢索的拉力、桥面的微小变形和哪里正在慢慢疲劳，像给桥装了会说话的体检表。哪里快撑不住了，电脑会提前亮红灯提醒。��It shows in real time the tension in each cable, tiny deck deflections and where fatigue is creeping in—like a talking health report for the bridge. When something nears its limit, the screen warns you early.�ans��src��SGrieves，《数字孪生：通过虚拟工厂复制实现制造卓越》（2014）�\Grieves, 'Digital Twin: Manufacturing Excellence through Virtual Factory Replication' (2014)��id�bbe1752c2afd�body�ٷ拱形能把桥面受到的重力沿着弧线传向两端的桥墩，主要承受压力。石头和砖这类抗压强的材料做拱桥特别合适，所以拱桥既稳固又省料。��An arch directs the weight on the deck along its curve to the supports at both ends, mainly under compression. Stone and brick resist compression well, so arch bridges are both stable and material-efficient.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�c300b2fe3dfc�body���滚动轴承用滚珠或滚子把两接触面隔开，摩擦小、所需润滑剂少、启动力矩低。滑动轴承两表面以流体油膜直接接触滑动（如轴颈轴承），适合高载、高速且要求安静运转的场合。�5Rolling-element bearings use balls or rollers to separate the two surfaces, giving low friction and needing little lubricant with low starting torque. Plain bearings have surfaces in sliding contact supported by a fluid film (e.g., journal bearings) and suit high-load, high-speed, quiet-running applications.�ans��src��>SKF 轴承产品技术手册；Shigley《机械工程设计》�?SKF bearing catalogue; Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design'��id�c4c699875e5a�body�٢螺丝上的螺纹像一座小小的斜坡，转动时把旋转的力量变成向里推的力，同时螺纹卡住材料，所以越拧越紧、不容易松脱。ٟA screw's thread is like a tiny ramp that turns twisting into a pushing force, and the grooves grip the material, so it tightens more and resists coming loose.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�c7bbcf1079de�body�ٽ机器人通过摄像头、超声波、激光雷达等传感器来感知周围环境。这些传感器把光、声、距离等信息传给控制器，机器人据此判断障碍和路线。��Robots perceive their surroundings through sensors such as cameras, ultrasonic, and LiDAR devices. These sensors feed light, sound, and distance information to the controller, which then judges obstacles and paths.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�c9074355d618�body�ٺ工厂先把墙和楼板做成大块构件，工地用吊车吊起来对准预留钢筋和接口，再浇一点混凝土把缝连牢。像拼积木一样，房子就很快立起来了。ٳFactories pre-make big wall and floor modules; cranes lift them onto aligned rebar and joints, then a little concrete seals the seams. Like toy blocks, the building rises quickly.�ans��src��BEastman、Teicholz、Sacks & Liston，《BIM手册》（第3版）�;Eastman, Teicholz, Sacks & Liston, 'BIM Handbook' (3rd ed.)��id�d6826341956f�body��r钟表里有大小不同的齿轮互相咬着转。它们按固定速度转动，带动指针指出几点几分。ٍA clock holds gears of different sizes that mesh and turn together. They spin at set speeds and move the hands to show the hours and minutes.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�db9bb1cd1d72�body���电池通过内部化学反应把化学能转化为电能。当电池放电时，化学反应释放电子形成电流；充电时则反向进行，把电能重新变回化学能储存起来。�A battery stores energy by means of internal chemical reactions that convert chemical energy into electricity. During discharge the reactions release electrons as current, and charging reverses the process, storing electrical energy back as chemical energy.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�de941ffb5e4c�body��r碳滑板持续接触接触网取电，弹性悬挂吸收振动，保证高速下稳定供电而不拉弧断流。ْA carbon strip keeps contact with the catenary to draw power; elastic suspension absorbs vibration so supply stays stable at speed without arcing.�ans��src��%IEC 62486（受电弓）；UIC 标准�&IEC 62486 (pantographs); UIC standards��id�ee1a6f50652f�body�ٙ管道内壁锈蚀或沉积的铁锈在长时间不用后随水流冲出；放掉一会儿通常变清，持续发黄则可能是老管或水箱问题。�~Rust from old pipe interiors flushes out after standby; it usually clears, but persistent yellow suggests aging pipes or tank.�ans��src��lNFPA 消防与给水排水规范（NFPA 13/14/25/101）；Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程：处理与回用》�iNFPA fire/plumbing codes (NFPA 13/14/25/101); Metcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering: Treatment and Reuse��id�eng_25_006�body��$摩天大楼其实会轻轻晃动,这是设计好的:像不倒翁一样,晃动把风的力气卸掉。工程师还藏了秘密武器——阻尼器,台北101里挂着一个660吨的大铁球,风一来它反向摆动,把摇晃稳稳抵消。地基深达几十米,像大树的根抓住岩层。�Skyscrapers really do sway a little — on purpose, like roly-poly toys shedding wind's force. Engineers hide secret weapons too: Taipei 101 hangs a 660-ton steel ball that swings opposite the wind to cancel shaking. Foundations reach tens of meters deep like tree roots gripping rock.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�eng_25_007�body��5同名磁极互相排斥——工程师让轨道和列车底部产生强大的排斥力,把几十吨重的列车托离轨道一厘米左右,悬浮滑行。没有轮轨摩擦,它就能安静地跑得又快又稳,时速可达四百多公里,试验中甚至突破每小时600公里,比很多飞机起飞还快。�ILike poles repel: engineers make track and train push apart with mighty magnetic force, lifting the train about one centimeter above the guideway to glide. Without wheel friction it runs quietly and smoothly at over four hundred kilometers per hour — test runs have even passed six hundred — faster than many planes take off.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�f998d435e0ed�body��i地基把房子的重量传到结实的地下土里。地基越深越稳，房子就不容易歪或塌。مA foundation carries the building's weight down into solid ground. The deeper and firmer it is, the less the building leans or falls.�ans��src��8Das《土力学与基础工程》；ACI/API 桩基规范�JDas, Principles of Geotechnical Engineering; ACI/API pile foundation codes��id�fc41d6d6a757�body���硅是半导体，能精确控制导电与否，是做开关的理想材料。但电路细到头发丝万分之一，一粒灰尘落上去就能让线路断掉，所以车间要比手术室还干净。��Silicon is a semiconductor whose conductivity can be precisely controlled, ideal for tiny switches. But circuits are a ten-thousandth of a hair wide, so one dust speck can break a line—hence cleaner-than-operating-room factories.�ans��src��CMay & Spanos，《半导体制造与过程控制基础》（2006）�VMay & Spanos, 'Fundamentals of Semiconductor Manufacturing and Process Control' (2006)��id�ff685b81de43�body��A玻璃在冷却时速度太快，原子来不及排成周期性晶格，被“冻结”成类似液体的无序结构，因此没有长程有序，也没有固定的熔点，而是在一个温度范围内逐渐软化。所以玻璃属于非晶态固体，与金属、陶瓷等晶体材料在原子排列上截然不同。�?When glass cools it does so too fast for atoms to arrange into a periodic lattice, so they are frozen into a liquid-like random structure with no long-range order. It therefore has no sharp melting point but softens over a temperature range, so glass is an amorphous solid distinct from crystalline metals and ceramics.�ans��src��R美国材料与试验协会（ASTM）；Callister《材料科学与工程导论》�SASTM International; Callister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction'��id�0d9e761c5604�body�٢飞船里带着氧气罐，还会用机器把宇航员呼出的二氧化碳和水变成新鲜氧气，就像在太空里种了一台会造空气的魔法盒子。٥The spacecraft carries oxygen tanks and runs machines that turn the carbon dioxide and water the crew exhale back into fresh oxygen, like a magic box that makes air.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1a0475ecb1ab�body�٫把房子架在高高的柱子上，可以让风吹水流通、房子不被潮水泡坏，也方便在底下停小船，就像给房子穿了一双不怕水的高跷鞋。١Lifting the house on tall posts lets wind and water flow underneath, keeps it dry from tides, and gives room for boats, like waterproof stilt shoes for the home.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�1a24c8ea83e0�body��Z风鼓起大大的帆，推着船往前跑。舵手转舵让船朝着想去的方向走。�yWind fills the big sail and pushes the boat forward. The sailor turns the rudder to point the boat where they want to go.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�1fd7dd480789�body��{跷跷板是一根杠杆，中间有个支点。坐得离支点远一点，轻轻一压就能把另一边的人抬起来。�A seesaw is a lever with a pivot in the middle. Sit farther from the pivot and a small push lifts the person on the other side.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�2149517dec00�body�ِ山体本身是一道天然屏障，城墙只需补上缺口；高处视野开阔便于燃烽传讯，且敌人仰攻更费力、难架云梯。ٸMountain ridges are natural barriers, so the wall only needs to fill the gaps. High ground gives a wide view for beacon signals, and attackers must climb upward, making scaling harder.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�23527cb20280�body�ٱ肥皂分子一头亲水、一头亲油，亲油端钻进油污，亲水端朝外，把油滴包成小团带到水里冲走。这样油就不粘在手上，能被水冲掉了。��Soap molecules have a water-loving end and an oil-loving end; the oil-loving end dives into grease while the other faces out, wrapping oil into tiny blobs carried away by water, so it rinses off your hands.�ans��src��)Atkins，《物理化学》（第10版）�'Atkins, 'Physical Chemistry' (10th ed.)��id�25a71adc9c2d�body�ٽ那层白雾大多是极冷的液氧或燃料泄漏后遇热空气凝结成的小水珠，也有部分是喷水降温产生的水蒸气。它不是燃料本身，而是水汽形成的云。��The white cloud is mostly tiny water droplets from super-cold liquid oxygen or fuel condensing in warm air, plus steam from water sprayed to cool the pad. It's water vapor, not the fuel itself.�ans��src��QHuzel & Huang，《液体推进剂火箭发动机现代设计》（NASA SP-125）�`Huzel & Huang, 'Modern Engineering for Design of Liquid-Propellant Rocket Engines' (NASA SP-125)��id�31350e4eb2ba�body��o大楼里面有钢铁架子撑着，像人的骨头一样。地基也挖得很深，把楼稳稳扎在地下。قA skyscraper has a steel frame inside, like bones in a body. Its foundation is dug deep to hold the building firmly in the ground.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�34fcf34c3f48�body�ف电机带动叶轮在腔内制造低于大气压的负压，外界空气裹着灰尘从吸口被压进来，滤网把灰留下。�sA fast impeller makes lower pressure inside, so outside air rushes in carrying dust through a filter that traps it.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�3b49ffd91155�body�ي线路用通风管路基、热棒（重力式虹吸）、碎石护坡和主动冷却，把热量带走、保持冻土终年冻结稳定。ٺThe line uses ventilated embankments, thermosyphons (gravity-fed heat pipes), crushed-stone slopes and active cooling to remove heat and keep the permafrost frozen and stable year-round.�ans��src��u程国栋等关于青藏铁路路基主动冷却措施的论文,载于《Cold Regions Science and Technology》(2008)ٍCheng G D et al., Application of the roadbed cooling approach in Qinghai-Tibet Railway engineering, Cold Regions Science and Technology, 2008��id�3f6546b6f55b�body���风扇只是把空气搅动起来，它自己的电动机还在把电变成热，房间温度其实会略微上升。人觉得凉，是因为流动的空气把皮肤旁边被体温烘热的空气层吹走，并加快汗液蒸发，而蒸发要带走大量热量，皮肤的散热效率就提高了。所以风扇在闷热、汗不容易蒸发的时候最管用；空调则是真的把屋里的热搬到室外去，温度计上的数字才会往下走。��A fan only stirs the air and its motor even adds a little heat, so room temperature edges up rather than down. People feel cooler because moving air sweeps away the warm film of air hugging the skin and speeds up sweat evaporation, and evaporation carries off a lot of heat, raising the skin's cooling rate. That is why a fan helps most in muggy stillness, whereas an air conditioner genuinely moves heat out of the room, which is what makes the thermometer fall.�ans��src��<ASHRAE Handbook—Fundamentals（2021），第9章 热舒适�AASHRAE Handbook—Fundamentals (2021), Chapter 9, Thermal Comfort��id�419adf3bf070�body��i潜水艇肚子里有水舱，装满水就变重往下潜。把水排出去变轻，它就浮回水面。مA submarine has tanks in its belly. Fill them with water and it gets heavy and dives; pump the water out and it gets light and rises.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�4cf87079b353�body�ٖ把支点放在靠近重物的地方，你在一头轻轻一压，另一头就能把重物翘起来，就像用一根棍子当魔法手臂借力气。ًPut the pivot near the heavy object and a small push on your end lifts the load on the other, as if the stick lends you a magic strong arm.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�4d39be1c008a�body�ٽ红绿灯里有定时器或埋在路下的传感器，数着每边等了多少车和等多久。轮到别的方向时，控制器就让它变红、让另一方向变绿，大家轮流走。��Traffic lights use timers or sensors buried in the road that count cars and wait time. When it's another direction's turn, the controller turns this one red and the other green, so everyone takes turns.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�4edeb3d935da�body���电池里有两种不同的材料泡在电解液里，化学反应会把电子推到一侧积存起来。用电器接通时，电子从一边流向另一边形成电流，反应慢慢消耗完电就没了。��A battery has two different materials in an electrolyte; chemical reactions pile electrons on one side. When you connect a device, electrons flow from one side to the other as current, and the reaction runs down until empty.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�524eb8d0a552�body�٫桥墩要把整座桥和上面跑的车重量稳稳传到河底地基上。做得粗粗的才不容易被压坏，也能扛住水流和船撞的推挤，桥才站得牢。��Piers must carry the whole bridge and the traffic weight down to the riverbed. Making them thick keeps them from being crushed and lets them resist water flow and boat bumps, so the bridge stands firm.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�5df446d9ad40�body��u单发质量超过火箭运力，所以把模块分别送上天后在轨对接拼装，既灵活又能随时扩展。�yA single launch exceeds rocket capacity, so modules are sent up separately and docked in orbit—flexible and extensible.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6e61ea82806f�body��{不是。花纹沟槽在雨天把胎面下的水排出，防止水滑失去抓地；也帮助散热和咬住泥雪路面。�hGrooves channel water away to prevent hydroplaning and add grip in mud and snow and help dissipate heat.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�75776a58b6cb�body�ٷ机翼做成上面弯下面平，上面空气跑得更快、压力变低，下面压力相对高，就把机翼往上托。这个上下压力差就是升力，飞机才飞得起来。��The wing is curved on top and flatter below, so air moves faster above and pressure drops there while pressure stays higher below, pushing the wing up. This pressure difference is lift, and that is how planes fly.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�778799af4dc1�body�ي沉管在岸上预制、浮运到位再沉放对接，对繁忙航道和海底起伏适应好，接缝与抗震可控，且工期更短。��Tunnel elements are prefabricated on land, floated out and sunk into place. This suits busy shipping lanes and uneven seabeds, with controllable joints and seismic behavior and a shorter schedule.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�79287ed7ebd7�body�ٺ风车叶片虽然转得慢，但连着很多级齿轮把转速放大，再带动发电机里的线圈快速切割磁力线产生电。叶片越大、风越强，发出的电就越多。ٸThough the blades turn slowly, gears multiply the speed to spin the generator's coils fast through magnetic fields to make electricity. Bigger blades and stronger wind mean more power.�ans��src��(Burton，《风能手册》（第2版）�(Burton, 'Wind Energy Handbook' (2nd ed.)��id�823652266dbe�body���长条把手本身就是一根杠杆，手掌、手肘甚至手臂随便压一下就能产生足够的转动力矩；圆球门把必须用手指抓住再靠摩擦扭转，手上有水、戴着手套或握力不足时很容易打滑。把手的形状还直观地告诉人应该往下压，这种一看就知道怎么用的特征在设计学里叫示能，能减少试错。因此无障碍设计规范普遍要求公共通道的门采用可用握拳或手肘操作、不需要抓握和转腕的把手形式。�/A lever handle is literally a lever, so a palm, elbow or even forearm can generate ample turning moment, whereas a round knob must be gripped by the fingers and twisted through friction, which slips when hands are wet or gloved or grip strength is low. The handle's shape also visibly suggests pushing down, a self-explanatory cue designers call an affordance that spares people trial and error. Accessibility codes accordingly require door hardware on public routes to be operable with a closed fist or elbow, without tight grasping or twisting of the wrist.�ans��src��HNorman，《The Design of Everyday Things》（修订扩充版，2013）�HNorman, 'The Design of Everyday Things' (Revised and Expanded ed., 2013)��id�85e57eac5263�body�ه卫星飞得又快又高，地球的拉力让它转弯绕着地球跑。它一直往前冲又一直被拉弯，就停在天上转圈。ًA satellite flies very fast and high. Earth's pull bends its path into a circle, so it keeps racing forward while falling around the Earth.�ans��src��(Curtis，《轨道力学》（第4版）�>Curtis, 'Orbital Mechanics for Engineering Students' (4th ed.)��id�87314cc87fb0�body��i圆顶把上面的重量分散到整个边上。这样没有一处受力太大，屋顶就不容易塌。�{A dome spreads the weight above it all around its curved edge. No single spot bears too much, so the roof rarely collapses.�ans��src��nHibbeler《结构分析》/《材料力学》；Shigley《机械工程设计》；Timoshenko《板壳理论》هHibbeler, Structural Analysis / Mechanics of Materials; Shigley, Mechanical Engineering Design; Timoshenko, Theory of Plates and Shells��id�889f37f75697�body�ل吸尘器里面有个小风扇，转起来把空气往外抽。里面的空气变少，外面的空气带着灰尘被吸了进去。�yA vacuum has a small fan that pushes air out. With less air inside, outside air rushes in and carries dust along with it.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�8a9936bcf786�body�ٱ踏板连着齿轮和链条，链条把前面齿轮的转动传到后轮的小齿轮上。齿轮比让踩的力气变成更快的转动，后轮就跟着转起来带车前进。��The pedals connect to a gear and a chain that carries the spinning to a smaller gear on the rear wheel. The gear ratio turns your pushing into faster rotation, so the wheel spins and the bike moves.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�8e279e3f071d�body��u轮子把滑动变成滚动，滚动时地面只轻轻蹭着轮子。这样不用花大力气就能把东西推走。ٌWheels turn sliding into rolling, and the ground only lightly touches them as they turn. That lets you push heavy things with little effort.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�96f5d80f969c�body���微波炉用微波让食物中的水分子快速抖动发热。金属杯子会把微波反射甚至打火，所以不行；玻璃和标明可微波的塑料能让微波穿过、自己不怎么吸热，因此安全。��Microwaves make water molecules in food vibrate and heat up. Metal cups reflect microwaves and can spark, so they're unsafe; glass and microwave-safe plastics let waves pass through without heating much, so they're fine.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�9920e4b32b85�body��u面包机里面有发热的丝，通电后就变红发烫。把面包放进去，热丝就把面包烤得香香的。�tA toaster has wires inside that glow hot when electricity flows. The hot wires toast the bread until it smells nice.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�9b7a30f21ae9�body�ن约7.9 km/s，是物体在地球表面附近绕地球做匀速圆周运动所需的最小速度，也是近地轨道的环绕速度。�sAbout 7.9 km/s, the speed needed to orbit Earth near its surface, the circular orbital velocity in low Earth orbit.�ans��src��SBate, Mueller & White《天体力学基础》；NASA 轨道力学；开普勒定律�[Bate, Mueller & White, Fundamentals of Astrodynamics; NASA orbital mechanics; Kepler's laws��id�9f215ffb388d�body���这类标志灯内部带有自备蓄电池，平时由市电充电，一旦外部供电中断，控制电路立刻切换到电池供电，让灯继续亮够规定的时间（常要求三十分钟以上）。火灾里浓烟遮挡视线、走廊一片漆黑，人往往只能沿着贴近地面的持续光带和箭头找到最近的出口，所以规范要求这些标志常亮、配备用电源并定期做断电试验。这也是为什么它们不能被货物遮挡，更不能随便把电源关掉。�WSuch signs contain their own rechargeable battery kept topped up by the mains, and when external supply fails the control circuit switches instantly to battery power so the sign stays lit for a required period, commonly at least thirty minutes. In a fire, smoke blocks vision and corridors go dark, so people can often only follow the continuous glow and arrows near floor level to the nearest exit, which is why codes require these signs to remain illuminated, have standby power and be tested by simulated power failure. It is also why they must never be blocked by goods or switched off casually.�ans��src��HNFPA 101《Life Safety Code》关于出口标志与应急照明的规定�PNFPA 101, 'Life Safety Code', requirements for exit signs and emergency lighting��id�a04833683bfe�body���防弹玻璃是把多层硬玻璃和柔软的塑料夹层粘在一起，子弹打来时硬层把力分散、软层把能量吸收并兜住碎片。普通玻璃一撞就碎成尖片，根本挡不住。��Bulletproof glass bonds many hard glass layers with soft plastic interlayers; the hard layers spread the force and the soft layers absorb energy and catch shards. Ordinary glass just shatters into sharp pieces and cannot stop a bullet.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�a2a69a4e7c6b�body�٨它用摄像头、雷达和激光像眼睛一样不停扫描周围，电脑马上认出红绿灯和走路的人。它一刻不停地“看”，比人还不敢闭眼。ٽIt scans around continuously with cameras, radar and lasers, and the computer instantly recognizes lights and walking people. It 'watches' nonstop and dares not shut its eyes like we might.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�a2c14045868e�body��u船的身体很宽很轻，把水往旁边推开。推开的水会用力把船托起来，所以船不会沉下去。ىA boat is wide and light, pushing water out to the sides. The pushed-aside water pushes back up, holding the boat up so it does not sink.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�a98e2aab5127�body��l火箭尾巴喷出滚烫的气体，气体往下冲。用力往下的同时，火箭就被推着往上飞。�{A rocket blasts hot gas out of its tail, pushing downward. As the gas goes down hard, the rocket is pushed up into the sky.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�a9ad797e6719�body�ف这里大气极稀薄、阻力小，还能用货运飞船定期补推维持轨道；同时又方便载人往返和对地观测。٘The air is thin enough that drag is small yet cargo craft can periodically reboost the orbit, while crew transport and Earth observation stay practical.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�b05b7ba7efd4�body�َ它们靠多台电机持续对抗重力悬停，能量消耗大，而电池能量密度远低于燃油，因此通常只能飞20到40分钟。ْThey spend energy fighting gravity to hover, and batteries have far lower energy density than fuel, so flights usually last only 20 to 40 minutes.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�c05278d67958�body��{机器人身体里有小马达，还有会想事情的电脑。电脑下令，马达转动，机器人就走路或转头。ٌA robot has small motors and a tiny computer that thinks. The computer gives orders, the motors spin, and the robot walks or turns its head.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�cd07bc9eb84b�body���滑轮是一个会转的小轮子，绳子绕在上面。你往下拉绳子，轮子就把力换了个方向，把另一头的东西提起来——站着往下拉比弯腰往上抬更方便。��A pulley is a small turning wheel with a rope over it. When you pull the rope down, the wheel changes the force's direction and lifts the object on the other end—pulling down while standing is handier than bending to lift up.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�d4d4cc5d9ed4�body��x洗碗机喷水柱冲掉油污，再用热水和洗洁精把脏东西泡松。最后再冲一遍，碗碟就干净了。ًA dishwasher sprays water jets to wash off grease, then uses hot water with soap to loosen the dirt. A final rinse leaves the plates clean.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�d72361ee985f�body�ٺ保温瓶内壁是双层玻璃，中间抽成真空，真空不传热的传导和对流都被切断，再加镜面反射挡住辐射。热被“关”在里面，所以水很久都烫。��A thermos has double glass walls with a vacuum between them; the vacuum blocks heat conduction and convection, and a silvered surface reflects radiation. Heat is trapped inside, so water stays hot for ages.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�db35f01061de�body��x冰箱里面有会吸热的管子，把里面的热气搬走。里面变凉，细菌长得慢，食物就不容易坏。�mA fridge has pipes that pull heat out of the inside. It stays cool, germs grow slowly, and food lasts longer.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�dc062a0b002a�body�ٮ按下按钮会打开水箱里的阀门，存水快速冲进马桶，借落差和虹吸把脏水连同废物从弯管吸走排到下水道，然后水箱再慢慢蓄满水。��Pressing the button opens a valve in the tank; stored water rushes in and, using the drop and siphon action, sucks the waste through the curved trap into the sewer, then the tank slowly refills.�ans��src��'White，《流体力学》（第8版）�"White, 'Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�de64bcb7dbcc�body��f风吹动风车的长叶子，叶子连着里面的转轴。风一推，叶子转起来就能发电。فWind pushes the long blades of a turbine, which are joined to a spinning shaft inside. As the blades turn, they make electricity.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�eng_25_001�body�ٯ圆轮子滚起来又稳又顺,骑车的人不会被颠得一跳一跳。方轮子的角会磕磕绊绊,骑一下卡一下。轮子转一圈,车就稳稳地向前走一大步!ٍRound wheels roll smooth and steady; square corners would bump and jolt every step. One turn of a round wheel carries you smoothly far ahead!�ans��src��>David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988�;David Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988��id�eng_25_002�body���电线里住着看不见的小小电流精灵。开关一按,路就通了,精灵们飞快地跑过灯泡里的细丝,丝一发热就发出光来。再按一下,门关上,灯就熄了。所以不能把手指伸进插座哦!��Tiny electric helpers live inside wires. Flip the switch and the road opens: they race through the bulb's thin filament, which glows hot with light. Flip again, the door closes and the lamp sleeps. Never put fingers in sockets!�ans��src��>David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988�;David Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988��id�eng_25_003�body���吊车有长长的铁胳膊和一个大大的配重屁股,像跷跷板一样保持平衡。它的钢缆滑轮能提起几十辆汽车那么重的东西,还能转圈把货物轻轻放到高楼上去。ٿA crane has a long arm and a heavy counterweight bottom, balancing like a seesaw. Its steel cables and pulleys lift loads as heavy as dozens of cars and swing them gently onto tall buildings.�ans��src��>David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988�;David Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988��id�eng_25_004�body���电梯像一个会飞的房间,头顶有结实的钢缆拉着它,机器轮子慢慢收放缆绳,它就稳稳上下。电梯不会累,但很守纪律:超重了会响铃,门没关好就不出发。��An elevator is a flying room held by strong steel cables. Machines wind them slowly and it glides up and down. Elevators never tire, but they follow rules: too heavy rings a bell, doors must close before moving.�ans��src��>David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988�;David Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988��id�f0c718a21e31�body�ل白漆掺了玻璃微珠等逆反射材料，车灯照上去把光原路返给司机，夜间更醒目；白对比强也易辨识。�xGlass beads make the paint retroreflective so headlights bounce back to drivers at night; white also contrasts strongly.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�f7a806cb80d9�body��l气球里的空气被烧热后变轻了。轻的空气往上飘，就把气球和篮子一起带上了天。وThe air inside the balloon is heated and becomes lighter. Light warm air floats upward, lifting the balloon and its basket into the sky.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�fb4c8c168145�body��i斜坡把又高又陡的路拉长了。一步步慢慢上，每次只用一点点力，就不那么累。�wA ramp stretches a steep climb into a longer, gentler path. You use a little force many times, so it feels much easier.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�fccf49536229�body���把沙子里的二氧化硅高温熔化成液体再快速冷却，不结晶就成玻璃。它的电子结构没有能吸收可见光的能级间隙，所以可见光直接穿过去，看起来透明。��Silica from sand is melted at high temperature and cooled quickly without crystallizing into glass. Its electronic structure has no energy gap to absorb visible light, so light passes through and it looks transparent.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�fe7ba68c56e8�body��o降落伞张开像一把大伞，兜住很多空气。空气托着它，让人慢慢、安全地落到地上。ـA parachute opens like a big umbrella and catches lots of air. The air holds it up, so the person floats down slowly and safely.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�ff6bd29dd3d8�body���工程师先把一套动作编成程序存进控制器，电机和编码器精确记住每个角度。每次运行都按同样的数字指令走，所以它能一模一样地重复成千上万次。��Engineers program a sequence into the controller, and motors with encoders precisely remember each angle. Every run follows the same digital commands, so it repeats identically thousands of times.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�00d0b1b695a0�body���垂度指悬索桥主缆在塔间自然下垂形成的弧线最低点与塔顶的高度差。垂度越大，主缆水平拉力越小但所需锚碇和塔高增加。设计时要平衡材料用量与受力。�Sag is the vertical drop from the tower tops to the lowest point of the main cable's natural curve between towers on a suspension bridge. Greater sag reduces the cable's horizontal tension but needs larger anchorages and taller towers. Designers balance material use against the forces.�ans��src��QHibbeler《结构分析》；AASHTO 桥梁规范；悬索桥工程（Leonhardt）�fHibbeler, Structural Analysis; AASHTO bridge specifications; suspension bridge engineering (Leonhardt)��id�01212a806117�body���WDM把多路不同波长的光信号在发送端通过合波器合成一束光注入同一根光纤传输，接收端再用分波器把各波长分离出来，实现一根光纤同时承载多路信号。由于每路波长互相独立、互不干扰，光纤容量就按波长数成倍增长，再加上每路采用高速调制和相干接收，单纤容量可达几十Tbps。它与时分复用不同，是在光域维度上的复用。�VWDM combines multiple signals on different optical wavelengths into one beam at the transmit end via a multiplexer, sends them down the same fibre, and at the receive end a demultiplexer separates the wavelengths again, so a single fibre carries many channels at once. Because the wavelengths are independent and do not interfere, capacity grows in proportion to the number of wavelengths, and with high-speed modulation and coherent detection each channel is very fast, pushing single-fibre capacity to tens of Tbps. Unlike time division multiplexing, it multiplies capacity in the optical domain.�ans��src��)Keiser《光纤通信》；Corning 光纤�;Keiser, Optical Fiber Communications; Corning optical fiber��id�020e2d0774ad�body���固定参数控制器在设计工况附近表现最好，一旦对象特性改变，例如反应釜物料变化或飞机油量减少导致质量下降，性能就会退化。自适应控制在线辨识对象参数或直接调整控制器增益，使控制律随工况变化。常见形式有增益调度、模型参考自适应和自校正调节器。难点在于辨识需要足够激励，且必须保证辨识与控制耦合时整体依然稳定。�^A fixed-gain controller performs best near its design operating point, and performance degrades once plant characteristics change, for example when reactor feedstock changes or an aircraft grows lighter as fuel burns off. Adaptive control identifies plant parameters online or adjusts controller gains directly so the control law tracks the changing conditions. Common forms are gain scheduling, model reference adaptive control and self-tuning regulators. The difficulties are that identification needs sufficient excitation and that the coupled identification and control loop must remain stable overall.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�02fd3e59da54�body�٨公差限定了零件尺寸的允许偏差，配合（间隙、过盈）决定两零件是轻松装入还是紧压连接，直接影响装配顺利度与运转精度。٩Tolerance bounds allowed size deviation; fit (clearance or interference) decides whether parts slide or press together, affecting ease of assembly and running precision.�ans��src��HGroover《现代制造基础》；ISO 公差与配合标准（ISO 286）�LGroover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; ISO limits and fits (ISO 286)��id�03b6b89f82bb�body�ٷ铝合金在铝中加入铜、镁等元素提高强度，同时保留轻质和耐腐蚀。它广泛用于飞机、汽车和门窗。通过热处理或加工硬化可进一步增硬。��Aluminum alloy adds elements like copper and magnesium to aluminum to raise strength while keeping it light and corrosion-resistant. It is widely used in aircraft, cars, and window frames. Heat treatment or work hardening can harden it further.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�06bb52941fff�body���常用指标包括上升时间反映响应快慢，超调量表示最大冲过目标的百分比，调节时间指进入误差带并保持所需的时间，稳态误差衡量最终偏离目标多少。这些指标相互制约，追求快就容易超调，压低超调往往变慢。工程上还要看抗扰恢复能力和对参数变化的鲁棒性，而不只看单一阶跃曲线。��Typical metrics are rise time for how quickly the system responds, overshoot for the percentage by which it passes the target, settling time for how long until it stays within an error band, and steady-state error for the final offset from the target. These conflict with one another: pushing for speed invites overshoot, while suppressing overshoot usually slows the response. Engineers also examine recovery from disturbances and robustness to parameter changes, not just one step curve.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�07a99fce2cbe�body�٫沉井是一个在地面预制、靠自重或压重逐层下沉的井筒结构，常用于桥梁墩台、泵站和深基坑，能在水下或软土中形成坚固井壁。٣A caisson is a prefabricated shaft that sinks under its own weight, used for bridge piers, pump stations and deep pits, forming strong walls in water or soft soil.�ans��src��QHibbeler《结构分析》；AASHTO 桥梁规范；悬索桥工程（Leonhardt）�fHibbeler, Structural Analysis; AASHTO bridge specifications; suspension bridge engineering (Leonhardt)��id�088a8b541da6�body���V2X 让车与红绿灯、路侧设备和云端互相通信，能提前知道弯道后堵车或盲区里有行人，突破视距限制。车和路一起做决策，比单车闭眼硬扛更可靠。��V2X lets cars talk to signals, roadside units and the cloud, learning of hidden congestion or pedestrians beyond line of sight. Car and road decide together, more reliable than a lone car coping blindly.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�08ccd526dd06�body���热电偶利用两种金属接点的温差电动势，量程宽可达上千摄氏度，响应快、结构结实、成本低，但灵敏度低、需要冷端补偿，精度一般。热电阻如铂电阻靠金属阻值随温度变化测温，在零下二百到六百摄氏度范围内精度高、稳定性好、线性优良，但价格较高、响应较慢且需要考虑引线电阻。高温炉窑用热电偶，实验室和过程精密控温多用铂电阻。��A thermocouple uses the thermoelectric voltage of a junction between two metals, offering a wide range up to thousands of degrees Celsius, fast response, rugged construction and low cost, but low sensitivity, a need for cold-junction compensation and modest accuracy. A resistance thermometer such as a platinum RTD infers temperature from metal resistance, giving high accuracy, good stability and excellent linearity from about minus two hundred to six hundred degrees Celsius, at higher cost, slower response and with lead resistance to consider. Furnaces use thermocouples, while laboratories and precise process control usually use platinum RTDs.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�09c036831978�body���悬挑结构是只有一端固定、另一端向外伸出而下方无支撑的构件，如阳台和檐口。它靠固定端内部的弯矩和配重来维持平衡。悬挑越长，固定端承受的力矩越大。�%A cantilever is a structural member fixed at only one end and extending outward with no support below, such as a balcony or overhang. It stays in balance through the bending moment and counterweight at the fixed end. The longer the cantilever, the greater the moment the fixed end must resist.�ans��src��L《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012,中国建筑工业出版社,2012�hLoad Code for the Design of Building Structures GB 50009-2012, China Architecture & Building Press, 2012��id�0a9517f8847a�body���风冷冰箱把蒸发器藏在箱体后部的风道里，风机吹动箱内空气经过蒸发器降温除湿，水汽全部凝结在这块看不见的翅片上，所以食品间看不到霜。控制器按压缩机累计运行时间或化霜传感器判断结霜量，定期停止制冷并接通蒸发器上的电加热丝几分钟，融化的水沿排水槽流到压缩机上方的接水盘，靠压缩机余热蒸发掉。化霜期间压缩机与风机停转，箱体保温使内部只升温几度且时间很短，随后立即恢复制冷；代价是电加热与循环风机带来额外能耗，箱内空气偏干使不密封的食物更容易失水。��A frost-free unit hides its evaporator in an air duct behind the cabinet, and a fan draws cabinet air across those cold fins so all moisture condenses there instead of on food shelves. A controller decides from accumulated compressor run time or a defrost sensor when to pause cooling and switch on an electric heater at the evaporator for a few minutes; meltwater drains to a pan above the compressor and evaporates using its waste heat. During defrost the compressor and fan stop while the insulated cabinet limits warming to a few degrees for a short time before cooling resumes, the costs being extra energy for heater and circulating fan and drier air that desiccates unwrapped food.�ans��src��ADossat 与 Horan，《Principles of Refrigeration》（第5版）�7Dossat & Horan, 'Principles of Refrigeration' (5th ed.)��id�0b586b4220ec�body��)HBM 把多片存储裸片垂直堆叠，并通过硅通孔（TSV）和极宽的并行接口与处理器在 2.5D 中介层上紧邻互连。相比 DDR 的窄位宽长走线，HBM 以更短的距离和更宽的通道传输数据，可在较低时钟下提供远高于 DDR 的带宽并降低能耗。�bHBM stacks multiple memory dies vertically and connects them to the processor through through-silicon vias (TSV) and a very wide parallel interface on a 2.5D interposer. Compared with DDR's narrow bus and long traces, HBM transfers data over a shorter distance with a much wider channel, delivering far higher bandwidth at a lower clock with less energy.�ans��src�٨Jun, Cho, Lee, Son,《HBM (High Bandwidth Memory) DRAM Technology and Architecture》,2017 IEEE International Memory Workshop (IMW),2017 (DOI: 10.1109/imw.2017.7939084)٦Jun, Cho, Lee, Son, 'HBM (High Bandwidth Memory) DRAM Technology and Architecture', 2017 IEEE International Memory Workshop (IMW), 2017, DOI: 10.1109/imw.2017.7939084��id�0c040f2d2962�body��i把长建筑分成几个独立单元，避免温度胀缩和地震扭转时各段互相撕扯、开裂。�|Joints split a long building into independent blocks so thermal expansion and quake twisting don't tear the structure apart.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�0c35d2204e2f�body���边缘计算把数据处理放在靠近数据源的网络边缘，避免所有数据都上传云中心，从而降低时延、节省带宽、减少网络依赖，并可在本地处理敏感数据。自动驾驶需要在几十毫秒内完成环境感知和决策，工业设备需要毫秒级的实时控制，云端往返延迟无法满足，因此必须在车载或工厂边缘完成低延迟计算，云端只承担训练模型和大数据分析等非实时任务。�(Edge computing processes data near its source instead of shipping everything to a central cloud, cutting latency, saving bandwidth, reducing dependence on the network and keeping sensitive data local. Autonomous driving must finish perception and decision-making within tens of milliseconds, and industrial machines need millisecond-level real-time control, which round-trips to the cloud cannot meet, so low-latency computation happens at the vehicle or factory edge while the cloud handles offline tasks such as model training and big-data analytics.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0c4384ce8b86�body�ه超高层按规范间隔设避难层，防火防烟、有独立通风和救生口，是火灾时暂时避险等待救援的安全岛。�{Very tall buildings place refuge floors at intervals, fire and smoke proof with independent air and access, as safe havens.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�0c8f31007a31�body�َ1779年英国科尔布鲁克代尔铁桥用铸铁首次造出大跨度拱，证明工业铁件可做承重结构，开启金属桥梁时代。كThe 1779 Iron Bridge in Britain used cast iron for a large arch, proving metal could carry loads and starting the metal-bridge era.�ans��src��0Trinder《铁桥》(1979)；The Iron Bridge 1779�ETrinder, The Iron Bridge (1979); The Iron Bridge, Coalbrookdale, 1779��id�0e6891ca23eb�body��SLED的电流随正向电压呈指数增长，正向压降还会随温度升高而下降。用恒压源供电时，温度稍升就会导致电流增大、发热更多，形成热失控，亮度和寿命都受影响。恒流驱动直接把电流锁定在设计值，电压自动适配，因此亮度稳定、色温一致、器件更耐久。��LED current rises exponentially with forward voltage, and the forward drop itself falls as temperature rises. Fed from a constant-voltage source, a small temperature rise increases current and heating further, leading to thermal runaway that harms brightness and lifetime. A constant-current driver fixes the current at the design value and lets the voltage settle wherever it needs to, giving stable brightness, consistent colour temperature and longer life.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�102c7b905ff0�body���充电时锂若沉积不均会长成针状枝晶，在液态电池里可能刺穿隔膜造成短路起火；在固态电池里它同样会沿缝隙钻长、撑裂脆弱的固界面。抑制枝晶是两类电池共同的难题。��Uneven plating grows needle-like lithium dendrites that can pierce the separator and short-circuit a liquid cell, and in solid cells they creep through gaps and crack the brittle interface. Suppressing dendrites is a shared challenge.�ans��src��iTarascon & Armand，《可充电锂电池面临的挑战》，《自然》414卷，359–367页（2001）�nTarascon & Armand, 'Issues and challenges facing rechargeable lithium batteries,' Nature 414, 359–367 (2001)��id�104e47d518e0�body�ي把洗浴洗衣等较干净灰水经简单处理（过滤消毒）后用于冲厕、绿化，省下饮用水；需独立管道防混用。فGreywater from baths and laundry is filtered and disinfected for toilets and irrigation via separate pipes, saving potable water.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�10db6113dbbc�body���编码器把转轴角位移转为电信号，用于位置与速度反馈。增量式输出相对脉冲、断电后需回零；绝对式直接给出唯一绝对角度编码，上电即知位置，抗掉电但成本较高。�An encoder converts shaft angular displacement to electrical signals for position and speed feedback. Incremental encoders output relative pulses and need homing after power loss; absolute encoders give a unique absolute angle, known at power-up, but cost more.�ans��src��0《传感器技术》（机械工业出版社）�,Fraden, Handbook of Modern Sensors, Springer��id�115be46cae29�body��]细辐条主要受拉、效率高又轻，迎风面积小阻力低；实心盘重且兜风。�hThin spokes work in tension—light and efficient with low drag; a solid disc is heavy and catches wind.�ans��src��+Shigley《机械工程设计》；轮力学�7Shigley, Mechanical Engineering Design; wheel mechanics��id�12101e308f92�body��2增量编码器只输出变化的脉冲，断电后位置信息丢失，重新上电必须先找零点。绝对值编码器每个角度都有唯一编码，上电即知实际关节角，省去回零动作，也避免撞到工件。对多圈运动的关节则采用多圈绝对式或加电池记忆圈数。��An incremental encoder only outputs pulses for change, so position is lost at power-down and the joint must be homed after every restart. An absolute encoder gives a unique code for each angle, so the true joint position is known the moment power is applied, removing the homing move and the risk of colliding with the workpiece. Joints that turn many revolutions use multi-turn absolute encoders or battery-backed turn counters.�ans��src��?Craig，《机器人学导论：力学与控制》（第4版）�BCraig, 'Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control' (4th ed.)��id�13845549124d�body���机翼上表面弯曲使气流流速更快，依据伯努利方程动压升高导致静压降低；下表面流速慢、静压较高，上下压差形成向上的升力。实际升力还离不开迎角造成的环量与牛顿第三定律的反作用。�&The curved upper surface speeds up airflow, lowering static pressure by Bernoulli's equation, while the slower lower surface keeps higher pressure, and the pressure difference produces upward lift. In practice lift also relies on the angle-of-attack circulation and Newton's third law reaction.�ans��src��-《流体力学》（清华大学出版社）�.Fundamentals of Fluid Mechanics, Munson et al.��id�1388c614f80d�body�ِ叶片靠变速齿轮箱或直驱发电机把低速大扭矩变成高频电，加上叶片长、扫风面积大，捕获的风功率并不小。�wA gearbox or direct-drive generator turns slow, high-torque rotation into usable power; long blades sweep a large area.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�142a3fa5a9a5�body���锌保护钢铁有两层机制：物理上，锌层把钢与水、氧气隔开，阻挡腐蚀介质；更重要的是锌比铁活泼，是"牺牲阳极"——即使表面划破露出钢，锌也会优先腐蚀，通过电偶作用让钢免锈。热浸镀锌把钢件浸入熔融锌液，形成与钢材冶金结合的锌铁合金层，寿命可达数十年。造船、桥梁、风电塔筒等长期暴露的钢构件都大量采用，这是最经济的长效防腐手段之一。�Zinc protects steel in two ways: physically the coating seals the steel from water and oxygen, and more importantly zinc is more active than iron, so it acts as a sacrificial anode — even where the coating is scratched, the zinc corrodes first and protects the steel galvanically. Hot-dip galvanizing immerses parts in molten zinc, forming a metallurgically bonded zinc-iron alloy layer that can last decades. Ships, bridges, and wind-tower legs in harsh environments rely on it as one of the cheapest long-term corrosion defenses.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�1500623883ff�body�� 烟道气体积大、二氧化碳浓度相对低且含水蒸气与杂质，捕集溶剂再生能耗高会显著削减电厂净效率（常称能效惩罚）。还需解决设备腐蚀、溶剂降解与大型吸收塔的占地成本，使整体成本与系统兼容性成为部署关键。�rFlue gas is large in volume with relatively low CO2 concentration and contains water vapor and impurities, so solvent regeneration consumes energy that notably cuts net plant efficiency (the energy penalty). Corrosion, solvent degradation, and the footprint and cost of large absorbers also matter, making overall cost and system compatibility the deployment bottleneck.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�160f2c5b2bbe�body���气凝胶约99%是空气，骨架是纳米级网络，固相传热路径被切得极碎，气体又被困在小于自由程的孔里难以对流。于是对流、传导、辐射都被压制，成为顶级隔热材料。��Aerogel is about 99% air in a nanoscale network; the solid conduction path is shattered and gas is trapped in pores smaller than its mean free path, suppressing convection. Conduction, convection and radiation are all throttled, making it a top insulator.�ans��src��9Aegerter & Leventis 编，《气凝胶手册》（2011）�6Aegerter & Leventis (eds.), 'Aerogels Handbook' (2011)��id�164d5f4c8788�body�٨充电芯片按先恒流后恒压的协议智能调节，并实时监测温度和电压；快充只是前期提高电流，接近满电时自动放缓以保护电池。ٖA controller follows a constant-current then constant-voltage profile and watches temperature and voltage, tapering off near full to protect the cell.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�164e63e3bcab�body���输电线上损耗功率与电流的平方成正比，升高电压可在相同功率下大幅降低电流，从而减少发热损失。高压只用在输电线路上，到用户端再用变压器逐级降到安全电压，两者并不矛盾。��Line loss grows with the square of current, so raising voltage cuts current for the same power and reduces heat loss. High voltage is only on the lines; transformers step it down to safe levels before it reaches homes.�ans��src��<Stevenson & Grainger，《电力系统分析》（第3版）�7Stevenson & Grainger, 'Power System Analysis' (3rd ed.)��id�168b4a0c8851�body���固体发动机把燃料和氧化剂预先浇铸成药柱，结构简单、可长期贮存、随时点火，推力大而集中，适合助推器和需要快速反应的场合。但它点火后难以关机和调节推力，比冲一般偏低。液体发动机可节流、可多次启动、比冲高，适合入轨与深空机动，代价是系统复杂、需要低温或有毒推进剂管理。�A solid motor has fuel and oxidiser cast together as a grain, giving a simple structure that can be stored for years, ignited on demand, and delivering large concentrated thrust, which suits boosters and quick-reaction missions. Once lit it is hard to shut down or throttle, and specific impulse is usually lower. Liquid engines can be throttled and restarted and offer higher specific impulse, suiting orbit insertion and deep-space manoeuvres, at the cost of complexity and handling of cryogenic or toxic propellants.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�168d1d95d11b�body���斜拉索两端分别锚固在塔柱和桥面梁上，把拉力可靠传递进去。锚固区应力集中，需用特殊构造和高质量混凝土防止开裂。锚具失效会危及整桥安全。�The stay cables are anchored at both ends into the tower and the deck girder to reliably transfer tension. The anchorage zones have stress concentration and need special detailing and high-quality concrete to prevent cracking. Failure of an anchor could endanger the whole bridge.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�171017620a4b�body���发动机把热变成功，制冷机则耗功把热从冷处搬到热处，是逆卡诺循环。压缩机把低温低压气体压成高温高压，使其在室外放热冷凝，从而实现“制冷”。��An engine turns heat into work; a refrigerator spends work to pump heat from cold to hot—a reverse Carnot cycle. The compressor squeezes low-pressure gas into hot high-pressure gas that releases heat outdoors, achieving cooling.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�1725989bc1fd�body���采样定理指出，要无失真地由离散样本重建模拟信号，采样频率须大于信号最高频率的两倍（奈奎斯特率）。否则相邻频谱会混叠，使高频成分错误折叠进低频，无法恢复。�The sampling theorem states that to reconstruct an analog signal from samples without distortion, the sampling rate must exceed twice the highest frequency (Nyquist rate). Otherwise spectral copies alias, folding high frequencies into low ones irrecoverably.�ans��src��?《信号与系统》（奥本海姆，电子工业出版社）�Signals and Systems, Oppenheim��id�17b796d84140�body���奥托循环的理论效率由压缩比决定，但压缩比受爆震限制，加上汽油机空燃比控制在化学计量附近、泵气损失和部分负荷时节气门节流损失大，实际效率远低于理论值。能量去向包括排气带走的热、冷却系统散失的热、摩擦与泵气损失以及不完全燃烧损失。提高效率的路线包括稀薄燃烧、高压缩比加米勒循环、直喷和可变压缩比等。��The theoretical efficiency of the Otto cycle is set by the compression ratio, but knock limits how high the ratio can go, and stoichiometric air-fuel control, pumping losses and throttle losses at partial load push real efficiency far below the ideal. Energy is lost to exhaust heat, coolant heat, friction and pumping, and incomplete combustion. Efficiency routes include lean burn, high compression with the Miller cycle, direct injection and variable compression ratio.�ans��src��Heywood，《内燃机基础》�2Heywood, 'Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals'��id�1818f0090b66�body�ه常用生物相容性好的钛合金、钴铬钼合金以及超高分子量聚乙烯作摩擦面，既耐磨又不易被人体排斥。ٚThey use biocompatible titanium or cobalt-chrome alloys with ultra-high-molecular-weight polyethylene bearing surfaces, wear-resistant and well tolerated.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�18bade824b5a�body�ٓ光电式靠烟雾散射光、离子式靠烟颗粒改变电离电流；单纯油烟颗粒大易触发，所以有厨房专用或带静音抑制。مPhotoelectric and ionization detectors sense smoke particles; greasy fumes can false-trigger, so kitchen-rated or hush features help.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�19cabf529128�body���抽水蓄能是规模最大的电网储能方式：深夜或风电大发时电力过剩、电价低，电站用电把下水库的水抽到高处，把电能变成水的重力势能；白天用电高峰时再放水，让水流推动水轮机发电。往返效率约70%到80%，损耗来自水泵水轮机的摩擦和蒸发。它响应快、一次可存数百万度电，是调峰、调频和支撑新能源消纳的主力。�7Pumped storage is the grid's largest energy-storage technology: when power is surplus and cheap — overnight or when wind peaks — it uses electricity to pump water from the lower reservoir up to the upper one, storing energy as gravitational potential energy; at daytime peak, the water flows back down through turbines to generate. Round-trip efficiency is roughly 70-80%, with losses to pump-turbine friction and evaporation. It responds within minutes, holds millions of kWh, and is the backbone of peak shaving, frequency regulation, and renewable integration.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�19e6ba0e7d7a�body���多主元造成严重晶格畸变、缓慢扩散和“鸡尾酒效应”，既阻碍位错运动提高强度，又靠混乱结构延缓裂纹。传统合金靠一两种主元，反而少了这种协同强化。��Many principal elements cause severe lattice distortion, sluggish diffusion and a 'cocktail effect', blocking dislocations for strength while the disordered structure slows cracks. Traditional alloys with one or two main elements miss this synergy.�ans��src��iYeh 等，《多主元纳米结构高熵合金》，《先进工程材料》6卷，299–303页（2004）�wYeh et al., 'Nanostructured high-entropy alloys with multiple principal elements,' Adv. Eng. Mater. 6, 299–303 (2004)��id�19f4de8ced5e�body���抽水蓄能在用电低谷时用多余电把水抽到上库，高峰时放水发电，相当于巨型充电宝。它响应快，是电网调峰和消纳风光的重要手段。全球储能装机中它占大头。�Pumped storage uses surplus power at low-demand times to pump water uphill to a reservoir, then releases it to generate at peaks, acting like a giant power bank. It responds quickly and is key for grid balancing and absorbing wind and solar. It dominates global storage capacity.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�19fc89757deb�body���交流电在导体内产生的涡流会把电流挤向表面，频率越高电流分布越集中在薄薄的表层，这就是集肤效应。它使导体的有效截面变小，交流电阻高于直流电阻，发热增加。把导线分成许多细股并绞合，甚至采用每股都单独绝缘并周期换位的利兹线，可以增大有效导电面积，显著降低高频损耗。��Eddy currents induced by alternating current push the current toward the conductor's surface, and the higher the frequency the thinner the layer that carries it, which is the skin effect. It reduces the effective cross-section so AC resistance exceeds DC resistance and heating rises. Splitting a conductor into many fine strands and twisting them, or using Litz wire in which each strand is separately insulated and transposed, increases the effective conducting area and markedly cuts high-frequency loss.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�1a852a6a8763�body���雷诺数是惯性力与粘性力的比值，反映了流体“想乱跑”还是“被粘住”。数值小则粘性主导、分层平稳（层流）；数值大则惯性主导、出现涡团翻滚（湍流）。��The Reynolds number is the ratio of inertial to viscous forces—how much fluid 'wants to wander' versus 'is held back'. Low values mean viscosity dominates calm layering (laminar); high values mean inertia dominates with swirling turbulence.�ans��src��'White，《流体力学》（第8版）�"White, 'Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�1a9f45511f1a�body��o拱把水压传给两岸坚固岩体，省大量混凝土；重力坝则靠自身重量挡水、需好地基。مThe arch transfers water pressure into the abutments, saving concrete; a gravity dam relies on its own weight and needs solid ground.�ans��src��nHibbeler《结构分析》/《材料力学》；Shigley《机械工程设计》；Timoshenko《板壳理论》هHibbeler, Structural Analysis / Mechanics of Materials; Shigley, Mechanical Engineering Design; Timoshenko, Theory of Plates and Shells��id�1ab79116ae9a�body��k折流板安装在壳程中，使壳侧流体在管束间反复横向折流流动，从而强化湍流、增加流体与管壁的接触路径。相比直线流动，这种流动提高了对流传热系数，同时支撑管束、抑制管子振动并减小管子的跨距变形。折流板间距过小会增大压降，设计时要在传热与压降之间权衡。��Baffles in the shell side force the shell-side fluid to flow back and forth across the tube bundle, promoting turbulence and lengthening the contact path with the tube surfaces. This raises the convective heat-transfer coefficient compared with straight-through flow, while also supporting the tubes, suppressing vibration, and limiting tube span deflection. Too small a baffle spacing raises pressure drop, so design balances heat transfer against pumping cost.�ans��src��:ASHRAE Handbook—Fundamentals,ASHRAE,Atlanta 年度更新�8ASHRAE Handbook - Fundamentals, Atlanta, recent editions��id�1abf4e862562�body��W直流电机的转向取决于绕组电流方向，单个开关管只能通断而不能改变极性。H桥用四个开关管组成两条支路，导通对角的两个管子就让电流从一个方向流过电机，导通另一对则反向。控制器必须防止同一侧上下管同时导通造成直通短路，因此要插入死区时间。��A DC motor's direction depends on the direction of current through its winding, and a single switch can only interrupt current, not reverse its polarity. An H-bridge uses four switches in two legs; turning on one diagonal pair sends current through the motor one way, and the other pair reverses it. The controller must prevent the upper and lower switches of one leg conducting together, which would be a shoot-through short, so a dead time is inserted.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�1b318153b243�body���傅里叶把信号拆成稳态的正弦分量，适合看频率和频谱；拉普拉斯多了指数衰减项，能处理暂态、增长和不稳定系统。工程上常先用拉普拉斯解响应，再借傅里叶看频率特性。��Fourier decomposes signals into steady sinusoids, good for frequency and spectrum; Laplace adds exponential terms to handle transients, growth and unstable systems. Engineers often solve response with Laplace, then read frequency behavior via Fourier.�ans��src��8Oppenheim & Willsky，《信号与系统》（第2版）�4Oppenheim & Willsky, 'Signals and Systems' (2nd ed.)��id�1bfc4d5e9599�body�٨它们模仿自然界结构，如莲叶的自清洁、壁虎脚趾的粘附、贝壳的层状增韧，用微观结构设计出疏水、强韧或自修复的新材料。ُThey mimic nature, lotus self-cleaning, gecko adhesion, shell layering, using micro-structure for hydrophobic, tough or self-healing materials.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1df7198cab02�body��^D形把载荷集中在背部直边，强度高、减少门部弯曲，受力路径最合理。�gThe D shape puts load on the straight back spine, maximizing strength and reducing bending at the gate.�ans��src��%UIAA 121（登山装备）；EN 12275�'UIAA 121 (climbing equipment); EN 12275��id�21b71f136096�body�ٽ无刷电机用电子换向取代碳刷，没有机械磨损和火花，效率更高、寿命更长，而且转速范围和功率密度更好，适合需要精确调速的机器人关节。��Brushless motors replace carbon brushes with electronic commutation—no mechanical wear or sparks, higher efficiency and longer life, plus better speed range and power density, ideal for precisely controlled robot joints.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�2353d9394824�body���电池电压较低时用恒定电流快速注入电量，此时限制电流是为了控制发热和极化，避免锂在负极沉积成枝晶。当电压升到截止值后改为恒压，电流自然逐渐衰减，让锂离子有时间充分嵌入，从而在不超压的前提下把容量充满。若一直恒流会导致过压析锂，若一直恒压则初期电流过大，两段式是安全与速度的折中。�,While the cell voltage is low, a constant current pushes charge in quickly, and limiting that current controls heating and polarisation so lithium does not plate as dendrites on the anode. Once the voltage reaches the cut-off value the charger holds voltage constant and the current tapers naturally, giving lithium ions time to intercalate fully and filling the capacity without overvoltage. Constant current alone would overcharge and plate lithium, constant voltage alone would draw excessive initial current, so the two stages balance safety and speed.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�24d130bf86df�body���谐波减速靠柔轮在椭圆凸轮挤压下与刚轮差几个齿来慢速输出，结构极紧凑、零背隙。行星齿轮则靠多级太阳轮与齿圈啮合，思路是刚性分流传力。��A harmonic drive uses a flexible gear squeezed by an elliptical cam to engage a rigid ring a few teeth off, yielding slow output in tiny space with zero backlash. Planetary gears instead split torque through rigid sun-ring meshes.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�253c62d7d534�body���传统四到二十毫安模拟信号一根线只能传一个变量，而且无法回传设备状态。现场总线用一对线挂接多台设备，除测量值还能传诊断信息、量程和标定参数，接线量和端子数大幅减少。工业以太网进一步提高带宽，支持时间敏感调度实现确定性通信，便于与上层信息系统直接互通。代价是需要网络规划、诊断工具和网络安全防护。�2A traditional four-to-twenty milliamp loop carries only one variable per pair of wires and cannot report device status. A fieldbus hangs many devices on one pair and carries diagnostics, range and calibration data as well as the measurement, cutting wiring and terminal counts dramatically. Industrial Ethernet raises bandwidth further and supports time-sensitive scheduling for deterministic communication, integrating directly with higher-level information systems. The trade-offs are the need for network design, diagnostic tools and cybersecurity protection.�ans��src��VIEC 61131-3（PLC）；ISO 3691-4（AGV 安全）；Groover《自动化生产系统》�zIEC 61131-3 (PLC); ISO 3691-4 (AGV safety); Groover, Automation, Production Systems, and Computer-Integrated Manufacturing��id�2958d179dc20�body�ِ每个喷头玻璃球内有感温液体，达到温度就胀破出水，只有起火点附近升温的喷头动作，既灭火又减少水损。فEach head's glass bulb bursts only when locally heated, so only near-fire heads spray, fighting fire while limiting water damage.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�2abb5f7e8a1d�body���弯折时刚性电极会开裂断路，柔性电池用蛇形导线、海绵状电极和可延展封装，让内部导电通路在拉伸弯曲中仍保持连通。这样手表手环才能随意弯折而不掉电。��Rigid electrodes crack and break circuit when bent; flexible cells use serpentine traces, spongy electrodes and stretchable packaging so conductive paths survive stretching. That lets watches and bands flex without losing power.�ans��src��gRogers & Huang，《可拉伸电子材料的力学与设计》，《科学》327卷，1603页（2010）�_Rogers & Huang, 'Materials and mechanics for stretchable electronics,' Science 327, 1603 (2010)��id�2ad28782696d�body�ِ变电站通过变压器升高或降低电压，并借助开关设备分配、保护电路，是连接发电、输电与配电的关键节点。ٛA substation transforms voltage up or down and uses switches to route and protect circuits, the key node linking generation, transmission and distribution.�ans��src��5Stevenson《电力系统分析》；IEEE 输电标准�IStevenson, Elements of Power System Analysis; IEEE transmission standards��id�2ae848578e56�body���软件越改越复杂，一处修改可能悄悄破坏远不相干的功能，这就是回归缺陷。自动化测试把检查变成可重复执行的代码：单元测试验证单个函数或模块的行为，集成测试检查模块之间的配合，端到端测试走完整的用户流程。每次代码提交由持续集成（CI）自动触发全套测试，几分钟内就能知道有没有破坏。它比人工点击更快更准，给了开发者不断修改代码的信心。�Software grows complex, and one change can quietly break unrelated features elsewhere — a regression. Automated testing turns checks into repeatable code: unit tests verify individual functions or modules, integration tests check how modules cooperate, and end-to-end tests walk through complete user flows. Continuous integration (CI) reruns the whole suite on every commit and reports breakage within minutes. It is faster and more reliable than clicking through a UI by hand, and it gives developers the confidence to keep changing code.�ans��src���S. Freeman, N. Pryce《测试驱动的面向对象软件开发》(GOOS) 第3章 (人民邮电出版社) ; 另见: S. Freeman, N. Pryce, Growing Object-Oriented Software, Guided by Tests, Addison-Wesley, 2009��S. Freeman, N. Pryce, Growing Object-Oriented Software, Guided by Tests, Addison-Wesley, 2009 ; see also: S. Freeman, N. Pryce《测试驱动的面向对象软件开发》(GOOS) 第3章 (人民邮电出版社)��id�2ae9fd6f801a�body��Z链牙的斜面互相扣住，滑块引导它们啮合或分离，楔形把力传导开。�iThe teeth's slopes lock together; the slider guides them to mesh or split as a wedge transfers the force.�ans��src��&Sundback 1917 拉链专利；拉链史�4Sundback zipper patent (1917); history of the zipper��id�2afd097e6c52�body��k微分对信号变化率敏感，而噪声通常是高频小幅波动，其变化率却很大，因此微分放大了噪声而不是有用信号。表现为控制量剧烈抖动、执行器频繁动作发热。工程上给微分通道加低通滤波、采用不完全微分，或改用微分先行、只对测量值微分不对设定值微分的形式来缓解。��Differentiation responds to rate of change, and noise is typically small in amplitude but high in frequency, so its rate of change is large and the derivative amplifies noise rather than the useful signal. The result is violently chattering control output and actuators that work hard and overheat. Practical fixes include low-pass filtering the derivative path, using a filtered or incomplete derivative, or taking the derivative of the measurement only rather than of the setpoint.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�2b29a36d30bb�body���控制回路要求每个采样周期都在确定时间内完成采集、运算和输出，偶尔的延迟会直接破坏控制品质甚至引发事故。实时性关注的是最坏情况下的响应时间上界和抖动，而不是平均速度快。因此工业控制器使用实时操作系统、固定周期任务调度和确定性网络，宁可牺牲平均吞吐量来换取时间可预测性。��A control loop must complete acquisition, computation and output within a bounded time every sampling period, since an occasional delay directly degrades control quality or even causes an incident. Real-time behaviour is about the worst-case bound on response time and its jitter, not about high average speed. Industrial controllers therefore use real-time operating systems, fixed-cycle task scheduling and deterministic networks, sacrificing average throughput for predictability in time.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2d2e1dd47682�body�ل米水混合物沸腾时温度保持在约100℃；水收干后锅底温度迅速越过100℃上升，温控器据此跳到保温。�{While boiling the pot stays near 100℃; once water is gone the temperature climbs, and a thermostat switches to keep-warm.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�2d7fdd677a46�body��r那660吨配重会随大楼反向摆动，像钟摆一样吸收风致振动的能量，把晃动幅度压下来。قThe 660-tonne mass swings opposite to the building, acting like a pendulum that soaks up wind-induced vibration and cuts the sway.�ans��src��NSmith & Carss《调谐质量阻尼器》；Structural Design of Tall Buildings�FSmith & Carss, Tuned Mass Dampers; Structural Design of Tall Buildings��id�2e44ad010e0a�body��l低于路面的绿地先暂存雨水、下渗回补地下水，溢出的再进管网，从而削峰减涝。هGreen belts below road level store runoff and let it soak into groundwater; only overflow enters pipes, cutting peak flow and flooding.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�2f404ee252a2�body���步进电机是开环运行，控制器只管发脉冲，并不知道转子实际到了哪里。如果加速太快、负载转矩超过该转速下的输出，或者出现共振，转子跟不上磁场就会漏掉步数，且误差永久累积。解决办法是合理设计加减速曲线、留足转矩余量、采用细分驱动降低振动，或改用闭环步进和伺服电机。��A stepper runs open loop: the controller sends pulses without knowing where the rotor actually is. If acceleration is too aggressive, load torque exceeds the available torque at that speed, or resonance occurs, the rotor cannot follow the field and steps are lost, with the error accumulating permanently. Remedies include proper acceleration profiles, adequate torque margin, microstepping to reduce vibration, or moving to closed-loop steppers or servo motors.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�311ad204aaf1�body���版本控制记录代码文件的每一次修改，相当于给代码库拍快照。Git的分支让多人能并行开发不同功能而不互相踩踏；提交记录"谁在何时改了什么"；两人改到同一处时，合并会提示冲突供人工解决。一旦出错，可以回退到任意历史版本，或用二分查找定位到引入缺陷的那次提交。它是团队协作、代码审计和发布管理的地基。��Version control snapshots every change to the codebase. Git's branches let many people develop features in parallel without stepping on each other; commits record who changed what and when; if two people edit the same lines, merging flags a conflict for a human to resolve. When something breaks, you can revert to any historical state or bisect to the exact commit that introduced the bug. It is the foundation of teamwork, auditing, and release management.�ans��src��LBeecher,《Getting Started with Git》,2020 (DOI: 10.1007/978-1-4842-6353-2)�IBeecher, 'Getting Started with Git', 2020, DOI: 10.1007/978-1-4842-6353-2��id�311b0af84f32�body��l是的。氩气等保护气把空气隔开，防止熔池氧化、气孔和脆化，焊缝才牢固美观。�rShielding gas keeps air away from the molten pool to prevent oxidation, porosity, and brittleness for sound welds.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�312e57d15328�body��z气开阀在失去气源时靠弹簧回到全关，气关阀失气时回到全开。选择依据是失气或停电这一故障状态下，哪种阀位对工艺更安全：燃料进气阀通常选气开，失气即切断燃料；换热器冷却水阀常选气关，失气时全开保证冷却。这体现了故障安全位的设计思想，属于工艺安全分析的一部分。��An air-to-open valve springs fully closed when air supply is lost, while an air-to-close valve springs fully open. The choice depends on which position is safer for the process in the failure state of lost air or power: a fuel gas valve is usually air-to-open so fuel is cut off on failure, whereas a cooling water valve on a heat exchanger is often air-to-close so it opens fully and keeps cooling. This reflects the fail-safe position principle and forms part of process safety analysis.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�31cfa56159c7�body���氢原子会渗入金属晶界，使材料变脆、在远低于设计应力下开裂。普通高强度钢和某些焊缝容易中招，因此输氢设备往往要改用低强度钢、奥氏体不锈钢或特殊涂层。��Hydrogen atoms seep into metal grain boundaries, making it brittle and cracking below design stress. Common high-strength steels and some welds are vulnerable, so hydrogen equipment often uses low-strength steel, austenitic stainless or special coatings.�ans��src��8ASM手册第20卷，《材料选择与设计中氢脆》�NASM Handbook Vol. 20, 'Materials Selection and Design: Hydrogen Embrittlement'��id�32e71bdcad24�body�٥在建筑物与基础间设橡胶隔震支座，延长结构自振周期、避开地震主频，使上部结构运动大幅减弱，类似把楼浮在柔性层上。ٷRubber bearings between building and ground lengthen the natural period away from the quake's dominant frequency, greatly reducing motion, like floating the structure on a soft layer.�ans��src��1ASCE 7-16；FEMA P-749《地震隔离与耗能》�4ASCE 7-16; FEMA P-749, Earthquake Protective Systems��id�33bc4dde7235�body�ٖ表面抗反射蓝膜减少光反射、让更多光进入硅片发电，蓝色是膜与硅的干涉色；黑色板多为高效双面或特定工艺。�sA blue anti-reflective coating cuts reflection so more light enters the silicon; the hue is an interference effect.�ans��src��<Green & Emery《太阳能电池原理》；NREL 光伏研究�7Green & Emery, Solar Cells; NREL photovoltaics research��id�36aa1c0c311c�body��k低轨物体相对速度可达每秒十公里量级，一颗厘米级碎片的动能就足以击穿舱壁。为减少碎片增长，低轨卫星寿命末期要主动降低轨道，让大气阻力在数十年内使其再入烧毁；同步轨道卫星则抬升到坟墓轨道。国际准则还要求钝化剩余能源，避免贮箱和电池爆炸产生新碎片。��Relative speeds in low orbit reach around ten kilometres per second, so even a centimetre-sized fragment carries enough energy to punch through a spacecraft wall. To limit debris growth, low-orbit satellites lower their orbit at end of life so atmospheric drag causes reentry and burn-up within a few decades, while geostationary satellites are boosted into a graveyard orbit. Guidelines also require passivating stored energy so tanks and batteries cannot explode and create new fragments.�ans��src��(Curtis，《轨道力学》（第4版）�>Curtis, 'Orbital Mechanics for Engineering Students' (4th ed.)��id�36df7b3a202b�body�ٍ核电机组需要巨量冷却水带走余热，临水取排水方便；也因机组大、需远离密集城区并便于重型设备水运。�~Reactors need huge cooling water flows and sit away from dense cities, with waterways easing both cooling and heavy transport.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�36f8b9ca8923�body��~交流电可用变压器轻松升压远距离输电、损耗小，战胜直流；家用电器的直流再由适配器变换。�vAC won because transformers enable efficient long-distance high-voltage transmission; devices' DC comes from adapters.�ans��src��2Hughes《权力的网络》(1983)；IEEE 电力史�BHughes, Networks of Power (1983); IEEE history of electrical power��id�3747962a7a08�body�ٺ它描述裂纹尖端附近应力场的强弱，随外载和裂纹长度变化。把算出的K和材料的断裂韧性K_IC比较，K超过临界值裂纹就失稳扩展，否则安全。��It characterizes the stress field near a crack tip and grows with load and crack length. Comparing computed K to the material's fracture toughness K_IC tells you: exceed the critical value and the crack runs; otherwise it is safe.�ans��src��<Anderson，《断裂力学：基础与应用》（第4版）�MAnderson, T.L., 'Fracture Mechanics: Fundamentals and Applications' (4th ed.)��id�375020b69854�body��w它们按耐火极限（常2–4小时）设计，目的是为人员疏散和灭火争取时间，并非永久隔离。�xThey are rated by fire-resistance (often 2–4 hours) to buy time for evacuation and firefighting—not to seal forever.�ans��src��)NFPA 252（门防火测试）；UL 标准�6NFPA 252 (fire tests of door assemblies); UL standards��id�376271352735�body�ٮ它用机械臂或龙门架把混凝土或特种砂浆按数字模型逐层挤出堆叠，像写毛笔字一样打印墙体，可节约模板与人力、实现异形结构。ٝA robotic arm or gantry extrudes concrete layer by layer per a digital model, printing walls like brush strokes, saving formwork and enabling organic shapes.�ans��src��GBehrokh Khoshnevis,《Contour Crafting》,Academic Press(Elsevier),2006�5B. Khoshnevis, Contour Crafting, Academic Press, 2006��id�3791bacd5426�body���常规工艺为混凝、沉淀（或澄清）、过滤与消毒四步。混凝使细小颗粒脱稳絮凝，沉淀与过滤去除悬浮物，最后消毒杀灭病原微生物，保障微生物安全。�Conventional treatment has four steps: coagulation, sedimentation (or clarification), filtration, and disinfection. Coagulation destabilizes fine particles into flocs; sedimentation and filtration remove suspended matter; disinfection kills pathogens for microbial safety.�ans��src��3《给水工程》（中国建筑工业出版社）�/Water Treatment Principles and Design, AWWA/MWH��id�37d36242a936�body���老城区的合流制管道把雨水和污水混在一起，暴雨时水量远超管道容量，检查井就会冒水溢流。管内沉积的有机物在厌氧条件下产生硫化氢等臭气，随气流从井口冒出。��Older combined sewers mix stormwater and sewage; heavy rain overwhelms capacity and manholes overflow. Anaerobic deposits release hydrogen sulfide and other foul gases that vent through the openings.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�37d627b0a398�body��t失速取决于迎角而不是速度，因此机身上装有随气流偏转的迎角风标或压差探头，实时测量迎角。当迎角接近临界值时，系统触发抖杆器或语音警告，提醒飞行员推杆减小迎角。现代飞机还有失速保护，会自动限制驾驶输入，但传感器故障可能导致虚假触发，所以通常有多套冗余。��Stall depends on angle of attack rather than speed, so the airframe carries a vane or differential-pressure probe that measures angle of attack directly. As it approaches the critical value the system fires a stick shaker or aural warning telling the pilot to push forward and reduce the angle. Modern aircraft add stall protection that limits control inputs automatically, but a faulty sensor can trigger it falsely, so multiple redundant probes are fitted.�ans��src��}Anderson，《Fundamentals of Aerodynamics》（第6版）；FAA《Airplane Flying Handbook》(FAA-H-8083-3C) 高空运行章�|Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.); FAA 'Airplane Flying Handbook' (FAA-H-8083-3C), high-altitude operations��id�38d0c1d6baa2�body���国际通行把自动驾驶分0到5级：0级全人工，2级以下为辅助驾驶，3级起系统可在特定场景接管，4级高度自动，5级完全自动无需方向盘。目前多数量产车处于2级水平。�8The common standard ranks driving automation from 0 to 5: level 0 is fully manual, below level 2 is driver assistance, from level 3 the system can take over in defined situations, level 4 is high automation, and level 5 is full automation with no steering wheel needed. Most production cars today are at level 2.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�3a97ac8986bc�body���氯价廉、持续抑菌（余氯）且操作简便，是最普及的消毒剂。但它与水中天然有机物反应生成三卤甲烷等消毒副产物，长期摄入有健康风险，因此需控制投量与前置去除有机物。�;Chlorine is cheap, leaves a residual (free chlorine) that inhibits regrowth, and is easy to apply, making it the most common disinfectant. But it reacts with natural organic matter to form trihalomethanes and other disinfection byproducts, a long-term health concern, so dosage and precursor removal are controlled.�ans��src��3《给水工程》（中国建筑工业出版社）�/Water Treatment Principles and Design, AWWA/MWH��id�3b98e8309e46�body�ٍ不会。电梯通常有数根并列钢缆、极少同时断；即便失速，限速器也会触发安全钳把轿厢死死夹在导轨上。ٌNo. Several ropes run in parallel and rarely all fail; if speed runs away, a governor triggers safety gears that clamp the car to the rails.�ans��src��4ASME A17.1，《电梯与自动扶梯安全规范》�6ASME A17.1, 'Safety Code for Elevators and Escalators'��id�3dfd197405e8�body��?机翼上表面气流快压强低，上下压差产生升力。�>Faster flow above the wing lowers pressure, lifting the plane.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�3e356fa32501�body���焚烧使垃圾体积减少约85%至90%、质量减少约70%，燃烧释放的热量通过余热锅炉产生蒸汽推动汽轮发电机发电，炉渣经处理后还可作为建材，实现了减量与资源化。二噁英的控制核心是三T加E原则（温度、停留时间、湍流和过量空气）：保持炉温850摄氏度以上、烟气在高温区停留2秒以上、加强湍流混合并保证足够过量空气，再配合活性炭吸附和布袋除尘，把二噁英排放降到极低水平。�oIncineration shrinks waste volume by roughly 85 to 90 percent and mass by about 70 percent; the combustion heat raises steam in a waste-heat boiler to drive a turbine generator, and treated bottom ash is reused in construction, achieving both reduction and resource recovery. Dioxin control follows the 3T plus E rule (temperature, time, turbulence and excess air): furnace temperatures above 850 degrees Celsius, gas residence above 2 seconds at high temperature, strong turbulent mixing and sufficient excess air, together with activated-carbon injection and bag filters that cut dioxin emissions to extremely low levels.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�3f07c324aaf7�body�ٟ它们是安装在航天器上的小推力喷口，通过短暂喷气产生力矩，用来调整飞行姿态、保持太阳能板对日或天线对地指向。فSmall jets on a spacecraft fire briefly to create torque, adjusting attitude so solar panels face the Sun or antennas face Earth.�ans��src��@Sutton《火箭推进原理》；NASA；Tsiolkovsky 火箭方程�ESutton, Rocket Propulsion Elements; NASA; Tsiolkovsky rocket equation��id�3f1206561a17�body���光伏在轻载正午大发时向线路反向倒送功率，使馈线末端电压抬升越上限。常见缓解手段包括有载调压变压器、无功补偿、逆变器功率因数调节以及储能就地消纳。��At midday low load with high PV output, reverse power flow raises the voltage at feeder ends beyond limits. Mitigations include on-load tap changers, reactive compensation, inverter power-factor control, and local battery storage absorption.�ans��src���Tonkoski, Lopes 与 El-Fouly,《Coordinated Active Power Curtailment of Grid Connected PV Inverters for Overvoltage Prevention》,IEEE Transactions on Sustainable Energy 2(2): 139-147,2011 (DOI: 10.1109/tste.2010.2098483)��Tonkoski, Lopes and El-Fouly, 'Coordinated Active Power Curtailment of Grid Connected PV Inverters for Overvoltage Prevention', IEEE Transactions on Sustainable Energy 2(2): 139-147, 2011, DOI: 10.1109/tste.2010.2098483��id�4045788e9746�body��f后掠减小垂直于前缘的气流分量，推迟激波和阻力激增（提高临界马赫数）。هSweep reduces the flow component normal to the leading edge, delaying shock waves and the drag rise (raising the critical Mach number).�ans��src��2Anderson《空气动力学基础》；飞机性能�<Anderson, Fundamentals of Aerodynamics; aircraft performance��id�411279d41077�body���调制是用基带信息改变高频载波的幅度、频率或相位。调制的目的是把信号搬移到适合天线辐射与频道分配的频带，并支持多路复用与抗干扰传输。��Modulation varies a high-frequency carrier's amplitude, frequency, or phase with baseband information. It shifts the signal to a band suited for antenna radiation and channel allocation, and enables multiplexing and interference resistance.�ans��src��9《通信原理》（樊昌信，国防工业出版社）�*Communication Systems Engineering, Proakis��id�424b5beb1c16�body���BIM 给每个构件挂上尺寸、材料、工期和成本等信息，能在电脑里提前做碰撞检查和施工模拟。图纸冲突、管线打架在开工前就被发现，减少返工和浪费。��BIM attaches data—dimensions, materials, schedule, cost—to each component and lets teams run clash detection and construction simulation beforehand. Conflicts are caught before breaking ground, cutting rework and waste.�ans��src��BEastman、Teicholz、Sacks & Liston，《BIM手册》（第3版）�;Eastman, Teicholz, Sacks & Liston, 'BIM Handbook' (3rd ed.)��id�432c32082a68�body���1940年塔科马大桥的倒塌是空气动力颤振造成的，而不是被强风直接吹垮或强度不足。桥面在风中开始扭转振动，振动又改变了气流分离的方式，气动力反过来给振动"加能量"，振幅越来越大，这就是气动弹性自激振动，直到中间桥面被扭断、大桥解体。这个教训让工程师认识到：大跨柔性桥梁必须做风洞试验和颤振分析才能动工。��The 1940 Tacoma Narrows Bridge fell to aeroelastic flutter, not to strong wind or insufficient strength. The deck began torsional oscillation, and the motion altered how airflow separated, feeding energy back into the vibration — a self-excited oscillation that grew until the mid-span section tore apart and the bridge broke up. The disaster taught engineers that flexible long-span bridges must pass wind-tunnel testing and flutter analysis before they are built.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�4379f61fc5f4�body���风扇靠叶片推动空气获得动量，风量与叶片线速度近似成正比，转速越高单位时间推动的空气越多。低速时叶片只是轻轻拨动空气，产生的流速和风量都很小。��A fan imparts momentum to air by its blades; airflow roughly scales with blade tip speed, so higher rpm pushes more air per second. At low speed the blades merely nudge the air, giving little flow.�ans��src��'White，《流体力学》（第8版）�"White, 'Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�44818fa0be9b�body���放大时三极管工作在放大区，集电极电流约等于基极电流乘放大倍数，管子上有较大电压和电流同时存在，因此发热明显，输出与输入成比例。开关时它在截止区和饱和区之间跳变，要么几乎不导通，要么两端压降很小，功耗低。数字电路和电机驱动追求开关状态，音频与传感器前端才用放大区。��For amplification the transistor works in the active region, where collector current is roughly base current times gain and appreciable voltage and current coexist, so it dissipates noticeable heat while the output tracks the input proportionally. As a switch it jumps between cut-off and saturation, either barely conducting or dropping very little voltage, so losses are low. Digital circuits and motor drives want switching operation, while audio and sensor front ends use the active region.�ans��src��<Streetman & Banerjee，《固态电子器件》（第7版）�@Streetman & Banerjee, 'Solid State Electronic Devices' (7th ed.)��id�44b57a07c513�body��Z防止拉环掉进饮料或环境造成污染，也方便整体回收，更安全卫生。�oIt stops the tab falling into the drink or litter, and stays attached for easier recycling—safer and cleaner.�ans��src��<铝罐设计（Reynolds/Coors  stay-on tab）；罐头工程�AAluminium can design (stay-on tab); can manufacturing engineering��id�44ec1f98a137�body�ه指可灭的火灾类别：A固体如木纸、B液体如油、C气体如燃气；干粉ABC通用，油锅火要用水基或灭火毯。�}A, B, C mark fuel classes, solid, liquid, gas; ABC powder is multipurpose, while cooking-oil fires need wet or blanket types.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�45346b1ab915�body�ٓ鱼道用一连串浅水池和跌水模拟天然缓流，引导洄游鱼逆流越过坝体；设计坡度与流速要匹配鱼的种类才有效。�zA fish ladder mimics gentle rapids with pools so migratory fish climb past the dam; slope and speed must suit the species.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�454cbd64cbb1�body���高铁在钢轮钢轨上运行，靠轮缘和锥形踏面导向与自动对中，不需要橡胶轮胎那样的排水花纹。平整踏面保证高速时接触平稳、噪音低、磨损均匀。��Trains run on steel wheels and rails, guided by the flange and a slightly conical tread that self-centers, so no tread pattern is needed for drainage. A smooth tread gives stable high-speed contact, low noise, and even wear.�ans��src��9Iwnicki 编，《铁路车辆动力学手册》（2006）�@Iwnicki, S. (ed.), 'Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics' (2006)��id�466ca87a84ec�body�ي常用振动、温度、电流和声学信号，例如轴承早期磨损会使振动频谱出现特定频率峰值，据此提前报警。ٝIt uses vibration, temperature, current and acoustic signals; early bearing wear shows characteristic peaks in the vibration spectrum, enabling early alarms.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�4709d9b8e788�body���地基承载力是土层在不发生破坏或过大沉降时能安全承受的压力。工程师通过钻探取样、标准贯入试验和土工试验，结合土力学公式估算这一数值，再乘以安全系数用于设计。��Bearing capacity is the pressure the soil can safely support without failure or excessive settlement. Engineers drill boreholes, run penetration and lab tests, then use soil-mechanics formulas with a safety factor to design foundations.�ans��src��+Das，《岩土工程原理》（第9版）�7Das, 'Principles of Geotechnical Engineering' (9th ed.)��id�480865c3c14c�body���那就是绿波带：工程师把主干道上相邻交叉口的绿灯启亮时间按设计车速错开，让车队以建议时速行驶时正好一路绿灯。更先进的信号控制还能根据路口埋设的检测线圈或视频识别出的车流量，实时调整各相位的绿灯时长，这叫感应控制或自适应控制，可用来优先放行公交车、疏导拥堵。配时还要兼顾行人过街时间与路口间距，绿波不是"永远绿灯"，而是把等待集中在少数路口。�6That is a green wave: engineers offset the green-start times of adjacent intersections along an arterial by the travel time at a design speed, so a platoon rolling at that speed hits green after green. Smarter systems use detection loops or video to measure traffic and re-time phase durations in real time — actuated or adaptive control — which can also prioritize buses and dissolve congestion. Timing must respect pedestrian crossing times and intersection spacing; a green wave does not mean always green, just that delay concentrates at a few intersections.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�4a3a5ece8009�body��A线圈是电感，电流不能突变。开关断开瞬间电感试图维持电流，会在两端产生很高的反向电压尖峰，足以击穿驱动管或干扰电路。反并联的续流二极管为这股电流提供回路，让它在线圈和二极管中缓慢衰减，把电压钳位在一个二极管压降左右。��A coil is an inductor, and its current cannot change instantly. When the switch opens, the inductance tries to maintain current and generates a large reverse voltage spike that can destroy the driving transistor or upset nearby circuits. A reverse-connected freewheeling diode gives that current a path to circulate and decay slowly through the coil, clamping the voltage to about one diode drop.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�4a57218b0cf9�body���有刷电机靠机械电刷与换向器切换电流，结构简单但电刷磨损需维护；无刷电机用电子换向驱动永磁转子，效率高、寿命长、噪声低，但需配套控制器。�Brushed motors switch current mechanically via brushes and a commutator, simple but wearing and maintenance-prone. Brushless motors use electronic commutation driving a permanent-magnet rotor, giving higher efficiency, longer life, and lower noise but needing a controller.�ans��src��*《电机学》（机械工业出版社）�Electric Machinery, Fitzgerald��id�4a724fbe21dd�body���无砟轨道不用碎石道床，而是把轨道板或双块式轨枕直接固定在混凝土底座上。它平顺性好、维护少，能支撑列车以350公里时速平稳运行。京津、京沪等线广泛采用。�Ballastless track replaces the gravel bed with rails fixed directly to a concrete base via track slabs or twin-block sleepers. It offers smooth riding and low maintenance, supporting trains at 350 km/h steadily. It is widely used on lines like Beijing-Tianjin and Beijing-Shanghai.�ans��src�ٴWang, Chen, Chen,《Dynamic Assessment of Ballastless Track Stiffness and Settlement in High-Speed Railway》,2010 Joint Rail Conference, Volume 1,2010 (DOI: 10.1115/jrc2010-36115)ٲWang, Chen, Chen, 'Dynamic Assessment of Ballastless Track Stiffness and Settlement in High-Speed Railway', 2010 Joint Rail Conference, Volume 1, 2010, DOI: 10.1115/jrc2010-36115��id�4a9e2b5bc0d2�body���SCADA偏向对地理上分散的站点做数据采集与监控，例如输油管线、电网变电站和水厂，通信距离长、以采集和远程操作为主，控制逻辑多下放到现场设备。DCS则面向单一大型连续过程，例如化工装置和电厂，强调众多回路的紧耦合闭环调节和统一组态，控制器与操作站在同一厂区高速网络内。近年二者功能不断融合，界限已经模糊。�JSCADA is oriented to acquiring data from and supervising geographically dispersed sites such as pipelines, grid substations and waterworks, with long communication links, emphasis on monitoring and remote operation, and control logic largely delegated to field devices. A DCS targets one large continuous process such as a chemical plant or power station, stressing tightly coupled closed-loop regulation of many loops with unified configuration, its controllers and operator stations on one high-speed plant network. In recent years the two have converged and the boundary has blurred.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�4aee4aa26cba�body�ٜ桥梁能保证平顺的线形和均匀的沉降控制，少占耕地、跨过河流道路，也避免地面起伏和地基不均下沉影响高速平稳。�~Viaducts give a smooth alignment, controlled settlement, and crossings over obstacles while sparing farmland and bumpy ground.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�4b196628afb3�body��_纬度越低，地球自转带来的向东初速度越大，向东发射赤道轨道时可以白赚一部分速度，节省推进剂。靠海则让残骸和一二级落区落在无人海域，降低对地面的风险，同时便于用船运输超大直径箭体。发射极地或太阳同步轨道时纬度优势减小，但落区安全依然重要。��The lower the latitude, the greater the eastward speed given free by Earth's rotation, so launching east into an equatorial orbit gains velocity and saves propellant. A coastal site lets spent stages and debris fall into empty ocean, reducing risk to people, and makes it easier to ship oversized rocket sections by sea. For polar or sun-synchronous orbits the latitude benefit shrinks, but safe drop zones still matter.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�4cb7e313a80e�body���反馈控制持续测量输出并据此修正输入，能抑制模型误差、外部扰动与参数漂移带来的影响，使被控量稳定在期望附近。开环则完全依赖模型准确，对扰动无能为力。�␀Feedback control continuously measures the output and corrects the input, rejecting model error, disturbance, and parameter drift to keep the variable near the setpoint. Open-loop control relies entirely on an accurate model and cannot handle disturbances.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�4ceed00e51e7�body��u竹子的比强度（强度除以密度）接近某些钢材，中空结构很高效，但绝对强度仍低于钢。ٕBamboo's specific strength (strength/density) rivals some steels thanks to its hollow efficient form, but its absolute strength is still below steel.�ans��src��;Callister《材料科学》；Ashby《材料选择》(1999)�TCallister, Materials Science; Ashby, Materials Selection in Mechanical Design (1999)��id�4d70cbdcf87b�body���碳纤维单丝直径只有5到10微米，内部碳原子沿轴向整齐排列成石墨片层，轴向抗拉强度是钢材的数倍，密度却只有钢的四分之一。但单根纤维像线一样不能承压，必须用树脂把成千上万根纤维粘成复合材料层合板，纤维方向还可以按受力方向铺设设计。贵就贵在原料要高温碳化、工艺链长且能耗高，成型还需要热压罐，所以主要用于航空航天、高端汽车和体育器材。�jCarbon fiber filaments are only 5-10 micrometers across, with carbon atoms aligned along the axis in graphite sheets, giving several times steel's tensile strength at a quarter of its density. But a single filament is like a thread and takes no compression, so thousands of fibers must be bonded in resin to form composite laminates, with the fiber direction engineered to match the load path. It is expensive because the raw material must be carbonized at high temperature in a long, energy-hungry process, and curing needs autoclaves — which is why it is reserved for aerospace, premium cars, and sports equipment.�ans��src��$《自然》杂志（材料科学）�Nature (materials science)��id�4d80498025a9�body���胺溶剂靠可逆化学键“抓住”二氧化碳，要把它释放出来必须加热打破该键，这一步叫再生，蒸汽提供了热量。再生能耗正是胺法捕集最贵、最影响经济性的环节。��Amine solvent captures CO2 by a reversible chemical bond that must be broken by heat to release it—a step called regeneration that consumes steam. This regeneration energy is the costliest, most economy-limiting part of amine capture.�ans��src��YRochelle，《胺法捕集二氧化碳》，《科学》325卷，1652–1654页（2009）�QRochelle, G.T. 'Amine Scrubbing for CO2 Capture.' Science 325, 1652–1654 (2009)��id�4f4424205d49�body���永磁同步电机的转子由永磁体提供磁场，无需从定子吸取励磁电流，因而效率更高、功率密度更大，同样的体积和重量能输出更强的扭矩，直接有助于增加续航里程。它体积小、低速扭矩大，配合磁场定向控制能实现精准的转速与扭矩调节。主要缺点是稀土永磁材料（如钕铁硼）价格波动大、高温下有退磁风险。��An EV traction PMSM generates rotor flux from permanent magnets, so it draws no excitation current from the stator and offers higher efficiency and power density, more torque for a given size and weight, which directly benefits driving range. It is compact, delivers strong low-speed torque, and pairs with field-oriented control for precise torque and speed regulation. Its main drawbacks are the cost volatility of rare-earth magnet materials such as NdFeB and the risk of demagnetisation at high temperature.�ans��src��EMohan，《电力电子：变换器、应用与设计》（第3版）�IMohan, 'Power Electronics: Converters, Applications and Design' (3rd ed.)��id�4f6ee0124d16�body��常见思路包括用机械臂或网捕抓取、用系绳拖曳离轨、用离子束或太阳光压等无接触方式推移，以及用充气球囊增大阻力使碎片再入。难点在于目标常翻滚失稳、缺乏接口且任务成本高，需要自主交会抓捕能力。�ECommon ideas are capturing with a robotic arm or net, tether-towing to deorbit, non-contact pushing via ion beam or solar radiation pressure, and inflating a balloon to increase drag for reentry. The hard parts are the target's tumbling, lack of interfaces, and high mission cost, requiring autonomous rendezvous and capture.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�4fcbea2cd4e5�body���电泳涂装把工件浸入带电漆液，靠电场让涂料均匀沉积在表面，连缝隙也能覆盖。它防腐好、涂料利用率高，汽车车身底漆普遍采用。之后还要喷面漆。��Electrophoretic coating dips the part in a charged paint bath so the electric field deposits coating evenly, even into crevices. It gives good corrosion resistance and high paint use, and is standard for car body primers. A topcoat follows.�ans��src��Q《ASM Handbook, Vol. 13A: Corrosion — Fundamentals, Testing, and Protection》�M'ASM Handbook, Vol. 13A: Corrosion — Fundamentals, Testing, and Protection'��id�5025890e91c2�body���MRI机器内部是超导磁体产生的强磁场，场强通常是1.5特斯拉或3特斯拉，约为地磁的3万到6万倍。硬币、钥匙、轮椅等铁磁性物品会被瞬间吸向磁体，速度快到足以伤人损机；体内的金属植入物（如起搏器、人工关节、颅内动脉瘤夹）则可能被牵拉移动、发热或失效。所以受检者必须取下金属并接受安全检查，这是MRI的铁律。��Inside an MRI is a superconducting magnet producing typically 1.5 or 3 tesla — 30,000 to 60,000 times Earth's field. Ferromagnetic objects like coins, keys, wheelchairs, or steel-bearing tattoo inks get yanked toward the magnet fast enough to injure people and damage the machine; metal implants such as pacemakers, joint replacements, and aneurysm clips can be pulled, heated, or disabled. That is why patients must remove all metal and pass screening — it is an absolute rule of MRI.�ans��src��^Kak & Slaney《CT 原理》；Haacke 等《MRI 原理》；超声成像（Hendee & Ritenour）هKak & Slaney, Principles of Computerized Tomographic Imaging; Haacke et al., Magnetic Resonance Imaging; ultrasound (Hendee & Ritenour)��id�532fa730ad88�body�٨常见飞行时间法（ToF）向目标发射激光并测量反射光返回的时间，用光速乘以半程时间得到距离；也有三角测距法用于近距离。١Time-of-flight lidar fires a laser and measures return time, computing distance from light speed and half the travel time; triangulation is used for short range.�ans��src���Wehr, A., Lohr, U.,《Airborne laser scanning—an introduction and overview》, ISPRS Journal of Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing, 1999 (DOI: 10.1016/s0924-2716(99)00011-8)；激光雷达原理ٴWehr, Lohr, 'Airborne laser scanning—an introduction and overview', ISPRS Journal of Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing, 1999, DOI: 10.1016/s0924-2716(99)00011-8; lidar principles��id�538c2431228c�body���隔震支座安装在建筑底部与基础之间，像一层柔软的垫子吸收地震能量。它延长结构的振动周期，让上部建筑随地面缓慢移动而不被剧烈摇晃。日本和汶川部分建筑已采用这种技术。�lA seismic isolation bearing is installed between a building and its foundation, acting like a soft cushion that absorbs earthquake energy. It lengthens the structure's vibration period so the upper building moves slowly with the ground instead of being shaken violently. This technology is used in Japan and in some buildings rebuilt after the Wenchuan earthquake.�ans��src��1ASCE 7-16；FEMA P-749《地震隔离与耗能》�4ASCE 7-16; FEMA P-749, Earthquake Protective Systems��id�5558723afeb7�body���BIM是用三维数字模型整合建筑几何、材料、工期和成本等信息的协同方法。它让设计、施工和运维各方在同一模型上协作，提前发现碰撞冲突。相比传统图纸，它能显著减少返工。�$BIM is a collaborative method that uses a 3D digital model to integrate a building's geometry, materials, schedule, and cost information. It lets designers, builders, and operators work on one shared model and spot clashes early. Compared with traditional drawings, it greatly reduces rework.�ans��src��BEastman、Teicholz、Sacks & Liston，《BIM手册》（第3版）�;Eastman, Teicholz, Sacks & Liston, 'BIM Handbook' (3rd ed.)��id�558f2116f540�body�ٟ它通过控制各单元发射信号的相位差，使合成波束电子扫描指向不同方向，转向快、可同时跟踪多目标，无需机械转动。ّBy controlling phase differences across elements it steers the beam electronically, scanning fast and tracking many targets without moving parts.�ans��src��6Balanis《天线理论》；IEEE 天线与传播学会�>Balanis, Antenna Theory; IEEE Antennas and Propagation Society��id�5686e0f7d5c3�body��V星敏感器用小型相机拍下一小片天区，提取亮星的相对位置构成图形特征，再与星载星表比对匹配。匹配成功后即可解出相机光轴在惯性空间的指向，精度可达角秒级。它是卫星最精确的绝对定姿手段，但被太阳或地球边缘照射时会短暂失效，需要陀螺接续。��A star tracker photographs a small patch of sky, extracts the relative positions of bright stars as a pattern, and matches that pattern against an onboard star catalogue. A successful match yields the camera's pointing in inertial space, with accuracy down to arcseconds. It is a satellite's most precise absolute attitude reference, but glare from the Sun or Earth limb can blind it briefly, so gyroscopes bridge the gap.�ans��src��+Clarke 1945（地球静止轨道）；Wertz�AClarke (1945, geostationary orbit); Wertz, Space Mission Analysis��id�56f32a55954c�body���许多物料需要保持特定温度才能流动或反应，保温层减少热量散失、节约能源并防止管内结晶或凝固。它也保护人员不被烫到，并避免外壁结露腐蚀。��Many streams must stay at a set temperature to flow or react; insulation cuts heat loss, saves energy, and prevents freezing or solidifying inside. It also protects people from burns and stops condensation corrosion.�ans��src��+Cengel，《传热与传质》（第5版）�*Cengel, 'Heat and Mass Transfer' (5th ed.)��id�57849c24fd26�body��~层间封闭空气或充惰性气体形成隔热层，配低辐射镀膜反射热，显著减少冬天散热和夏天得热。�aSealed air or gas layers plus Low-E coatings cut heat flow, slashing winter loss and summer gain.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�5836f5c740c4�body�ٴ低温下锂电池内部离子迁移变慢、内阻增大，可用容量和放电功率都下降，且暖风等附加用电增多。两方面叠加使实际可行驶里程缩短。ٴCold slows ion transport and raises internal resistance in Li-ion cells, cutting usable capacity and power, while cabin heating adds load. Together they shorten real driving range.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�58b472db0178�body�٥它把城市的建筑、管网、交通和能耗建成可计算的虚拟模型，用于洪水推演、交通优化和应急演练，在虚拟中先试错再落地。ٯIt builds a computable virtual model of buildings, pipes, traffic and energy for flood simulation, traffic optimization and drills, testing ideas virtually before real action.�ans��src��eGrieves《数字孪生》(2014/2019)；NASA 预测与健康管理（PHM）；Batty 数字城市研究�oGrieves, Digital Twin (2014/2019); NASA Prognostics and Health Management (PHM); Batty, digital cities research��id�5a1d18bad5af�body���拓扑优化让计算机按载荷路径把多余材料“掏空”，只留下受力必需的骨架，得到像树枝或海绵一样怪异却高效的结构。这种有机形状用传统切削很难做出，正好发挥增材制造的自由度。��Topology optimization lets a computer remove material along load paths, leaving only the skeleton that must carry force—strange but efficient tree- or sponge-like shapes. Such organic forms are hard to machine but ideal for additive freedom.�ans��src��jGibson、Rosen & Stucker，《增材制造技术：从快速原型到直接数字化制造》（第2版）�{Gibson, Rosen & Stucker, 'Additive Manufacturing Technologies: Rapid Prototyping to Direct Digital Manufacturing' (2nd ed.)��id�5d654a753ef3�body�ٍ常用换填、强夯、水泥土搅拌桩（如CFG桩）或预压排水等方法提高承载力、减少沉降，视土质和荷载而定。٧Methods like replacement, dynamic compaction, cement-soil piles (e.g., CFG piles) or preloading drain and strengthen soil to raise bearing capacity and cut settlement.�ans��src��8Das《土力学与基础工程》；ACI/API 桩基规范�JDas, Principles of Geotechnical Engineering; ACI/API pile foundation codes��id�5e45e76dc615�body��`陀螺效应加前叉后倾带来的转向自稳共同作用，速度够时车会自己回正。�xGyroscopic effect plus the self-centering from fork trail keep it upright; fast enough, the bike steers itself straight.�ans��src��.Whitt & Wilson《自行车科学》(MIT Press)�-Whitt & Wilson, Bicycling Science (MIT Press)��id�5e7bcb977301�body�ٱ润滑油在金属表面形成油膜，隔开滚动或滑动接触面，减少磨损和发热。它还帮助散热、防止锈蚀，并冲走磨屑，从而延长轴承寿命。ٮLubricant forms a film that separates the contacting surfaces, cutting wear and heat. It also dissipates heat, prevents rust, and flushes away debris, extending bearing life.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�5eaddb7e7bf6�body��i门封里的磁条让箱门一靠就吸住并压紧软胶条，堵住缝隙减少冷气漏出和结露。�eA magnetic strip snaps the door shut and compresses the seal to stop cold-air leaks and condensation.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�5f1e7edf65d5�body���都江堰是战国时期李冰在成都平原修建的无坝引水工程，用鱼嘴分水、飞沙堰排沙、宝瓶口控水。它至今仍在灌溉上千万亩农田。体现了顺应水势的生态智慧。�@Dujiangyan is a dam-free diversion system built by Li Bing in the Warring States period on the Chengdu plain, using a leaping mouth to split flow, a spillway to expel sand, and a bottle-neck channel to control water. It still irrigates millions of mu of farmland. It shows ecology-wise engineering in harmony with water.�ans��src��E联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《青城山—都江堰》�NUNESCO World Heritage Centre, Mount Qingcheng and Dujiangyan Irrigation System��id�5fba2460ee59�body���传统电网是发-输-配的单向供电，电厂跟着负荷走；智能电网则在发电、输电、配电、用电各环节装上传感器和双向通信，让电网实时感知状态并自动调配。它能接入海量的分布式光伏、风电和电动车充电桩，通过需求响应调节负荷（比如引导电动车错峰充电），停电时自动隔离故障区段并快速自愈。就像给电网装上大脑和神经，在新能源波动越来越大的时代维持供需平衡。�:A conventional grid is one-way — plants follow the load. A smart grid layers sensors and two-way communication across generation, transmission, distribution, and consumption so the network senses its state and dispatches automatically. It integrates massive rooftop solar, wind, and EV chargers, shifts load through demand response (such as guiding EV charging to off-peak hours), and isolates faulted sections to self-heal after outages. It is like giving the grid a brain and nervous system to balance supply and demand in an era of increasingly volatile renewables.�ans��src��AIEEE 电网调度标准；Kundur《电力系统稳定与控制》�HIEEE grid dispatch standards; Kundur, Power System Stability and Control��id�6233518c293f�body�ٟ它在电厂或工厂把烟气中的二氧化碳分离出来，压缩后注入地下岩层封存，减少温室气体进入大气，常配合提高采油率。٣CCS separates CO2 from flue gas, compresses it and injects it into underground rock for permanent storage, cutting emissions, sometimes with enhanced oil recovery.�ans��src��YRochelle，《胺法捕集二氧化碳》，《科学》325卷，1652–1654页（2009）�QRochelle, G.T. 'Amine Scrubbing for CO2 Capture.' Science 325, 1652–1654 (2009)��id�625da9955ab4�body��P蛇形机器人由许多串联关节组成，控制器让各关节按一定相位差做正弦摆动，形成沿身体传播的行波。身体侧面与地面的摩擦各向不同，横向摩擦大于纵向，波动就被转化成向前的推进力。改变波的幅值、波长和相位还能实现侧向蜿蜒、翻滚或攀爬管道。��A snake robot is a chain of many joints; the controller makes each joint oscillate sinusoidally with a fixed phase offset, creating a travelling wave along the body. Because friction with the ground is anisotropic, resisting sideways sliding more than forward sliding, the wave is converted into forward propulsion. Changing the wave amplitude, wavelength and phase produces lateral undulation, rolling or pipe climbing.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�62b2ce3fa66c�body��f每个喷头的玻璃球感温到阈值才爆破喷水，只有火点附近动作，节水又减损。قEach head's glass bulb bursts only when its spot gets hot enough, so just the fire area sprays—saving water and limiting damage.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�62e25ebdbac6�body��,换填法是把承载力不足的表层软土挖除，换填砂、碎石等级配良好的材料并分层压实，形成人工垫层。垫层能把上部荷载扩散到更大的面积上并减小沉降，同时为下卧软土分担部分荷载，因此整体承载力和变形性能都得到改善。�?The replacement method excavates weak surface soil and backfills it with well-graded sand or gravel compacted in layers to form a cushion. The cushion spreads the load over a wider area, reduces settlement, and sheds part of the load onto the underlying soil, so both bearing capacity and deformation behaviour improve.�ans��src��S《建筑地基处理技术规范》JGJ 79-2012 ; 另见: ASCE (Ground Improvement)�UASCE (Ground Improvement) ; see also: 《建筑地基处理技术规范》JGJ 79-2012��id�63a4d20c3d9a�body��#普通仿真模型通常是离线的、基于假设的静态模型；数字孪生则与实际物理对象通过实时传感数据持续连接，能随对象状态变化动态更新并用于预测与优化。它强调实时数据闭环和全生命周期同步，而不只是一次性分析。�TAn ordinary simulation is typically an offline, assumption-based static model, whereas a digital twin is continuously linked to its physical counterpart through real-time sensor data, updating dynamically to predict and optimize. It emphasizes a real-time data feedback loop and whole-lifecycle synchronization rather than one-off analysis.�ans��src��SGrieves，《数字孪生：通过虚拟工厂复制实现制造卓越》（2014）�\Grieves, 'Digital Twin: Manufacturing Excellence through Virtual Factory Replication' (2014)��id�63b62d3e26d3�body���电机转子转动时，绕组在磁场中切割磁感线，会产生一个与外加电压方向相反的感应电动势，称为反电动势，其大小与转速近似成正比。测得端电压并减去绕组电阻和电感上的压降，就能反推转速，这样无需安装编码器。无刷电机的无位置传感器控制正是利用反电动势的零点来判断换相时刻。��As the rotor turns, the windings move through the magnetic field and generate an induced voltage opposing the applied voltage, called back-EMF, whose magnitude is roughly proportional to speed. Measuring terminal voltage and subtracting the drops across winding resistance and inductance yields an estimate of speed without any encoder. Sensorless control of brushless motors uses the zero crossings of back-EMF to decide when to commutate.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�6457ffe1c7ab�body�ٓ车轮抱死会打滑失控且刹不住；ABS用轮速传感器检测即将抱死就快速点刹，让轮胎边滚边减速，保留转向能力。�|Locked wheels slide and lose steering; ABS pulses the brakes to keep tires rolling, shortening stops and preserving control.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�64718b5465ea�body���粉煤灰、矿渣等具有火山灰活性，与水泥水化产生的氢氧化钙反应生成额外水化硅酸钙，细化孔隙、降低渗透性。同时降低水化热与碱骨料反应风险，提升抗侵蚀与长期体积稳定性。�Fly ash and slag are pozzolanic: they react with calcium hydroxide from cement hydration to form additional C-S-H, refining pores and lowering permeability. They also reduce heat of hydration and alkali-silica reaction risk, improving resistance and long-term stability.�ans��src��9《土木工程材料》（中国建筑工业出版社）�FHewlett, Lea's Chemistry of Cement and Concrete, Butterworth-Heinemann��id�64cda967f528�body���一个刚体在三维空间里有6种独立运动：沿x、y、z三个方向的移动和绕三个轴的转动。要让末端工具到达任意位置并朝向任意方向，就需要恰好6个自由度去匹配这6个参数。少于6个只能实现特定的姿态，多于6个虽然更灵活、能避障，但控制也复杂得多。6自由度机械臂的逆运动学有解析解，所以成了工业标准；每个关节由伺服电机配减速器驱动。�A rigid body in 3-D space has 6 independent motions: translation along x, y, and z plus rotation about three axes. To place the end-effector at any position with any orientation, you need exactly 6 DOF to match those 6 parameters. With fewer than 6 you can only reach some orientations; with more you gain agility and obstacle avoidance but far more complex control. A 6-DOF arm's inverse kinematics has closed-form solutions, which is why it became the industrial standard; each joint is driven by a servo motor plus gearbox.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�650bf4c3ce89�body���它用透水铺装、下沉绿地、湿地和蓄水池代替硬质地面，让雨水就地渗入、滞蓄和净化，而不是全冲进管道。暴雨时削峰、晴时回补地下水，内涝和污染都减轻。��It replaces hard surfaces with permeable pavement, sunken green spaces, wetlands and storage to let rain infiltrate, detain and purify on site instead of rushing to pipes. Storms are peak-shaved and groundwater recharged, easing floods and pollution.�ans��src��O中国住房和城乡建设部，《海绵城市建设技术指南》（2014）�EMOHURD (China), 'Technical Guide for Sponge City Construction' (2014)��id�650eedb12f65�body��i斜面原理把很大的轴向力变成很小的圆周力，还能自锁防松，咬合更渐进牢固。�wThe inclined plane turns a large axial force into a small rotary one and self-locks, gripping progressively and firmly.�ans��src��7Shigley《机械工程设计》；ASME B1.1（螺纹）�AShigley, Mechanical Engineering Design; ASME B1.1 (screw threads)��id�65e30f643b88�body���悬索桥用两根跨越全桥的巨大主缆兜住桥面，主缆两端要锚固在巨大的锚碇里，主塔只承受竖向压力，因此适合跨径超过1000米的特大桥，如明石海峡大桥。斜拉桥则用很多根斜拉索直接从塔顶斜拉到桥面，索力在塔身两侧互相平衡，不需要锚碇，自重更轻、架设更快，适合300到1000米的跨径，如苏通大桥。简单说：悬索桥靠主缆把力传到锚固端，斜拉桥靠斜索与塔自平衡。�PA suspension bridge drapes two giant main cables across the whole span to carry the deck, anchoring the cable ends in huge anchorages; the towers take only vertical load, which is why it suits spans beyond 1000 m — like Akashi Kaikyo. A cable-stayed bridge runs many inclined stay cables directly from tower tops to the deck; the stay forces balance each other across the tower, so no anchorage is needed, the structure is lighter, and erection is faster, suiting spans of 300-1000 m like Sutong. In short: suspension cables deliver load to anchors; stayed cables self-balance at the tower.�ans��src��QHibbeler《结构分析》；AASHTO 桥梁规范；悬索桥工程（Leonhardt）�fHibbeler, Structural Analysis; AASHTO bridge specifications; suspension bridge engineering (Leonhardt)��id�65faae83a852�body�ٟ探头发出超声波并接收组织界面的回声，不同组织声阻抗不同、反射强弱有别，由回波时间和强度重建出实时断层图像。ٱA probe emits ultrasound and receives echoes at tissue boundaries; differing acoustic impedance yields varying reflections, reconstructed by time and intensity into live images.�ans��src��^Kak & Slaney《CT 原理》；Haacke 等《MRI 原理》；超声成像（Hendee & Ritenour）هKak & Slaney, Principles of Computerized Tomographic Imaging; Haacke et al., Magnetic Resonance Imaging; ultrasound (Hendee & Ritenour)��id�6690dc2427c6�body��b通风道散热防止'热衰减'，划线排出粉末和气体，保持摩擦力稳定不抱死。�dVents shed heat to avoid fade; slots clear dust and gas so friction stays steady without locking up.�ans��src��9Shigley《机械工程设计》；Bosch《汽车手册》�BShigley, Mechanical Engineering Design; Bosch, Automotive Handbook��id�66b5b21dfa80�body��W雨水入渗使土体饱和度增加、孔隙水压力上升，有效应力减小，抗剪强度随之下降，同时渗流产生指向坡外的渗透力，滑坡风险因此大增。安全系数定义为抗滑力与下滑力之比，大于1表示理论稳定，工程上通常要求达到1.2至1.5以覆盖计算不确定性和荷载变化。��Rainwater infiltration raises soil saturation and pore water pressure, reducing effective stress and shear strength, while seepage adds an outward-directed seepage force, sharply increasing landslide risk. The factor of safety is the ratio of resisting force to driving force; a value above 1 means theoretical stability, and engineering practice usually requires 1.2 to 1.5 to cover calculation uncertainties and load variations.�ans��src��L《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012,中国建筑工业出版社,2012�hLoad Code for the Design of Building Structures GB 50009-2012, China Architecture & Building Press, 2012��id�67141a8543f0�body�ِ它用泵把少量水加压喷成多方位水柱反复冲刷并循环使用，总用水量常低于长流水手洗；高温水也更易去油。�xIt pressurizes and recirculates a small amount of water through spray arms, often using less than open-tap hand washing.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�67c52543d72d�body��c在地下水位以下建大口径隧洞调蓄暴雨洪水，避免浅层管网溢流造成内涝。�xLarge tunnels below the water table store storm surges, preventing shallow sewers from overflowing and flooding streets.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�67fa4109be71�body��Z多股柔韧耐弯折、断丝是渐进的可被检出；单根粗杆易脆断且太硬。فMany strands flex and bend well, and broken wires appear gradually and can be detected; one thick rod snaps brittle and is stiff.�ans��src��"ASME A17.1《电梯安全规范》�ASME A17.1, Elevator Code��id�688f77d5b84c�body���可用性常包括有效性（任务完成率）、效率（耗时与资源）和满意度（主观体验），ISO 9241 还强调易学性与容错。良好可用性需以用户为中心、经可用性测试迭代优化。�Usability typically covers effectiveness (task completion), efficiency (time and resources), and satisfaction (subjective experience); ISO 9241 also stresses learnability and error tolerance. Good usability requires user-centered design iterated via usability testing.�ans��src��ISO 9241-11 可用性标准�#ISO 9241-11 Ergonomics of Usability��id�68dae59cfb3d�body�٥火箭飞出大气层后抛掉已烧完的储箱和发动机，可大幅减轻质量，根据齐奥尔科夫斯基方程，减少死重能显著提高最终速度。ٌAfter burnout, discarding empty tanks and engines cuts dead weight; by the Tsiolkovsky equation, less mass means much higher final velocity.�ans��src��@Sutton《火箭推进原理》；NASA；Tsiolkovsky 火箭方程�ESutton, Rocket Propulsion Elements; NASA; Tsiolkovsky rocket equation��id�696e0204e975�body�ه顺桨让叶片转到迎风最小角使风几乎推不动它，再上机械刹车锁住；电网失电时靠备用电池完成顺桨。�yFeathering turns blades edge-on to the wind and a brake locks the rotor; backup batteries feather it if grid power fails.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�69cb4a6bad44�body���核裂变是重原子核（如铀235）被中子击中分裂成较小核并释放巨大能量的过程。反应堆用它持续产生热能再发电。控制链式反应是安全运行的关键。��Nuclear fission is when a heavy nucleus such as uranium-235 is hit by a neutron and splits into smaller nuclei, releasing large energy. Reactors sustain this to produce heat for electricity. Controlling the chain reaction is the key to safe operation.�ans��src��)Atkins，《物理化学》（第10版）�'Atkins, 'Physical Chemistry' (10th ed.)��id�6b0bc50446fa�body�ٜ空间中的刚体位姿由3个位置加3个姿态共6个量描述，六自由度足以让末端到达任意位姿，再多主要为了避障与灵活性。ٞA rigid body pose needs 3 positions plus 3 orientations; six DOF lets the end-effector reach any pose, with extra joints mainly for avoidance and flexibility.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�6c243885461e�body�ٟ桥面荷载经吊索传到两根主缆，主缆再通过锚锭和桥塔把巨大拉力分散到地基，主缆受拉、桥塔受压，适合大跨度跨越。٥Deck load travels via hangers to two main cables, which spread the tension to anchorages and towers; cables carry tension and towers compression, suiting long spans.�ans��src��QHibbeler《结构分析》；AASHTO 桥梁规范；悬索桥工程（Leonhardt）�fHibbeler, Structural Analysis; AASHTO bridge specifications; suspension bridge engineering (Leonhardt)��id�6cc98983cc46�body��5扑翼把升力与推力合并在一次拍打中产生，能利用前缘涡获得较高的低速升力，噪声小、外形接近鸟类，适合微型和隐蔽任务。但它的机构复杂、往复运动损耗大，载荷和续航通常不如旋翼。旋翼结构简单、悬停稳定，工程上更成熟。��A flapping wing generates lift and thrust in the same stroke and can exploit a leading-edge vortex for high lift at low speed, while staying quiet and bird-like, which suits micro and covert missions. However the mechanism is complex and reciprocating motion wastes energy, so payload and endurance usually fall short of rotorcraft. Rotors are mechanically simpler, hover steadily and are far more mature in engineering terms.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6d9dd96f5a72�body���并联机构由多条独立支链共同约束动平台，负载被分配到多个闭环，误差不逐级累积。因此刚度高、末端精度好、动态响应快，适合精密定位与运动模拟，但工作空间受限。�3A parallel mechanism constrains the platform through several independent limbs, distributing load across closed loops so errors do not accumulate link by link. This yields high stiffness, good end accuracy, and fast dynamics, suiting precision positioning and motion simulation, though workspace is limited.�ans��src��-《机器人学》（清华大学出版社）�Parallel Robots, Springer��id�6e025d2d5dbb�body��D章鱼触手没有关节，靠肌肉阵列在任意位置弯曲，能绕过障碍并温柔地包裹物体。用弹性体加气腔或缆绳驱动可以复制这种连续变形，理论上自由度无限。这类结构天生安全、适合抓取易碎物或在狭缝中穿行，但精确控制和建模比刚性臂难得多。��An octopus arm has no joints; arrays of muscle let it bend anywhere along its length, wrapping gently around objects and threading past obstacles. Elastomer bodies driven by air chambers or tendons reproduce this continuous deformation, giving effectively unlimited degrees of freedom. Such structures are inherently safe and good for fragile objects or narrow gaps, but modelling and precise control are far harder than for rigid arms.�ans��src�وPapadakis, Tsakiris, Sfakiotakis,《An Octopus-Inspired Soft Pneumatic Robotic Arm》,Biomimetics,2024 (DOI: 10.3390/biomimetics9120773)نPapadakis, Tsakiris, Sfakiotakis, 'An Octopus-Inspired Soft Pneumatic Robotic Arm', Biomimetics, 2024, DOI: 10.3390/biomimetics9120773��id�6efb8acea3c3�body���轻轨是运量介于地铁和公交之间的有轨电车系统，多用地面或高架，造价较低。它可与其他交通共享路权或独立路权。欧洲和北美许多城市将其作为骨干公交。��Light rail is a tramway system with capacity between a metro and a bus, often at grade or elevated, at lower cost. It may share or have exclusive right-of-way. Many European and North American cities use it as a backbone transit.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�6f0e5dde50f8�body���需求侧响应指用户根据电价或激励信号主动调整用电时段与负荷。通过削峰（高峰时减少用电）和填谷（低谷时增加用电），它降低峰值机组需求、延缓电网扩容投资。��Demand response means consumers actively shift or adjust their load according to price or incentive signals. By shaving peaks and filling valleys, it lowers the need for peaking units and defers grid expansion.�ans��src�نSiano,《Demand response and smart grids—A survey》,Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews,2014 (DOI: 10.1016/j.rser.2013.10.022)لSiano, 'Demand response and smart grids—A survey', Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews, 2014, DOI: 10.1016/j.rser.2013.10.022��id�7077e402f52d�body��o柔性结构把振动能量耗散掉，限制幅度下的晃动比硬扛更安全，还能避开共振破坏。�uA flexible structure dissipates vibration energy; bounded sway is safer than fighting it and avoids resonant failure.�ans��src��+Chopra，《结构动力学》（第5版）�*Chopra, 'Dynamics of Structures' (5th ed.)��id�70b8a9ede462�body���重复定位精度衡量机器人多次回到同一示教点时位置的分散程度，主要取决于机械间隙和编码器分辨率，工业臂常达到零点零几毫米。绝对定位精度衡量实际到达点与指令坐标的偏差，还受连杆尺寸误差、热变形和标定质量影响，通常比重复精度差一个数量级。离线编程依赖绝对精度，因此必须做运动学标定。�)Repeatability measures how tightly a robot returns to the same taught point on repeated trials and depends mainly on mechanical backlash and encoder resolution, often a few hundredths of a millimetre on industrial arms. Absolute accuracy measures the deviation between the point actually reached and the commanded coordinates, and is additionally affected by link dimension errors, thermal deformation and calibration quality, typically an order of magnitude worse. Offline programming relies on absolute accuracy, so kinematic calibration is essential.�ans��src���ISO 230-2 机床定位精度评定标准；K. K. Tan、S. Huang、T. H. Lee 等,《Precision Motion Control: Design and Implementation》第2版(Springer) 双反馈章节；西门子 SINAMICS V90 应用文档��ISO 230-2 positioning accuracy evaluation standard; K.K. Tan, S. Huang, T.H. Lee et al., Precision Motion Control: Design and Implementation, 2nd ed. (Springer), dual-feedback chapter; Siemens SINAMICS V90 application documentation��id�710675cd3dc5�body��u它的重心仍落在底面范围内，软土让沉降可控，塔身对称、风载小，处于临界稳定状态。ْIts center of mass still falls inside the base; soft soil made settling gradual, and the symmetric tower with low wind sits in marginal stability.�ans��src��-Heyman《石骨架》(1995)；结构稳定性�7Heyman, The Stone Skeleton (1995); structural stability��id�7152e2e226e3�body���智能电网用传感器、通信和自动控制在传统电网上加装“大脑”，实现供需实时平衡。它能更好接纳风光等波动电源并支持电动车充电。停电时还能快速定位隔离。�A smart grid adds a 'brain' of sensors, communications, and automation to the traditional grid for real-time supply-demand balance. It better absorbs variable sources like wind and solar and supports EV charging. During outages it can quickly locate and isolate faults.�ans��src��AIEEE 电网调度标准；Kundur《电力系统稳定与控制》�HIEEE grid dispatch standards; Kundur, Power System Stability and Control��id�72717b533d3c�body�ِ它要协调多台小车在仓库或车间中的任务分配、路径规划和交通避让，避免拥堵与碰撞，提升整体物流效率。َIt coordinates task assignment, routing and traffic avoidance for many vehicles to prevent jams and collisions and raise logistics efficiency.�ans��src��VIEC 61131-3（PLC）；ISO 3691-4（AGV 安全）；Groover《自动化生产系统》�zIEC 61131-3 (PLC); ISO 3691-4 (AGV safety); Groover, Automation, Production Systems, and Computer-Integrated Manufacturing��id�77e5b450be70�body�ٜ空间站其实在绕地球自由落体，处于持续下落的轨道中，内部物体相对漂浮，但仍有微小残余加速度，所以叫微重力。ٙThe station is in continuous free-fall orbit, so objects float inside, but tiny residual accelerations remain, hence micro rather than true zero gravity.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�78d2cffcc0f4�body���在荷载作用前对混凝土施加预压应力，使受拉区在外荷载下先抵消部分拉应力，从而推迟开裂、减小挠度并提高抗裂与刚度。常用先张法或后张法建立预应力。��Before service loads, concrete is pre-compressed so that tension under load is partly offset, delaying cracking, reducing deflection, and raising crack resistance and stiffness. Prestress is typically introduced by pretensioning or post-tensioning.�ans��src��B《混凝土结构设计原理》（中国建筑工业出版社）�=Lin & Burns, Design of Prestressed Concrete Structures, Wiley��id�78eb19a1d2b4�body��i斜坡能消减波浪能量、减少越浪和反射，比直墙更抗冲击、也不易被水流掏空。لSlopes dissipate wave energy and reduce overtopping and reflection; they resist impact better and are less likely to be scoured out.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�79cb3027aaf7�body���这类屋顶是张拉结构：高强度的膜材料（如PTFE涂层玻璃纤维布或ETFE膜）被绷紧，膜内始终只有拉力而没有压力，曲面做成鞍形或波浪形让应力均匀分布。外部的风压、雪载等一切力都转化为膜内的拉力，再由边缘的钢索和桅杆约束住。因为材料全程受拉、自重极轻，跨度可以做到一两百米，北京水立方就是ETFE膜结构的大型实例。��These are tension structures: high-strength membranes (PTFE-coated fiberglass fabric or ETFE foil) are stretched taut so they see only tension, never compression, and the saddle or wavy curved surfaces spread stress evenly. Every external force — wind, snow, self-weight — turns into tension in the membrane, restrained by edge cables and masts. Because the material is always in tension and the self-weight is tiny, spans can reach 150-200 m; Beijing's Water Cube is a large ETFE membrane example.�ans��src��6Gordon，《结构：或事物为什么不塌下来》�3Gordon, 'Structures: Or Why Things Don't Fall Down'��id�7cefb923a5a7�body��o三角形几何形状不变，把弯曲力矩转成杆件的拉和压，用细长杆高效承重、省材料。َA triangle is geometrically rigid, turning bending into axial tension/compression so slender members carry load efficiently and save material.�ans��src��3Hibbeler《结构分析》；桥梁工程（Chen）�8Hibbeler, Structural Analysis; bridge engineering (Chen)��id�7d7d085d4404�body�ٙ它涵盖取水、净水、输配水管网（给水）以及污水收集、处理与排放或回用（排水），保障饮水安全与水环境健康。ٞIt covers intake, treatment and distribution (supply) plus sewage collection, treatment and reuse (drainage), safeguarding drinking water and the environment.�ans��src��:AWWA 给水工程手册；Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程》�QAWWA Water Treatment/Distribution manuals; Metcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering��id�7de73e6ba154�body�٨可动桥能在船只通过时开启或旋转，让出航道空间。常见有开启桥、升降桥和旋转桥。它适合河面通航但两岸空间有限的地点。��A movable bridge can open or rotate to let ships pass, giving way to the navigation channel. Common types are bascule, lift, and swing bridges. They suit locations with river traffic but limited space on the banks.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�7e268d4f8fe4�body���普通凝汽式电厂发电时，约六成能量作为废热从冷却塔白白排走；热电联产（CHP）则把发电后的余热蒸汽或热水送到附近的居民区和工厂供暖，实现"一鱼两吃"。燃料的总利用率可以从约40%提高到80%以上。代价是电厂必须靠近热用户，供热距离越长管网损耗越大，所以中国北方城镇集中供热常采用大型热电联产机组。��A conventional condensing plant dumps about 60% of the fuel's energy into the cooling tower as waste heat. Combined heat and power (CHP) captures the turbine's exhaust steam or hot water and delivers it to nearby homes and factories for heating — two uses from one fire. Total fuel utilization can rise from about 40% to over 80%. The catch is that the plant must sit close to heat customers because distribution losses grow with distance, which is why northern Chinese cities heat with large CHP units.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�7eb81ba0dd5a�body��<臂杆、减速器和皮带都有弹性，高速运动积累的动能在减速时激发结构的低阶固有振动，表现为末端残余抖动。工程上通过提高结构刚度、减小末端惯量，以及采用S形加减速曲线或输入整形来抑制。控制上还可以加入振动观测和阻尼补偿。��Links, reducers and belts all have finite elasticity, so the kinetic energy of fast motion excites the structure's low-order natural modes during deceleration, appearing as residual vibration at the tip. Engineers suppress it by stiffening the structure, reducing distal inertia, and using S-curve acceleration profiles or input shaping. Controllers can additionally estimate the vibration and add active damping.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�7ec564fe6535�body���MBR把膜分离组件直接浸在或置于生物反应器中，用膜代替二沉池实现泥水分离，出水中悬浮物和细菌几乎为零，容积负荷高、占地小，污泥浓度可提高数倍。膜污染是主要运行难题，污染物在膜表面堆积使通量下降，缓解手段包括曝气冲刷膜面、定期反洗、化学清洗以及控制污泥浓度和运行通量。�An MBR places a membrane module directly in the bioreactor and replaces the secondary clarifier with membrane separation, giving effluent almost free of suspended solids and bacteria, high volumetric load, small footprint, and several-fold higher mixed-liquor concentration. Membrane fouling is the main operational challenge: deposited foulants cut the permeate flux. Countermeasures include air scouring of the membrane surface, periodic backwashing, chemical cleaning, and controlling sludge concentration and operating flux.�ans��src��0《膜分离技术》（化学工业出版社）�%Judd, The MBR Book, 2nd ed., Elsevier��id�7ec71e333389�body�ٺ钛合金以钛为主加入铝、钒等，强度高、密度小、耐海水腐蚀且生物相容。它用于飞机发动机、植入物和化工设备。缺点是提炼难、价格高。�
Titanium alloy is mainly titanium with aluminum and vanadium, offering high strength, low density, seawater corrosion resistance, and biocompatibility. It is used in jet engines, implants, and chemical equipment. Its drawbacks are difficult extraction and high cost.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�7fc912bfa3a4�body�ٴ注塑把熔融塑料高速注入钢模，冷却后顶出成型，适合大批量生产塑料件。手机壳、牙刷和餐具多由此而来。模具成本高但单件极便宜。��Injection molding forces molten plastic into a steel mold at high speed and ejects it after cooling, ideal for mass plastic parts. Phone cases, toothbrushes, and utensils come from it. The mold is costly but each part is very cheap.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�80c989c11427�body���压缩空气储能（CAES）在用电低谷时用电动机驱动压缩机，把空气压进地下盐穴或储罐，电能变成空气的压强能；用电高峰时放出压缩空气，加热后推动涡轮机发电。传统CAES放气前要烧天然气补热，效率只有40%到50%；新一代绝热CAES把压缩过程中产生的热储存起来回用，效率可提高到约70%。它储量大、寿命长达数十年、响应快，是继抽水蓄能之后第二大规模化储能路线。�1Compressed-air energy storage (CAES) uses off-peak electricity to run compressors that force air into underground salt caverns or tanks, storing energy as air pressure; at peak hours the air is released, reheated, and run through turbines to generate. Conventional CAES burns natural gas to reheat the air and reaches only 40-50% efficiency, while new adiabatic CAES stores the heat of compression for reuse and can reach about 70%. It offers huge capacity, decades of life, and fast response — the second major utility-scale storage route after pumped hydro.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�80fccf101f93�body��K区分标准是制取氢气时所用能源与碳排放。灰氢来自化石燃料重整且碳排放不回收；蓝氢同样来自化石能源但配套碳捕集利用与封存（CCUS）；绿氢则由可再生电力电解水制得、全程近零碳排放。颜色标签本质反映的是碳足迹而非氢气本身的化学性质。��The distinction is based on the energy source and carbon emissions of production. Grey hydrogen comes from fossil reforming with no capture, blue hydrogen also from fossil sources but paired with carbon capture, utilization and storage, and green hydrogen is made by electrolyzing water with renewable electricity at near-zero emissions. The color labels reflect carbon footprint, not the chemistry of the hydrogen itself.�ans��src��.Nature Energy（氢能供应链与碳排放）�3Nature Energy (hydrogen supply chain and emissions)��id�821814cedb6f�body���砂型铸造先把模型放入型砂制成型腔，合箱后浇入熔融金属，待冷却凝固后落砂取出铸件。金属在凝固时体积收缩，若型腔相应部位缺少液态金属补给，最后凝固的厚大区域就会形成缩孔。为此需要设置冒口储存补缩用金属，并利用浇注温度、冷铁等控制凝固顺序，让缩松尽量转移到冒口中。��In sand casting a pattern forms a cavity in moulding sand, the flask is closed, molten metal is poured in, and after solidification the casting is shaken out. Metals shrink as they solidify; where the cavity cannot be refilled with liquid metal, the last-to-solidify thick sections form shrinkage cavities. Risers store extra liquid to feed the casting, and pouring temperature, chillers and solidification sequencing are used so any porosity ends up in the riser instead of the part.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�86446c569209�body�ِ温水加快洗衣粉中酶的活性并软化油污，让污渍更容易从纤维脱离；但高温也会伤某些面料，所以分档选择。�wWarm water boosts enzyme activity and softens grease so stains detach more easily, though high heat can damage fabrics.�ans��src��+Cengel，《传热与传质》（第5版）�*Cengel, 'Heat and Mass Transfer' (5th ed.)��id�865a7bf89f84�body�٣在输送相同功率时，电压越高电流越小，线路发热损耗（I²R）越低，因此用特高压把电能远距离、低损耗地送往负荷中心。َFor the same power, higher voltage means lower current and far less I²R line loss, so UHV sends electricity long distances with minimal loss.�ans��src��5Stevenson《电力系统分析》；IEEE 输电标准�IStevenson, Elements of Power System Analysis; IEEE transmission standards��id�86ceb33ab601�body��u电磁力（吸引或排斥）抵消重力使车体与轨道无接触，没有机械摩擦，因而极快且安静。ٌElectromagnetic force (attraction or repulsion) cancels gravity so the train never touches the rail—no friction means very fast and quiet.�ans��src��LR. C. Hibbeler,《Engineering Mechanics: Statics & Dynamics》Pearson 多版�VR. C. Hibbeler, Engineering Mechanics: Statics and Dynamics, Pearson, various editions��id�875d32405d05�body���它先预测周围每辆车未来几秒的可能轨迹，再结合博弈和概率评估风险，最后在约束内选出最安全的加速度和转向。预测越准，紧急避险就越从容。��It predicts each nearby vehicle's possible future trajectories, assesses risk with game-theoretic and probabilistic reasoning, then picks the safest acceleration and steering within constraints. Better prediction means calmer emergency handling.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�894aac734e3b�body���佩特拉是约旦沙漠中的古城，纳西比人开凿引水渠、蓄水池和陶管，把稀少雨水收集利用。它还用峡谷地形防洪。这让它能在干旱区繁盛数百年。��Petra is a desert city in Jordan where the Nabataeans carved channels, cisterns, and terracotta pipes to collect scarce rain. They also used canyon terrain for flood control. This let the city thrive for centuries in arid land.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8ac96ca4b881�body���热处理通过加热保温冷却改变金属内部组织，从而调整硬度、韧性和强度。退火是其中一种，缓慢冷却以消除内应力、软化材料便于加工。淬火和回火则提高硬度。�
Heat treatment changes a metal's internal structure by heating, holding, and cooling to adjust hardness, toughness, and strength. Annealing is one type that cools slowly to relieve stress and soften the material for machining. Quenching and tempering raise hardness.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�8afb3bbe8bc8�body���雷诺数是惯性力与黏性力的无量纲比值，反映流动受黏性抑制的程度。数值较小趋向层流，较大则易发展为湍流；它是判断管流与绕流状态的关键判据。��The Reynolds number is the dimensionless ratio of inertial to viscous forces, reflecting how much viscosity suppresses disturbances. Low values tend to laminar flow, high values favor turbulence, and it is a key criterion for pipe and external flows.�ans��src��-《流体力学》（清华大学出版社）�.Fundamentals of Fluid Mechanics, Munson et al.��id�8b764acf6fb5�body�ٍ小备胎省空间减重、只供临时低速开到修理店；很多车改用补胎液和充气泵或依赖道路救援，进一步减重。�Space-saver spares save room and weight for low-speed emergency use; many cars now carry sealant kits or rely on roadside help.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�8bb084cecbe7�body���Qi充电基于电磁感应：发射线圈通入交流电产生交变磁场，接收线圈通过磁耦合感应出电动势，整流后给电池充电。耦合系数随两线圈的对准程度和距离急剧变化，偏离中心时磁通耦合面积减小、效率大幅下降，所以要求线圈对准；Qi还通过异物检测和通信协议协商功率，防止金属异物被磁场加热并保证充电安全。�Qi charging is based on electromagnetic induction: an AC current in the transmitter coil creates an alternating magnetic field, which induces an EMF in the receiver coil that is rectified to charge the battery. The coupling coefficient changes sharply with alignment and gap; off-centre coils reduce the linked flux and drag efficiency down, so alignment matters. Qi also performs foreign-object detection and uses a communication protocol to negotiate power, preventing metal objects from heating up and ensuring safe charging.�ans��src��&无线充电联盟（WPC，Qi标准）�,WPC (Wireless Power Consortium, Qi Standard)��id�8c3c0060864c�body���激光雷达通过发射激光脉冲测距并扫描得到高分辨率三维点云，能精确识别物体轮廓和位置，但成本高、在雨雪雾天气性能衰减明显。毫米波雷达直接测量距离和速度（利用多普勒效应），对雨雾穿透力强、测速准、成本低，但角度分辨率低，难以分辨行人等小目标。因此两者常与摄像头互补使用，各取所长。�LiDAR emits laser pulses and scans to build high-resolution 3D point clouds, accurately resolving object shapes and positions, but it is expensive and degrades badly in rain, snow and fog. Millimetre-wave radar directly measures range and velocity via the Doppler effect, penetrates rain and fog well, is accurate for speed and cheap, but offers low angular resolution and struggles to distinguish small objects such as pedestrians. The two are therefore usually fused with cameras so each covers the others' weaknesses.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�8cb5fee7ffa4�body�ٍ里面的电热丝通电发热，小风扇把空气吹过发热丝带走热量；负离子款只是额外加一束带电粒子减少静电。�nA heating element warms air pulled through by a fan; ionic models just add charged particles to reduce static.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�8d2f05f4e7e8�body���地热发电利用地球内部的热水或蒸汽驱动涡轮发电，稳定且不受天气影响。干蒸汽、闪蒸和二元循环是三种主要技术。冰岛和印尼等地热资源丰富。��Geothermal power uses heat from underground hot water or steam to drive turbines, providing steady output unaffected by weather. Dry steam, flash, and binary cycle are the three main technologies. Iceland and Indonesia have rich resources.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�8d889d67aead�body�ٜ再入后依次用减速伞、稳定伞和主降落伞大幅降低下降速度，部分型号再配合反推火箭或气囊在触地瞬间进一步缓冲。ّAfter reentry it deploys drogue, stabilization and main parachutes to slow descent, sometimes with retro-rockets or airbags for final cushioning.�ans��src��VCurrey，《Aircraft Landing Gear Design: Principles and Practices》（AIAA，1988）�MCurrey, 'Aircraft Landing Gear Design: Principles and Practices' (AIAA, 1988)��id�912fce54b745�body��D轨道越高，绕地球一圈的周期越长。当轨道半径使周期恰好等于地球自转一周的时间时，卫星就与地面同步，这个高度约为三万五千八百公里。若同时把轨道放在赤道面且接近圆形，卫星在地面看来就固定在天上一点，非常适合通信和气象观测。��The higher the orbit, the longer it takes to circle the Earth. When the radius makes the period exactly equal to one rotation of the Earth, the satellite keeps pace with the ground, and that altitude is about thirty-five thousand eight hundred kilometres. If the orbit also lies in the equatorial plane and is nearly circular, the satellite appears fixed at one point in the sky, which is ideal for communications and weather watching.�ans��src��+Clarke 1945（地球静止轨道）；Wertz�AClarke (1945, geostationary orbit); Wertz, Space Mission Analysis��id�917819fbda40�body���串联电池组的容量和内阻存在个体差异，充放电中各电芯电压会逐渐分化。由于整组必须以最高电压的电芯为充电上限、以最低的为放电下限，不均衡会让可用容量被最差的电芯拖累。均衡电路通过电阻放电耗散多余电量，或用变换器把电量搬到低电芯，使各电芯保持一致，从而延长寿命并避免过充过放。��Cells in a series pack differ slightly in capacity and internal resistance, so their voltages drift apart during charge and discharge. Because charging must stop at the highest-voltage cell and discharging at the lowest, imbalance lets the weakest cell limit the usable capacity of the whole pack. Balancing circuits either dissipate surplus charge through resistors or move charge to weaker cells with converters, keeping the cells matched, extending life and preventing over-charge or over-discharge.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�935077ea6daf�body���管片是工厂预制的弧形混凝土块，盾构每前进一环就把数块拼成圆圈，环环相扣并施加预应力螺栓，形成永久衬砌。它既是模板也是结构，扛住周围土水压。��Segments are factory-made curved concrete blocks; as the shield advances a ring, several are assembled into a circle and bolted with prestress, forming permanent lining. It is both formwork and structure, resisting surrounding soil and water pressure.�ans��src��CMaidl、Herrenknecht & Anheuser，《机械化盾构隧道技术》�>Maidl, Herrenknecht & Anheuser, 'Mechanised Shield Tunnelling'��id�93693072c346�body��起搏器通过电极持续监测心脏电活动，当检测到心率过慢或停搏时，按设定节律发放电脉冲刺激心肌收缩。现代设备还可感知运动状态自动调整频率，并以密封钛壳与长效电池保证十余年的体内稳定工作。�MThe pacemaker continuously monitors cardiac electrical activity via leads and, when it detects bradycardia or pauses, delivers timed electrical pulses to make the myocardium contract. Modern devices sense activity to auto-adjust rate and use a sealed titanium case and long-life battery for over a decade of stable in-body operation.�ans��src��8Nature Biomedical Engineering（植入式心脏设备）�;Nature Biomedical Engineering (implantable cardiac devices)��id�93c41f8669c1�body���海绵城市强调把雨水就地渗、滞、蓄、净、用、排，通过源头分散控制减少城市内涝并补充地下水。透水铺装让雨水直接下渗回补土壤，绿色屋顶截留并蒸发部分雨水、减缓屋面径流，下沉式绿地、雨水花园和蓄水池则临时储存径流并自然净化，最后超出能力的雨水再进入管网。这一体系把灰色管网与绿色基础设施结合，削减洪峰、净化水质。�4A sponge city manages stormwater locally through infiltration, retention, storage, purification, reuse and controlled discharge, cutting urban flooding at the source and recharging groundwater. Permeable pavement lets rain soak back into the soil, green roofs retain and evaporate rainfall while delaying roof runoff, and sunken green spaces, rain gardens and storage tanks temporarily hold and naturally treat runoff, with excess draining into pipes. This system couples grey pipe networks with green infrastructure to shave flood peaks and improve water quality.�ans��src��lNFPA 消防与给水排水规范（NFPA 13/14/25/101）；Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程：处理与回用》�iNFPA fire/plumbing codes (NFPA 13/14/25/101); Metcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering: Treatment and Reuse��id�9402ac52874c�body�ي聚焦的激光在极小光斑释放极高能量熔化或气化金属，同时喷辅助气体吹走熔渣；非接触故无刀具磨损。�rA focused beam melts and vaporizes metal while assist gas blows away slag; being non-contact, it avoids tool wear.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�945592519c29�body���单轨铁路用一条高架轨道支撑并引导列车，占地少、转弯半径小，适合城市和景区。列车骑跨在轨道梁上或用悬挂式。重庆的跨座式单轨很有名。��A monorail uses a single elevated beam to support and guide the train, taking little land and allowing tight turns, so it suits cities and scenic areas. Trains straddle the beam or hang beneath it. Chongqing's straddle-type monorail is well known.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�9724c4a29360�body���京杭大运河始凿于春秋、隋代贯通，北起北京南至杭州，全长约1794公里，是世界最长人工运河。它沟通五大水系，曾是国家漕运命脉。今天部分河段仍通航。�.The Grand Canal was first dug in the Spring and Autumn period and linked in the Sui dynasty, running about 1,794 km from Beijing to Hangzhou, the world's longest artificial canal. It connects five major river systems and was the lifeline of imperial grain transport. Some sections still navigate today.�ans��src��?联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《中国大运河》�-UNESCO World Heritage Centre, The Grand Canal��id�9770bf5f259d�body���用户画像是基于真实调研构建的代表性虚拟用户，包含目标、行为与痛点。它帮助团队在设计中始终以具体人群需求为锚，统一决策、避免主观臆测，是用户中心设计的核心工具。��A persona is a representative fictional user built from real research, with goals, behaviors, and pain points. It keeps the team anchored to concrete needs, unifies decisions, and avoids guesswork, a core tool of user-centered design.�ans��src��-《人机交互》（清华大学出版社）�*The Inmates Are Running the Asylum, Cooper��id�97921aa525a6�body���反馈控制必须先看到偏差才动作，本质上总是滞后一步。前馈控制直接测量已知的扰动源，例如进料流量或环境温度，按模型提前调整执行机构，让扰动还没影响输出就被抵消。前馈依赖模型准确度，无法处理未建模的误差，因此工程上常用前馈加反馈：前馈负责快速抑制主要扰动，反馈负责消除残余偏差。��Feedback control must see an error before it acts, so it is inherently one step behind. Feedforward control measures a known disturbance directly, such as feed flow or ambient temperature, and adjusts the actuator in advance from a model so the disturbance is cancelled before it affects the output. Feedforward depends on model accuracy and cannot handle unmodelled errors, so practice combines the two: feedforward quickly suppresses the main disturbance while feedback removes the residual error.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�97ab7f57f0b0�body��`船宽增大初稳性高度（稳心高），恢复力矩更大，抵抗倾覆的能力更强。�qMore beam raises the initial stability (metacentric height); the larger righting moment resists capsizing better.�ans��src��:Bhattacharya《海洋车辆动力学》；IMO 稳性规范�>Bhattacharya, Dynamics of Marine Vehicles; IMO stability codes��id�991a4dff2616�body��r需要长直线进出站和大量用地，城外征地成本低、能带动新区，也避免穿越密集城区。�They need long straight approaches and land; suburbs cost less, spark new districts and avoid cutting through dense city areas.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�992a8ca577f0�body��驾驶舱人因工程的目标是让飞行员在复杂任务下快速准确获取信息并作出决策，避免因显示混乱或操作不便造成人为差错。设计要点包括仪表信息按重要性分级布置、主飞行显示器保持直观一致、报警按紧急程度分层、控制按钮形状位置符合肌肉记忆（形状编码），并用冗余显示减少误读。研究表明相当比例的事故源于人机界面设计不当引发的失误，因此FAA等机构把人为因素纳入适航审定的重要内容。��Cockpit human-factors engineering aims to let pilots acquire information and make decisions quickly and accurately under heavy workload, preventing errors caused by confusing displays or awkward controls. Design essentials include grouping instruments by importance, keeping the primary flight display intuitive and consistent, tiering alerts by urgency, giving controls shape and location coding that match muscle memory, and providing redundant display paths to reduce misreading. A large share of accidents traces to human-machine interface failures, which is why agencies such as the FAA make human factors a key part of airworthiness certification.�ans��src��-《人机交互》（清华大学出版社）�9Sweller, Ayres & Kalyuga, Cognitive Load Theory, Springer��id�999fb242d105�body���它们按制氢过程的碳排放划分：灰氢来自化石能源且无捕集，蓝氢有碳捕集，绿氢用可再生电力电解水几乎零碳。绿氢最清洁，但当前成本也最高。��They are classified by carbon emissions: gray from fossil fuels without capture, blue with capture, and green from renewable-powered electrolysis near zero carbon. Green is cleanest but currently costliest.�ans��src��aIEA,《低碳能源未来中的氢能》(The Role of Hydrogen in a Low-carbon Energy Future),2019�=IEA, The Role of Hydrogen in a Low-carbon Energy Future, 2019��id�9a540b16d8db�body�ِ当发生室颤时心肌乱跳，除颤器释放一次高能电脉冲使全部心肌同步除极，争取让窦房结重新主导正常节律。٫In ventricular fibrillation the muscle quivers; a defibrillator delivers a high-energy shock to depolarize all of it at once, letting the natural pacemaker regain control.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�9b9ca2d83f03�body��e机翼上下表面压差在翼尖处使气流绕流，形成强烈的翼尖涡，涡的能量表现为诱导阻力。小翼把翼尖涡的形成位置推远、削弱其强度，相当于增大了有效展弦比，从而降低诱导阻力。在长航程巡航中这能带来百分之几的燃油节省，比单纯加长翼展更容易兼顾停机位限制。��The pressure difference between the wing's upper and lower surfaces makes air curl around the tip, forming a strong tip vortex whose energy appears as induced drag. A winglet pushes the vortex formation outboard and weakens it, effectively increasing the aspect ratio and cutting induced drag. Over a long cruise this saves a few percent of fuel, and it is easier to fit airport gate limits than simply making the wing longer.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�9ba19e1dc048�body�٤OPC UA是跨平台、安全的工业通信标准，让不同厂商的设备与上位系统（如MES、SCADA）互通数据，是信息互联互通的关键协议。ٗOPC UA is a secure, cross-platform industrial standard letting devices from different vendors exchange data with MES or SCADA, key to interoperability.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�9cb99bacd26d�body��c把水、电、气、通信管线集中入廊，检修在廊内完成，不必反复开挖路面。�uUtility lines (water, power, gas, comms) run in one tunnel, so maintenance happens inside—no repeated road digging.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�9dc5016d7def�body���幕墙是挂在主体结构外侧、只承受自身重量的轻质外墙，不承担楼面荷载。它常用玻璃、金属或石材面板，让大楼外表通透美观。幕墙需要处理好防水、隔热和风压变形。�+A curtain wall is a lightweight outer wall hung on the main structure that carries only its own weight and not floor loads. It often uses glass, metal, or stone panels to give a building a transparent, attractive facade. The wall must handle water sealing, insulation, and wind-pressure deformation.�ans��src��+《玻璃幕墙工程技术规范》JGJ 102�8Technical Code of Glass Curtain Wall Engineering JGJ 102��id�9e23c7c5bb2a�body��;关节力矩传感器直接测量输出轴承受的力矩，比用电机电流估算更准确，因为它绕过了减速器摩擦和效率变化。有了它机器人可以感知碰撞并立即停下，也能实现精细的柔顺装配和拖动示教。代价是成本高、需要良好的抗过载与温漂设计。��A joint torque sensor measures the torque actually transmitted by the output shaft, which is more accurate than estimating from motor current because it bypasses gearbox friction and efficiency variation. With it the robot can detect a collision and stop immediately, and can perform delicate compliant assembly or hand-guided teaching. The downsides are cost and the need for good overload protection and temperature-drift design.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�9e53fd419145�body��许多卫星并非设备报废，而是推进剂耗尽被迫退役；在轨加注把燃料补给到失效卫星，使其恢复轨道维持与机动能力。这避免了整星替换的高成本，也减少太空碎片的产生，是延寿与可持续利用的关键手段。�Many satellites retire not from failure but from depleted propellant; on-orbit refueling replenishes fuel so they regain station-keeping and maneuver capability. This avoids the high cost of full replacement and reduces debris, making it key to life extension and sustainability.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�9f11f6d90a55�body�ٖ绿氢用可再生能源发电，再通过电解槽把水电解成氢气和氧气，全过程零碳排放，被视为难减排行业的清洁燃料。ْGreen hydrogen uses renewable electricity to electrolyze water into H2 and O2 with zero emissions, seen as a clean fuel for hard-to-abate sectors.�ans��src��>Larminie & Dicks，《燃料电池系统解析》（第2版）�9Larminie & Dicks, 'Fuel Cell Systems Explained' (2nd ed.)��id�9f7d61d3b349�body���碳纤维沿纤维方向由规整的石墨微晶构成，键强很高所以比强度大、刚性好。但它主要靠纤维本身承力，缺乏塑性变形能力，受横向冲击或弯折时容易分层或脆断。��Carbon fiber's aligned graphite crystallites give very high specific strength and stiffness. But it relies on the fibers themselves and lacks ductility, so transverse impact or bending causes delamination or brittle breakage.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�a075e47488e2�body��谐波减速器靠一个柔性薄壁齿轮变形与刚性齿圈啮合，能在很小的体积内实现上百倍减速。它的齿隙极小、传动精度高，正好满足机械臂对定位精度的要求。代价是柔轮寿命有限、承受冲击的能力不如齿轮箱。��A harmonic drive uses a thin flexible gear cup that deforms and meshes with a rigid ring gear, achieving reduction ratios of a hundred or more in a very compact package. Its backlash is extremely small and its transmission accuracy is high, which matches the positioning precision robot arms need. The trade-off is the limited fatigue life of the flexspline and lower tolerance to shock loads than a conventional gearbox.�ans��src��hHarmonic Drive Systems 官方技术文献《Harmonic Drive Gearing》(谐波齿轮基本原理与应用)�iHarmonic Drive Systems, 'Harmonic Drive Gearing' Technical Literature (basic principles and applications)��id�a1865d2fa90e�body���失速指迎角超过临界值后机翼上表面边界层大面积分离、升力骤降而阻力剧增的状态。此时操控效率下降、高度迅速损失，若不及时改出可能失控，因此必须避免。�␀Stall occurs when the angle of attack exceeds a critical value, the upper-surface boundary layer separates massively, lift drops sharply and drag surges. Control effectiveness falls and altitude is lost rapidly, so it must be avoided or corrected promptly.�ans��src��0《空气动力学》（国防工业出版社）� Introduction to Flight, Anderson��id�a51b616b801b�body��w差分传输用两根线传送极性相反的信号，接收端只看两者之差，因此外界耦合进来的共模噪声被相减抵消，抗干扰能力强，向外辐射也小。两根线必须等长，否则信号到达时间不同会产生相位偏移，破坏差分对称并引入共模成分。同时要控制线间距以保持恒定的差分阻抗，避免反射。��Differential transmission sends opposite-polarity signals on two traces and the receiver looks only at their difference, so common-mode noise coupled from outside subtracts away, giving strong immunity and low emission. The two traces must be equal in length, otherwise the signals arrive at different times, creating skew that breaks the differential symmetry and introduces a common-mode component. Spacing must also be controlled to keep the differential impedance constant and avoid reflections.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�a55312e723fe�body���QAM把载波分解成相互正交的两路，即同相分量（I）和正交分量（Q），每路独立调幅，合成后的每个符号点就同时携带两路信息。比如16QAM有16个符号点，每个符号代表4比特；64QAM有64个点，每符号6比特，频谱效率随调制阶数对数增长。但星座点越密，点间距越小，对噪声和相位噪声越敏感，所以高阶QAM需要更高的信噪比，通常与信道编码和均衡配合使用。�6QAM splits the carrier into two orthogonal components, the in-phase (I) and quadrature (Q) axes, each independently amplitude-modulated, so the combined symbol point carries two independent streams at once. 16QAM has 16 constellation points, giving 4 bits per symbol; 64QAM has 64 points or 6 bits per symbol, so spectral efficiency grows logarithmically with modulation order. But denser constellations mean smaller point spacing and higher sensitivity to noise and phase noise, so high-order QAM demands high SNR and is paired with channel coding and equalisation.�ans��src��9《通信原理》（樊昌信，国防工业出版社）�OA Mathematical Theory of Communication, Shannon (Bell System Technical Journal)��id�a68fd94863a2�body��o电磁门吸平时保持通行，烟温探测器触发后释放，门靠闭门器自闭，隔火防烟蔓延。وElectromagnetic holders keep them open for passage; smoke/heat detectors release them so closers shut the door, blocking fire and smoke.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�a6d94d57e759�body�ٙ调制把要传的信息（语音、数据）加载到高频载波上，便于远距离辐射和频分复用，常见方式有调幅、调频和调相。ٔModulation puts information onto a high-frequency carrier for efficient radiation and channel sharing, via amplitude, frequency or phase modulation.�ans��src��HRappaport《无线通信》；3GPP 5G 标准；Proakis《数字通信》�VRappaport, Wireless Communications; 3GPP 5G standards; Proakis, Digital Communications��id�a9263d1f7aea�body���安全仪表系统独立于常规控制系统，专门在工艺参数越限时执行联锁停车，把风险降到可接受水平。SIL即安全完整性等级，用要求时失效概率的量级来分级，等级越高要求的可靠性越高，通常需要冗余传感器、表决逻辑和定期功能测试。设计要点是安全功能必须与基本控制功能分离，避免同一个故障同时让控制和保护失效。�"A safety instrumented system is independent of the normal control system and exists to execute interlock shutdowns when process variables exceed limits, reducing risk to a tolerable level. SIL, the safety integrity level, grades these functions by the probability of failure on demand, with higher levels demanding greater reliability, typically through redundant sensors, voting logic and periodic proof testing. A key design principle is separating the safety function from basic control so one fault cannot disable both control and protection.�ans��src��oRausand, M.与Høyland, A.《系统可靠性理论：模型、统计方法与应用》第2版，Wiley，2004年�yRausand, M. & Hoyland, A., System Reliability Theory: Models, Statistical Methods, and Applications, 2nd ed., Wiley, 2004��id�a9bd8d745288�body�ِ外机外壳和电气盒按防护等级设计，关键部件密封防淋；散热片本就耐候，但长期锈蚀或支架老化仍需检查。َOutdoor units meet ingress-protection ratings with sealed electronics; fins are weatherproof, though brackets and corrosion still need checks.�ans��src��9IEC 60529（防护等级 IP 代码）；AHRI 空调标准�3IEC 60529 (IP code); AHRI air-conditioner standards��id�a9c07258b62a�body��c砖缝和孔隙让雨水直接下渗回补地下水，减少地表径流和热岛，缓解内涝。�yJoints and pores let rain soak straight into groundwater, cutting surface runoff and the heat island and easing flooding.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�aa3503b2456e�body���适度柔性让建筑把风的能量通过小幅摆动耗散掉，而不是硬扛产生过大内力。若结构绝对刚硬，风载会在局部形成极高的应力集中，反而更容易损坏，所以可控的晃动是设计上的缓冲。�Slight flexibility lets the building dissipate wind energy through small motion instead of resisting with huge internal forces. If perfectly rigid, wind would create severe local stress concentrations and more damage, so controlled sway is a designed buffer.�ans��src��+Chopra，《结构动力学》（第5版）�*Chopra, 'Dynamics of Structures' (5th ed.)��id�aa51efbf5e6c�body�٨盾构机前端刀盘旋转切削岩土，螺旋或皮带机把渣土运出，同时在尾部拼装管片形成衬砌，边开挖边支护，适合城市软土隧道。ٮA TBM's cutterhead spins to excavate, conveyors remove muck, and segmental rings are erected behind as lining, excavating and supporting at once, ideal for urban soft ground.�ans��src��_TBM 技术规范；国际隧道与地下空间协会（ITA-AITES）；Barla 等《Tunnelling》�^TBM specifications; ITA-AITES (International Tunnelling Association); Barla et al., Tunnelling��id�ab2998d6eb53�body��t无人机靠磁力计确定机头朝向，而机上的电机、电流和铁磁件会叠加固有磁场偏差，不同地点的地磁强度和磁偏角也不同。绕两个轴转动机身，让磁力计在多个方向采样，软件就能拟合出偏差椭球并加以补偿。若不校准或在钢筋、变压器附近起飞，可能出现航向错误导致画圈飞行。��A drone determines heading from its magnetometer, but onboard motors, currents and ferrous parts add fixed magnetic offsets, and geomagnetic strength and declination differ from place to place. Rotating the airframe about two axes samples the field in many directions so the software can fit and compensate the offset ellipsoid. Skipping calibration, or taking off near rebar or a transformer, can give a wrong heading and make the aircraft fly in circles.�ans��src��:Thrun、Burgard & Fox，《概率机器人学》（2005）�5Thrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (2005)��id�ac0d086cdc25�body���把复杂装配拆成许多小步骤，每个工人反复做同一动作会变得非常熟练，切换和找工具的时间被省掉。各工位并行作业，整件产品在不同站点同时被加工，总产出远高于一人做完所有工序。��Breaking assembly into tiny steps lets each worker repeat one motion and become very skilled, eliminating setup and tool-search time. Stations work in parallel so many units advance at once, far outproducing one person doing everything.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�ac53c0709acf�body���典型的监测系统包括挠度、应变、加速度、索力、位移、温度及环境风荷载等传感器，通过长期采集数据识别桥梁状态变化。单纯的数据异常不等于损伤，因为温度和交通荷载也会引起变化，所以要把数据与有限元模型或统计基线对比，通过模态参数变化等特征识别来区分损伤与正常波动。��A typical monitoring system uses sensors for deflection, strain, acceleration, cable forces, displacements, temperature and wind loads, collecting long-term data to track structural behaviour. A raw data anomaly is not necessarily damage, because temperature and traffic also shift readings, so data are compared with finite-element models or statistical baselines, and features such as changes in modal parameters are used to tell real damage from normal variation.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�acbacf06c0a0�body�ل光伏板和电池输出的是直流电，逆变器把直流变成与电网同频同相的交流电才能并网或供家电使用。قSolar panels and batteries output DC; the inverter converts it to grid-synchronous AC so it can feed the grid or power appliances.�ans��src��U王兆安 刘进军 主编,《电力电子技术》第5版,机械工业出版社,2009�VWang Zhaoan and Liu Jinjun eds., Power Electronics, 5th ed., China Machine Press, 2009��id�ad784fbc4e3a�body�ٺ拱桥把荷载通过弯曲的拱圈传递到两端桥台，主要承受压力。拱形能跨越较梁桥更大的跨度且造型优美。石材、混凝土和钢材都能建造拱桥。��An arch bridge transfers loads through a curved arch to the abutments at both ends, mainly under compression. The arch shape can span longer than a beam and looks elegant. Stone, concrete, and steel can all be used to build arches.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�ada12f187b7a�body���它利用电磁感应：充电板里的交流电产生交变磁场，手机线圈感应出电流再整流成直流电。谐振耦合还能拉近一点距离仍高效，所以手机放上去就悄悄充上了。��It uses electromagnetic induction: AC in the pad makes an alternating magnetic field, and the phone coil induces current that is rectified to DC. Resonant coupling stays efficient a bit farther, so the phone charges quietly when placed on top.�ans��src��jKurs 等，《基于强耦合磁共振的无线能量传输》，《科学》317卷，83–86页（2007）�lKurs et al., 'Wireless Power Transfer via Strongly Coupled Magnetic Resonances,' Science 317, 83–86 (2007)��id�ae3a4f02bf94�body�ٽ潮汐能利用海水涨落的势能推动水轮机发电，周期可预测、稳定。拦坝式和潮流式是两类主要方式。适合潮差大的海湾，但选址受限且投资高。��Tidal energy uses the rise and fall of seawater to drive turbines, with a predictable and steady cycle. Barrage and tidal-stream are the two main approaches. It suits bays with large tidal range but is site-limited and capital-intensive.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�af1edf815b44�body��V在管道中放置孔板或文丘里管，流体经过缩口时流速增大、静压下降，前后压差与流速平方近似成正比。测出压差再开平方并乘以标定系数，就得到流量。这种方法结构简单、无活动部件、适应高温高压，但压损较大，且小流量时压差很小导致相对误差增加。�An orifice plate or Venturi tube is placed in the pipe; as fluid passes the constriction its velocity rises and static pressure falls, and the pressure difference across it is roughly proportional to the square of velocity. Taking the square root of the measured differential and multiplying by a calibration coefficient gives the flow rate. The method is simple, has no moving parts and tolerates high temperature and pressure, but it causes appreciable pressure loss and its relative error grows at low flow where the differential is tiny.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�af781aec294c�body�ل地漏底部有存水弯，始终留一汪水形成水封把管道臭气和虫挡住；水封干涸（长期不用）就会失效。�gA trap keeps a water seal that blocks sewer gas and pests; if it dries out from disuse, the seal fails.�ans��src��K《国际管道规范》(IPC) /《建筑给水排水设计标准》GB 50015�_International Plumbing Code (IPC); China Code for Building Water Supply and Drainage (GB 50015)��id�af81fd998894�body��智能电网是集成了数字通信、传感和自动控制技术的电力网络，能够双向实时监控发电、输电与用电。相比传统电网，它支持分布式电源接入、需求侧响应和自愈能力，从而提升可靠性与运行效率。�MA smart grid is an electricity network that integrates digital communications, sensing, and automatic control to monitor generation, transmission, and consumption in real time, bidirectionally. Unlike conventional grids, it accommodates distributed generation, demand response, and self-healing, improving reliability and efficiency.�ans��src��6IEEE Std 2030-2011《智能电网互操作性指南》�=IEEE Std 2030-2011 IEEE Guide for Smart Grid Interoperability��id�b0e5b27265d3�body��e模数转换把连续电压映射到有限个整数台阶，位数决定台阶总数，十二位就有四千零九十六级。每级对应的电压是量程除以级数，量化误差最大为半级，位数每增加一位误差减半。但实际有效位数还受噪声、参考电压稳定性和线性度限制，标称位数高并不等于测得更准。��An ADC maps continuous voltage onto a finite number of integer steps, and the bit count sets how many steps there are, so twelve bits gives four thousand and ninety-six levels. Each step corresponds to the full range divided by the number of levels, the worst-case quantisation error is half a step, and every extra bit halves it. In practice the effective number of bits is limited by noise, reference stability and linearity, so a high nominal bit count does not by itself mean more accurate measurement.�ans��src��9《通信原理》（樊昌信，国防工业出版社）�OA Mathematical Theory of Communication, Shannon (Bell System Technical Journal)��id�b3731186b278�body��&韧性指城市系统在遭受冲击（自然灾害、疫情、断供）时维持基本功能，并在冲击后快速恢复甚至变得更强的能力，涵盖冗余、多样性与自适应。它与单纯抗灾强度不同，更强调吸收扰动与学习演进，而非把风险完全消除。�SResilience refers to a city's ability to maintain essential functions under shocks (disasters, pandemics, supply cuts) and recover quickly or even adapt stronger afterward, covering redundancy, diversity, and self-organization. Unlike mere resistance, it emphasizes absorbing disturbance and learning rather than eliminating risk entirely.�ans��src��'Nature Sustainability（城市韧性）�(Nature Sustainability (urban resilience)��id�b4e9bcbd5844�body��BIM 用包含几何、材料与工序等属性的三维数字模型作为单一信息源，使设计冲突、工程量与进度可在施工前被模拟与协调。它支持碰撞检查、成本估算与运维管理，减少返工并提升多方协作效率。�DBIM uses a 3D digital model carrying geometry, material, and schedule attributes as a single source of truth, letting design clashes, quantities, and timelines be simulated and coordinated before construction. It supports clash detection, cost estimation, and facility management, cutting rework and improving collaboration.�ans��src��BEastman、Teicholz、Sacks & Liston，《BIM手册》（第3版）�;Eastman, Teicholz, Sacks & Liston, 'BIM Handbook' (3rd ed.)��id�b509eb43f75e�body�ٿ3D打印材料按工艺不同有塑料丝、光敏树脂、金属粉末等，逐层堆积成型。它们让复杂形状无需模具即可制造。金属打印常用激光熔融铺粉工艺。��Depending on the process, 3D printing materials include plastic filament, photopolymer resin, and metal powder, built up layer by layer. They let complex shapes be made without molds. Metal printing often uses laser melting of a powder bed.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�b85a59386e0b�body���变压器利用电磁感应：初级线圈通入交流电，在铁芯中产生交变磁通，次级线圈切割磁通感应出电压。电压比等于匝数比，想要多少伏就按比例绕多少圈。它不能用于直流，因为恒定电流不产生变化的磁通，次级就没有感应电动势。电网正是靠层层变压器把电压升上去输送、再降下来使用，理想情况下功率守恒：升压的同时电流同比例减小。�A transformer works by electromagnetic induction: AC in the primary winding creates alternating flux in the core, which induces voltage in the secondary winding. The voltage ratio equals the turns ratio, so you wind as many turns as you need volts. It cannot work on DC, because steady current makes no changing flux and hence no induced EMF. The grid is a ladder of transformers stepping voltage up for transmission and down for use; ideally power is conserved, so higher voltage means proportionally lower current.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�b90a3e987681�body���超材料不是靠成分而是靠人工周期性微结构来操控电磁波、声波等，等效参数可突破自然材料范围。设计成让波绕行或反向折射，就能做隐身斗篷或超透镜。�Metamaterials rely on artificial periodic microstructures rather than composition to steer electromagnetic or acoustic waves, reaching parameters beyond natural materials. Engineered to bend waves around objects or refract negatively, they enable cloaks and superlenses.�ans��src��iSmith、Pendry & Wiltshire，《超材料与负折射率》，《科学》305卷，788–792页（2004）�gSmith, Pendry & Wiltshire, 'Metamaterials and Negative Refractive Index,' Science 305, 788–792 (2004)��id�b98acd043a3b�body���前馈根据可测扰动或指令提前施加补偿，在偏差出现前抵消其影响，提速且减小波动。它常与反馈结合：前馈处理已知可测扰动，反馈消除残差与未建模误差。�Feedforward acts on measured disturbances or commands to compensate before an error appears, speeding response and reducing variation. It is often paired with feedback: feedforward handles known measurable disturbances, feedback removes residual and unmodeled errors.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�b993ff2fa7f5�body���风绕过后方两侧会交替甩出旋转涡，形成有节奏的卡门涡街，涡脱落的频率若接近结构自振频率就会共振抖得厉害。工程师用导流板或改变截面来打乱这种节奏。��Wind sheds alternating rotating vortices behind a body—a Karman vortex street—and if its frequency nears the structure's natural frequency, resonant shaking results. Engineers use fairings or changed cross-sections to break the rhythm.�ans��src��'White，《流体力学》（第8版）�"White, 'Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�bbccc0820b15�body���罗马水道桥用微微倾斜的石拱渠道把远山泉水引进城里，靠重力自流。西班牙塞戈维亚水道桥保存极好，高约29米。它体现古罗马的测绘与拱券技术。��Roman aqueducts used gently sloping stone arches to bring mountain spring water into cities by gravity flow. Spain's Segovia aqueduct is superbly preserved at about 29 m high. It shows Roman surveying and arch technology.�ans��src��vOwens,《The Kremna Aqueduct and Water Supply in Roman Cities》,Greece and Rome,1991 (DOI: 10.1017/s001738350002297x)�tOwens, 'The Kremna Aqueduct and Water Supply in Roman Cities', Greece and Rome, 1991, DOI: 10.1017/s001738350002297x��id�bc405a511392�body��民航客机大多在仪表飞行规则下由空中交通管制（ATC）统一指挥。飞机沿指定的航路飞行，航路在水平方向和垂直方向都互相隔开（垂直间隔通常约300米，雷达管制下还可缩小），管制员用雷达监视并下达指令保证间隔。飞机还装有应答机广播自己的高度和呼号，机载防撞系统（TCAS）在间隔过小时会自动给出爬升或下降指令。起飞降落阶段则由塔台按顺序和间隔放行，跑道时刻精确到秒级。�mCommercial flights mostly fly under instrument flight rules controlled by air traffic control (ATC). Aircraft follow defined airways that are separated both laterally and vertically — vertical separation is typically about 300 m, reduced under radar control — and controllers monitor radar and issue instructions to keep spacing. Aircraft also broadcast their altitude and identity via transponders, and the TCAS collision-avoidance system automatically commands climb or descend when separation gets too tight. At takeoff and landing, tower controllers sequence departures and arrivals to intervals timed in seconds.�ans��src��:Anderson《空气动力学基础》；ICAO 巡航高度层�<Anderson, Fundamentals of Aerodynamics; ICAO cruising levels��id�bc582331e6cc�body��-生物相容性考察材料在生物环境中不引发毒性、过敏、血栓或过度炎症的能力，并通过细胞毒性、致敏、血液相容与植入后局部反应等系列测试评价。国际标准（如 ISO 10993）系统规定了按接触类型与时限应做的生物学评价项目。�lBiocompatibility assesses a material's ability to reside in a biological environment without causing toxicity, allergy, thrombosis, or excessive inflammation, evaluated through cytotoxicity, sensitization, hemocompatibility, and local implantation-response tests. Standards such as ISO 10993 specify which biological evaluations apply by contact type and duration.�ans��src��*ISO 10993（医疗器械生物学评价）�4ISO 10993 (biological evaluation of medical devices)��id�bd69aacb534b�body��V吸收是用液体溶剂从气体混合物中脱除可溶组分的过程，例如用水洗去烟气中的二氧化硫。逆流时液体的溶质浓度从塔顶到塔底递增，气液两相始终存在较大的浓度差即传质推动力，同一塔高能得到更高的吸收率；并流时推动力沿塔迅速下降，效果明显变差。��Absorption removes a soluble component from a gas mixture using a liquid solvent, for example scrubbing sulfur dioxide from flue gas with water. In countercurrent operation the liquid solute concentration rises from top to bottom, so the gas-liquid concentration difference (mass-transfer driving force) stays high along the column, and a given column height achieves a higher removal efficiency; in co-current flow the driving force falls off quickly and performance degrades markedly.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�be7682805ff9�body���古代木材容易获取且自重轻，加工工具简单，适合榫卯连接而不用钉子。木结构有一定韧性，在地震中能通过变形吸收能量。不过它怕火、易朽，所以留存至今的古木建筑很少。�@In ancient times timber was readily available, light, and easy to work with simple tools, and it could be joined by mortise-and-tenon without nails. Wood has some flexibility and can absorb earthquake energy through deformation. However, it is vulnerable to fire and decay, so few ancient wooden buildings survive today.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�bec6ea51ca26�body���激光切割用高功率光束熔化或气化材料，配合气体吹走熔渣，切口细且变形小。它适合金属、木材和亚克力等多种材料。数控路径让复杂图形也能快速完成。��Laser cutting uses a high-power beam to melt or vaporize material while gas blows away slag, giving fine, low-distortion cuts. It suits metal, wood, acrylic, and more. CNC paths let complex shapes be cut quickly.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�beed411fe932�body��微重力下去除了对熔池与粉床的重力沉降约束，热对流减弱、材料更易漂浮，使粉床稳定与成形质量依赖表面张力与静电控制而非重力。这既带来无支撑悬垂成形的可能，也要求重新设计送料、铺粉与冷却方式。�CMicrogravity removes gravity-driven settling of the melt pool and powder bed, weakens thermal convection, and lets material float, so bed stability and quality rely on surface tension and electrostatic control rather than gravity. This enables support-free overhangs but requires rethinking feeding, spreading, and cooling.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bf2c130a142d�body�٢数字助听器用麦克风采集声音后经数字信号处理器降噪、分频放大，可按听损曲线个性化补偿，还能抑制啸叫和突发噪声。١Digital aids use a DSP to denoise and frequency-shape sound to the user's loss profile, suppressing feedback and sudden noise, far more personalized than analog.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�bfa08afbcafb�body���BRT是用专用车道、站台售票和信号优先模拟地铁体验的公交系统，造价远低于地铁。它运量介于普通公交和轨道之间。拉美城市如库里蒂巴最早成功应用。��BRT is a bus system using dedicated lanes, off-board ticketing, and signal priority to mimic the metro experience at far lower cost. Its capacity lies between ordinary buses and rail. Curitiba in Brazil was among the first to apply it successfully.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�c06d1739c516�body��Y自旋稳定让整星像陀螺一样绕一个轴旋转，靠角动量抵抗扰动，结构简单可靠，但载荷指向受限，太阳能板利用率低。三轴稳定用反作用轮和推力器分别控制三个轴，星体可以稳定对地或对目标指向，适合成像和通信卫星，代价是控制系统复杂、需要更多部件。��A spin-stabilised satellite rotates about one axis like a gyroscope, resisting disturbance with its angular momentum; it is simple and robust but payload pointing is limited and solar cells are poorly used. Three-axis stabilisation uses reaction wheels and thrusters to control each axis, letting the body hold a steady attitude toward Earth or a target, which suits imaging and communication satellites at the cost of a more complex control system and more hardware.�ans��src��,Wertz《空间任务分析》；卫星稳定�AWertz, Space Mission Analysis and Design; satellite stabilization��id�c07efe919aed�body�ف叶片超长超限，多用特种拖车低速夜运、转弯要清道；有的现场用模具分段粘接，避免上路难题。�~Oversize blades move on special trailers at night with escorts, or are joined on-site from segments to avoid transport limits.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�c0cceedc9dd1�body��f环向波纹像肋一样提高轴向抗压和刚度，让薄壁容器能承受更大压力而不瘪。�sThe rings act like ribs, boosting axial crush strength and stiffness so thin walls resist pressure without denting.�ans��src��1Timoshenko《板壳理论》；罐头制造工程�FTimoshenko, Theory of Plates and Shells; can manufacturing engineering��id�c10198413bbe�body���返回时飞船以极高速度冲入大气层，空气被剧烈压缩产生上千度的高温。防热大底用烧蚀或隔热材料把热量挡在外面并随表层烧蚀带走热量，保护舱内人员和设备。��On reentry the craft slams into the atmosphere at huge speed, compressing air to over a thousand degrees. The heat shield uses ablative or insulating material to block heat and carry it away as the surface burns, protecting the cabin.�ans��src��BAnderson，《高超声速与高温气体动力学》（第2版）�BAnderson, 'Hypersonic and High-Temperature Gas Dynamics' (2nd ed.)��id�c1ad94a9e359�body�٢光在玻璃纤芯中靠全反射约束前进，优质石英光纤损耗极低（约0.2 dB/km），且不受电磁干扰，因此适合大容量长距离通信。��Light is guided by total internal reflection in the glass core; quality silica fiber loses only about 0.2 dB/km and is immune to electromagnetic interference, ideal for long-haul, high-capacity links.�ans��src��)Keiser《光纤通信》；Corning 光纤�;Keiser, Optical Fiber Communications; Corning optical fiber��id�c3d5688cece5�body�ٟP是比例，按当前误差大小反应；I是积分，消除长期稳态误差；D是微分，抑制超调与振荡。三者结合广泛用于运动控制。ٝP is proportional to current error, I integrates to remove steady-state error, and D differentiates to damp overshoot; together they dominate motion control.�ans��src��*Astrom & Hagglund《PID 控制器》(1995)�)Astrom & Hagglund, PID Controllers (1995)��id�c3efaa12e3bf�body�ي把发电材料做成幕墙、屋面或遮阳构件，省建材又就地发电、隔热；挑战在防水、维护和发电效率折中。ْBuilding-integrated photovoltaics serve as facade, roof, or shade while generating power and insulating, trading off waterproofing and efficiency.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�c5b063c9e3de�body�ٹ应县木塔建于辽代，高约67米，全木结构不用一根铁钉，靠榫卯层层咬合。它近千年来经历多次地震仍屹立。是世界上最高的古代木构建筑。�The Yingxian Wooden Pagoda was built in the Liao dynasty, about 67 m tall, entirely of wood with not a single iron nail, joined by mortise and tenon. It has survived many earthquakes over nearly a millennium. It is the world's tallest ancient wooden structure.�ans��src��3Chen & Zhang《应县木塔》；建筑抗震设计�GChen & Zhang, Yingxian Wood Pagoda; seismic design of timber structures��id�c5e59372d515�body��o典型包括感知、定位、规划、控制四大模块，形成看到、定位、决策、行动的闭环。�xIt typically has perception, localization, planning and control, forming a closed loop of sense, locate, decide and act.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�c64077bb47ef�body�ق1853年奥的斯在博览会上演示砍断缆绳平台不坠的安全钳，证明有保险，才让公众接受电梯上高楼。قIn 1853 Otis demonstrated a safety brake that held the platform after cutting the rope, convincing the public elevators were safe.�ans��src��.Otis 安全电梯 1854；Elevator World 史料�>Otis safety elevator (1854); Elevator World historical records��id�c71ae22095c2�body���磁悬浮列车利用电磁力使车体悬浮于轨道之上，消除轮轨摩擦，因此能跑得极快。它靠直线电机推进，运行平稳噪音低。上海磁悬浮线最高运营时速约430公里。�A maglev train uses electromagnetic force to levitate the car above the track, removing wheel-rail friction so it can travel very fast. It is propelled by linear motors and runs smoothly with low noise. Shanghai's maglev line reaches about 430 km/h in service.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�c7274f01f82b�body���DMAIC是定义（Define）、测量（Measure）、分析（Analyze）、改进（Improve）、控制（Control）的首字母，是六西格玛改进项目的数据驱动流程框架。它与传统质量管理的关键区别在于强调用统计方法量化缺陷率、以西格玛水平衡量过程能力，并由跨职能团队围绕顾客关键质量特性系统改进，最终把缺陷率降到百万分之3.4以下的水平。��DMAIC stands for Define, Measure, Analyze, Improve and Control, the data-driven framework of Six Sigma improvement projects. Its key difference from traditional quality control is that defects are quantified statistically, process capability is expressed in sigma levels, and cross-functional teams improve around critical-to-quality customer requirements, ultimately driving defect rates below 3.4 parts per million.�ans��src��^Six Sigma（Pyzdek & Keller）；ISO 9001；机器视觉检测（Davies《Machine Vision》）�YSix Sigma (Pyzdek & Keller); ISO 9001; machine vision inspection (Davies, Machine Vision)��id�c7ff7e16f5c6�body��>机器人内部只知道法兰盘的位姿，工具中心点是法兰到实际作业点的一个固定偏移。换夹爪后这个偏移的长度和方向都变了，如果不重新标定，示教好的轨迹就会整体错位。标定通常让机器人用不同姿态触碰同一个固定尖点，反解出偏移量。��The controller only knows the pose of the mounting flange; the tool centre point is a fixed offset from that flange to the actual working point. Changing the gripper changes both the length and direction of that offset, so without recalibration every taught trajectory is shifted. Calibration typically has the robot touch one fixed sharp point from several different orientations and solves for the offset.�ans��src��?Craig，《机器人学导论：力学与控制》（第4版）�BCraig, 'Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control' (4th ed.)��id�c8554fcf1785�body��f高强常伴随低塑性，裂纹一旦萌生就迅速扩展；韧性材料会先变形耗能再断。�{High strength often means low ductility, so a crack runs fast once started; tough materials deform and absorb energy first.�ans��src��=Griffith 1921《裂纹扩展》；Callister《材料科学》�ZGriffith, The Phenomena of Rupture and Flow in Solids (1921); Callister, Materials Science��id�c9f9361ed45d�body��>烟气通过含醇胺（如 MEA）的吸收塔时，二氧化碳与胺可逆反应生成不稳定盐，在低温下被吸收；富液加热到约 120 摄氏度左右又在解吸塔释放高浓度二氧化碳并再生胺液。该工艺成熟、应用最广，但再生能耗和胺降解是主要成本与损耗来源。��Flue gas passes through an absorber containing alkanolamines such as MEA, where CO2 reversibly reacts to form labile salts and is absorbed at low temperature; the rich solution is then heated to about 120 °C in a stripper to release concentrated CO2 and regenerate the amine. The process is mature and widely used, but regeneration energy and amine degradation drive most cost and loss.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�caa4c127c4f0�body�ي洞口内外亮度差巨大，明适应和暗适应会让司机短暂盲；洞内照明和过渡段灯光减少黑洞白洞效应事故。�wThe brightness jump blinds drivers briefly; interior and threshold lighting reduce the black-hole or white-hole effect.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�cad186779dff�body��`中间PVB膜把两片玻璃粘在一起，碎了也不飞散，仍能挡住风雨灌入室内。�fA PVB interlayer bonds the panes so even if broken they don't fly apart, still blocking wind and rain.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�cc866bd944d8�body��␀FDM 通过逐层挤出热塑性丝材成型，零件内部通常不需要完全实心。设置填充率可在保证强度与刚度的前提下大幅减少材料用量和打印时间，外壳承担主要载荷，内部网格仅提供支撑与抗弯刚度。�MFDM builds parts by extruding thermoplastic filament layer by layer, and the interior need not be fully solid. Setting an infill percentage greatly reduces material use and print time while keeping strength and stiffness, since the outer shell carries most load and the internal lattice mainly provides support and bending stiffness.�ans��src��5ASTM F42 / ISO 17296（增材制造术语与工艺）�9ASTM F42 / ISO 17296 (additive manufacturing terminology)��id�ccf66ea201c0�body���当泵入口压力低到液体自身沸点以下，水会局部汽化产生气泡，流到高压区又瞬间溃灭，像小爆炸一样啃蚀叶轮。汽蚀会掉性能、吵闹并很快打坏泵。��When inlet pressure falls below the liquid's vapor pressure, local boiling forms bubbles that collapse violently in high pressure, pitting the impeller like tiny explosions. Cavitation kills performance, is noisy and quickly damages the pump.�ans��src��@Karassik、Messina、Paul & Heald，《泵手册》（第4版）�:Karassik, Messina, Paul & Heald, 'Pump Handbook' (4th ed.)��id�cd982af28d64�body��G空速管迎着来流的开口测到总压，机身侧面的静压孔测到静压，两者之差就是动压。由动压与空气密度的关系即可算出指示空速。所以空速管一旦被冰、昆虫或防尘套堵住，仪表就会给出错误速度，历史上多起事故与此有关，因此它必须加热除冰。��The forward-facing opening of the pitot tube senses total pressure while static ports on the fuselage sense static pressure, and the difference is dynamic pressure. From dynamic pressure and air density the indicated airspeed is computed. If the tube is blocked by ice, insects or a forgotten cover the instruments read wrongly, a factor in several historical accidents, which is why the probe is electrically heated.�ans��src��+FAA 飞行手册；Anderson 空气动力学�9FAA Flight Manual; Anderson, Fundamentals of Aerodynamics��id�cf3b3388cd98�body��G超级电容器靠电极表面的双电层或快速氧化还原储能，充放电极快、循环寿命可达百万次，但单位质量储能少。锂离子电池靠缓慢的体相化学反应储能，能量密度高却功率密度低、循环寿命较短。二者常互补用于需要瞬间大功率又需长续航的系统。��Supercapacitors store energy at the electrode surface via the double layer or fast redox, charging extremely fast with up to a million cycles but low energy per mass. Lithium-ion cells store energy through slower bulk chemical reactions, giving high energy density but lower power density and shorter cycle life. The two are often complementary where both burst power and long range are needed.�ans��src��-《材料科学》（电化学储能材料）�<Materials Science (electrochemical energy storage materials)��id�d1213cb843cc�body��i汛前预泄降低水位留出防洪库容，洪峰来时拦蓄削峰，再按下游安全能力下泄。ٟBefore floods they pre-release to lower the level and free storage; at peak flow they hold back water, then release only as much as the lower reaches can take.�ans��src��:USBR 水库运行规程；中国《防洪标准》GB 50201�BUSBR reservoir operations; China Flood Control Standard (GB 50201)��id�d5579e6367fb�body��3传统捕集针对电厂、工厂排放口浓度高（约 10–15%）的二氧化碳；DAC 则从大气（约 420 ppm）中直接提取，浓度极低、处理气量大、能耗更高。DAC 的优点是可部署在任何地点并与封存或利用设施就近组合，适合处理已扩散的存量排放。�`Conventional capture targets high-concentration CO2 at plant stacks (about 10–15%), while DAC extracts from the atmosphere at roughly 420 ppm, so the concentration is far lower, the gas volume far larger, and energy use higher. Its advantage is siting anywhere and pairing with nearby storage or utilization, suiting already-diffuse legacy emissions.�ans��src��aLackner，《从环境空气中捕集二氧化碳》，《能源》32卷，491–495页（2007）�TLackner, K.S. 'Carbon dioxide capture from ambient air.' Energy 32, 491–495 (2007)��id�d5b7bdebfb8d�body��;结构光投出已知的编码图案，根据图案变形算深度，近距离精度高但怕强光。飞行时间相机测量调制光往返的时间或相位，帧率高、量程较远，分辨率一般。双目靠两个镜头的视差三角测量，不主动发光，但在纹理稀少的白墙上容易失效。��Structured light projects a known coded pattern and computes depth from its distortion, giving high accuracy at short range but suffering in bright sunlight. Time-of-flight cameras measure the round-trip time or phase of modulated light, offering high frame rates and longer range with modest resolution. Stereo cameras triangulate the disparity between two lenses without emitting light, but fail on textureless surfaces such as blank walls.�ans��src�كZanuttigh, Marin, Dal Mutto, Dominio,《Time-of-Flight and Structured Light Depth Cameras》, 2016 (DOI: 10.1007/978-3-319-30973-6)�Zanuttigh, Marin, Dal Mutto, Dominio, 'Time-of-Flight and Structured Light Depth Cameras', 2016, DOI: 10.1007/978-3-319-30973-6��id�d867a2b100f3�body���嵌入式系统是嵌入到特定设备中、为特定功能定制的计算机系统，资源受限但要求高可靠性，广泛用于汽车电子、家电、医疗和工业控制。RTOS强调可预测的响应时间，通过优先级调度保证任务在规定的截止时间内完成，因此行为可确定；通用操作系统如Windows或Linux优化的是平均吞吐量，响应时间存在不确定性，无法满足硬实时控制需求。�An embedded system is a computer dedicated to a specific function inside a larger device, resource-constrained but highly reliable, found across automotive electronics, appliances, medical equipment and industrial control. An RTOS stresses predictable response: priority-based scheduling guarantees that tasks finish within their deadlines, so behaviour is deterministic; general-purpose OSes such as Windows or Linux optimise average throughput and have non-deterministic response times, which cannot meet hard real-time control requirements.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d867dfbee034�body��{阴天靠散射光仍能发一部分电，只是功率大降；晚上没有光就不发电，需靠电池或电网补电。فOn cloudy days diffuse light still yields some power at reduced output; at night it produces none and draws from storage or grid.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�da553aa1ddca�body��;壁虎脚掌上有亿万根纳米级绒毛，与墙面接触面积极大，靠分子间的范德华力产生吸附。仿生脚垫用微米柱阵列复制这种结构，压上去贴合、按特定方向剥离就脱开。它不需要真空，因此在粗糙度合适的干燥表面上比吸盘更省能、更安静。��A gecko's toe pads carry billions of nanoscale hairs that make enormous real contact area, generating adhesion through van der Waals forces between molecules. Biomimetic pads copy this with arrays of micro-pillars that grip when pressed and release when peeled in a particular direction. Because no vacuum is needed, they are quieter and use less energy than suction cups on suitably smooth, dry surfaces.�ans��src�٨Xiang, Honarvar Shakibaei Asli,《Advances in Gecko-Inspired Climbing Robots: From Biology to Robotics—A Review》,Electronics,2025 (DOI: 10.3390/electronics14142810)٦Xiang, Honarvar Shakibaei Asli, 'Advances in Gecko-Inspired Climbing Robots: From Biology to Robotics—A Review', Electronics, 2025, DOI: 10.3390/electronics14142810��id�da6ab5401f1b�body�ٷ数控加工用计算机程序控制机床自动切削金属或塑料，精度可达微米级。它适合复杂零件的小批量和柔性生产。车、铣、钻都可由CNC完成。��CNC machining uses computer programs to control machine tools that automatically cut metal or plastic, with micron-level precision. It suits complex parts in small batches and flexible production. Turning, milling, and drilling can all be CNC-run.�ans��src�ًAltintas，《Manufacturing Automation: Metal Cutting Mechanics, Machine Tool Vibrations, and CNC Design》（第2版，Cambridge，2012）فAltintas, 'Manufacturing Automation: Metal Cutting Mechanics, Machine Tool Vibrations, and CNC Design' (2nd ed., Cambridge, 2012)��id�da6cf70da596�body�٨协作机器人设计为人机共享工作空间，具备力觉与碰撞检测，碰撞即停，通常无需安全围栏；传统机器人速度快、需隔离防护。ٻCobots are built to share space with humans, with force sensing and collision detection so they stop on contact, usually needing no safety fence; traditional arms are fast and fenced off.�ans��src��VIEC 61131-3（PLC）；ISO 3691-4（AGV 安全）；Groover《自动化生产系统》�zIEC 61131-3 (PLC); ISO 3691-4 (AGV safety); Groover, Automation, Production Systems, and Computer-Integrated Manufacturing��id�da835c1781ef�body��t主动分滞洪水、削减下游洪峰，比堤防无序溃决更可控，是用'有计划淹没'换重点安全。يDeliberately diverting water cuts the downstream peak and is more controllable than random levee breaks—planned flooding for key safety.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�db5db8bf7eef�body���热电联产在同一机组中同时产出电力和可用余热，总效率可达80%以上。余热用于供暖或工业蒸汽，避免单独发电时废热排掉。它常见于工业园区和区域供暖。�␀Combined heat and power produces electricity and useful heat from the same unit, reaching overall efficiency above 80%. The waste heat warms buildings or feeds industrial steam instead of being dumped. It is common in industrial parks and district heating.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�dbe2913b1b9d�body��J挤压式供应要求整个推进剂贮箱承受与燃烧室相当的压力，贮箱壁必须很厚，结构质量代价巨大。涡轮泵在低压贮箱和高压燃烧室之间做增压，贮箱可以做得很轻，因此大型火箭都用泵压式。挤压式结构简单可靠，仍用于小推力的姿控和上级发动机。��Pressure-fed supply requires the whole propellant tank to withstand roughly chamber pressure, so tank walls must be thick and the structural mass penalty is severe. A turbopump raises pressure between a low-pressure tank and a high-pressure chamber, letting the tanks be very light, which is why large rockets are pump-fed. Pressure-fed systems remain simple and reliable, so they are still used for small attitude-control and some upper-stage engines.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�dcc0e68bc421�body��3RISC-V 是一个开放、免费、模块化的精简指令集，其基础指令集很小，并可通过标准扩展（如乘除法、浮点、向量）按需叠加。由于指令集规范公开，任何机构都能自由设计兼容处理器，而不必支付授权费，这降低了芯片设计的门槛。�RRISC-V is an open, royalty-free, modular reduced instruction set whose base ISA is tiny and can be extended on demand with standard extensions such as multiply/divide, floating point, and vector. Because the specification is public, anyone can design compatible processors without paying license fees, lowering the barrier to chip design.�ans��src��yRISC-V International,《The RISC-V Instruction Set Architecture, Volume I: Base User Instruction Set》(RISC-V ISA规范)�}RISC-V International, The RISC-V Instruction Set Architecture, Volume I: Base User-Instruction Set (RISC-V ISA specification)��id�dcd924f55a8f�body���轴承把轴与机座之间笨重的滑动摩擦变成滚动摩擦（滚动轴承）或薄油膜内的剪切摩擦（滑动轴承），摩擦系数可下降一个数量级。滚动轴承用滚珠或滚柱在内外圈之间滚动，以点或线接触承载；滑动轴承靠油泵或自吸作用把润滑油楔进间隙，形成动压油膜把轴"托"起来，完全避免金属直接接触。没有轴承，高铁轮对、电机转子很快就会烧毁。�'Bearings replace the heavy sliding friction between shaft and housing with rolling friction (rolling bearings) or shear within a thin oil film (sliding bearings), cutting the friction coefficient by an order of magnitude. Rolling bearings use balls or rollers between the inner and outer races and carry load at point or line contacts; sliding bearings wedge lubricant into the clearance to build a hydrodynamic film that floats the shaft, avoiding metal-to-metal contact entirely. Without bearings, a train wheelset or motor rotor would soon burn up.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�dcf91f74ccfa�body�� 集群多采用去中心化的相对定位与局部通信，每个单元依据邻居状态与简单规则（如分离、对齐、聚合）自行决策，整体涌现出编队、覆盖或围捕等行为。相比集中控制，这种方式对单点失效更鲁棒，也更易扩展规模。�eSwarms typically use decentralized relative positioning and local communication, where each unit decides from neighbors' states via simple rules such as separation, alignment, and cohesion, and the group emerges behaviors like formation, coverage, or encirclement. Versus centralized control, this is more robust to single-point failure and easier to scale.�ans��src��%Science Robotics（集群机器人）�!Science Robotics (swarm robotics)��id�de703659552f�body�٢它向气道施加正压把气体送入肺部（正压通气），并按设定频率和潮气量维持氧合与二氧化碳排出，用于麻醉或呼吸衰竭。ٟIt pushes gas into the lungs with positive pressure at set rates and volumes, maintaining oxygenation and CO2 removal during anesthesia or respiratory failure.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�df37ce6d412d�body���整体件少了大量焊缝，焊缝恰恰是疲劳和泄漏的薄弱点，也省了对齐和检测。一体成型既轻又可靠，虽然加工费料费时，但安全和寿命账更划算。��Monolithic parts avoid many welds, which are exactly the weak points for fatigue and leakage, and skip alignment and inspection. Integral shaping is lighter and more reliable; though wasteful and slow to machine, the safety and life math wins.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�e072eedde9d0�body���轮轨关系研究车轮与钢轨接触处的受力、磨损和导向机理。车轮的锥度踏面让列车能自动回正并顺利通过曲线。它是列车安全、平稳和噪声控制的核心。��Wheel-rail interaction studies the forces, wear, and guiding mechanism at the contact between wheel and rail. The coned wheel tread lets trains self-center and pass curves smoothly. It is central to safety, ride comfort, and noise control.�ans��src��OIwnicki 主编,《Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics》第2版,CRC Press,2019�NS. Iwnicki ed., Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics, 2nd ed., CRC Press, 2019��id�e21f01340c16�body��J数字芯片在时钟跳变瞬间会突然抽取大电流，而电源走线存在电感，电流突变会造成电压跌落和振铃。紧贴电源脚的去耦电容像一个小水库，就近提供瞬态电流，把电源噪声限制在很小的回路里。因此它必须离引脚尽可能近，回路面积越小效果越好。��A digital chip suddenly draws a burst of current when its clock switches, and because the supply trace has inductance, that step causes voltage droop and ringing. A decoupling capacitor right at the power pin acts as a small reservoir, supplying the transient current locally and confining supply noise to a tiny loop. That is why it must sit as close to the pin as possible, with the smallest possible loop area.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�e40136e332db�body���桥面系是桥梁上部直接承受车辆和行人荷载的部分，包括桥面板、铺装层和排水设施。它把荷载传给主梁并保障行车舒适与安全。桥面铺装还要耐磨、防水、抗冻。�The deck system is the upper part of a bridge that directly carries vehicles and pedestrians, including the deck slab, surfacing, and drainage. It transfers loads to the main girders and ensures comfortable, safe riding. The surfacing must also resist wear, water, and freezing.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�e4547ac7c88e�body���空间站在轨无法补给大气，必须循环再生。氧气主要靠电解水制得，同时副产氢气；二氧化碳由分子筛吸附捕获后，与氢气在萨巴蒂耶反应器中合成水和甲烷，水再送回电解，形成氧-氢-水闭合循环。尿液和冷凝水经蒸馏、反渗透净化后变成饮用水。只有食品无法再生，靠货运飞船定期补给。这套环境控制与生命保障系统让空间站的水自给率达到90%以上。�EIn orbit a station cannot import air, so it must recycle. Oxygen comes mainly from electrolyzing water, which also yields hydrogen; carbon dioxide is captured by molecular sieves and reacted with that hydrogen in Sabatier reactors to make water and methane, and the water returns to electrolysis — a closed oxygen-hydrogen-water loop. Urine and condensed moisture are distilled and reverse-osmosed into drinking water. Only food cannot be regenerated and arrives by cargo ship. This Environmental Control and Life Support System gives the station over 90% water self-sufficiency.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e4d8a8d0e37d�body���状态空间用一组变量完整描述系统演化，观测器则利用可测输出和模型，反推出那些装不了传感器的内部状态。就像通过体温和心率推测身体内部状况一样。��State space describes a system by a set of variables; an observer uses measurable outputs and the model to infer internal states lacking sensors. It is like guessing internal condition from temperature and heart rate.�ans��src��Kailath，《线性系统》�Kailath, 'Linear Systems'��id�e4d9796eb58e�body��x传送带把工序连成节拍一致的连续流，减少搬运等待、平衡各工位产能；节拍由需求决定。�kConveyors link stations into a paced flow, cutting handling and balancing work; takt time is set by demand.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�e773d1deb6c5�body���表面处理在零件表层形成保护或装饰膜，如镀锌、阳极氧化和喷塑，用以防锈美观或耐磨。它不改变整体形状只改表层性能。选择取决于基材和使用环境。�Surface treatment forms a protective or decorative layer on a part, such as galvanizing, anodizing, and powder coating, for rust proofing, looks, or wear resistance. It changes only the surface, not the shape. Choice depends on the substrate and environment.�ans��src��Q《ASM Handbook, Vol. 13A: Corrosion — Fundamentals, Testing, and Protection》�M'ASM Handbook, Vol. 13A: Corrosion — Fundamentals, Testing, and Protection'��id�e786ddd2dac1�body���AGV（自动导引车）沿固定路径（磁条、导轨、二维码）行驶，需改造地面；AMR（自主移动机器人）靠激光或视觉自主导航，能绕障并动态规划路线。٪AGVs follow fixed paths (magnetic tape, rails, QR codes) and often need floor changes, while AMRs navigate autonomously with lidar or vision and reroute around obstacles.�ans��src��)ISO 3691-4（工业卡车 / AGV 安全）�+ISO 3691-4 (industrial trucks / AGV safety)��id�e7d48302cd57�body��f凹底增加瓶身耐压强度、让沉淀聚在中心，也更好握持，并非为了显得酒多。�iThe punt adds pressure strength, gathers sediment in the center and aids grip—not to fake extra volume.�ans��src��nHibbeler《结构分析》/《材料力学》；Shigley《机械工程设计》；Timoshenko《板壳理论》هHibbeler, Structural Analysis / Mechanics of Materials; Shigley, Mechanical Engineering Design; Timoshenko, Theory of Plates and Shells��id�e954769904f1�body���绿色建筑评级是用一套指标衡量建筑在节能、节水、材料和室内环境方面的表现，如中国的三星标准和美国的LEED。达到高等级可获得认证标志。它鼓励建筑全生命周期降低环境负担。�BA green building rating uses a set of criteria to measure a building's performance in energy, water, materials, and indoor environment, such as China's three-star standard and the U.S. LEED system. High-scoring buildings earn certification. It encourages lowering environmental impact across a building's whole life cycle.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�e98d3d4693c0�body�ه可回收物进分拣中心打包再利用，厨余进堆肥或厌氧产沼，其他垃圾焚烧或填埋，有害垃圾专门处置。ُRecyclables go to a sorting facility, food waste to composting or biogas, residual to incineration or landfill, hazardous to special treatment.�ans��src��,世界银行《城市固体废物简报》(What a Waste 2.0);国家发展改革委、住建部生活垃圾分类制度实施方案 ; 另见: World Bank, What a Waste 2.0: A Global Snapshot of Solid Waste Management to 2050; NDRC & MOHURD, Implementation Plan on Household Waste Sorting System (China)�.World Bank, What a Waste 2.0: A Global Snapshot of Solid Waste Management to 2050; NDRC & MOHURD, Implementation Plan on Household Waste Sorting System (China) ; see also: 世界银行《城市固体废物简报》(What a Waste 2.0);国家发展改革委、住建部生活垃圾分类制度实施方案��id�eacd9db6495c�body���减振器本身不支撑车身重量，那是弹簧的工作；它的任务是把振动能量耗散掉。减振器内部是液压缸，活塞上下运动时迫使油液流过小孔和阀片，液体流动的黏性阻力把机械能变成热能散发。弹簧负责储存能量、把冲击变得平缓，减振器负责把弹簧储存的能量逐步"泄"掉，两者配合车身才能很快平稳。伸张与压缩行程的阻尼大小可以不同，以兼顾舒适与操控。�␀A shock absorber does not carry the car's weight — springs do. Its job is to dissipate vibrational energy. Inside is a hydraulic cylinder: as the piston strokes up and down it forces oil through small orifices and valve discs, and viscous drag converts mechanical energy into heat. The spring stores energy and softens the impact; the damper bleeds that stored energy away, and together they settle the body quickly. Damping can differ between extension and compression strokes to balance comfort and handling.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�ec63dc0b9f0c�body���可访问性让所有人——包括视障、听障、行动不便者——都能使用产品。具体手段包括：给图片写替代文本供读屏软件朗读，保证整个流程可用键盘操作，让颜色对比度足够色弱者看清，为表单提供明确的标签和错误提示，给视频配上字幕。设计时遵循WCAG等标准，受益的不只是残障人士，还有老年人和临时受限的人；在某些地区这甚至是法律要求。��Accessibility lets everyone use a product, including people who are blind, deaf, or have limited mobility. Concrete techniques include alt text for images so screen readers can speak them, full keyboard operability, sufficient color contrast for color-blind users, clearly labeled forms with error feedback, and captions on video. Following standards like WCAG benefits not only people with disabilities but also seniors and temporarily constrained users, and in some regions it is a legal requirement.�ans��src��-《人机交互》（清华大学出版社）�9Sweller, Ayres & Kalyuga, Cognitive Load Theory, Springer��id�ec7e5318d2c9�body���车轮踏面做成锥形是为了让列车自动对中转弯。轮对是左右两轮固定在一根轴上的，过弯时外轮走的长轨、内轮走短轨，若两轮滚动半径相同就会打滑。锥形踏面让车体在弯道向一侧偏移时，外侧车轮的滚动半径变大、内侧变小，两轮转速自动匹配内外轨长度，实现自导向。这个几何特性也正是高铁"蛇行运动"的来源，需要靠踏面磨耗管理和主动稳定来控制。�%Conical wheel treads let a trainset self-center on curves. A wheelset has two wheels fixed on one axle; in a curve the outer wheel travels a longer rail than the inner, and equal rolling radii would cause slipping. With a coned profile, when the set shifts sideways the outer wheel rides a larger rolling radius and the inner a smaller one, so the wheels automatically match the two rail lengths and steer themselves. The same geometry is what produces high-speed "hunting" oscillation, controlled through tread wear management and active stability.�ans��src��OIwnicki 主编,《Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics》第2版,CRC Press,2019�NS. Iwnicki ed., Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics, 2nd ed., CRC Press, 2019��id�ec94a7fbdab2�body�ف钢轮与钢轨接触阻力小、承载力大、耐高速磨损，能耗低；橡胶既不耐高温也不耐磨于这种速度。ٕSteel-on-steel has low resistance, high load capacity and wears well at speed with low energy use; rubber can't take the heat or wear at such speeds.�ans��src��LR. C. Hibbeler,《Engineering Mechanics: Statics & Dynamics》Pearson 多版�VR. C. Hibbeler, Engineering Mechanics: Statics and Dynamics, Pearson, various editions��id�eee2b82d5163�body�ٮ它把摄像头、激光雷达、毫米波雷达和GPS或IMU的数据融合，互补各自优劣（视觉辨色、雷达测距测速），形成统一可靠的环境模型。٢It fuses camera, lidar, radar and GPS or IMU data, each compensating the others, vision for color, radar for range and speed, into one reliable environment model.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�eng_19_002�body��,藤壶与黏液膜使船体表面粗糙度增大,湍流边界层内摩擦阻力上升,而常规航速下摩擦阻力约占总阻力的七成。实船测量表明仅一层薄黏液膜即可使燃油消耗增加一成以上,因此船东依靠防污涂料、水下清洗和坞修周期来控制污底。��Barnacles and slime films raise hull roughness, increasing frictional resistance inside the turbulent boundary layer, which accounts for roughly seventy percent of total resistance at service speed. Full-scale measurements show that even a thin slime layer can push fuel consumption up by more than ten percent, so operators fight fouling with antifouling coatings, underwater cleaning and dry-docking intervals.�ans��src��sA. F. Molland 等《Ship Resistance and Propulsion》(剑桥大学出版社)阻力章节中的粗糙度增量数据ٚA. F. Molland, S. R. Turnock & D. A. Hudson, Ship Resistance and Propulsion, Cambridge University Press, roughness-addition data in the resistance chapter��id�eng_19_005�body��纺丝拉伸后的纤维内部冻结着取向应力,遇热便以收缩和起皱的形式释放。在玻璃化温度以上保温让链段重排并生成稳定结晶,冷却后新形态被固定,织物获得尺寸稳定性、持久折皱回复力和染色过程中的保形性。�kAs-spun drawn fibres carry frozen-in orientation stresses that release later as shrinkage and creasing when heated. Holding the fabric above the glass transition lets chain segments rearrange into stable crystals, and on cooling the new geometry is locked in, yielding dimensional stability, durable crease recovery and shape retention through dyeing and washing.�ans��src��oW. E. Morton 与 J. W. S. Hearle《Physical Properties of Textile Fibres》(Woodhead出版,第4版)定形章节�tW. E. Morton & J. W. S. Hearle, Physical Properties of Textile Fibres, 4th ed., Woodhead Publishing, setting chapter��id�eng_19_008�body��T气流绕过主梁断面按斯特劳哈尔数确定的频率周期性脱涡,当脱落频率逼近某阶固有频率时发生锁定,结构进入共振状态。锁定区内负气动阻尼有限,振幅收敛于一个上限值而非像颤振那样发散,工程上常用调谐质量阻尼器、导流板或优化主梁断面外形加以抑制。��Flow past the deck sheds vortices periodically at a frequency fixed by the Strouhal number, and once shedding approaches a natural frequency the response locks in and the structure resonates. Within the lock-in range the negative aerodynamic damping is bounded, so amplitudes settle at a finite limit instead of growing as in flutter; engineers curb the effect with tuned mass dampers, fairings or reshaped deck cross-sections.�ans��src��TE. Simiu & R. Scanlan《风对结构的作用：基础与应用》第2版,Wiley,1999�iE. Simiu & R. H. Scanlan, Wind Effects on Structures: Fundamentals and Applications, 2nd ed., Wiley, 1999��id�eng_19_012�body��8原矿铜品位通常只有百分之零点几，直接入炉会消耗大量燃料，还有过多金属随炉渣流失。浮选中捕收剂把黄铜矿表面改造成疏水性，矿粒附着气泡上浮与脉石分离，可将铜富集到百分之二十以上的精矿，显著降低熔炼能耗和金属损失。�^Run-of-mine copper grades are often only fractions of a percent, so charging ore straight into the furnace wastes fuel and loses too much metal to slag. Collector reagents make chalcopyrite surfaces hydrophobic, letting mineral grains ride bubbles away from gangue; concentrates above twenty percent copper slash downstream energy use and metal loss.�ans��src��K孙传尧主编《选矿手册》浮选工艺分册，冶金工业出版社�PWills' Mineral Processing Technology, 8th ed., Elsevier, chapter Froth Flotation��id�eng_19_015�body��F若两片玻璃等厚，二者的吻合临界频率重合，隔声曲线在同一频段叠加出一个共同的深谷，计权隔声量被明显拖累。改成不等厚度让两个低谷彼此错开，再辅以较宽的空气腔抑制质量-空气-质量共振，构件便能在更宽的频带内维持平稳的隔声衰减。�cEqual-thickness panes share one coincidence frequency, their transmission-loss dips stack into a single deep valley in the same band and drag down the weighted sound reduction index. Unequal thickness staggers those dips, and a wider cavity damps the mass-air-mass resonance, so the assembly holds steady attenuation across a much broader frequency range.�ans��src��EGB/T 8485《建筑门窗空气声隔声性能分级及检测方法》�uISO 10140-2, Acoustics — Laboratory measurement of sound insulation of building elements, airborne sound insulation��id�eng_19_018�body��M叶背局部压力降到饱和蒸气压以下即产生气泡，气泡滑入高压区溃灭时会剥蚀金属、辐射强烈噪声并蚕食有效推力。设计中通过限制叶梢负荷、增大侧斜和纵倾来摊平吸力峰，同时匹配足够的浸深与较低转速，保证盘面上方来流静压处处高于汽化阈值。��Cavitation starts wherever local blade-surface pressure falls below saturated vapour pressure; collapsing bubbles erode metal, radiate harsh noise and eat into useful thrust. Designers flatten suction peaks by capping tip loading and adding skew plus rake, then pair sufficient immersion depth with lower shaft speed so static pressure across the disc stays above the vaporization threshold everywhere.�ans��src��Z盛振邦、刘应中《船舶原理》，上海交通大学出版社，螺旋桨推进篇�[J. S. Carlton, Marine Propellers and Propulsion, Butterworth-Heinemann, cavitation chapters��id�eng_19_020�body��e连铸把钢水直接凝成定尺长坯，省去钢锭脱模、均热炉加热和初轧开坯三道高耗工序，吨钢综合能耗大幅下降，金属收得率提高约八到十个百分点。激冷的定向凝固细化了铸态组织，中心缩孔与宏观偏析明显减轻，铸坯可热装直送轧机，生产节奏和质量一致性同步改善。��Casting steel straight into measured strands skips three energy-hungry steps — mould stripping, soaking-pit reheating and primary blooming — cutting total energy per tonne sharply and lifting metal yield by roughly eight to ten percentage points. Fast directional solidification refines the as-cast structure while easing centreline pipe and macrosegregation, and hot-charged strands roll directly, steadying both mill rhythm and product consistency.�ans��src���蔡开科《连续铸钢》，科学出版社，连铸坯凝固与质量控制章节 ; 另见: I. V. Samarasekera & J. K. Brimacombe, mould heat-transfer studies in continuous casting, Canadian Metallurgical Quarterly, 1979��I. V. Samarasekera & J. K. Brimacombe, mould heat-transfer studies in continuous casting, Canadian Metallurgical Quarterly, 1979 ; see also: 蔡开科《连续铸钢》，科学出版社，连铸坯凝固与质量控制章节��id�eng_20_002�body��VAV系统根据末端负荷实时调节送风量,而不是始终以设计风量运行。风机功耗近似与风量的三次方成正比,部分负荷下转速下降带来的节能非常显著。同时避免了定风量系统中常见的再热冷热抵消损失。�:A VAV system modulates supply airflow in real time to match zone loads instead of running at design flow continuously. Fan power scales roughly with the cube of airflow, so slowing fans at part load yields large savings. It also avoids the reheat penalty of simultaneous cooling and heating typical of CAV systems.�ans��src��BASHRAE Handbook—HVAC Systems and Equipment,变风量系统章节�QASHRAE Handbook—HVAC Systems and Equipment, Variable Air Volume systems chapter��id�eng_20_005�body��[起重量随臂长、幅度和支腿状态变化:幅度越大或臂架越长,允许吊重越小,且整机抗倾覆力矩存在硬性上限。特性曲线综合了结构强度、整机稳定性和液压能力三方面约束,超载会引发倾翻或臂架屈曲。作业前按实际工况查表并考虑吊具自重,是防止事故的基本要求。��Rated capacity varies with boom length, working radius, and outrigger configuration: the larger the radius or the longer the boom, the lower the permissible load, subject to hard limits on the overturning moment. The capacity chart combines structural strength, overall stability, and hydraulic capability constraints, and overload can trigger tipping or boom buckling. Checking the chart for the actual configuration, including rigging weight, is a basic requirement for accident prevention.�ans��src��WGB/T 3811-2008《起重机设计规范》,整机稳定性与额定起重量计算条款�cGB/T 3811-2008 Design Rules for Cranes, clauses on overall stability and rated capacity calculation��id�eng_20_008�body���冷裂纹需三要素同时满足:足量扩散氢、马氏体类淬硬组织和较高拘束应力,缺一不裂。焊后氢原子沿位错与晶界向热影响区应力集中处扩散富集,局部浓度越过临界值才萌生微裂纹并逐步连通扩展,这段扩散富集时间正是'延迟'的来源。工艺对策是采用低氢焊材、按规定预热并在焊后及时后热消氢,把扩散氢含量与热影响区硬度控制在临界组合以内。��A cold crack requires three factors together — sufficient diffusible hydrogen, a harden microstructure such as martensite, and substantial restraint stress; lacking any one, it will not form. After welding, hydrogen atoms diffuse along dislocations and grain boundaries and pile up at stress concentrations in the heat-affected zone, and microcracks initiate only when the local concentration crosses a critical threshold, which is exactly where the delay comes from. Countermeasures are low-hydrogen consumables, prescribed preheat, and prompt post-weld hydrogen bake-out so diffusible hydrogen and HAZ hardness stay below their critical combination.�ans��src�ٚAWS D1.1/D1.1M Structural Welding Code - Steel, Annex XI: Guideline on alternative methods for determining preheat temperatures, American Welding Society.ْAWS D1.1/D1.1M Structural Welding Code - Steel, Annex XI (guideline on preheat determination against hydrogen cracking), American Welding Society.��id�eng_20_012�body���性能化设计的基本判据是可用安全疏散时间(ASET)大于所需安全疏散时间(RSET),前者取决于火源热释放速率、通风条件、烟气层下降速度和人员响应时间分布。构件耐火极限只描述它在标准升温曲线下的失效时刻,既不涵盖烟气蔓延与毒性的危害,也不代表真实火灾的发展进程。只有针对设定火场景计算 ASET 并留出足够裕度覆盖 RSET,才能论证设计方案达到与规范要求等效的安全水平。�aPerformance-based design rests on the criterion that available safe egress time (ASET) must exceed required safe egress time (RSET), where ASET depends on heat release rate, ventilation, smoke layer descent and the distribution of occupant pre-movement times. A fire-resistance rating only tells you when a member fails under the standard heating curve; it says nothing about smoke spread, toxic products, or how a real fire develops. Only by modeling the design fire, computing ASET and keeping a sufficient margin over RSET can the scheme be argued to deliver safety equivalent to prescriptive requirements.�ans��src��XSFPE Handbook of Fire Protection Engineering 第5版性能化设计与人员疏散章节�kSFPE Handbook of Fire Protection Engineering, 5th ed., performance-based design and human behavior chapters��id�eng_20_015�body���SVI 只定量反映沉降性能恶化的程度,MLSS 更只是常规运行参数,二者都无法指明膨胀机理。镜检能识别丝状菌类型:低溶解氧常滋生球衣菌,低负荷利于微丝菌生长,高硫酸盐浓度则诱发发硫菌过度繁殖,不同类型对应的调控方向完全不同。只有确认诱因后,才能针对性地提高曝气量、调整泥龄或补充营养盐,避免盲目排泥拖长恢复周期。�=SVI only quantifies how far settleability has degraded, and MLSS is just a routine operating parameter; neither reveals the mechanism behind the bulking. Microscopy identifies the filament type: low dissolved oxygen favors Sphaerotilus natans, low food-to-microorganism ratio promotes Microthrix parvicella, and elevated sulfate levels trigger Thiothrix overgrowth — each demanding different corrective actions. Only once the cause is identified can operators raise aeration, adjust sludge age or dose nutrients, instead of wasting sludge blindly and prolonging recovery.�ans��src��YMetcalf & Eddy《废水工程:处理与回用》第4版 活性污泥法运行问题章节�iMetcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering: Treatment and Resource Recovery, activated-sludge bulking chapter��id�eng_20_018�body���VRF采用变频压缩机和电子膨胀阀,按室内机实际负荷连续调节制冷剂流量,避免了定频系统的启停损耗和过冷过热再热损失。制冷剂直接蒸发换热省去了冷冻水二次换热的温差损失和水泵功耗。多室内机可分区独立控制并在部分负荷时压缩机长期运行于高效率区间,实测部分负荷季节能效比(IPLV)通常显著高于定容系统。�;A VRF system uses inverter-driven compressors and electronic expansion valves to modulate refrigerant flow continuously against the actual load of each indoor unit, avoiding the start-stop losses and reheat penalties of fixed-speed systems. Direct refrigerant evaporation eliminates the temperature-glide loss and pump power of a secondary chilled-water loop. With zoned independent control and compressors operating mostly in their high-efficiency band at part load, measured integrated part-load efficiency (IPLV) is typically well above that of fixed-capacity systems.�ans��src��uZhou et al., Applied Energy, 2008, 85(8): 675-689 / Aynur, Hwang & Radermacher, HVAC&R Research, 2010, 16(3): 293-309�tZhou et al., Applied Energy, 2008, 85(8): 675-689; Aynur, Hwang & Radermacher, HVAC&R Research, 2010, 16(3): 293-309��id�eng_20_020�body���顶棚射流把燃烧产物沿天花板水平输送,探测器必须位于射流厚度内才能及时感知,安装越高烟到达浓度衰减越快,响应延迟明显增大——规范因此对点型感烟探测器的最大保护高度设限(如GB 50116规定不超过12 m)。机械通风加速烟气稀释与迁移,高速气流会冲散上升烟羽并把烟推出保护区,需加大灵敏度或改用吸气式感烟探测器(ASD)通过管网主动采样。�GThe ceiling jet carries combustion products horizontally along the ceiling, and the detector must sit within that jet thickness to sense smoke promptly; the higher the mounting, the faster the smoke concentration decays before arrival, which is why codes cap the protected height for point-type smoke detectors (e.g. GB 50116 limits it to 12 m). Mechanical ventilation dilutes and transports smoke away, and strong airflows can disperse the plume and sweep smoke out of the protected volume, requiring higher sensitivity or aspirating smoke detection (ASD) with active pipe sampling.�ans��src��ZGB 50116-2013《火灾自动报警系统设计规范》第6.2节 / NFPA 72-2022 Chapter 17يNFPA 72-2022 National Fire Alarm and Signaling Code, Chapter 17; GB 50116-2013 Code for Design of Automatic Fire Alarm System, Section 6.2��id�eng_21_002�body��o若每层都沿同一方向扫描,热量沿该方向反复累积,温度梯度与收缩呈强各向异性,裂纹和翘曲随之加重。逐层转过67°这类非整数角后,新熔道不再持续压在前一层的熔道间隙上,孔隙难以连通成贯穿通道,整体热历史也更均匀。该策略配合基板预热已成为钛合金增材制造的常规做法。��If every layer is scanned along the same direction, heat accumulates anisotropically, steepening temperature gradients and shrinkage along that axis and aggravating cracking and warping. Rotating by a non-divisor angle such as 67° keeps new tracks from sitting persistently on the gaps left by previous ones, so pores struggle to link into continuous channels and the thermal history evens out. Combined with build-plate preheating, this strategy has become routine practice for titanium alloys.�ans��src�ټThijs, Verhaeghe, Craeghs, Humbeeck,《A study of the microstructural evolution during selective laser melting of Ti–6Al–4V》,Acta Materialia,2010 (DOI: 10.1016/j.actamat.2010.02.004)ٺThijs, Verhaeghe, Craeghs, Humbeeck, 'A study of the microstructural evolution during selective laser melting of Ti–6Al–4V', Acta Materialia, 2010, DOI: 10.1016/j.actamat.2010.02.004��id�eng_21_005�body���微生物致死的温度敏感性远高于美拉德褐变和维生素分解,因此把温度提升到135–150 °C并将保温时间压缩到数秒,可在杀灭细菌芽孢的同时把风味与营养损失控制在很小范围。蒸汽喷射等直接加热方式升降温极快,蒸煮味明显轻于间接板式换热。后续无菌灌装用双氧水处理包材,防止成品二次污染。��Microbial death responds to temperature far more steeply than Maillard browning or vitamin degradation, so raising the temperature to 135–150 °C while squeezing the holding time down to seconds destroys spores before flavor and nutrient losses mount. Direct steam injection heats and cools almost instantly, producing a far lighter cooked note than indirect plate heat exchangers. Downstream aseptic fillers treat packaging material with hydrogen peroxide to prevent recontamination of the finished product.�ans��src��rP. J. Fellows,《Food Processing Technology: Principles and Practice》第4版,Woodhead Publishing,热加工章节�}P. J. Fellows, Food Processing Technology: Principles and Practice, 4th ed., Woodhead Publishing, thermal processing chapters��id�eng_21_008�body��"理论阿特金森循环的膨胀行程长于压缩行程，需要复杂的连杆机构实现；米勒循环用进气门晚关（或早关）实现同样的有效膨胀比大于压缩比效果，机械上就是普通四冲程机加可变气门正时（米勒循环还常带增压中冷）。代价是进气量减少、升功率明显下降。混动车有电机补足低速与急加速扭矩，发动机可以专心运行在高效区，因此广泛采用该循环；纯燃油车若采用同样方案会感到动力不足，难以被市场接受。��In the ideal Atkinson cycle the expansion stroke exceeds the compression stroke, historically requiring intricate linkage mechanisms; the Miller cycle achieves the same effective-expansion-ratio-greater-than-compression-ratio effect by late (or early) intake-valve closing, i.e., a conventional four-stroke engine with variable valve timing, often plus turbocharging and intercooling. The penalty is reduced trapped air and markedly lower specific output. Hybrids use electric motors to supply low-speed and launch torque, letting the engine dwell in its high-efficiency island, so they adopt this cycle widely; a conventional car would feel underpowered and uncompetitive if it did the same.�ans��src�ْHeywood,《Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals》第2版(McGraw-Hill) 第2章;SAE论文 2012-01-1017（丰田THS-II紧凑型车动力总成）٪J.B. Heywood, Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals, 2nd ed. (McGraw-Hill), Ch.2; SAE Paper 2012-01-1017 (Development of the New THS-II Powertrain for Compact Vehicles)��id�eng_21_012�body���纯摩擦公式只计法向压力乘摩擦系数,忽略岩体与混凝土胶结面的黏聚力,既偏保守也无法体现帷幕灌浆与排水的加固效益。抗剪断公式同时计入黏聚力c′与摩擦系数f′,与SL 319和美国垦务局准则一致,更贴合剪摩破坏机制。设计还需对最不利深层块体做抗滑复核,不足时设置抗力齿墙或预应力锚索。�3The pure-friction formula counts only normal pressure times a friction coefficient and ignores the cohesion of the bonded rock-concrete interface, making it overly conservative and blind to the benefit of grout curtains and drainage. The shear-friction formula includes both cohesion c′ and friction coefficient f′, consistent with SL 319 and US Bureau of Reclamation criteria, matching the shear-slip failure mechanism far better. Designs additionally verify deep-seated critical blocks, adding shear keys or prestressed anchors where margin is insufficient.�ans��src��1SL 319—2018《混凝土重力坝设计规范》�\SL 319-2018, Design Specification for Concrete Gravity Dams (China Energy Industry Standard)��id�eng_21_015�body���进口静压降到饱和蒸汽压以下后,叶片前缘大量析出汽泡,汽泡进入高压区溃灭令流道有效过流面积锐减,扬程与效率随之陡降,H-Q曲线呈断裂状。按Gülich的定义,汽蚀比转速Nss=n·Q^0.5/NPSHr^0.75(Q取m³/s)把转速、流量与必需汽蚀余量合成单一指标,常规清水离心泵约在150–250。Nss偏高说明叶轮入口负荷过重,可通过扩大吸入口径、降低转速或加装诱导轮加以缓解。�SOnce inlet static pressure drops below vapor pressure, copious vapor bubbles form at the blade leading edge; collapsing in the high-pressure region they slash the effective flow area, dropping head and efficiency so steeply that the H-Q curve visibly breaks. Following Gülich's definition, suction specific speed Nss=n·Q^0.5/NPSHr^0.75 (Q in m³/s) folds speed, flow and required NPSH into a single figure of merit, about 150–250 for conventional clean-water pumps. A high value signals overloaded eye geometry, mitigated by enlarging the suction bore, lowering speed, or fitting an inducer.�ans��src��,Gülich《Centrifugal Pumps》第4版第6章�8Gülich, Centrifugal Pumps, 4th ed., Chapter 6, Springer��id�eng_21_018�body���熔丝逐层堆积时,层与层之间仅靠材料局部重熔形成的界面粘接,界面处孔隙率高、浸润不完全,受拉时裂纹优先沿层间扩展,所以Z向拉伸强度与层间剪切强度明显低于面内性能。提高热床与腔体温度、减小层厚、加大挤出宽度与走线重叠率都能增强层间融合;把主承载方向布置到面内同样是有效的对策。��Layer-by-layer deposition bonds layers only through partial local remelting, so interfaces carry higher porosity and incomplete wetting; under tension cracks preferentially run between layers, leaving Z-direction tensile and interlayer shear strength clearly below in-plane properties. Higher bed and chamber temperatures, thinner layers, wider extrusion, and greater raster overlap all strengthen interlayer fusion, and orienting the main load path into the plane works just as well.�ans��src�مJ. Torres等人论文《Anisotropic Mechanical Properties of Fused Deposition Modeling ABS》(Experimental Mechanics,2016年第56卷)�|J. Torres et al., Anisotropic Mechanical Properties of Fused Deposition Modeling ABS, Experimental Mechanics, vol. 56, 2016.��id�eng_21_020�body���重力坝以自身重量在坝基接触面上产生的摩阻力抵抗水压力、泥沙压力等水平推力,抗滑稳定安全系数必须满足规范限值。库水沿坝基裂隙渗入会在坝底形成竖直向上的扬压力,大面积抵消坝体有效重量,因而成为抗滑稳定的控制性不利作用;帷幕灌浆配合排水孔幕一般能把扬压力削减三成以上,从而明显收窄坝体断面、减少混凝土用量。�3A gravity dam resists horizontal thrusts such as water and silt pressure through friction mobilized by its own weight on the foundation contact plane, and the sliding safety factor must satisfy code limits. Reservoir water percolating along foundation fissures builds a vertical uplift pressure beneath the base that cancels a large share of the effective dam weight, making it the governing adverse action for stability; a grout curtain backed by drain holes typically cuts uplift by more than thirty percent, noticeably slimming the section and saving concrete.�ans��src��V美国陆军工程兵团设计手册EM 1110-2-2200《Gravity Dam Design》(1995年版)�bU.S. Army Corps of Engineers, Engineering Manual EM 1110-2-2200, Gravity Dam Design, 1995 edition.��id�eng_22_002�body���主线车流密度一旦逼近临界值，微小扰动即可触发流态失稳，车速与通行能力同时骤降，形成走走停停的激波。匝道信号把汇入率限制在与主线剩余通行能力匹配的水平，多余车辆暂时在匝道上排队，使主线始终处于临界密度以下的稳定区；拉大的汇入间隔也免去了主线车辆频繁减速避让。排队延误小于主线提速带来的收益，断面总通过量不降反升。��Once mainline density nears its critical value, a tiny disturbance triggers flow breakdown: speeds and throughput collapse together into stop-and-go shockwaves. Ramp metering holds entering traffic to match the mainline's residual capacity, queuing surplus vehicles on the ramp so the mainline stays in the stable regime below critical density. Wider merge gaps also spare through drivers constant braking. Ramp delay costs less than the benefit of keeping the mainline fast, so total throughput rises.�ans��src�نM.帕帕乔治欧与A.科齐亚洛斯《高速公路匝道控制综述》，IEEE智能交通系统汇刊，第3卷第4期，2002年。ّM. Papageorgiou & A. Kotsialos, Freeway Ramp Metering: An Overview, IEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems, vol. 3, no. 4, 2002.��id�eng_22_005�body���寿命初期，材料缺陷与装配误差陆续暴露，故障率高但随磨合迅速下降；随后进入偶然故障期，故障仅由随机过载等因素引发，故障率近似恒定，体现设计固有的可靠水平；进入耗损期后，磨损、腐蚀与老化不断累积，故障率再次攀升。维修上宜分段应对：早期靠筛选与磨合剔除缺陷，平稳期用状态监测代替频繁解体检修，临近耗损期则按寿命定期更换。�Early in life, material flaws and assembly errors surface quickly, so failure rate starts high and falls as units burn in. Failures then become random events at a nearly constant rate—a useful-life plateau reflecting the design's inherent reliability. Finally wear, corrosion and ageing accumulate and the rate climbs again. Policy should follow the phases: screen and run in new units, use condition monitoring instead of intrusive overhauls on the plateau, and move to age-based replacement as wear-out nears.�ans��src��]P.D.T.奥康纳与A.克利纳《实用可靠性工程》第5版，Wiley出版社，2012年。�\P. D. T. O'Connor & A. Kleyner, Practical Reliability Engineering, 5th edition, Wiley, 2012.��id�eng_22_008�body���钻井液经钻杆泵送到井底，从钻头喷嘴高速喷出后沿环空返出地面，同时完成三件事：把钻头破碎的岩屑携带出井，冷却并润滑钻头与钻具，以及在裸眼段维持液柱压力。液柱压力略高于地层孔隙压力时，油气水就被“顶住”进不了井筒；一旦停泵，岩屑下沉易卡钻，压力失衡还可能诱发井涌乃至井喷，因此循环不能中断。�7Mud is pumped down the drill pipe, jets out of the bit nozzles at high speed, and returns up the annulus, doing three jobs at once: carrying rock cuttings out of the hole, cooling and lubricating the bit and string, and holding hydrostatic pressure across the openhole interval. As long as this column pressure slightly exceeds formation pore pressure, oil, gas, and water are held back from entering the wellbore; stop circulation and cuttings settle to stick the pipe, while any pressure imbalance can trigger a kick or even a blowout—so circulation never pauses.�ans��src�هR.肯恩、H.C.H.达利与G.R.格雷《钻井与完井液的成分和性能》（第6版），Gulf Professional Publishing，2011年。ُR. Caenn, H.C.H. Darley & G.R. Gray, Composition and Properties of Drilling and Completion Fluids, 6th ed., Gulf Professional Publishing, 2011.��id�eng_22_018�body���四路信号交叉口存在约32个交叉、合流冲突点，直角碰撞与左转对撞的冲击速度高；环岛把冲突点减至约8个且均为低角度合流分流，车辆进入前必须减速让行，环内车速一般低于30公里/小时。碰撞角度变浅、速度降低使事故动能大幅下降，死伤事故随之明显减少；但流量过大时环岛易拥堵，需按交通量选型。�KA four-leg signalized intersection concentrates about 32 crossing and merging conflict points, and right-angle and left-turn opposing collisions occur at high closing speeds. A roundabout cuts this to roughly 8 low-angle merging and diverging conflicts and requires entering drivers to yield and slow down, keeping circulating speeds below about 30 km/h. Shallower impact angles and lower speeds dissipate most crash energy, so fatal and injury crashes drop markedly. The tradeoff is capacity: under very heavy demand roundabouts can congest, so the design must match the traffic volume.�ans��src��wB. W. Robinson 等《Roundabouts: An Informational Guide》（FHWA-RD-00-067），美国联邦公路管理局，2000年�pB. W. Robinson et al., Roundabouts: An Informational Guide, FHWA-RD-00-067, Federal Highway Administration, 2000��id�eng_23_002�body��y输送功率一定时，电压越高线路电流越小，而导线发热损耗与电流平方成正比（P=I²R）：电压提高10倍、电流降到原来的1/10，同一导线的电阻损耗只剩1/100。更高的电压还能减小线路压降，让单回线路输送更大容量，因此远距离、大容量输电普遍采用超高压乃至特高压交流或直流线路。��For a fixed transmitted power, raising the voltage proportionally lowers the line current, and conductor heating loss grows with the square of the current (P = I²R): increasing voltage tenfold cuts current to one-tenth and leaves only one-hundredth of the resistive loss on the same conductors. Higher voltage also reduces voltage drop along the line and lets each circuit carry more capacity, which is why bulk, long-distance transfer relies on extra-high or ultra-high voltage AC and DC lines.�ans��src��_何仰赞、温增银《电力系统分析》,中国水利水电出版社,远距离输电章节�nHe Yangzan & Wen Zengyin, Power System Analysis, China Water & Power Press, long-distance transmission chapter��id�eng_23_005�body���纸的强度主要来自相邻纤维素纤维之间羟基形成的氢键：压榨和干燥使纤维收紧贴近，生成大量氢键把纤维“粘”成整体；水分子进入后会占据这些羟基位点、拆散氢键，纤维间结合力骤降，纸随之变软变弱。此外，经历过去干燥的纤维会发生“角质化”，再次润湿后结合能力下降，这正是再生纸浆强度通常低于原生纸浆的原因。�Dry strength comes mainly from hydrogen bonds between hydroxyl groups on neighboring cellulose fibers: pressing and drying pull the fibers close together, forming extensive bonds that knit them into a coherent sheet. When water penetrates, its molecules occupy those hydroxyl sites and break the bonds, so inter-fiber cohesion collapses and the sheet weakens. Once-dried fibers also “hornify”, bonding less effectively after rewetting—which is why recycled pulp usually yields weaker paper than virgin pulp.�ans��src��tSmook G.A.《制浆造纸技术手册》（Handbook for Pulp & Paper Technologists）第4版，TAPPI Press，2016年�[Smook, G.A., "Handbook for Pulp & Paper Technologists", 4th ed., TAPPI Press, Atlanta, 2016��id�eng_23_008�body���金属液凝固收缩时若得不到补充，厚大部位会留下集中缩孔或分散缩松。冒口是连接铸件的储液池，按顺序凝固原则布置：离冒口最远的部位先冻结，固液界面逐渐朝冒口推进，补缩通道始终畅通，收缩空腔最终由冒口内的金属液填满。设计上令冒口模数大于被补缩部位，并常加保温套减缓散热，以确保它成为最后凝固的区域。��If shrinking melt gets no replenishment during freezing, heavy sections retain concentrated shrinkage cavities or dispersed porosity. A riser is a liquid reservoir attached to the casting and laid out for directional solidification: metal farthest from it freezes first, the front advances toward the riser, the feeding channel stays open, and the final cavity is filled from the riser. Its modulus is made larger than the fed section, often with insulating sleeves to slow heat loss.�ans��src��SJ. 坎贝尔（John Campbell），《完整铸造手册》第2版，Elsevier，2015�AJohn Campbell, Complete Casting Handbook, 2nd ed., Elsevier, 2015��id�eng_23_012�body���侧倾源于离心力作用在高于侧倾中心的车身上所形成的翻转力矩。防倾杆是一根横贯左右的U形扭杆弹簧：两轮同向上下跳动时它随之空转、不起作用；一旦左右轮行程出现差异，杆身被扭转并产生反抗侧倾的回复力矩，相当于给车轴附加了侧倾刚度，使车身滚转角减小。前后轴防倾杆刚度的配比还会影响不足转向或过多转向的平衡，是底盘调校的关键参数。�BBody roll comes from centrifugal force acting on a centre of gravity located above the roll centres, creating an overturning moment about the suspension. An anti-roll bar is a U-shaped torsion spring spanning the axle: when both wheels bounce together it merely pivots and does nothing, but when their travel differs the bar twists and develops a restoring torque against roll, adding roll stiffness to that axle and shrinking the roll angle. The front-to-rear split of roll stiffness also shifts the car toward understeer or oversteer, making it a key chassis tuning parameter.�ans��src��QGillespie, T. D.《Fundamentals of Vehicle Dynamics》，SAE International，1992�KGillespie, T. D., Fundamentals of Vehicle Dynamics, SAE International, 1992��id�eng_23_015�body���发光芯片只能发出由材料带隙决定的窄波段光，尚无高效芯片能直接输出全可见光谱的白光。主流方案用约450nm的氮化镓蓝光芯片激发铈掺杂钇铝石榴石（YAG:Ce）荧光粉：粉体吸收部分蓝光后发射黄光，残余蓝光与黄光混成白光。该“下转换”经斯托克斯位移损失少量热，却换来结构简单、成本低廉的白光源，色温与显色性可用荧光粉配方调节。�oAn LED die emits only the narrow band fixed by its material bandgap, and no efficient chip today radiates white light spanning the whole visible spectrum. The mainstream solution runs a gallium nitride blue chip near 450 nm against a cerium-doped yttrium aluminium garnet (YAG:Ce) phosphor: the powder absorbs part of the blue photons and re-emits yellow, and the leftover blue mixed with that yellow appears white. This down-conversion loses a little energy as heat through the Stokes shift, yet it delivers a simple, low-cost white source whose colour temperature and rendering are tuned by adjusting the phosphor recipe.�ans��src��USchubert, E. F.《Light-Emitting Diodes》第2版，Cambridge University Press，2006�USchubert, E. F., Light-Emitting Diodes, 2nd edition, Cambridge University Press, 2006��id�eng_23_018�body���交流线路上导体间的电容以工频反复充放电，容性充电电流随距离增长，会占用大量输送容量，远送还需昂贵的无功补偿并受同步稳定约束。直流没有充电电流，只需正负两极，杆塔与走廊更省、损耗更低，超过交直流“等价距离”后明显更经济。换流站还将两端电网解耦，不同频率或非同步的系统也能可靠互联。��In an AC line the conductor capacitance charges and discharges every cycle, and this reactive charging current grows with distance, consuming line capacity and demanding costly compensation plus stability margins. DC carries no charging current: two poles suffice, towers and rights-of-way shrink, and losses drop, so past the break-even distance HVDC wins economically. Converter stations also decouple the two grids, letting asynchronous or different-frequency systems be interconnected reliably.�ans��src��WJ. Arrillaga《High Voltage Direct Current Transmission》（第2版），IEE，1998年�JJ. Arrillaga, High Voltage Direct Current Transmission, 2nd ed., IEE, 1998��id�eng_24_014�body��2是真的。轮轨接触斑大约一平方厘米,却要传递牵引、制动与导向的全部力。秘密在锥形踏面与钢轨廓形的配合:轮对左右两轮刚性同轴,滚动半径差让它过弯时自动向内偏移实现自导向,减少轮缘摩擦;蠕滑理论描述了接触面间微小相对滑动如何传递切向力。高速化的代价是对平顺性极端敏感——毫米级的轨道不平顺经车厢弹簧放大成不适甚至脱轨风险,所以无砟轨道把误差控制在毫米内,检测车用激光每几天扫描一遍全线路基。�qTrue. The wheel-rail contact patch spans about one square centimeter yet transmits all traction, braking and steering forces. The trick lies in coned treads matched to rail profiles: rigidly coupled wheelsets steer themselves through curves by rolling-radius difference, sparing flange friction; creep theory describes how micro-slips in that patch transmit tangential forces. High speed makes everything unforgiving — millimeter track irregularities amplify through suspension into discomfort or derailment risk, so slab track holds tolerances to millimeters and laser inspection trains scan the whole line every few days.�ans��src��OIwnicki 主编,《Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics》第2版,CRC Press,2019�NS. Iwnicki ed., Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics, 2nd ed., CRC Press, 2019��id�eng_24_020�body��H现代叶片是玻璃纤维或碳纤维复合材料制成的空心翼型,设计上刻意允许叶尖在大风中挠动数米:柔性卸载阵风弯矩,减轻根部载荷与重量。变桨系统实时转动全叶片改变攻角,在超过额定风速时主动泄功保护机组。麻烦在后半生:热固性复合材料无法像金属一样重熔,早期叶片多被切碎填埋,欧洲部分国家已经立法禁填埋。新方案包括机械回收做水泥添加料、热解回收纤维,以及新一代可回收环氧树脂——让叶片在服役二十五年后能整体拆解回炉。�fModern blades are hollow airfoils of glass or carbon fiber composites, deliberately flexible: tips bend meters in gusts to shed bending moments, slimming roots and mass. Pitch systems rotate blades to change angle of attack, spilling power above rated wind to protect the drivetrain. Retirement is the headache: thermoset composites cannot remelt like metal, early blades were shredded into landfill, and several European states now ban that. New routes grind blades into cement kiln feedstock, pyrolyze fibers back out, or build with recyclable epoxy so twenty-five-year-old blades can finally come apart cleanly.�ans��src��wLiu 与 Barlow,《Wind turbine blade waste and circular economy》,Resources, Conservation and Recycling 第124卷,2017�wP. Liu and C. Y. Barlow, Wind turbine blade waste and circular economy, Resources, Conservation and Recycling 124, 2017��id�eng_26_006�body���直答：依靠增大数值孔径、压低工艺因子k1并辅以多重曝光，把瑞利判据R=k1λ/NA推近极限，线宽便可小于光源波长。机理：浸没式光刻在镜头与晶圆间充入折射率约1.44的超纯水，光在水中波长缩短，有效NA由干式约0.93升至1.35以上；离轴照明与相移掩模再把k1压向0.3，单次曝光即能分辨约40nm级半节距，更小节点靠自对准双重或四重图形化实现。�UBy raising the numerical aperture, driving the process factor k1 down and adding multiple exposures, the Rayleigh bound R=k1λ/NA is pushed toward its limit until features shrink below the wavelength itself. Immersion lithography fills the lens-to-wafer gap with ultrapure water of refractive index about 1.44, shortening the wavelength inside and lifting effective NA from roughly 0.93 dry to over 1.35; off-axis illumination and phase-shift masks press k1 toward 0.3 so a single exposure resolves 40 nm-class half-pitches, with self-aligned double or quadruple patterning carrying smaller nodes.�ans��src��EB.J. Lin《Optical Lithography: Here Is Why》，SPIE Press，2009年�<B.J. Lin, Optical Lithography: Here Is Why, SPIE Press, 2009��id�eng_26_008�body��直答：离子注入靠束流积分精确计量剂量、靠能量控制深度，常温即可完成掺入;但高能离子会把硅原子撞离晶格位置形成损伤层，不经退火修复，杂质无法占据替位位置、几乎不导电。机理：注入深度服从可用LSS理论预言的峰形分布，约7度倾角入射可避开沟道效应;快速热退火在数秒内把晶圆升到1000℃以上，固相外延沿原晶向重结晶消除缺陷，替位杂质近乎全部电激活，而结深扩散被限制在纳米量级。��Implantation meters dose by integrated beam current and tunes depth through ion energy, doping at near room temperature; yet energetic ions knock lattice atoms out of place and leave a damage layer that keeps dopants off substitutional sites, so they stay electrically inert until annealing. Depth follows a peaked profile predicted by LSS theory, with about seven degrees of wafer tilt suppressing channeling. Rapid thermal annealing ramps the wafer above 1000 degrees C within seconds: solid-phase epitaxy regrows the layer along the original lattice, annihilating defects and activating nearly every dopant, while junction smearing stays at the nanometer scale.�ans��src��dE. Rimini《Ion Implantation: Basics to Device Fabrication》，Kluwer Academic Publishers，1995年�[E. Rimini, Ion Implantation: Basics to Device Fabrication, Kluwer Academic Publishers, 1995��id�eng_26_018�body��(直答：染色路径取决于纤维的化学结构与物理形态，涤纶大分子排列紧密、结晶度高，链上缺少能与染料反应的活性基团，染料只能以溶解扩散方式进入无定形区。机理：分散染料几乎不溶于水，靠分散剂以微粒悬浮于染浴；温度超过纤维玻璃化温度后链段运动打开瞬时空隙，染料扩散速率才足以进入纤维并驻留于疏水内部；棉纤维富含羟基，活性染料在碱催化下与之共价结合，常压即可完成，两条路线截然不同。��How a fiber takes color is fixed by its chemistry and physical texture: polyester chains pack tightly into a highly crystalline structure with no reactive sites, leaving dissolution-and-diffusion into amorphous regions as the only route in. Disperse dyes barely dissolve in water and ride through the bath as particles held by dispersing agents; only above the glass transition, where segmental motion opens transient gaps, is diffusion fast enough for dye to enter and lodge in the hydrophobic interior. Cotton, rich in hydroxyl groups, bonds reactive dyes covalently under alkaline catalysis at ordinary pressure — two utterly different routes.�ans��src�ٱ王菊生主编《染整工艺原理》，纺织工业出版社，1982年 ; 另见: A.D. Broadbent, Basic Principles of Textile Coloration, Society of Dyers and Colourists, 2001ٳA.D. Broadbent, Basic Principles of Textile Coloration, Society of Dyers and Colourists, 2001 ; see also: 王菊生主编《染整工艺原理》，纺织工业出版社，1982年��id�f04acb821db9�body��#单一传感器各有盲区与噪声，融合把多个异源传感器的观测按统计最优方式结合，得到比任一单独传感器更可靠、更完整的状态估计。卡尔曼滤波及其扩展是经典工具，能在噪声与缺失下持续给出位置、速度等关键信息。�REach single sensor has blind spots and noise; fusion combines heterogeneous observations in a statistically optimal way to yield more reliable and complete state estimates than any sensor alone. The Kalman filter and its variants are classic tools, continuously providing position, velocity, and other key states under noise and dropouts.�ans��src��:Thrun、Burgard & Fox，《概率机器人学》（2005）�5Thrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (2005)��id�f086c6d66ffa�body�ٴ玻璃钢是玻璃纤维与树脂复合的材料，俗称FRP，质轻、强度高、耐腐不锈。它用于船体、储罐和汽车部件。但刚度不如金属且不耐高温。��Fiberglass, or FRP, is glass fiber embedded in resin; it is light, strong, and corrosion-proof. It is used for hulls, tanks, and car parts. But its stiffness is lower than metal and it does not withstand high heat.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�f0ff80460497�body�ٓ碟刹暴露在空气中散热快、连续刹车不易热衰减，且结构简单易排水；鼓刹封闭、易过热但成本低、驻车力大。�vDiscs cool fast in open air with less fade and shed water; drums overheat but are cheap and give strong parking force.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�f2893072a7c8�body�ي旋钮设定压力让双金属片在不同温度弯曲并断开触点，达到目标温度就断电、降温后再接通，从而恒温。�kA dial sets how far a bimetal strip must bend to open the contact, cycling power to hold a set temperature.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�f558ee381e8a�body��;轮式里程计假设轮子纯滚动，用轮转数推算走了多远。实际地面会打滑、轮胎会磨损变径、两轮直径存在细微差异，这些误差在积分中不断累加，方向误差尤其致命。所以必须靠激光雷达、视觉或信标做闭环校正，把累积误差周期性拉回。��Wheel odometry assumes pure rolling and infers travelled distance from wheel rotations. In practice wheels slip, tyres wear and change diameter, and the two wheels differ slightly in size; these errors accumulate through integration, with heading error being especially damaging. That is why lidar, vision or beacons are used to close the loop and periodically pull the accumulated error back.�ans��src��:Thrun、Burgard & Fox，《概率机器人学》（2005）�5Thrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (2005)��id�f62f3f0772fe�body�ِ当浅层土软弱时，桩把上部荷载穿过软弱层传到深处坚硬土层或岩层，靠侧摩阻和端承共同承重，减少沉降。ٝWhen surface soil is weak, piles transfer load through it to deep firm soil or rock, sharing resistance by skin friction and end bearing to limit settlement.�ans��src��8Das《土力学与基础工程》；ACI/API 桩基规范�JDas, Principles of Geotechnical Engineering; ACI/API pile foundation codes��id�f71d52aa23c2�body���钢筋与混凝土两者线膨胀系数接近，温度变化下变形协调；混凝土硬化后与钢筋粘结良好，并把钢筋包裹保护免受锈蚀。钢筋抗拉、混凝土抗压，二者互补形成高效复合材料。�Rebar and concrete have similar thermal expansion coefficients, so they deform together under temperature changes, and hardened concrete bonds well to steel and shields it from corrosion. Steel resists tension while concrete resists compression, forming an efficient composite.�ans��src�ل《混凝土结构设计原理》（中国建筑工业出版社） ; 另见: EN 1992-1-1 (Eurocode 2), Design of Concrete StructuresنEN 1992-1-1 (Eurocode 2), Design of Concrete Structures ; see also: 《混凝土结构设计原理》（中国建筑工业出版社）��id�f73a52d0c3e6�body��人工耳蜗绕过受损的耳蜗毛细胞，用麦克风与处理器把声音编码为电信号，经植入电极直接刺激听神经不同频段。大脑由此重新学会解读这些电模式为语音，使先天或后天重度聋者获得语言感知能力。�VA cochlear implant bypasses damaged hair cells, using a microphone and processor to encode sound into electrical signals delivered by implanted electrodes that stimulate different frequency bands of the auditory nerve. The brain relearns to interpret these electrical patterns as speech, giving severe-profound deaf users language perception.�ans��src�٧Clark,《The multi-channel cochlear implant and the relief of severe-to-profound deafness》,Cochlear Implants International,2012 (DOI: 10.1179/1754762811y.0000000019)٥Clark, 'The multi-channel cochlear implant and the relief of severe-to-profound deafness', Cochlear Implants International, 2012, DOI: 10.1179/1754762811y.0000000019��id�f7f3185a273c�body�٢微电网是局部可独立运行的发配用电系统，平时并网运行，外部故障时能切为孤岛模式靠本地光伏、储能和柴油机自供电。٤A microgrid is a local generation-distribution system that normally runs grid-connected but can island itself on local solar, storage and generators during outages.�ans��src��:IEEE 1547（并网）；DOE 智能电网报告；IEC 61850�>IEEE 1547 (interconnection); DOE smart grid reports; IEC 61850��id�f837ccc64b4d�body�ّ摄像头拍摄工件，算法对比标准模板检测尺寸、划痕、缺料等缺陷，速度快、可100%在线全检，减少人工漏检。ٟA camera images the part and algorithms compare it to a standard to find size, scratch or missing-feature defects, enabling fast 100 percent inline inspection.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�f8af4d758067�body��城市数字孪生把建筑、管网、交通与人口等要素实时映射到虚拟模型，可模拟洪水、地震或拥堵的演化并预演应急方案。管理者借此在灾害发生前识别薄弱点、优化疏散与资源调度，把被动响应转为主动预防。�=An urban digital twin mirrors buildings, utilities, traffic, and population in real time, letting planners simulate floods, earthquakes, or congestion and rehearse response. It helps identify vulnerabilities, optimize evacuation and resource dispatch before disasters, turning passive response into active prevention.�ans��src���Yu 与 He,《Digital twin-driven intelligence disaster prevention and mitigation for infrastructure: advances, challenges, and opportunities》,Natural Hazards,2022 (DOI: 10.1007/s11069-021-05190-x)��Yu & He, 'Digital twin-driven intelligence disaster prevention and mitigation for infrastructure: advances, challenges, and opportunities', Natural Hazards, 2022, DOI: 10.1007/s11069-021-05190-x��id�f92fc96eb555�body���被动式房屋是一种通过超强保温、气密设计和热回收通风，几乎不需要主动供暖制冷的节能建筑。它依靠良好朝向和隔热把能耗降到极低。德国是这一标准的主要发源地。�4A passive house is an energy-efficient building that relies on superb insulation, airtight design, and heat-recovery ventilation so it needs almost no active heating or cooling. By using good orientation and insulation, it cuts energy use to a very low level. Germany is the main birthplace of this standard.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�fc06fcf68ae3�body��e常规工艺为混凝、沉淀、过滤、消毒。混凝投加铝盐或铁盐使细小颗粒脱稳聚集成大絮体，沉淀池让絮体沉降分离，快滤池用石英砂等滤料截留剩余悬浮物和部分微生物，最后加氯或臭氧等消毒剂灭活病原体。必要时还辅以活性炭吸附去除有机物、臭氧氧化等深度处理。��The conventional train is coagulation, sedimentation, filtration and disinfection. Coagulation adds aluminium or iron salts to destabilise fine particles so they aggregate into flocs; the sedimentation basin settles the flocs out; rapid sand filters trap residual suspended solids and many microbes; and finally a disinfectant such as chlorine or ozone inactivates pathogens. Advanced steps such as activated-carbon adsorption for organics or ozonation are added as needed.�ans��src��3《给水工程》（中国建筑工业出版社）�/Water Treatment Principles and Design, AWWA/MWH��id�fda8b25f8a0b�body���良率是能正常工作的芯片占全部芯片的比例。先进制程一颗纳米级灰尘颗粒就能毁掉一个晶粒，而一片晶圆上有上千个小芯片，所以洁净度和工艺稳定性直接决定赚钱还是亏本。ٻYield is the fraction of working chips. A single nanometer particle can kill one die, and a wafer holds thousands of tiny dies, so cleanliness and process stability decide profit or loss.�ans��src��CMay & Spanos，《半导体制造与过程控制基础》（2006）�VMay & Spanos, 'Fundamentals of Semiconductor Manufacturing and Process Control' (2006)��id�fff4969d72dd�body�٢制造执行系统（MES）位于车间层，负责排产、工序跟踪、物料与质量数据采集，连接上层ERP与底层设备，让生产透明可控。ٗManufacturing Execution Systems sit on the shop floor, handling scheduling, tracking, material and quality data, bridging ERP above and machines below.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�0463de3f2fe2�body���岸桥、堆场吊和自动导引车协同，靠算法在最短时间把船-堆场-卡车衔接好，减少设备空跑和拥堵。本质是在时空约束下求解大规模调度优化问题。��Quay cranes, yard cranes and AGVs coordinate so algorithms link ship-yard-truck in minimal time, cutting idle runs and jams. It is essentially large-scale scheduling optimization under space-time constraints.�ans��src��OSteenken、Voss & Stahlbock，《集装箱码头运营与运筹学》（2004）�YSteenken, Voss & Stahlbock, 'Container Terminal Operation and Operations Research' (2004)��id�05cda8cc1a99�body���SLAM（同步定位与地图构建）让机器人在未知环境中一边确定自身位置，一边绘制周围地图。它结合激光、摄像头和惯性传感器数据，是扫地机和自动驾驶的关键技术。��SLAM (Simultaneous Localization and Mapping) lets a robot determine its own position while building a map of an unknown environment. Fusing laser, camera, and inertial data, it is key to robot vacuums and autonomous driving.�ans��src��:Thrun、Burgard & Fox，《概率机器人学》（2005）�5Thrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (2005)��id�0c8028512c1e�body��
单根导线的表面电场强度随电压升高而增大，一旦超过空气击穿场强就产生电晕，带来功率损耗、无线电与可听噪声以及臭氧腐蚀。把一相拆成二到八根间隔布置的子导线后等效半径大幅增大，表面场强显著降低，于是不必使用不切实际的超粗导线就能抑制电晕。分裂还减小线路电抗、提高输送能力，代价是需要间隔棒与更多金具、铁塔风载增大，并要防范子导线间的次跨距振荡与覆冰舞动。�]Surface field strength on a single conductor grows with voltage, and once it exceeds air's breakdown strength corona appears, bringing power loss, radio and audible noise and ozone attack. Splitting a phase into two to eight spaced sub-conductors greatly increases the equivalent radius and lowers the surface gradient, suppressing corona without impractically thick conductors. Bundling also reduces series reactance and raises transmission capacity, at the cost of spacers and extra hardware, larger tower wind loads, and the need to control subspan oscillation and ice galloping between sub-conductors.�ans��src��LGrainger 与 Stevenson，《Power System Analysis》（McGraw-Hill，1994）�AGrainger & Stevenson, 'Power System Analysis' (McGraw-Hill, 1994)��id�11cc1be7fa0c�body���雷诺数 Re = ρVD/μ，是惯性力与黏性力的比值，是无量纲数。圆管流动中 Re < 约2300 为层流，Re > 约4000 为湍流，中间为过渡区。它可预测流态并用于相似放大。��The Reynolds number Re = ρVD/μ is the ratio of inertial to viscous forces and is dimensionless. For pipe flow, Re < about 2300 is laminar, Re > about 4000 is turbulent, and between them is transitional. It predicts flow regime and enables scaling.�ans��src��=F.M. White《流体力学》；O. 雷诺 1883 年经典实验�MF.M. White, 'Fluid Mechanics'; O. Reynolds, classic 1883 pipe-flow experiment��id�1302d3f301b4�body���翼型使上表面气流速度更快、压强更低，下表面压强相对较高，压强差产生向上的升力，同时气流被向下偏转也通过牛顿第三定律提供升力。升力大小 L = ½ρV²S C_L，其中 C_L 为升力系数。�#An airfoil makes the upper flow faster and lower in pressure while the lower surface stays at higher pressure, and the pressure difference yields upward lift; the downward deflection of air also contributes via Newton's third law. Lift is L = ½ρV²S C_L, where C_L is the lift coefficient.�ans��src��M美国航空航天学会（AIAA）；J.D. Anderson《空气动力学基础》�hAmerican Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics (AIAA); J.D. Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics'��id�164de117a90e�body���卡诺循环是一种理想化的热机循环，由两个等温过程和两个绝热过程组成。它给出了在给定高温和低温热源之间热机可能达到的最高效率上限，真实发动机的效率都低于这个极限。�The Carnot cycle is an idealized heat-engine cycle made of two isothermal and two adiabatic processes. It sets the maximum possible efficiency for any heat engine operating between two given temperature reservoirs, and real engines always fall short of this limit.�ans��src��ICarnot《论火的动力》(1824)；Cengel 与 Boles《工程热力学》�sCarnot, 'Reflections on the Motive Power of Fire' (1824); Cengel & Boles, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach'��id�19597ab00aff�body�ٷ它们用镁合金或聚乳酸等材料，在体液里逐渐水解或腐蚀成无害小分子，被身体代谢掉。骨折愈合后不必二次手术取出，减少痛苦和费用。��Made of magnesium alloy or polylactic acid, they slowly hydrolyze or corrode in body fluid into harmless small molecules that the body metabolizes. Once the bone heals, no second surgery is needed to remove them.�ans��src��_Ratner、Hoffman、Schoen & Lemons，《生物材料科学：医用材料导论》（第3版）�lRatner, Hoffman, Schoen & Lemons, 'Biomaterials Science: An Introduction to Materials in Medicine' (3rd ed.)��id�24371edfc83f�body���公差是允许的尺寸变动量，配合描述相配零件间的松紧关系（间隙配合、过渡配合、过盈配合）。标注公差可实现互换性、保证功能，又避免不必要的过高加工精度带来的成本。�Tolerance is the permissible variation in a dimension, and fit describes the clearance or interference between mating parts (clearance, transition, or interference fit). Specifying tolerances ensures interchangeability and function without the cost of unnecessarily high precision.�ans��src��b国际标准化组织（ISO）ISO 286《极限与配合》；ASME Y14.5《尺寸与几何公差》�yInternational Organization for Standardization (ISO) ISO 286 'Limits and Fits'; ASME Y14.5 'Dimensioning and Tolerancing'��id�24e4e64a8e01�body���马赫数 Ma = 飞行速度 / 当地音速。当 Ma > 1 进入超音速后会产生激波、波阻剧增、机体严重气动加热并伴随音爆，因此需采用后掠翼、加力燃烧和耐热材料。�␀The Mach number is Ma = flight speed divided by the local speed of sound. Once Ma > 1, shock waves form, wave drag rises sharply, the airframe heats severely, and a sonic boom occurs, so swept wings, afterburners, and heat-resistant materials are required.�ans��src��J美国航空航天学会（AIAA）；J.D. Anderson《现代可压缩流》�dAmerican Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics (AIAA); J.D. Anderson, 'Modern Compressible Flow'��id�36f6628f1a65�body���流水线把一条指令的执行拆成取指、译码、执行、访存、写回等多个阶段，使多条指令在不同阶段重叠执行。吞吐率因此提高，尽管单条指令的延迟不变；冒险（hazard）会造成停顿。�Pipelining splits instruction execution into stages such as fetch, decode, execute, memory, and write-back so multiple instructions overlap in different stages. Throughput rises even though a single instruction's latency is unchanged; hazards can cause stalls.�ans��src��JACM；Hennessy & Patterson《计算机体系结构：量化研究方法》�KACM; Hennessy & Patterson, 'Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach'��id�48776caba03e�body���锂离子电池靠锂离子在石墨负极与金属氧化物正极（如 LiCoO2）之间通过电解液往返穿梭。放电时 Li+ 从负极迁向正极、电子经外电路做功；充电时在外电压下 Li+ 回到负极嵌入。�A Li-ion battery shuttles Li+ ions between a graphite anode and a metal-oxide cathode such as LiCoO2 through the electrolyte. On discharge Li+ moves from anode to cathode while electrons do work in the external circuit; on charge an external voltage drives Li+ back into the anode.�ans��src���美国能源部（US DOE）；Tarascon & Armand《可充电锂离子电池面临的挑战》（Issues and challenges facing rechargeable lithium batteries），《自然》（Nature），2001 年�U.S. Department of Energy (DOE); Tarascon & Armand, 'Issues and challenges facing rechargeable lithium batteries,' Nature, 2001��id�49e3595280f3�body���微电网是局部可孤岛运行的小电网，自己平衡发用；VPP 是把分散的光伏、储能、电动车聚成“一个电厂”由云端统一调度。两者都让碎片化的清洁能源变得可调、可控、可用。��A microgrid is a local grid that can island and balance itself; a VPP aggregates scattered solar, storage and EVs into 'one plant' scheduled from the cloud. Both make fragmented clean energy dispatchable and usable.�ans��src��BHatziargyriou，《微电网：架构与控制》（Wiley, 2014）�DHatziargyriou, 'Microgrids: Architectures and Control' (Wiley, 2014)��id�4e6b3ad1c39e�body���光伏直接把光变电、云来就停；CSP 用镜子把阳光聚到工质上加热，再靠储热罐把热量存几小时，晚上也能推动汽轮机发电。相当于给太阳装了个“热水电池”。��PV turns light straight to power and stops when clouds come; CSP mirrors concentrate sunlight to heat a fluid, stored in tanks for hours so a turbine can generate even at night. It is like a 'hot-water battery' for the sun.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�4e76c6832f74�body���变压器的一次、二次绕组绕在同一铁芯上，一次侧交流电流产生交变磁通，按法拉第电磁感应定律在二次侧感应出电动势。电压比等于匝数比，即 V_s/V_p = N_s/N_p，可实现升压或降压。�A transformer's primary and secondary windings share a magnetic core; AC in the primary creates an alternating flux that induces an EMF in the secondary by Faraday's law. The voltage ratio equals the turns ratio, V_s/V_p = N_s/N_p, enabling step-up or step-down.�ans��src��d电气与电子工程师协会（IEEE）IEEE C57 系列标准；Fitzgerald & Kingsley《电机学》�@IEEE Std C57 series; Fitzgerald & Kingsley, 'Electric Machinery'��id�648cdb7db3b8�body���主缆以抛物线形垂挂在塔顶，把桥面荷载经吊索汇聚到主缆，再由主缆的轴向拉力传到锚碇和桥塔，最终压入地基。桥塔受压、主缆受拉，这种分工让它能用很轻的结构跨越极长的跨度。�The main cables hang in a parabola from the towers; hangers gather deck load into the cables, whose axial tension carries it to anchorages and towers and into the ground. Towers take compression and cables take tension, letting a light structure span very long distances.�ans��src��SPetroski《梦想工程师》(Engineers of Dreams)；Leonhardt《桥梁》(Bridges)�5Petroski, 'Engineers of Dreams'; Leonhardt, 'Bridges'��id�64a8e8ae63b2�body���CSTR 内完全混合，器内浓度处处等于出口浓度，单容积转化率低但换热易控。PFR 内无轴向返混，浓度沿轴向递减，对一级反应在相同容积下转化率更高。二者选择取决于反应动力学与热管理。�IA CSTR is perfectly mixed so its internal concentration equals the outlet concentration; it gives low conversion per volume but easy heat control. A PFR has no axial backmixing and concentration falls along its length, giving higher conversion per volume for first-order reactions. Choice depends on kinetics and heat management.�ans��src��CLevenspiel《化学反应工程》；《Perry 化学工程手册》�SLevenspiel, 'Chemical Reaction Engineering'; 'Perry's Chemical Engineers' Handbook'��id�6565495d444e�body���自振频率是结构在无外力时自由振动的固有频率，由质量和刚度决定。当外部激励频率接近自振频率时会发生共振，振幅急剧增大，可能导致破坏，因此桥梁和高楼要避开共振。�
Natural frequency is the rate at which a structure vibrates freely on its own, set by its mass and stiffness. When external excitation nears this frequency, resonance occurs and amplitude grows sharply, risking damage, so bridges and towers are designed to avoid it.�ans��src��+Chopra，《结构动力学》（第5版）�*Chopra, 'Dynamics of Structures' (5th ed.)��id�658b854f862c�body���卡诺定理指出，工作在高温热源 T_h 和低温热源 T_c 之间的任何热机，效率都不可能超过 1 − T_c/T_h（温度用绝对温标）。它说明要想更高效，要么提高热源温差，要么减少不可逆损失。��Carnot's theorem states no engine operating between a hot reservoir T_h and a cold T_c can exceed an efficiency of 1 − T_c/T_h (absolute temperatures). It means higher efficiency needs a bigger temperature gap or fewer irreversibilities.�ans��src��ICarnot《论火的动力》(1824)；Cengel 与 Boles《工程热力学》�sCarnot, 'Reflections on the Motive Power of Fire' (1824); Cengel & Boles, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach'��id�67ee94ef7031�body���传统地热依赖天然的热水或蒸汽储层，EGS 则钻到数千米深的高温结晶岩，用水力激发张开并连通原有裂隙形成人造换热网络，再从另一口井把加热后的水取回地面。难点是裂隙网络的走向与渗透率难以预测：通道太少则换热面积不足、流量上不去，通道过于集中又会短路，注入水没被充分加热就返回，产出温度快速衰减。注水还会改变断层应力而诱发地震（瑞士巴塞尔项目因此停止），高温高矿化度流体又会腐蚀套管并结垢，所以选址、微地震监测与注入压力管理构成 EGS 的核心工程内容。�Conventional geothermal taps natural hot water or steam, whereas EGS drills kilometres into hot crystalline rock and uses hydraulic stimulation to open and link existing fractures into an artificial heat exchanger, with a second well returning the heated water. The hard part is that fracture orientation and permeability are hard to predict: too little connectivity starves flow rate, while an over-concentrated channel short-circuits the loop so water returns insufficiently heated and production temperature declines fast. Injection also perturbs fault stresses and can induce felt earthquakes, as the Basel project showed, while hot saline fluids scale and corrode casing, so siting, microseismic monitoring and injection-pressure management dominate EGS engineering.�ans��src��M麻省理工学院研究报告《The Future of Geothermal Energy》（2006）�4MIT report, 'The Future of Geothermal Energy' (2006)��id�7481de16752b�body��[激光熔池局部升温到熔点以上又在毫秒级冷却，熔化区收缩受周围已固化材料约束，逐层累积形成很大的残余应力，通常表层为拉应力、内部为压应力，量级可接近材料屈服强度。零件与基板和支撑连在一起时这些应力被机械约束住，一旦线切割分离，约束解除后应力重分布就表现为翘曲、扭曲甚至开裂。因此工艺上先带板进行去应力退火或热等静压，再切离基板；同时用分区（棋盘）扫描策略、基板预热、优化支撑布局和留出机加余量共同控制变形。�A laser melt pool is heated above melting and cooled within milliseconds, and the shrinking fused region is restrained by already-solid material, so layer after layer builds large residual stresses, typically tensile near the surface and compressive inside, approaching the material's yield strength. While the part stays fixed to the build plate and supports those stresses are mechanically restrained, but wire-cutting it free removes the restraint and the redistributing stress appears as warping, distortion or cracking. Practice therefore anneals for stress relief with the part still on the plate, or applies hot isostatic pressing, before separation, complemented by island or chequerboard scan strategies, plate preheating, optimized supports and machining allowance.�ans��src�٠Mercelis, Kruth,《Residual stresses in selective laser sintering and selective laser melting》,Rapid Prototyping Journal,2006 (DOI: 10.1108/13552540610707013)ٞMercelis, Kruth, 'Residual stresses in selective laser sintering and selective laser melting', Rapid Prototyping Journal, 2006, DOI: 10.1108/13552540610707013��id�750e6cd31517�body���雷达发射脉冲电磁波，遇到目标后部分能量反射回来，通过测量往返时间算出距离、用回波的多普勒频移算出速度。Watson-Watt 在二战前把这一原理发展成实用防空雷达。��Radar emits pulsed electromagnetic waves; part reflects off a target and returns, and the round-trip time gives range while the Doppler shift of the echo gives velocity. Watson-Watt developed this into practical air-defense radar before WWII.�ans��src�٥Skolnik《雷达系统导论》(Introduction to Radar Systems)，第 3 版；Watson-Watt《用无线电方法探测与定位飞机》备忘录(英国空军部, 1935)ٙSkolnik, 'Introduction to Radar Systems' (3rd ed.); Watson-Watt, 'Detection and Location of Aircraft by Radio Methods' memorandum (UK Air Ministry, 1935)��id�78905b36fe8c�body��X热影响区没有熔化，却经历了接近熔点的快速加热与冷却，近缝处晶粒严重粗化，冷却速度高的碳钢还会生成硬而脆的马氏体，韧性明显低于母材。焊缝金属可以通过填充材料成分和工艺主动控制组织，而热影响区的组织完全由热循环决定，再叠加焊接残余应力与氢的富集，就容易出现冷裂纹、氢致裂纹或脆化。控制办法是限定碳当量、预热并控制层间温度以降低冷却速率、限制热输入避免晶粒过分粗化，必要时焊后热处理消除残余应力与硬化组织。�	The heat-affected zone never melts but is heated near the melting point and cooled quickly, so grains coarsen severely next to the fusion line and carbon steels with fast cooling form hard, brittle martensite with toughness well below the base metal. Weld metal can be given matching or over-matched filler chemistry and controlled solidification, whereas HAZ microstructure is dictated purely by the thermal cycle, and combined with residual stress and hydrogen pickup it becomes the site of cold cracking, hydrogen-induced cracking or embrittlement. Remedies include limiting carbon equivalent, preheat and interpass temperature control to slow cooling, capping heat input to avoid excessive grain growth, and post-weld heat treatment to relieve stress and temper hard zones.�ans��src��:Kou，《Welding Metallurgy》（第2版，Wiley，2003）�0Kou, 'Welding Metallurgy' (2nd ed., Wiley, 2003)��id�84f3f7017541�body���碳纤维沿纤维方向的抗拉强度极高、密度却只有钢的约四分之一，把它埋入环氧树脂基体就得到比强度突出的层合板。缺点是各向异性、成本较高且层间易分层。�Carbon fibers have very high tensile strength along the fiber yet about one-quarter the density of steel; embedded in an epoxy matrix they form laminates with outstanding specific strength. Downsides are anisotropy, higher cost, and susceptibility to delamination.�ans��src��eMallick《纤维增强复合材料》(Fiber-Reinforced Composites)；Askeland《材料科学基础》�\Mallick, 'Fiber-Reinforced Composites'; Askeland, 'The Science and Engineering of Materials'��id�86781498982f�body��a钢的强度和弹性模量随温度显著下降，约 550–600 ℃ 时屈服强度只剩常温的一半左右，构件在设计荷载下就会大幅变形以致失稳；同时受约束的热膨胀会产生附加内力，把梁推向柱、拉裂节点。钢导热好、截面又薄，火场升温远快于混凝土，因此规范按构件的截面因子（受火周长与体积之比）和要求耐火时间来确定防火涂料、防火板或混凝土包裹的厚度。世贸中心调查也指出，喷涂防火层被撞击剥落、楼板与钢梁过热下垂、节点失效是渐进倒塌的关键环节。��Steel's strength and stiffness fall steeply with temperature, with yield strength roughly halved near 550–600 °C, so members deflect and buckle under their design load, while restrained thermal expansion adds forces that push beams into columns and tear connections apart. Steel conducts heat well and sections are thin, so it heats far faster than concrete in a fire, and codes size sprayed coatings, boards or concrete encasement from the section factor (heated perimeter to volume ratio) and the required fire-resistance period. The World Trade Center investigation likewise identified dislodged spray-applied fireproofing, overheated sagging floor systems and failing connections as key links in the collapse sequence.�ans��src��yNIST NCSTAR 1《Final Report on the Collapse of the World Trade Center Towers》；EN 1993-1-2（钢结构抗火设计）�}NIST NCSTAR 1, 'Final Report on the Collapse of the World Trade Center Towers'; EN 1993-1-2 (structural fire design of steel)��id�8bdccb741efa�body���软土指承载力低、压缩性高的淤泥、泥炭等软弱土层，常见于沿海和河漫滩。它在荷载下容易产生大沉降和侧向变形，需要专门的地基处理才能安全建造。�Soft soil refers to weak layers like mud and peat with low bearing capacity and high compressibility, common along coasts and floodplains. Under load it causes large settlement and lateral deformation, requiring special ground treatment for safe construction.�ans��src��8Das《土力学与基础工程》；ACI/API 桩基规范�JDas, Principles of Geotechnical Engineering; ACI/API pile foundation codes��id�8d0ac7fa2384�body��&定子绕组产生旋转磁场，转子导体因相对切割磁感线感应出电流，进而受安培力被『拖着』跟随旋转，转速略低于磁场转速（转差）。这种结构简单坚固、免维护，是工业最常用的电机。特斯拉在 1887 年发明多相感应电机。�@The stator's windings create a rotating magnetic field; currents induced in the rotor conductors by relative motion produce Ampere forces that drag the rotor along, at a speed slightly below the field (slip). Robust and brushless, it is industry's most common motor. Tesla invented the polyphase induction motor in 1887.�ans��src��WFitzgerald 等《电机学》(Electric Machinery)；Tesla《多相交流电机》(1888)�cFitzgerald et al., 'Electric Machinery'; Tesla, 'A New System of Alternating Current Motors' (1888)��id�917c76b99eb4�body���夹爪有平行夹爪、三指、柔性手和真空吸盘等多种形式：刚性夹爪靠几何包络夹持，真空吸盘靠负压吸附光滑表面。设计时要考虑物体质量、表面摩擦和是否易碎，Monkman 等对此有系统总结。�+Grippers come as parallel jaws, three-finger hands, compliant hands, and vacuum cups: rigid jaws grip by geometric envelopment while vacuum cups cling to smooth surfaces by negative pressure. Mass, surface friction, and fragility all guide the choice—surveyed systematically by Monkman and others.�ans��src��FMonkman 等《机器人夹爪》(Robot Grippers)（Wiley-VCH，2007）�2Monkman et al., 'Robot Grippers' (Wiley-VCH, 2007)��id�91d71bae8513�body���抽水蓄能是在电力富余时把水抽到上游水库、用电高峰时放水发电，往返效率约70%–80%。储能可平抑风电光伏的波动、削峰填谷并参与调频，是高比例可再生能源电网的关键。�+Pumped-storage hydropower pumps water uphill when power is abundant and generates by releasing it at peak demand, with round-trip efficiency of about 70%–80%. Storage balances intermittent wind and solar, shifts peak load, and provides frequency regulation, making it key to renewable-heavy grids.�ans��src��N国际能源署（IEA）；美国能源部（US DOE）《电网储能》报告�_International Energy Agency (IEA); U.S. Department of Energy (DOE) 'Grid Energy Storage' report��id�9888e3448524�body���悬索桥由主缆（悬链线）将桥面荷载经吊索传至桥塔和两端锚碇，主缆是主要受拉构件。斜拉桥则没有主缆与地锚，桥面直接由斜拉索连到桥塔，每根拉索既是支承又是受拉构件，桥塔受压。�{In a suspension bridge the main cables (in catenary) carry deck loads through vertical hangers to the towers and end anchorages, with the cable as the primary tension member. A cable-stayed bridge has no main cable or ground anchors; the deck is directly connected to the towers by diagonal stays that act as both supports and tension members, while the towers carry compression.�ans��src��L美国土木工程师学会（ASCE）；N.J. Gimsing《缆索支承桥梁》�SAmerican Society of Civil Engineers (ASCE); N.J. Gimsing, 'Cable Supported Bridges'��id�9d00f1ea0d36�body��精馏利用组分挥发度差异分离：上升蒸气富含易挥发组分、下降液体富含难挥发组分，在塔板上多次接触趋于平衡。理论板是指气液两相达到平衡的假定级，所需板数可用 McCabe-Thiele 图解法估算。�ZDistillation exploits differences in volatility: rising vapor is enriched in the more volatile component and descending liquid in the less volatile one, contacting repeatedly on trays toward equilibrium. A theoretical plate is an ideal stage where vapor and liquid reach equilibrium; the number of stages is estimated by the McCabe-Thiele method.�ans��src��QMcCabe, Smith & Harriott《化工单元操作》；Wankat《分离过程工程》�mMcCabe, Smith & Harriott, 'Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering'; Wankat, 'Separation Process Engineering'��id�a5dc8dbfd896�body���铁碳相图表示铁碳合金在平衡条件下各相随温度与成分的变化。含碳量低于约2.14%（质量分数）为钢，高于此值为铸铁；钢区包含铁素体、奥氏体、珠光体和渗碳体等组织。�	The iron-carbon phase diagram shows the equilibrium phases of Fe-C alloys versus temperature and composition. Alloys with less than about 2.14 wt% carbon are steel, and above that are cast iron; the steel region includes ferrite, austenite, pearlite, and cementite.�ans��src��WASM International《金属手册》第1卷；Callister《材料科学与工程导论》�iASM International, 'ASM Handbook' Vol. 1; Callister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction'��id�aacde049a74f�body�ٽ三相电由三个相位相差120度的交流电压组成，能平稳地提供动力。它比单相电输电效率更高、电机运行更平稳，因此广泛用于工厂和大型设备。��Three-phase power consists of three AC voltages offset by 120 degrees, delivering power smoothly. It transmits energy more efficiently and runs motors more steadily than single-phase power, so it is widely used in factories and large equipment.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�ad2e94b3c6fa�body��卡诺定理指出：工作于两个恒温热源之间的任何热机，其效率都不可能超过可逆卡诺热机，即 η_Carnot = 1 − T_c/T_h。实际热机存在摩擦、有限温差传热、非平衡过程等不可逆损失，因此效率必然更低。�Carnot's theorem states that no heat engine operating between two reservoirs can exceed the efficiency of a reversible Carnot engine: η_Carnot = 1 − T_c/T_h. Real engines suffer friction, finite-rate heat transfer, and non-equilibrium losses, so their efficiency is necessarily lower.�ans��src��UMoran & Shapiro《工程热力学基础》；S. Carnot《论火的动力》（1824）�zMoran & Shapiro, 'Fundamentals of Engineering Thermodynamics'; S. Carnot, 'Reflections on the Motive Power of Fire' (1824)��id�b8165cfd3233�body���列车高速挤入隧道会把空气猛推向前，形成压缩波在洞内来回反射，气压突变压迫耳膜。洞口渐扩或设开孔缓冲结构能放缓压力变化，减轻不适和微压波噪声。��A fast train shoves air ahead, forming compression waves that reflect in the tunnel and suddenly change pressure on your ears. A flared mouth or perforated buffer eases that pressure change, reducing discomfort and micro-pressure-wave noise.�ans��src��@美国联邦公路管理局（FHWA），《公路隧道通风》�%US FHWA, 'Highway Tunnel Ventilation'��id�bb8e17ed05dd�body��热电联产在发电的同时回收排热用于供热或工艺蒸汽，使燃料总利用率可达70%–90%，远高于单独电厂约40%的水平，因而显著降低能耗与排放。典型应用包括工业园区自备电站以及医院、数据中心的分布式能源系统。�aCombined heat and power generates electricity while recovering waste heat for heating or process steam, raising total fuel utilization to 70%–90%, far above the roughly 40% of separate plants, thus cutting energy use and emissions. Typical uses include industrial-park cogeneration plants and distributed energy systems for hospitals and data centers.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�c4c60b438f92�body���金属的塑性变形主要通过位错沿滑移系的滑移实现。位错只需很小应力即可逐排运动（切应力约为剪切模量的万分之一），远低于整层原子同时错动所需，这就解释了金属的优良延性。�Plastic deformation in metals occurs mainly by the slip of dislocations along slip systems. A dislocation moves one row at a time under a stress far smaller (about μ/10^4) than would be needed to shift whole atomic planes together, which explains the good ductility of metals.�ans��src��KHull & Bacon《位错导论》；Callister《材料科学与工程导论》�mHull & Bacon, 'Introduction to Dislocations'; Callister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction'��id�c5a302dc6787�body���风绕过高层建筑会在背风面周期性脱落涡街，既产生横向推力也可能引发涡激共振，使结构摇晃甚至疲劳。工程上用风洞试验和减振装置（如调谐质量阻尼器）来控制。�␀Wind passing a tall building sheds periodic vortices on the lee side, producing sideways force and possible vortex-induced resonance that sways or fatigues the structure. Engineers use wind-tunnel tests and dampers such as tuned mass dampers to control it.�ans��src��YHolmes《风荷载》(Wind Loading of Structures)；美国 ASCE 7《建筑荷载规范》�RHolmes, 'Wind Loading of Structures'; ASCE 7, 'Minimum Design Loads for Buildings'��id�c9f9da95d223�body���渐开线齿廓能保证两齿轮啮合时传动比恒定，且制造和安装误差的容忍度较好。它在整个啮合过程中压力角基本不变，因此成为最普遍的标准齿形。��An involute profile keeps the gear ratio constant during meshing and tolerates manufacturing and assembly errors well. Its pressure angle stays nearly constant through engagement, making it the dominant standard tooth form.�ans��src��{Shigley《机械工程设计》(Mechanical Engineering Design)，第 10 版；Budynas 与 Nisbett《Shigley 机械设计》�qShigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.); Budynas & Nisbett, 'Shigley's Mechanical Engineering Design'��id�cb78800efe19�body�ٱ第一宇宙速度是物体绕地球做圆周轨道运动所需的最小速度，约为每秒7.9公里。达到这个速度，物体就能成为地球卫星而不落回地面。��The first cosmic velocity is the minimum speed needed for an object to orbit Earth in a circular path, about 7.9 kilometers per second. At this speed an object becomes an Earth satellite instead of falling back down.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�d27b2977d034�body���交通流三要素是流量（单位时间通过的车辆数）、速度（车辆行驶快慢）和密度（单位长度内的车辆数）。它们满足流量等于密度乘以速度的基本关系，是分析拥堵的基础。��The three fundamentals of traffic flow are flow (vehicles per unit time), speed (how fast they move), and density (vehicles per unit length). They obey the basic relation flow equals density times speed and form the basis of congestion analysis.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�d6ab7d7d531e�body��冯·诺依曼架构是一种存储程序计算机：指令与数据存放在同一存储器中，经同一总线由 CPU 取指、译码、执行。其核心是“程序即数据”，局限在于 CPU 与存储器速度差距造成的“冯·诺依曼瓶颈”。�&The von Neumann architecture is a stored-program computer where instructions and data share the same memory and bus, and the CPU fetches, decodes, and executes them sequentially. Its core is that programs are data, and its limitation is the von Neumann bottleneck from the CPU-memory speed gap.�ans��src��z电气电子工程师协会计算机学会（IEEE Computer Society）；Patterson & Hennessy《计算机组成与设计》�OIEEE Computer Society; Patterson & Hennessy, 'Computer Organization and Design'��id�d89b517a5d64�body���雷诺数是惯性力与黏性力的比值，用来判断流动是层流还是湍流，并作为相似准则把小模型实验推广到真实尺寸。工程师据此选择管径、流速和泵的设计参数。�␀The Reynolds number is the ratio of inertial to viscous forces and predicts whether flow is laminar or turbulent; as a similarity criterion it lets small-model tests scale to full size. Engineers use it to pick pipe diameter, velocity, and pump parameters.�ans��src��cMunson 等《流体力学基础》(Fundamentals of Fluid Mechanics)；White《黏性流体力学》�MMunson et al., 'Fundamentals of Fluid Mechanics'; White, 'Viscous Fluid Flow'��id�dffb43b5f8e6�body���三相交流电由幅值相等、相位互差120°的三个正弦电压组成。它在传输相同功率时比单相更省导线材料，且瞬时功率恒定、能自然驱动三相感应电动机，因此成为电网标准。�Three-phase AC consists of three sinusoidal voltages of equal magnitude spaced 120° apart. For the same power it needs less conductor material than single-phase, delivers constant instantaneous power, and naturally runs three-phase induction motors, making it the grid standard.�ans��src��b电气与电子工程师协会（IEEE）IEEE Std 141（红皮书）；B.M. Weedy《电力系统》�=IEEE Std 141 (Red Book); B.M. Weedy, 'Electric Power Systems'��id�e79fd869b342�body���活性污泥法在曝气池中让混合的微生物絮体吸附并氧化分解有机物（降低 BOD），随后在二沉池中泥水分离，部分污泥作为回流污泥（RAS）返回。核心是有氧生物降解与硝化过程。�The activated sludge process aerates a tank where mixed microbial flocs adsorb and oxidize organic matter (reducing BOD), then a clarifier separates biomass, part of which is returned as return activated sludge (RAS). The core is aerobic biodegradation and nitrification.�ans��src��V水环境联合会（WEF）；Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程：处理与资源回收》�mWater Environment Federation (WEF); Metcalf & Eddy, 'Wastewater Engineering: Treatment and Resource Recovery'��id�e8ddc44e23e9�body���运算放大器是高增益差分放大器，放大两输入端之差。在负反馈下可近似为：两输入端电流为零、两输入端之间电压差为零（虚短）。据此可构成放大器、滤波器、积分器等电路。�VAn operational amplifier is a high-gain differential amplifier that amplifies the difference between its two inputs. Under negative feedback the ideal op-amp obeys: (1) no current enters the input terminals, and (2) the voltage difference between the inputs is zero (virtual short). From these rules come amplifiers, filters, and integrators.�ans��src��M电气与电子工程师协会（IEEE）；Sedra & Smith《微电子电路》�/IEEE; Sedra & Smith, 'Microelectronic Circuits'��id�ee6db7d2d4a1�body���数字主线让一份模型和数据贯穿全流程，设计改了制造和质检立刻同步，不必手动传表、对不上号。它把孤岛系统变成一条可追溯的连续链路，提质又提速。��A digital thread carries one model and dataset through every stage, so a design change instantly syncs to manufacturing and inspection instead of manual handoffs that mismatch. It turns silos into a traceable continuous chain, raising quality and speed.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�eng_24_017�body��$传统工业机器人的安全策略是隔离:围栏加光栅,人进即停线。协作机器人换思路为内在安全:轻量化圆角外壳消除夹伤点;关节内置力矩传感器,碰撞检测从电机电流反推异常力,几毫秒内停机或反弹;速度与空间限制在ISO/TS 15066阈值内——标准甚至给出人体各部位可承受的最大压力与能量表(额头最脆弱),厂商据此标定停机距离。人机由此能真正交接零件。代价是负载多在十公斤级——安全的本质是能量管理,而非勇气。�`Classic industrial robots isolate: fences plus light curtains stop everything when humans approach. Cobots instead build safety inward: lightweight rounded shells remove pinch points; joint torque sensors detect abnormal forces from motor current within milliseconds, halting or rebounding; speed and space obey ISO/TS 15066 thresholds whose tables list maximum tolerable pressure and energy per body region (forehead most fragile) so makers calibrate stopping distances. Humans and robots can truly hand over parts. The tradeoff is payloads around ten kilograms — safety is energy management, not courage.�ans��src��{国际标准化组织（ISO）,《Robots and robotic devices. Collaborative robots》,ISO/TS 15066 (DOI: 10.3403/30295037u)�]ISO, 'Robots and robotic devices. Collaborative robots', ISO/TS 15066, DOI: 10.3403/30295037u��id�f027822cc94c�body���CALPHAD 用热力学数据库和模型计算多组元体系在各温度的成分平衡，画出相图。输入合金配方就能预告哪些温度下会析出脆性相或偏析，指导成分设计。��CALPHAD uses thermodynamic databases and models to compute equilibrium compositions of multicomponent systems at each temperature, drawing phase diagrams. Feed an alloy recipe and it forecasts brittle precipitates or segregation, guiding design.�ans��src�ٝSaunders & Miodownik,《CALPHAD: Calculation of Phase Diagrams - A Comprehensive Guide》,Pergamon Materials Series,1998 (DOI: 10.1016/s1470-1804(98)x8001-6)ٛSaunders & Miodownik, 'CALPHAD: Calculation of Phase Diagrams - A Comprehensive Guide', Pergamon Materials Series, 1998, DOI: 10.1016/s1470-1804(98)x8001-6��id�f20831ebc774�body���设计先经 CAD 建模、CAM 生成刀具路径，再编译成 G 代码驱动机床按坐标精确走刀，自动完成铣、钻、车等工序。它把人的手艺变成可重复的数字控制，MIT 在 1952 年造出首台数控铣床。�A CAD model is passed to CAM to generate toolpaths, then compiled to G-code that drives the machine to cut precisely along coordinates, automating milling, drilling, and turning. It turns craft into repeatable digital control; MIT built the first NC mill in 1952.�ans��src��cGroover《现代制造基础》(Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing)；MIT《数控铣床》(1952)�XGroover, 'Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing'; MIT, 'Numerical Control Milling' (1952)��id�fb5def0511ee�body�ٴ腐蚀是金属与环境发生化学或电化学反应而逐渐损耗的过程，常见的是铁生锈。防护方法包括涂漆、镀锌、使用不锈钢以及阴极保护等。��Corrosion is the gradual loss of metal through chemical or electrochemical reactions with its environment, with iron rusting being the common case. Protection methods include painting, galvanizing, using stainless steel, and cathodic protection.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�0048c84112cc�body���它按进气、压缩、做功（点火膨胀）、排气四个冲程循环，曲轴转两圈完成一次做功。其热效率理论上受奥托循环上限约束，实际还受燃烧、摩擦和泵气损失限制。��It cycles through intake, compression, power (combustion and expansion), and exhaust, with the crankshaft turning twice per power stroke. Its efficiency is bounded in theory by the Otto cycle and in practice by combustion, friction, and pumping losses.�ans��src��mHeywood《内燃机基础》(Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals)；Cengel 与 Boles《工程热力学》�mHeywood, 'Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals'; Cengel & Boles, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach'��id�00e645602d1b�body�٥执行器是把电信号变成实际动作的部件，如电机、气缸、液压缸，它让机器人的关节转动、手臂伸缩，相当于机器人的肌肉。ُAn actuator converts an electrical signal into motion, such as a motor or cylinder, making joints turn and arms move; it is the robot's muscle.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�02b68df48be6�body�ٽ音障是飞机接近音速时激波导致阻力剧增、操控变难的现象。后掠翼、更强动力和面积律等设计让飞机在超音速下仍可控，从而稳定跨越音速。ټThe sound barrier is the drag and control difficulty from shock waves near Mach 1. Swept wings, more power, and area ruling let aircraft stay controllable and cross into supersonic flight.�ans��src��BAnderson，《高超声速与高温气体动力学》（第2版）�BAnderson, 'Hypersonic and High-Temperature Gas Dynamics' (2nd ed.)��id�02b96672e915�body���死区指输入控制信号小于某阈值时执行器无输出或不动的区域，源于摩擦、间隙或阀口开启压力。它会造成小信号下稳态误差、极限环振荡，需在控制律中补偿。�Dead zone is the input range below a threshold where an actuator produces no motion, due to friction, backlash, or valve cracking pressure. It causes steady-state error and limit-cycle oscillations under small signals, requiring compensation in the controller.�ans��src��B《现代控制工程》（绪方胜彦，电子工业出版社）�0Ogata, Modern Control Engineering, Prentice Hall��id�03045a176f3b�body���Delta 机构把三台电机全部固定在上方静平台，三条轻质连杆只传递力，运动部件的质量和转动惯量极小，末端加速度可以做到 10g 量级。多条支链共同承担负载，刚度沿闭链分布，末端也不像串联臂那样把每个关节的误差逐级放大，重复定位精度更容易做高。代价是工作空间小且形状复杂、姿态自由度少（典型只有三平移加一转），逆解简单但正解与奇异性分析比串联臂麻烦得多。�_A Delta places all three motors on the fixed upper platform and lets slim links carry only forces, so moving mass and inertia are tiny and end-effector accelerations around 10g become practical. Load is shared by several closed kinematic chains, giving high stiffness and avoiding the link-by-link error accumulation of a serial arm, so repeatability is easier to keep tight. The trade-offs are a small, awkwardly shaped workspace, few orientation degrees of freedom (typically three translations plus one rotation), and forward kinematics and singularity analysis that are much harder than for serial arms.�ans��src��=Merlet，《Parallel Robots》（第2版，Springer，2006）�3Merlet, 'Parallel Robots' (2nd ed., Springer, 2006)��id�0329bf6a4134�body�ٱ淬火把钢快速冷却，获得硬而脆的马氏体；回火是随后适度加热，让组织部分软化、消除内应力、提高韧性，使钢既硬又不至于太脆。ٶQuenching cools steel rapidly to form hard but brittle martensite; tempering then reheats it mildly to soften slightly, relieve stress, and gain toughness—hard yet not too brittle.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�04f586d0072a�body���冰箱用压缩机把制冷剂压缩成高温高压气体，流经背面冷凝器时把热量散到房间，制冷剂变回液体。它只在箱内的蒸发器吸热制冷，所以里面冷、背面热，热量其实被搬到了外面。��The compressor squeezes refrigerant into hot high-pressure gas that releases heat at the back condenser and liquefies. It only absorbs heat inside at the evaporator, so the inside is cold while the back is hot—heat is merely moved outside.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�05d9c447080f�body�ٺ涡轮机让高速气体或水流冲击叶片，推动转轮旋转，再把旋转传给发电机或泵。蒸汽、燃气和水轮机都靠这一原理把热或水能转化为机械能。��A turbine lets high-speed steam, gas, or water strike blades that spin a rotor, which drives a generator or pump. Steam, gas, and hydro turbines all turn thermal or hydraulic energy into mechanical work.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�05eae937851b�body��R油气支柱把弹性元件与阻尼元件合成一体：封闭腔内的压缩氮气充当非线性气弹簧，刚度随行程压缩急剧上升，油液被迫通过小孔或计量针形成的变截面通道产生阻尼力。这样它能吸收着陆瞬间巨大的下沉动能并在一两个行程内耗散掉，几乎不回弹，避免飞机反复弹跳；汽车弹簧刚度基本线性、以乘坐舒适为目标，允许多次振荡由减振器逐渐衰减。设计上要按最大设计下沉速度校核吸能量与吸能效率，还要考虑气体温度变化引起的静态伸长差异。��An oleo strut merges spring and damper in one unit: sealed nitrogen acts as a strongly nonlinear gas spring whose stiffness rises steeply with stroke, while oil forced through an orifice or metering pin produces the damping force. That lets it absorb the large sink energy of touchdown and dissipate it within one or two strokes with almost no rebound, preventing bounce, whereas a car spring is nearly linear, tuned for ride comfort and tolerating several oscillations decayed by the shock absorber. Design must verify absorbed energy and absorption efficiency against the maximum design sink speed and allow for gas-temperature effects on static strut extension.�ans��src��VCurrey，《Aircraft Landing Gear Design: Principles and Practices》（AIAA，1988）�MCurrey, 'Aircraft Landing Gear Design: Principles and Practices' (AIAA, 1988)��id�0654eb14068e�body���风推动叶片绕轴旋转，把风能转为机械能，再通过齿轮箱增速带动发电机发电。风向标和变桨系统调节迎风和角度，使机组在不同风速下高效且安全。��Wind spins the blades, turning kinetic energy to mechanical rotation that a gearbox speeds up to drive a generator. Yaw and pitch systems tune alignment and angle for efficient, safe operation.�ans��src��(Burton，《风能手册》（第2版）�(Burton, 'Wind Energy Handbook' (2nd ed.)��id�086277326645�body�ٟ弧形坝面把水的推力转化为沿坝体传向两岸岩石的压力，借助自身巨大重量和两岸夹持来抵抗，比直坝更省料且更稳定。ٽThe curved face turns water thrust into compression carried to the canyon walls, and the dam's own huge weight plus the wedged shape resist the force more economically than a straight wall.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�098ec754040f�body���用可再生电力在催化剂上把CO2加水还原成一氧化碳、甲酸、乙烯甚至乙醇，等于把多余绿电存进化学键。捕集的碳因此从废物变成可循环的合成原料。��Renewable electricity reduces captured CO2 with water on a catalyst into CO, formate, ethylene or even ethanol—storing surplus green power in chemical bonds. Captured carbon thus becomes recyclable feedstock instead of waste.�ans��src��uWhipple & Kenis，《电化学还原利用二氧化碳的前景》，《物理化学快报》1卷，3451页（2010）�rWhipple & Kenis, 'Prospects of CO2 Utilization via Electrochemical Reduction,' J. Phys. Chem. Lett. 1, 3451 (2010)��id�0ac0707f3627�body���催化裂化用催化剂在高温下把大分子重油断裂成较小的烃分子，提高汽油和柴油等轻质馏分的产率。这样既增产高价值燃油，又消化掉需求较低的重质残渣。��Catalytic cracking uses a catalyst at high temperature to break large heavy-oil molecules into smaller hydrocarbons, raising yields of valuable light fractions like gasoline and diesel while consuming low-demand heavy residue.�ans��src��4Fogler，《化学反应工程原理》（第5版）�=Fogler, 'Elements of Chemical Reaction Engineering' (5th ed.)��id�0b1fe41c7a19�body���六西格玛是一套以数据驱动的质量管理方法，目标是把缺陷率降到每百万机会约3.4个以下，用DMAIC流程（定义、测量、分析、改进、控制）减少过程变异。ٜSix Sigma is a data-driven quality method aiming for fewer than about 3.4 defects per million opportunities, using the DMAIC cycle to cut process variation.�ans��src��^Six Sigma（Pyzdek & Keller）；ISO 9001；机器视觉检测（Davies《Machine Vision》）�YSix Sigma (Pyzdek & Keller); ISO 9001; machine vision inspection (Davies, Machine Vision)��id�0c0ee665052d�body���气动弹性研究气动力与结构柔度的耦合：太软会颤振发散，太硬则重且把载荷硬传给机身。设计师在重量、刚度和气动效率间找平衡，避开危险的共振频率。�Aeroelasticity studies coupling of aerodynamic force and structural flexibility: too soft invites flutter divergence, too stiff adds weight and harsh load transfer. Designers balance weight, stiffness and efficiency while avoiding dangerous resonant frequencies.�ans��src��:Bisplinghoff、Ashley & Halfman，《气动弹性力学》�0Bisplinghoff, Ashley & Halfman, 'Aeroelasticity'��id�0c8fdf3ae8d4�body��z精馏利用混合物各组分挥发度不同，通过气液两相在塔板或填料上的逆流接触反复部分汽化和冷凝，使易挥发组分富集于塔顶、难挥发组分富集于塔底。回流把塔顶冷凝的一部分液体送回塔内，为塔提供持续下行的液相，保证各级气液接触和组分分离连续进行，是精馏高效分离的关键。��Distillation exploits differences in volatility: vapour and liquid contact countercurrently on trays or packing, repeatedly partially vaporising and condensing, so the more volatile component concentrates at the top and the less volatile one at the bottom. Reflux returns part of the condensed overhead liquid to the column, providing a continuous downward liquid flow so that staged vapour-liquid contact and separation proceed steadily; it is essential for efficient separation.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�0ccb9819c42a�body��5沟道变短后，栅极对沟道的静电控制减弱，会出现阈值电压随沟道长度下降、漏致势垒降低（DIBL）和亚阈值斜率退化等现象。这会导致关态漏电流增大、功耗上升，并限制器件进一步缩小，是引入 FinFET、GAA 等三维结构的主要驱动力。�-As the channel shortens, the gate loses electrostatic control, leading to threshold-voltage roll-off, drain-induced barrier lowering (DIBL), and degraded subthreshold slope. These raise off-state leakage and power consumption and limit further scaling, motivating 3D structures such as FinFET and GAA.�ans��src��<Streetman & Banerjee，《固态电子器件》（第7版）�@Streetman & Banerjee, 'Solid State Electronic Devices' (7th ed.)��id�104b558f17b1�body���纯金属的原子排列规则，位错很容易滑移，所以纯铝、纯铁又软又弱。加入合金元素后，原子尺寸差异引起晶格畸变，阻碍位错运动，这叫固溶强化；还能析出细小的第二相颗粒把位错"钉住"，即沉淀强化。钢就是铁中加入约0.8%的碳，再通过控制冷却让碳化物析出，强度成倍提升；而奥氏体到马氏体的相变则是钢热处理强化的核心机制。�(In pure metals atoms line up regularly and dislocations glide easily, so pure aluminum or iron is soft and weak. Adding alloying elements distorts the lattice with their different atomic sizes, blocking dislocation motion — solid-solution strengthening — and tiny second-phase particles can also pin dislocations, which is precipitation hardening. Steel is iron with about 0.8% carbon; controlling the cooling makes carbides precipitate and multiplies strength. The austenite-to-martensite phase transformation is the heart of steel heat treatment.�ans��src��$《自然》杂志（材料科学）�Nature (materials science)��id�106ff91ccb45�body���复合材料由高强度纤维（如碳纤维）嵌在基体（如树脂）中，纤维承担主要载荷，基体传递力并保护纤维。它比强度、比刚度极高且耐腐蚀，广泛用于航空和体育器材。��Composites embed strong fibers like carbon in a matrix like resin; fibers carry the load while the matrix transfers force and protects them. They offer exceptional strength-to-weight and stiffness and resist corrosion.�ans��src��CCallister & Rethwisch《材料科学与工程基础》第9版,Wiley�iW. D. Callister Jr. & D. G. Rethwisch, Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, 9th ed., Wiley��id�10bb172ba399�body�ِ适度弯曲和起伏缓解驾驶单调、减少催眠事故，也利于排水；但主线仍以平顺为主，弯道是为安全而非绕路。�wGentle curves and grades fight driver fatigue and aid drainage; the mainline stays smooth, with bends added for safety.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�116efff78436�body�ٜ在小幅摆动下，摆的周期只由摆长决定，几乎不受幅度影响；齿轮机构数着摆动次数来推动指针，所以摆钟走得很准。٦For small swings a pendulum's period depends mainly on its length and hardly on amplitude; the gearwork counts the swings to drive the hands, keeping time accurately.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�1244ca54be56�body�ٴ公差是零件实际尺寸允许偏离设计值的上限范围。合理公差保证零件可互换装配、运转顺畅且成本可控；过严会贵，过松会松旷或卡死。��Tolerance is the allowed deviation from a designed dimension. Good tolerances ensure interchangeable, smoothly running parts at reasonable cost; too tight is expensive, too loose causes play or jamming.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�134fc6a5c6ce�body���活性污泥法是把含大量微生物的絮体回流到曝气池，微生物以污水中的有机物和氮磷为食，把它们转化成自身细胞和二氧化碳等。之后在二沉池里污泥沉降分离，清水排出。��Activated sludge recirculates microbe-rich flocs into an aeration tank where organisms consume organics and nutrients like nitrogen and phosphorus, turning them into biomass and CO2. The sludge then settles in a clarifier and clear water flows out.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�138b04af1c0b�body�ٽ轴承是支撑旋转轴并减少其运动摩擦的机械部件，常见类型有滚动轴承和滑动轴承。它能使机器运转更顺畅、更省能，并延长轴和轮子的寿命。��A bearing is a machine element that supports a rotating shaft and reduces friction in its motion, with rolling and sliding bearings being common types. Bearings let machines run smoother, save energy, and extend the life of shafts and wheels.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�15af10be8a35�body���PID 根据当前位置与目标的位置误差，分别用比例、积分、微分三项计算控制量。比例快速响应，积分消除稳态偏差，微分抑制超调，三者配合让手臂平滑且准确地停在目标点。��PID computes control from the position error using proportional, integral, and derivative terms. Proportion responds fast, integral removes steady error, derivative damps overshoot, together bringing the arm smoothly and accurately to the target.�ans��src��QÅström & Hägglund，《PID控制器：理论、设计与整定》（第2版）�LÅström & Hägglund, 'PID Controllers: Theory, Design and Tuning' (2nd ed.)��id�1777ff9533a6�body���人工湿地通过基质过滤截留悬浮物，植物根系供氧营造好氧-厌氧微区，依附于根与填料的生物膜降解有机物并进行硝化和反硝化脱氮。磷则主要靠基质吸附与沉淀去除，有饱和寿命。�Constructed wetlands filter suspended solids by substrate, while plant roots create oxic-anoxic microzones where biofilms degrade organics and perform nitrification-denitrification. Phosphorus is mainly removed by substrate adsorption and precipitation, which has a finite capacity.�ans��src��6《水污染控制工程》（高等教育出版社）�8Kadlec & Wallace, Treatment Wetlands, 2nd ed., CRC Press��id�17cf7105d695�body�ٽ高楼用坚固的核心筒和支撑系统提供刚度，有的在顶层安装调谐质量阻尼器（如大水箱或重物），反向摆动抵消晃动，让楼内的人感觉更平稳。٨Tall buildings use stiff cores and bracing, and some place tuned mass dampers near the top that swing opposite to the motion, canceling sway so occupants feel steadier.�ans��src��+Chopra，《结构动力学》（第5版）�*Chopra, 'Dynamics of Structures' (5th ed.)��id�18e950c6f8c0�body���增材制造按 CAD 模型逐层堆积材料成形，无需模具。优势是可做复杂几何、材料浪费少、适合快速原型；相对切削加工，速度较慢且性能可能呈各向异性。��Additive manufacturing builds parts layer by layer from a CAD model without tooling. Advantages are complex geometry, low material waste, and rapid prototyping; compared with machining it is slower and properties can be anisotropic.�ans��src��n美国材料与试验协会（ASTM）ASTM F2792《增材制造术语标准》；制造工程师学会（SME）�yASTM International ASTM F2792 'Standard Terminology for Additive Manufacturing'; SME (Society of Manufacturing Engineers)��id�1a5ba2963277�body���淬火让钢变得极硬却很脆、内应力大。回火是把钢重新加热到较低温度再缓冷，使部分马氏体分解、析出碳化物，从而降低脆性、提高韧性，牺牲一点硬度换取可用性。��Quenching makes steel very hard but brittle with high internal stress. Tempering reheats it to a lower temperature then cools slowly, letting some martensite decompose and carbides precipitate, trading a little hardness for much-needed toughness.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�1aea856d5224�body�ٺ攻角是机翼弦线与来流方向的夹角。在一定范围内增大攻角会提高升力，但超过临界值气流分离、升力骤降并失速，所以飞行员需控制攻角。��Angle of attack is the angle between the wing chord and the airflow. Within a range, more angle means more lift, but past a critical value flow separates and lift collapses—stall—so pilots manage it.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�1b6b26de8372�body���传感器相当于系统的感官，把温度、位置、压力等物理量转成电信号供控制器读取；执行器相当于手脚，把控制器的电信号变成动作，如电机转动或阀门开合。��Sensors are the senses, converting temperature, position, pressure into signals the controller reads; actuators are the limbs, turning control signals into action like motor motion or valve movement.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�1ce72b8ece7a�body���层间剪切强度衡量相邻铺层界面抵抗沿厚度方向剪切分离的能力。它通常远低于纤维方向强度，是层合板最薄弱的环节，易在弯曲或冲击下发生分层，限制结构承载。�Interlaminar shear strength measures a laminate's resistance to shear separation between plies along the thickness. It is usually far lower than in-fiber strength, making delamination under bending or impact the weakest failure mode and limiting load capacity.�ans��src��`Callister 与 Rethwisch，《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》（第10版）�VCallister & Rethwisch, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�1df2ad0525f4�body�ٴ差异沉降指建筑不同部位下沉量不一致，会使结构产生附加弯矩和裂缝，严重时拉裂墙体。均匀沉降虽整体下沉却通常不直接破坏结构。��Differential settlement means different parts of a structure sink by unequal amounts, creating extra bending and cracks that can tear walls apart. Uniform settlement, though it lowers the whole building, usually does not split it.�ans��src��8Das《土力学与基础工程》；ACI/API 桩基规范�JDas, Principles of Geotechnical Engineering; ACI/API pile foundation codes��id�1e2914dd770c�body���隔震是在建筑基础和上部结构之间设置橡胶支座等柔性层，延长结构周期、削弱地震能量向上传递。它能显著降低地震时楼内的晃动，保护人员和设备。�Seismic isolation places flexible layers such as rubber bearings between a building's foundation and its superstructure, lengthening its period and reducing upward transmission of quake energy. It markedly cuts interior shaking and protects people and equipment.�ans��src��1ASCE 7-16；FEMA P-749《地震隔离与耗能》�4ASCE 7-16; FEMA P-749, Earthquake Protective Systems��id�1eae502ef35e�body���富营养化是氮磷等营养盐过量导致藻类等暴发性繁殖、耗氧缺氧的现象。生活污水与农业径流携带的氮磷若未经充分脱除排入水体，会直接加剧富营养化，因此污水厂需强化脱氮除磷。�Eutrophication is the explosive growth of algae from excess nitrogen and phosphorus, causing oxygen depletion. Nitrogen and phosphorus in sewage and runoff, if discharged without adequate removal, directly worsen it, so plants must enhance nutrient removal.�ans��src��6《水污染控制工程》（高等教育出版社）�'Metcalf and Eddy Wastewater Engineering��id�1f01fb09042b�body�٢自由度是机器人可以独立运动的方向或旋转轴的数量。自由度越多，机械臂能到达的姿态越灵活，但控制和编程也越复杂。��A degree of freedom is an independent direction or rotation axis a robot can move along. More degrees of freedom let a robotic arm reach more flexible poses, but control and programming also become more complex.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�203a56e0f142�body�ٷ发动机吸入空气，压缩后与燃料燃烧膨胀，从尾部高速喷出；根据反作用力，向后喷出的气体把飞机向前推，这和火箭、划船是一个道理。ٸIt sucks in air, compresses it, burns fuel to expand the gas, and blasts it out the back at high speed; the reaction pushes the plane forward, the same principle as a rocket or rowing.�ans��src��@Hill & Peterson，《推进的力学与热力学》（第2版）�GHill & Peterson, 'Mechanics and Thermodynamics of Propulsion' (2nd ed.)��id�20d1d378fd0e�body���离心泵靠高速旋转的叶轮把动能转化为压力，流量随压力变化大，适合大流量低扬程；容积泵靠腔体容积周期性变化挤送液体，压力高、流量稳定，适合高粘度和精密计量。��A centrifugal pump spins an impeller to convert kinetic energy to pressure and varies flow with pressure, suiting high flow. A positive-displacement pump traps and squeezes fluid, giving steady high-pressure flow for viscous or metered duty.�ans��src��'White，《流体力学》（第8版）�"White, 'Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�21a82fc510b6�body���注塑机把塑料颗粒加热熔融，在螺杆推动下高速注入闭合的模具型腔，保压补缩后冷却定型，最后开模顶出制品。翘曲主要源于冷却不均和收缩不均：制品各部位壁厚不同导致冷却速度不同，分子取向和各向异性收缩使内应力不对称释放，从而发生弯曲变形。解决措施包括均匀壁厚设计、优化浇口位置和模具温度场、合理调整保压工艺。�9An injection moulding machine melts plastic pellets, injects the melt at high speed into a closed cavity, holds pressure to pack the part, cools until it solidifies, then opens the mould and ejects the product. Warpage comes mainly from uneven cooling and shrinkage: varying wall thickness gives different cooling rates, and molecular orientation plus anisotropic shrinkage releases internal stress asymmetrically, bending the part. Countermeasures include uniform wall design, optimised gate positions and mould temperature fields, and adjusted hold-pressure profiles.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�22806a7e4f99�body���深空通信靠窄波束射电和极高的接收灵敏度。旅行者号以约8千兆赫的X波段发射约20瓦信号，信号按距离平方衰减，到达地球时功率已低至约10的负19次方瓦，但NASA直径70米的大天线把零星光子一点点收集起来，再靠信道编码纠错把信噪比极低的信号"救"回来。由于单程信号要飞二十多个小时，地面还必须用深空测控网（DSN）分布在三大洲的天线接力跟踪。�Deep-space links use narrow radio beams and extreme receiver sensitivity. Voyager transmits about 20 watts at X-band near 8 GHz; the signal fades as the square of distance and arrives at Earth at roughly 1e-19 watts, yet NASA's 70-meter antennas accumulate those few photons, and channel coding and error correction recover data from a signal far below the noise floor. With a one-way light time of over twenty hours, ground stations must also hand the spacecraft over across the three Deep Space Network (DSN) sites as Earth rotates.�ans��src��+Clarke 1945（地球静止轨道）；Wertz�AClarke (1945, geostationary orbit); Wertz, Space Mission Analysis��id�229af71c87f5�body���那是一个调谐质量阻尼器，由钢球、弹簧和液压装置组成。当大楼因风或地震晃动时，它向反方向摆动，吸收并抵消部分振动能量，减小顶层摆幅，提升舒适与安全。��It is a tuned mass damper—a steel mass with springs and dampers. As the tower sways from wind or quake, the mass swings opposite, absorbing energy and reducing top-floor motion for comfort and safety.�ans��src��+Chopra，《结构动力学》（第5版）�*Chopra, 'Dynamics of Structures' (5th ed.)��id�22b86dd0fe03�body��J电推进用电场把氙等工质加速到 20–40 km/s 的排气速度，比化学火箭高一个数量级，按齐奥尔科夫斯基公式，获得同样速度增量所需的推进剂质量因此大幅减少，比冲可达 3000 s 以上。推力虽小，却能连续工作数千小时乃至数年，把微小加速度累积成几公里每秒的速度增量，非常适合无阻力环境下的深空巡航与卫星位置保持。代价是必须携带大功率太阳能电池阵和电源处理单元，加速缓慢、无法用于快速逃逸机动，栅极溅射侵蚀还限制寿命。��Electric propulsion accelerates xenon or similar propellant electrostatically to exhaust speeds of 20–40 km/s, an order of magnitude above chemical rockets, so by the Tsiolkovsky equation the propellant mass for a given velocity change drops sharply and specific impulse exceeds 3000 s. Thrust is tiny but can run for thousands of hours or years, accumulating small accelerations into several km/s of delta-v, which suits drag-free deep-space cruise and satellite station keeping. The costs are large solar arrays and power processing units, slow acceleration unusable for quick escape manoeuvres, and grid erosion by ion sputtering limiting operating life.�ans��src��iGoebel 与 Katz，《Fundamentals of Electric Propulsion: Ion and Hall Thrusters》（JPL/Wiley，2008）�^Goebel & Katz, 'Fundamentals of Electric Propulsion: Ion and Hall Thrusters' (JPL/Wiley, 2008)��id�2344a1278af2�body���状态空间用一组一阶微分方程 x' = Ax + Bu、y = Cx + Du 描述系统，可处理多输入多输出、非线性与任意初始条件。传递函数是线性时不变系统的频域输入输出比值，通常只适用于单输入单输出。�State space describes a system by first-order equations x' = Ax + Bu and y = Cx + Du, handling MIMO, nonlinear, and arbitrary initial conditions. A transfer function is the frequency-domain input-output ratio of a linear time-invariant system and is usually limited to SISO.�ans��src��7Ogata《现代控制工程》；IEEE 控制系统学会�AOgata, 'Modern Control Engineering'; IEEE Control Systems Society��id�23a2a8579a3e�body���线性经济是『开采—制造—丢弃』，循环经济强调减量化、再利用、再循环，让材料和产品在设计上可循环，延长使用寿命、减少废物和原生资源消耗。ٲLinear economy is take–make–dump; circular economy stresses reduce, reuse, recycle so materials loop back by design, extending life and cutting waste and virgin resource use.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�23abd457c5c8�body���磁悬浮利用电磁力对抗重力。常导型（EMS）靠车底电磁铁与轨道铁磁轨之间的吸引力把车体吸起来，悬浮间隙仅约1厘米，必须实时控制防止"吸死"；超导型（EDS）如日本L0列车，则用超导磁体在轨道线圈中感应出强大的排斥力，悬浮间隙更大且天然稳定。没有轮轨接触摩擦后，阻力只剩空气阻力，所以时速可达500公里以上，噪声和磨损也大幅下降。��Maglev uses electromagnetic force to beat gravity. Electromagnetic suspension (EMS) levitates by the attractive force between onboard magnets and ferromagnetic rails, holding a gap of only about 1 cm under real-time control to avoid contact. Superconducting EDS, as in Japan's L0, induces strong repulsion in track coils and floats with a larger, inherently stable gap. With no wheel-rail contact, the only drag left is air resistance, so speeds exceed 500 km/h with far less noise and wear.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�253de1603748�body��VTOL 无需跑道即可起降，适合狭小平台与城市空运；但悬停时升力完全由旋翼提供、气动效率远低于巡航，导致能耗高、航时航程受限。近年电动垂直起降（eVTOL）通过分布式推进试图在续航与便捷间折中。�:VTOL needs no runway, suiting confined sites and urban air mobility, but during hover all lift comes from rotors at far lower aerodynamic efficiency than cruise, raising energy use and limiting endurance and range. Electric VTOL (eVTOL) with distributed propulsion seeks a compromise between range and convenience.�ans��src��1Seddon《直升机空气动力学基础》；NASA�+Seddon, Basic Helicopter Aerodynamics; NASA��id�26095292434b�body��#随着数据流量激增，传统电互连在带宽密度和能耗上接近极限。硅光子把激光器、调制器、探测器等光学元件集成到硅芯片上，用光而非电信号在芯片间传输数据，可在更低功耗下实现每通道数十到数百 Gbps 的互连带宽。�6As data traffic surges, electrical interconnects approach limits in bandwidth density and energy. Silicon photonics integrates lasers, modulators, and detectors on a silicon chip and moves data between chips with light rather than electricity, enabling tens to hundreds of Gbps per channel at much lower power.�ans��src��+Nature Photonics（硅光子集成综述）�7Nature Photonics (silicon photonics integration review)��id�2682c0bf3120�body��k墙后填土在自重作用下有沿潜在滑动面下滑的趋势，对墙体产生水平方向的主动土压力，墙体必须依靠自重、基底摩擦和埋深来抵抗倾覆与滑移。悬臂式挡土墙由立板、底板和趾板组成，利用底板上的覆土重量帮助稳定，比重力式挡墙轻省材料，适用于中等高度的挡墙工程。��Behind a retaining wall, the backfill tends to slide along a potential failure surface, exerting active earth pressure on the wall, which must resist overturning and sliding through its own weight, base friction and embedment. A cantilever retaining wall consists of a stem, a base slab and a toe, using the weight of soil over the heel to help stabilise the structure; it is lighter and more material-efficient than a gravity wall and suits walls of moderate height.�ans��src��+Das，《岩土工程原理》（第9版）�7Das, 'Principles of Geotechnical Engineering' (9th ed.)��id�26c374dd7f6a�body�ً漏保实时比较火线和零线电流，差值（漏向大地）超阈值就毫秒级跳闸；TEST键模拟漏电确认它还能动作。ـAn RCD compares live and neutral currents and trips if leakage to ground exceeds a threshold; the test button simulates a fault.�ans��src�ٕ国际电工委员会（IEC）,《Residual current operated circuit-breakers for household and similar use》,IEC 61008/61009 (DOI: 10.3403/30326912)�wIEC, 'Residual current operated circuit-breakers for household and similar use', IEC 61008/61009, DOI: 10.3403/30326912��id�2852800a8b18�body��Z螺栓靠拧紧产生的预紧力把结合面压紧，只要横向振动让结合面出现微小相对滑移，螺纹间的摩擦锁定就被短暂破坏，螺旋面于是一点点回退，预紧力逐次衰减直至完全松脱，这一机制在 Junker 横向振动试验中被清楚复现。弹簧垫圈依靠切口棱边咬入被连接件，实测防松效果有限，压平后甚至会降低连接的有效刚度。可靠做法是保证足够的预紧力和夹紧长度、采用楔形齿垫圈或全金属预载锁紧螺母、加螺纹胶或机械止动件，并用扭矩加转角法控制装配。��A bolt works through the preload clamping the joint faces, and if transverse vibration lets those faces slip microscopically the thread friction lock is momentarily lost, the helix backs off a little each cycle and preload decays until the nut runs free — the mechanism reproduced in the Junker transverse-vibration test. Split spring washers rely on their cut edges biting the parts, test poorly as locking devices and can even reduce effective joint stiffness once flattened. Dependable practice is high preload with adequate clamp length, wedge-tooth washers or all-metal prevailing-torque nuts, thread adhesive or positive mechanical locking, and torque-plus-angle tightening control.�ans��src��YBickford，《An Introduction to the Design and Behavior of Bolted Joints》（第4版）�QBickford, 'An Introduction to the Design and Behavior of Bolted Joints' (4th ed.)��id�29e49f704ed4�body�ٺ屈服强度是材料开始发生明显塑性变形（永久变形）时的最小应力。超过它就回不到原状，所以结构设计通常以屈服强度为安全承载的界限。ٯYield strength is the stress at which a material begins permanent plastic deformation. Beyond it the shape won't recover, so engineers use it as the safe load limit in design.�ans��src��3美国材料与试验协会（ASTM International）�ASTM International��id�2aa3b2db19ba�body�ٺ视距是驾驶员能看清前方路面障碍并安全停车或避让的最短距离。弯道和纵坡设计必须保证足够视距，否则容易引发追尾和冲出道路的事故。��Sight distance is the shortest length over which a driver can see an obstacle ahead and stop or avoid it safely. Curve and grade design must guarantee enough sight distance, or rear-end and run-off-road crashes become likely.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�2b58c3864c3c�body���BMS负责采集每节电芯的电压、电流和温度，据此估算荷电状态（SOC）与健康状态（SOH），并在过充、过放、过温或过流时切断回路保护电池。由于制造差异和使用环境不同，电芯容量会逐渐离散，若不均衡，短板电芯会过早到达充放电边界而限制整个电池包，所以BMS通过被动或主动均衡使各电芯趋于一致，延长电池寿命。��A BMS measures per-cell voltage, current and temperature, estimates state of charge (SOC) and state of health (SOH), and disconnects the pack on overcharge, over-discharge, over-temperature or over-current. Because of manufacturing variance and uneven operating conditions, cell capacities drift apart over time; without balancing the weakest cell hits its charge or discharge limit early and limits the whole pack, so the BMS uses passive or active balancing to keep cells matched and extend battery life.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�2c81cfbf3e1a�body���比例项按当前误差大小快速响应，积分项消除长期稳态误差，微分项根据误差变化速度提前抑制超调。三者配合能在速度和稳定之间取得良好平衡。��The proportional term responds quickly to the current error, the integral term removes long-term steady error, and the derivative term anticipates overshoot by the error's rate of change. Together they balance speed and stability well.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�2e50a62dc8e9�body�ٽ喷气发动机从大气中吸入空气作为氧化剂来燃烧燃料，因此只能在有空气处工作。火箭发动机自带氧化剂，不依赖空气，所以可用于太空飞行。��A jet engine draws air from the atmosphere as oxidizer to burn fuel, so it only works where air exists. A rocket carries its own oxidizer and does not depend on air, enabling it to operate in space.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�2e5b8f4539d8�body��+上游风机从气流中取走动能后，后方形成风速降低、湍流增强的尾流区，尾流要靠与周围空气掺混才逐渐恢复，恢复距离常达叶轮直径的若干倍到十几倍。由于风功率与风速三次方成正比，尾流里风速降低百分之十几就可能让发电量下降三成，整场累计的阵列损失常在百分之几到二十左右。因此布机时要沿主导风向拉大行距并错列排布，还可用尾流偏航控制让前排略微偏航，牺牲自身一点出力换取全场总发电量提升。��A turbine extracts kinetic energy from the flow and leaves a wake of reduced wind speed and raised turbulence that recovers only by mixing with surrounding air, typically over several to more than ten rotor diameters. Because power varies with the cube of wind speed, a wake deficit of a little over ten percent can cut a machine's output by about a third, and whole-farm array losses commonly run from a few percent to roughly twenty percent. Layouts therefore stretch spacing along the prevailing wind and stagger rows, and wake-steering control deliberately yaws upstream machines slightly, sacrificing their own output to raise total farm production.�ans��src��eManwell、McGowan、Rogers，《Wind Energy Explained: Theory, Design and Application》（第2版）�\Manwell, McGowan & Rogers, 'Wind Energy Explained: Theory, Design and Application' (2nd ed.)��id�306452bbc49b�body���位置控只管走到指定坐标，硬碰硬易卡死或撞坏；力控则把接触力作为目标，让末端柔顺地贴合并顺误差滑入。插孔时微妙的侧向力正是引导对正的信号。��Position control only reaches set coordinates and can jam or crash; force control makes contact force the target so the end-effector compliantly mates and slides in. The subtle sideways force during insertion is exactly the signal that guides alignment.�ans��src��?Craig，《机器人学导论：力学与控制》（第4版）�BCraig, 'Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control' (4th ed.)��id�30ca920347b5�body���直流电方向始终不变（如电池），交流电方向和大小周期性来回变化（如家用插座）。交流便于用变压器升压远距离输送，直流适合电子设备和储能。ٶDC flows one way steadily, like a battery; AC reverses direction periodically, like wall outlets. AC is easy to step up for long transmission, while DC suits electronics and storage.�ans��src��-Nilsson & Riedel，《电路》（第11版）�0Nilsson & Riedel, 'Electric Circuits' (11th ed.)��id�310c5fc01b27�body���蒸馏要靠加热汽化再冷凝，耗能巨大；膜靠压力让小分子透过、大分子留下，通常不需相变。对盐水脱盐、气体分离尤其节能，且设备紧凑易放大。��Distillation boils then condenses, costing huge energy; membranes let small molecules pass under pressure while holding larger ones, usually without phase change. For desalination and gas separation it saves energy and packs compactly.�ans��src��AMcCabe、Smith & Harriott，《化工单元操作》（第7版）�MMcCabe, Smith & Harriott, 'Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering' (7th ed.)��id�336e152e15d1�body���放宽静稳定度可减少配平阻力、提高机动性，但飞机本身趋于不稳定。电传操纵由飞行控制计算机持续微调舵面来稳定飞行，因而在战斗机与客机（如 A320）上广泛应用。�5Relaxed static stability reduces trim drag and improves maneuverability, but makes the airframe naturally unstable. Fly-by-wire systems use flight-control computers to continuously trim the control surfaces and stabilize the aircraft, so the approach is widely used in fighters and airliners such as the A320.�ans��src��L美国航空航天学会（AIAA）；Etkin & Reid《飞机飞行动力学》�tAmerican Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics (AIAA); Etkin & Reid, 'Dynamics of Flight: Stability and Control'��id�33b223d5098f�body�ٟ把塑料粒加热熔成液体，用螺杆高压射进模具空腔，冷却凝固后开模取出，就能大批量、快速地做出形状一样的塑料件。ٝPlastic pellets are melted, then forced under high pressure into a mold cavity, cooled solid, and ejected, enabling fast, identical mass production of parts.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�34bb0db72d32�body���光纤由高折射率的纤芯和低折射率的包层组成，光以大于临界角的角度入射到纤芯与包层界面时发生全内反射，光被囚禁在纤芯中沿轴向传播而几乎不进入包层。临界角由两种介质的折射率差决定，所以只要纤芯折射率高于包层且入射角足够大，光就能以极低损耗传输。再加上低损耗材料和光放大器补偿衰减，光纤可实现上百公里的中继距离。�cAn optical fibre has a high-index core and a lower-index cladding; light striking the core-cladding interface at more than the critical angle undergoes total internal reflection and stays trapped in the core, travelling along the axis with almost no loss into the cladding. The critical angle is set by the refractive-index contrast, so as long as the core index exceeds the cladding's and the incidence angle is large enough, light propagates with very low loss. Combined with low-loss materials and optical amplifiers that compensate attenuation, fibre achieves repeater spans of a hundred kilometres or more.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�3677af1a0919�body��\静止瞬间转子与旋转磁场的相对速度最大，转子感应电动势高、频率等于电源频率，此时等效电路中转子回路以漏抗为主而代表负载的等效电阻很小，整机呈现低阻抗，堵转电流可达额定的五到八倍。这股冲击电流会造成电网电压跌落、干扰邻近设备，同时带来剧烈的转矩冲击和绕组温升。工程上用星-三角启动、自耦变压器降压、晶闸管软启动器或变频器把启动电流限制到两三倍以内，代价是启动转矩按电压平方下降，必须仍然大于负载的启动阻力矩。��At standstill the relative speed between rotor and rotating field is maximal, rotor emf is high and at line frequency, so in the equivalent circuit the rotor branch is dominated by leakage reactance with only a small load-representing resistance, leaving low total impedance and locked-rotor current about five to eight times rated. That inrush sags the supply voltage and disturbs nearby equipment while imposing severe torque shock and winding heating. Star-delta, autotransformer, thyristor soft starters or variable-frequency drives limit starting current to roughly two or three times rated, at the cost of starting torque falling with the square of voltage, which must still exceed the load's breakaway torque.�ans��src��EFitzgerald、Kingsley、Umans，《Electric Machinery》（第7版）�<Fitzgerald, Kingsley & Umans, 'Electric Machinery' (7th ed.)��id�36a0be7f31e7�body���锻造通过压力使金属在固态下塑性变形，打碎铸态的粗大晶粒和枝晶偏析，形成沿变形方向延伸的纤维组织，并消除内部疏松，因此强度和韧性通常高于铸造件。锻造温度范围要选在再结晶温度以上以保证变形能力，又低于过烧温度以防晶界氧化甚至熔化，常用材料都规定了合适的始锻温度和终锻温度。��Forging deforms metal plastically in the solid state, breaking up coarse as-cast grains and dendritic segregation, creating fibre flow aligned with the deformation, and closing internal porosity, so strength and toughness generally exceed those of castings. The forging window sits above the recrystallisation temperature for workability but below the burning temperature where grain boundaries oxidise or melt; standard tables give start and finish forging temperatures for each alloy.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�36c85bde9d0e�body���缓存是靠近处理器的小容量高速存储器，存放近期或即将用到的数据，避免频繁访问慢速主存。处理器先查缓存，命中即可极快取得，从而整体提速。��Cache is a small fast memory near the processor holding recently or soon-needed data, avoiding slow main-memory trips. The CPU checks cache first; a hit is extremely fast, speeding the whole system.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�37a80a2731e2�body���人工湿地模拟自然湿地，污水流经基质、植物和附着微生物，靠物理拦截、植物吸收与微生物降解共同去除氮磷和有机物，运行能耗低、景观好。��Constructed wetlands mimic nature: water passes through substrate, plants, and biofilms where physical trapping, plant uptake, and microbial breakdown remove nitrogen, phosphorus, and organics at low energy.�ans��src��lNFPA 消防与给水排水规范（NFPA 13/14/25/101）；Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程：处理与回用》�iNFPA fire/plumbing codes (NFPA 13/14/25/101); Metcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering: Treatment and Reuse��id�37f84b0e98a3�body��向海洋添加碎石灰岩、橄榄石等碱性矿物或电解提升碱度，可促使海水更多溶解并长期封存大气二氧化碳，同时缓解海洋酸化。该方法理论容量巨大，但需谨慎评估对海洋生态、沉积与碳核算的潜在影响。�SAdding alkaline minerals such as crushed limestone or olivine, or electrochemically raising alkalinity, lets seawater dissolve and durably store more atmospheric CO2 while easing ocean acidification. The theoretical capacity is huge, but potential effects on marine ecology, sedimentation, and carbon accounting must be carefully assessed.�ans��src���Zheng 等,《Ocean alkalinity enhancement as a technology of ocean negative carbon emission: status, potential, and challenges》,Marine Environmental Science,2026 (DOI: 10.3724/j.1007-6336.2026-0013)��Zheng et al., 'Ocean alkalinity enhancement as a technology of ocean negative carbon emission: status, potential, and challenges', Marine Environmental Science, 2026, DOI: 10.3724/j.1007-6336.2026-0013��id�382510060fca�body���FEA把复杂结构离散成大量小单元，用计算机求解每个单元的受力与变形，再拼成整体响应，从而预测应力、应变和位移，替代或补充昂贵的实体试验。��FEA splits a structure into many small elements and computes each one's force and deformation, assembling them into the whole response to predict stress, strain, and displacement—replacing or supplementing costly tests.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�3987c45af144�body��主要挑战是在柔软脑组织与刚性电极之间维持长期稳定且高保真的信号记录。异物反应会形成瘢痕包裹电极、抬高阻抗并衰减信号，因此研究转向柔性、微纳电极阵列与生物相容涂层，以延长可用寿命并提高通道数。�eThe main challenge is maintaining long-term stable, high-fidelity recording between soft brain tissue and rigid electrodes. The foreign-body response forms scar tissue that encapsulates electrodes, raising impedance and weakening signals, so research turns to flexible micro-nano arrays and biocompatible coatings to extend lifetime and raise channel count.�ans��src��,Nature Biotechnology（神经接口技术）�2Nature Biotechnology (neural interface technology)��id�3a2caded32aa�body�ٺ厌氧消化在无氧条件下靠厌氧微生物把有机物分解成甲烷和二氧化碳为主的沼气，同时减量污泥。沼气可作能源，是废物资源化的常用技术。ٽAnaerobic digestion lets microbes break organics into biogas—mainly methane and CO2—without oxygen, while reducing sludge. The biogas is usable energy, a common waste-to-resource route.�ans��src��6《水污染控制工程》（高等教育出版社）�'Metcalf and Eddy Wastewater Engineering��id�3b982092c782�body��p那是调谐质量阻尼器（TMD）。风或地震让大楼摇晃时，悬挂的重球以相反相位摆动，其惯性力把大楼的振动能量"吸收"掉。球的质量、吊杆长度须与建筑固有频率精确匹配（调谐）：楼晃得越大，球摆得越凶，抵消得越多。台北101的阻尼器重约660吨，能让楼顶位移减小三到四成。��That is a tuned mass damper (TMD). When wind or a quake makes the tower sway, the suspended ball swings in opposite phase, and its inertia force absorbs the building's vibrational energy. The ball's mass and suspension length must be precisely tuned to the structure's natural frequency: the harder the building sways, the harder the ball swings back, canceling more motion. Taipei 101's damper weighs about 660 tonnes and cuts roof displacement by 30-40%.�ans��src��+Chopra，《结构动力学》（第5版）�*Chopra, 'Dynamics of Structures' (5th ed.)��id�3c16b09816bf�body���卫星用激光或微波直接互相对接通信，数据在太空里一跳跳转发，不必每颗都连地面。这样即使地面站少、极地海洋也能联网，延时更低、覆盖更稳。��Satellites link directly by laser or microwave and relay data hop-by-hop in space without each touching ground. Even with few ground stations, polar oceans get connected, with lower latency and steadier coverage.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版航空与航天分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�gTen Thousand Whys: Aviation and Aerospace volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�3e09b96c63ef�body���心脏瓣膜每天开关约十万次，主动脉瓣闭合瞬间要承受约120毫米汞柱的跨瓣压差和急速反向的血流冲击。人工瓣膜分机械瓣（热解碳双叶瓣）与生物瓣（猪或牛心包瓣）：机械瓣寿命长但需终身服用抗凝药，生物瓣血流更接近生理、可减少抗凝，但十年左右可能钙化退化。设计的关键在于低湍流、低剪切的血流动力学和极高的疲劳寿命。�/A heart valve opens and closes about 100,000 times a day, and the aortic valve slams shut against a pressure difference of about 120 mmHg and fast reversing blood flow. Artificial valves come in two types: mechanical (bileaflet pyrolytic carbon) and biological (porcine or bovine pericardium). Mechanical valves last long but require lifelong anticoagulation; tissue valves flow more naturally with less anticoagulation but may calcify and fail within about a decade. The design challenges are low-turbulence, low-shear hemodynamics and enormous fatigue life.�ans��src��_Ratner、Hoffman、Schoen & Lemons，《生物材料科学：医用材料导论》（第3版）�lRatner, Hoffman, Schoen & Lemons, 'Biomaterials Science: An Introduction to Materials in Medicine' (3rd ed.)��id�3e205e3792a8�body���复合材料由两种或多种性能不同的材料组合而成，常是强韧的纤维嵌入较软的基体中。碳纤维增强塑料就是典型例子，又轻又强，广泛用于飞机和赛车。��A composite combines two or more materials with different properties, often strong fibers embedded in a softer matrix. Carbon-fiber-reinforced plastic is a classic example: light and strong, it is widely used in aircraft and race cars.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�3fcc6217eaa2�body��k力线流过孔、尖角等截面突变处时会绕行拥挤，局部应力远高于平均应力，这就是应力集中。应力集中系数可达2-3甚至更高，当孔边应力超过材料强度，裂纹就在这里萌生。所以飞机舷窗从方角改成圆角、轴肩用圆弧过渡，正是为了让力线平滑通过、把应力集中系数降下来。��Force lines bunch up when they have to flow around holes, corners, or notches, so the local stress far exceeds the average — a phenomenon called stress concentration. The concentration factor can reach 2-3 or more, and cracks nucleate where the local stress overshoots the material's strength. That is why airplane windows were rounded and shaft shoulders use fillets: they smooth the force flow and lower the concentration factor.�ans��src��《机械设计基础》�Fundamentals of Machine Design��id�4014de996947�body�ٴ电容器是由两块导体和中间的绝缘介质组成的元件，能够储存和释放电荷。它在电路中用于滤波、耦合信号、定时以及瞬间提供大电流。��A capacitor is a component of two conductors separated by an insulating dielectric that can store and release electric charge. In circuits it is used for filtering, signal coupling, timing, and delivering brief bursts of high current.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�42d5f970f619�body���隧道封闭空间里汽车尾气会积累一氧化碳等有害气体，且火灾时浓烟致命。通风系统持续把新鲜空气送进来、把污浊和烟气排出，保证能见度和人员逃生条件。��In an enclosed tunnel, vehicle exhaust builds up carbon monoxide and smoke is deadly in fire. Ventilation constantly supplies fresh air and exhausts pollutants and smoke, preserving visibility and escape conditions.�ans��src��@美国联邦公路管理局（FHWA），《公路隧道通风》�%US FHWA, 'Highway Tunnel Ventilation'��id�43a4f5a6c912�body��t摩擦桩主要依靠桩身表面与土体之间的摩擦力承载，适用于软土层较厚而硬层较深的场地；端承桩则把荷载直接传递到桩端下方的坚硬持力层，侧摩阻力只占次要地位。选择取决于地层条件：端承桩要求桩端落在稳定的岩层或密实砂砾层上，摩擦桩依靠足够长的桩身提供总摩阻力。��A friction pile carries load mainly through skin friction between the pile shaft and the surrounding soil and suits sites where the soft layer is thick and the hard stratum deep; an end-bearing pile transmits load directly to a firm stratum beneath the pile toe, with shaft friction playing a secondary role. The choice depends on ground conditions: end-bearing piles need the tip to rest on rock or dense gravel, while friction piles rely on sufficient shaft length to develop the total frictional resistance.�ans��src��K《建筑桩基技术规范》JGJ 94-2008 ; 另见: ASCE (Deep Foundations)�MASCE (Deep Foundations) ; see also: 《建筑桩基技术规范》JGJ 94-2008��id�43af08c76bfa�body���智能电网在传统电网中加入传感、通信和自动控制，能实时监测潮流、快速隔离故障、接纳分布式发电并引导需求响应，使供电更可靠、高效和灵活。��A smart grid adds sensing, communications, and automation to the traditional grid, monitoring flows in real time, isolating faults fast, integrating distributed generation, and enabling demand response for reliability.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�43c673906dff�body�ٿ模数 m = 分度圆直径 / 齿数，单位为 mm，是齿轮齿大小的基准参数。相互啮合的齿轮必须具有相同模数；模数越大，齿越大越厚、承载能力越强。��The module m equals the pitch diameter divided by the number of teeth, in mm, and is the basic measure of tooth size. Meshing gears must share the same module; a larger module gives bigger, stronger teeth and higher load capacity.�ans��src��N美国齿轮制造商协会（AGMA）标准；ISO 6336《齿轮强度计算》�oAmerican Gear Manufacturers Association (AGMA) standards; ISO 6336 'Calculation of Load Capacity of Spur Gears'��id�43c892f55ba0�body��)液流电池把能量储存在外部电解液罐中，功率由电堆决定、容量由电解液体积决定，二者可独立扩展。因此储能时长只需增加电解液即可延长，且不易发生热失控，循环寿命长、安全性高，适合电网级调峰与可再生能源平抑。�CFlow batteries store energy in external electrolyte tanks, with power set by the stack and capacity by the electrolyte volume, which scale independently. Storage duration is extended simply by adding electrolyte, with low thermal-runaway risk, long cycle life, and high safety, suiting grid peaking and renewable smoothing.�ans��src��(Nature Energy（大规模储能技术）�0Nature Energy (large-scale storage technologies)��id�43fb98eb839f�body���生物反应器为微生物或细胞提供受控的温度、供氧和营养环境，让其在发酵或培养中转化原料。它用于生产抗生素、疫苗、啤酒和废水生物处理。ٱA bioreactor gives microbes or cells controlled temperature, oxygen, and nutrients to convert feedstocks—used to make antibiotics, vaccines, beer, and in wastewater treatment.�ans��src�ق美国微生物学会（ASM）发酵与微生物代谢教学专题；Adams 与 Moss《食品微生物学》（Food Microbiology）هAmerican Society for Microbiology (ASM), fermentation and microbial metabolism education; Adams, M.R. & Moss, M.O., 'Food Microbiology'��id�44552d8de169�body�ٰ光伏电池用半导体PN结吸收光子，使电子受激跃迁产生电子—空穴对，在内建电场作用下分离并向两极移动，形成可对外输出的电流。ٰA PV cell's semiconductor junction absorbs photons, exciting electrons into electron–hole pairs that a built-in field separates and drives to the terminals, yielding current.�ans��src��@Luque & Hegedus，《光伏科学与技术手册》（第2版）�MLuque & Hegedus, 'Handbook of Photovoltaic Science and Engineering' (2nd ed.)��id�460b6b79d151�body��塔机吊臂在侧风下承受很大的风压力矩，如果锁死回转机构，这个力矩就全部由塔身承担，可能使标准节、附墙件或基础超载。松开回转刹车后，吊臂像风向标一样自动转到风阻最小的位置（通常起重臂顺风、平衡臂迎风），风载对塔身的扭矩和倾覆弯矩显著减小。因此非工作状态的风载校核就是按自由回转工况进行的，规范同时规定停止作业与撤离的风速阈值、锚固方式以及吊钩和小车的收起状态。��A crane's jib picks up a large wind moment in a crosswind, and locking the slewing mechanism forces the tower, mast sections, tie-ins and foundation to carry all of it, which can overload them. Releasing the slew brake lets the jib weathervane into the position of least resistance — typically jib downwind and counter-jib into the wind — greatly reducing torsion and overturning moment on the tower. Out-of-service wind loads are therefore assessed for the free-slewing condition, and standards also set wind-speed thresholds for stopping work and evacuating, tie-down arrangements and the required stowed position of hook and trolley.�ans��src��b国际标准化组织（ISO）,《Cranes. Wind load assessment》,ISO 4302 (DOI: 10.3403/30274852)�DISO, 'Cranes. Wind load assessment', ISO 4302, DOI: 10.3403/30274852��id�46d5b0867dd1�body�ٽ在只有自重作用时，柔软缆索自然下垂成悬链线，这种形状让缆内几乎全是拉力且分布最均匀，用料最省、最安全；受桥面荷载后接近抛物线。٫Under its own weight a flexible cable naturally hangs in a catenary, a shape where the tension is nearly uniform and most efficient; deck load shifts it toward a parabola.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�497a5fadfd52�body���工业4.0以信息物理系统（CPS）为核心，把物理工厂与数字世界连接，实现设备互联、数据驱动的智能制造和柔性化生产。数字孪生是物理资产的实时虚拟镜像，通过传感器数据持续同步状态，可用来仿真预测、故障诊断、工艺优化和虚拟调试：先在孪生体上试验新方案，确认无误再应用到物理系统，降低试错成本。��Industry 4.0 centres on cyber-physical systems (CPS) that connect the physical factory with the digital world, enabling machine interconnection, data-driven smart manufacturing and flexible production. A digital twin is a live virtual mirror of a physical asset, continuously synced by sensor data; it supports simulation, fault diagnosis, process optimisation and virtual commissioning, new schemes are tested on the twin first and only applied to the real system once verified, cutting trial-and-error cost.�ans��src��=德国国家科学与工程院（acatech，工业4.0平台）�!acatech (Plattform Industrie 4.0)��id�49a189301652�body���GEO卫星在赤道上空约35786公里，周期与地球自转同步，对地静止，单星覆盖广、终端不用跟踪，但单跳延迟约250毫秒（上行加下行）且链路功率要求高。LEO卫星轨道高度仅几百到两千公里，单跳延迟可降到几十毫秒，信号损耗也小，但单星覆盖小，必须组网并频繁切换卫星来维持连续覆盖，这是Starlink等星座的思路。� GEO satellites sit about 35,786 km above the equator with an orbital period matching Earth's rotation, so they appear fixed, cover a huge area and need no terminal tracking, but one hop has roughly 250 ms latency and needs high link power. LEO satellites orbit at a few hundred to 2,000 km, cutting one-hop latency to tens of milliseconds with far less path loss, yet each satellite covers little ground, so a constellation and frequent handovers are required to maintain continuous coverage, the approach taken by Starlink and similar systems.�ans��src��+Clarke 1945（地球静止轨道）；Wertz�AClarke (1945, geostationary orbit); Wertz, Space Mission Analysis��id�49cdb3b901eb�body���冗余度指结构在局部构件失效后仍能依靠其他路径继续承重的能力。冗余度高的结构对偶然荷载或损伤不敏感，能防止连续倒塌，是稳健设计的重要原则。��Redundancy is a structure's ability to keep carrying load through alternate paths after a local member fails. Highly redundant structures resist progressive collapse under accidental loads or damage, a key principle of robust design.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�4b3b4f41b038�body�ٍ堤坝是用土石堆成的高墙，把河水限制在河道里；内部常铺防渗层和排水，防止水渗过去把堤身泡软冲垮。ٗA levee is an earthen wall keeping river water inside its channel; an impermeable core and drainage stop seepage from softening and breaching the bank.�ans��src��D美国陆军工程兵团，EM 1110-2-1913《堤防设计与施工》�OUS Army Corps of Engineers, 'EM 1110-2-1913, Design and Construction of Levees'��id�4b672649d133�body��N强度等级以标准立方体（边长150 mm）在28天龄期的抗压强度标准值表示，C30即代表该值为30 MPa。混凝土由脆性的水泥石基体构成，受压时骨料与基体协同承载，受拉时微裂纹极易扩展，故抗拉强度通常只有抗压强度的8%–15%，因此工程上用钢筋承担拉力。�tThe grade denotes the characteristic 28-day compressive strength of a standard 150 mm cube, so C30 means 30 MPa. Concrete is a brittle cementitious matrix that carries compression well via aggregate-matrix interaction but cracks easily under tension, so its tensile strength is only about 8%–15% of its compressive strength; steel reinforcement is used to carry tension.�ans��src�ُ美国混凝土学会（ACI）ACI 318《结构混凝土建筑规范要求》；Mehta & Monteiro《混凝土：微观结构、性能与材料》٧American Concrete Institute (ACI) ACI 318 'Building Code Requirements for Structural Concrete'; Mehta & Monteiro, 'Concrete: Microstructure, Properties, and Materials'��id�4bdb1d4ebfc9�body��选择性要求只切除故障所在的最小区段，让上级电源和无关线路继续供电。定时限或反时限过流保护无法仅凭电流判断故障究竟在本级还是下级，于是越靠电源侧的保护设置越长的动作延时（典型级差 0.3–0.5 s），下级先动作、上级只在下级失灵时作为后备跳闸。缺点是靠近电源处故障电流最大而延时最长，因此重要线路改用距离保护、差动保护或纵联通道实现快速的分区选择，把时间级差留给后备保护。��Selectivity means tripping only the smallest zone containing the fault so healthy feeders keep supplying load. Definite- or inverse-time overcurrent relays cannot tell from current alone whether a fault lies in their own zone or downstream, so relays nearer the source get progressively longer delays, typically 0.3–0.5 s per step, letting the downstream device clear first while the upstream one trips only as backup. The drawback is that the largest fault currents sit where delays are longest, so important circuits use distance, differential or pilot-channel protection for fast unit selectivity and keep time grading for backup duty.�ans��src��YBlackburn 与 Domin，《Protective Relaying: Principles and Applications》（第4版）�OBlackburn & Domin, 'Protective Relaying: Principles and Applications' (4th ed.)��id�4c443cd903cc�body���半导体是导电能力介于导体和绝缘体之间的材料，硅是最常见的半导体。二极管是一种只允许电流单向通过的半导体器件，常用于整流、保护和信号处理。�A semiconductor is a material whose conductivity lies between that of a conductor and an insulator, with silicon being the most common. A diode is a semiconductor device that lets current pass in only one direction, used for rectification, protection, and signal processing.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�4d776bc16b98�body���Devol 在 1954 年申请了可编程搬运装置专利，Engelberger 把它商业化推出 Unimate，1961 年进入通用汽车生产线；随后 PUMA 等标准化机型确立了六轴构型。这奠定了现代工业机器人产业。��Devol filed a patent for a programmable transfer device in 1954; Engelberger commercialized it as Unimate, which entered a GM production line in 1961, and later standardized six-axis arms like PUMA. This founded the modern industrial robot industry.�ans��src��jEngelberger,《Robotics in Practice》,1983 (DOI: 10.1007/978-1-4684-7120-5)；IFR《工业机器人史》ٕEngelberger, 'Robotics in Practice', 1983, DOI: 10.1007/978-1-4684-7120-5; International Federation of Robotics (IFR), 'History of Industrial Robots'��id�4de7b4020c4d�body���第一定律是能量守恒：能量不会凭空产生或消失，只能转化形式。第二定律指出热量自发从高温流向低温，过程伴随熵增，说明有用功有上限、永动机不可能。��The first law is conservation of energy—energy only changes form. The second says heat flows spontaneously from hot to cold with rising entropy, setting a ceiling on useful work and forbidding perpetual motion.�ans��src��\Y. A. Çengel、M. A. Boles,《Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach》第8版,McGraw-Hill�YY. A. Cengel & M. A. Boles, Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach, 8th ed., McGraw-Hill��id�4f3dcd244e10�body�٥机器人用摄像头、激光雷达、超声波等传感器收集信息，再由电脑把数据变成距离、形状和位置，从而避开障碍、识别物体。٭Robots use cameras, lidar and ultrasonic sensors to gather data, and a computer turns it into distance, shape and position so they can avoid obstacles and recognize objects.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�4f6fd837d4c5�body��R新拌混凝土的孔隙液呈强碱性，使钢筋表面生成钝化膜，只要碱性环境完好钢筋几乎不锈。空气中的二氧化碳会由表面向内碳化，海水或除冰盐中的氯离子也会向内扩散，两者都必须穿过保护层才能到达钢筋，而侵入深度大致与时间的平方根成正比，保护层加厚一倍可把到达钢筋的时间延长约四倍。钢筋一旦锈蚀，铁锈体积膨胀数倍会顶裂保护层，形成顺筋裂缝并加速侵蚀，因此规范按环境类别规定最小保护层厚度，同时限制水胶比和裂缝宽度。��Fresh concrete's pore solution is strongly alkaline and passivates the steel, so reinforcement barely corrodes while that environment survives. Atmospheric carbon dioxide carbonates the concrete inward and chlorides from seawater or de-icing salt diffuse inward, and both must cross the cover; since penetration depth grows roughly with the square root of time, doubling the cover multiplies the time to reach the bar by about four. Once the steel corrodes, rust occupies several times the volume of the consumed iron and splits the cover along the bars, accelerating attack, which is why codes prescribe minimum cover by exposure class together with limits on water-cement ratio and crack width.�ans��src��BACI 318-19《Building Code Requirements for Structural Concrete》�@ACI 318-19, 'Building Code Requirements for Structural Concrete'��id�510f588aaf5a�body���隔震支座把大楼与地基"软连接"：天然橡胶与钢板交替叠层，水平方向刚度低、竖向刚度高。地震时地面剧烈摆动，支座像软垫一样让上部结构整体缓慢平移，把本会被放大许多倍的高频晃动挡在楼外。这样楼层加速度可降低一半以上，结构保持弹性不受伤，这正是隔震设计与传统"硬抗"思路的本质区别。�#Base isolators softly decouple the building from the ground: layers of natural rubber alternate with steel shims, giving low horizontal but high vertical stiffness. During a quake the ground moves violently while the bearings let the whole upper structure translate slowly as a rigid body, filtering out the high-frequency shaking that would otherwise be amplified. Floor accelerations can drop by more than half and the structure stays elastic and undamaged — a fundamentally different strategy from stiffening the building to fight the motion.�ans��src��1ASCE 7-16；FEMA P-749《地震隔离与耗能》�4ASCE 7-16; FEMA P-749, Earthquake Protective Systems��id�511356adc2c8�body�ٯ能量转换效率是输出的有用能量与输入总能量的比值，永远小于100%。例如燃煤电厂把约40%的燃料热转化为电，其余以废热形式损失。��Energy conversion efficiency is the ratio of useful output energy to total input energy and is always below 100%. A coal plant, for example, converts only about 40% of fuel heat into electricity, losing the rest as waste heat.�ans��src��U王兆安 刘进军 主编,《电力电子技术》第5版,机械工业出版社,2009�VWang Zhaoan and Liu Jinjun eds., Power Electronics, 5th ed., China Machine Press, 2009��id�531cb65c28b1�body���CDMA 给每个用户分配互不正交但近似正交的扩频码，把窄带信号扩展到宽频带。接收端用相同码相关解扩，不同用户的信号因码间低相关性而相互区分，实现同频同时多址。�CDMA assigns each user a spreading code that is approximately orthogonal, spreading a narrowband signal over a wide band. The receiver despreads with the same code; other users' signals are separated by their low cross-correlation, enabling same-frequency same-time access.�ans��src��9《通信原理》（樊昌信，国防工业出版社）�*Communication Systems Engineering, Proakis��id�543d263e4501�body���工业机器人是可编程的多关节机械臂，常用于工厂的焊接、搬运、装配和喷涂。它能在重复、危险或高精度的岗位上替代人工，提高生产效率和一致性。��An industrial robot is a programmable multi-joint arm often used in factories for welding, handling, assembly, and painting. It replaces humans in repetitive, hazardous, or high-precision jobs, raising productivity and consistency.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�55fcf5e60860�body�ٓ把长桩打到深处坚硬的土层或岩层，让建筑物的重量通过桩传到深处可靠的地层，避免软土下沉导致房屋开裂。ٛLong piles are driven deep to firm soil or rock, carrying the building's weight down to reliable layers so soft ground cannot sink and crack the structure.�ans��src��+Das，《岩土工程原理》（第9版）�7Das, 'Principles of Geotechnical Engineering' (9th ed.)��id�5618ba07a4fd�body���逆变器用IGBT等功率开关管以每秒几千到几万次的高速开断直流母线，输出一串正负交替的方波脉冲；再用脉宽调制（PWM）让脉冲宽度按正弦规律变化，经滤波后得到平滑的正弦交流电。电压和频率都由开关规律决定，所以逆变器既能驱动变频电机调速，也能把光伏板或电池的直流电送上电网，并自动与电网电压相位同步。��An inverter switches the DC bus through power transistors such as IGBTs at rates from a few to tens of kilohertz, chopping it into alternating positive-negative pulses; pulse-width modulation (PWM) varies the pulse widths sinusoidally, and filters smooth the result into a clean sine wave. Both voltage and frequency are set by the switching pattern, so inverters drive variable-speed motors and also feed solar-panel or battery DC into the grid, locking automatically onto the grid's phase.�ans��src��U王兆安 刘进军 主编,《电力电子技术》第5版,机械工业出版社,2009�VWang Zhaoan and Liu Jinjun eds., Power Electronics, 5th ed., China Machine Press, 2009��id�574348cc06e2�body�ٖ千家万户的废水和雨水通过埋在地下的管道靠坡度自流汇集，送到处理厂净化后再排放，避免脏水横流传播疾病。ُWaste and rainwater flow by gravity through buried pipes to treatment plants that clean it before release, preventing disease from open sewage.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�5903bcb1ea95�body�ٹLMTD = (ΔT1 − ΔT2) / ln(ΔT1/ΔT2)，是沿换热器两端温差的有效平均值，用来驱动传热。设计公式 Q = U A LMTD 中，U 为总传热系数、A 为传热面积。��The LMTD = (ΔT1 − ΔT2) / ln(ΔT1/ΔT2) is the effective mean temperature difference between the two ends of a heat exchanger that drives heat transfer. In the design equation Q = U A LMTD, U is the overall heat-transfer coefficient and A the area.�ans��src��BIncropera & DeWitt《传热学》；《Perry 化学工程手册》�dIncropera & DeWitt, 'Fundamentals of Heat and Mass Transfer'; 'Perry's Chemical Engineers' Handbook'��id�5953a64f451e�body���存在游隙时只有承载区的少数滚动体接触，轴在载荷方向会先发生一段几乎无阻力的自由位移，刚度低且载荷方向反转时产生冲击与噪声。轴向预紧（成对角接触球轴承对顶安装、加预紧弹簧或磨配隔套）让所有滚动体始终受载，接触刚度提高、轴心位置确定，从而抑制振动、提高回转精度和系统固有频率。预紧过大则接触应力与摩擦发热上升，温升又因内外圈热膨胀差进一步加大预紧，形成恶性循环并缩短寿命，所以高速主轴多用定压弹簧预紧，并按转速、润滑方式与允许温升折中取值。�With clearance present only a few rolling elements carry load, the shaft can move almost freely for a short distance in the load direction, stiffness is low, and reversals cause impact and noise. Axial preload — back-to-back angular contact ball bearings, springs or ground spacers — keeps every rolling element loaded, raising contact stiffness, fixing the shaft centre and lifting both running accuracy and system natural frequency. Excessive preload raises contact stress and frictional heat, and the temperature difference between inner and outer rings then increases preload further in a runaway loop that shortens life, so high-speed spindles favour constant-pressure spring preload set as a compromise among speed, lubrication and allowable temperature rise.�ans��src��AHarris 与 Kotzalas，《Rolling Bearing Analysis》（第5版）�7Harris & Kotzalas, 'Rolling Bearing Analysis' (5th ed.)��id�5a1e8bd42e6b�body���四冲程循环是汽油和柴油内燃机常用的工作循环，包括进气、压缩、做功和排气四个过程。活塞每完成这四个冲程，曲轴转两圈，产生一次动力输出。�The four-stroke cycle is the common operating cycle of gasoline and diesel internal combustion engines, consisting of intake, compression, power, and exhaust strokes. The piston completes these four strokes while the crankshaft turns twice, producing one power output per cycle.�ans��src��Heywood，《内燃机基础》�2Heywood, 'Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals'��id�5a56c61b8324�body��状态空间以内部状态描述系统，天然支持多输入多输出、时变与非线性系统，并能配置极点、设计最优控制与观测器。传递函数仅适用于线性时不变单变量系统，且会丢失不可观不可控的内部模态。�State space describes a system by internal states, naturally handling MIMO, time-varying, and nonlinear systems, enabling pole placement, optimal control, and observers. Transfer functions apply only to LTI SISO systems and lose unobservable/uncontrollable internal modes.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�5b08fbf931b4�body���空间站以约每秒 7.7 公里的第一宇宙速度绕地球做圆周运动，地球引力恰好提供向心力，所以它不断下落却又始终错过地面。要维持轨道需要偶尔点火抵消大气阻力带来的减速。��The ISS orbits at about 7.7 km/s, the speed where Earth's gravity exactly supplies the centripetal force, so it keeps falling but forever misses the ground. Small thruster burns counteract drag to hold the orbit.�ans��src��(Curtis，《轨道力学》（第4版）�>Curtis, 'Orbital Mechanics for Engineering Students' (4th ed.)��id�5ce4b0a69840�body��}悬索桥的主缆由上万根钢丝拧成，从塔顶悬垂成悬链线（设计上按抛物线近似）。桥面荷载经吊索传给主缆，主缆再把力传到主塔和两端的锚碇：缆内沿曲线分布的是拉力，主塔承受竖向压力，锚碇则拉住缆端的水平分力。整个体系像一张拉满的弓，主缆的强度直接决定了桥能跨越多远。��The main cable of a suspension bridge is made of thousands of steel wires twisted together, hanging from tower tops in a catenary (approximated as a parabola in design). Deck loads pass through vertical hangers into the cable, which then carries the force to the towers and the anchorages at both ends: tension flows along the curve, the towers take compression, and the anchorages resist the horizontal pull. The whole system works like a drawn bow, and the cable's strength sets how far the bridge can span.�ans��src��QHibbeler《结构分析》；AASHTO 桥梁规范；悬索桥工程（Leonhardt）�fHibbeler, Structural Analysis; AASHTO bridge specifications; suspension bridge engineering (Leonhardt)��id�5d243d79f065�body�ٺ从底部吹入的气体把颗粒托起并使其悬浮翻滚，形成似流体的状态。气固接触极充分、传热均匀，温度好控，广泛用于催化裂化和燃煤燃烧。��Gas blown from the bottom suspends and tosses the particles into a fluid-like state. Gas-solid contact is excellent and heat transfer uniform and controllable, widely used in catalytic cracking and coal combustion.�ans��src��AMcCabe、Smith & Harriott，《化工单元操作》（第7版）�MMcCabe, Smith & Harriott, 'Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering' (7th ed.)��id�5d836f23af4e�body���可访问性指产品能被包括视障、听障、运动障碍在内的所有用户使用。遵循 WCAG 等规范可消除使用壁垒、满足法律合规，并扩大受众、提升整体可用性。��Accessibility means products are usable by everyone, including people with visual, hearing, or motor impairments. Following guidelines like WCAG removes barriers, meets legal compliance, and broadens audience while improving overall usability.�ans��src��W3C WCAG 2.1 无障碍指南�W3C WCAG 2.1 Guidelines��id�61292fd8779e�body���硬度反映材料抵抗压入或划伤的能力。常用布氏、洛氏、维氏等压痕法，用标准压头在给定载荷下压入，再按压痕尺寸换算硬度值，用于质量控制和选材。��Hardness is resistance to indentation or scratching. Common Brinell, Rockwell, and Vickers tests press a standard indenter under load and convert the impression size to a hardness number for QC and selection.�ans��src��3美国材料与试验协会（ASTM International）�ASTM International��id�6264fa6418bc�body���生物膜法是让微生物附着在填料或转盘表面形成膜，污水流过时膜上菌群降解污染物，无需大量回流悬浮污泥，抗冲击负荷较强、剩余污泥较少。ٹBiofilm processes grow microbes on fixed media; water flowing past is cleaned by the attached film, needing no return of suspended sludge—more shock-resistant with less excess sludge.�ans��src��6《水污染控制工程》（高等教育出版社）�'Metcalf and Eddy Wastewater Engineering��id�631f51e3c376�body���悬架通过弹簧和减振器吸收路面冲击，软悬架能把振动过滤得更彻底，乘坐舒适但转弯时车身侧倾大、动态响应慢。硬悬架支撑好、转向反应快，但路面冲击直接传到车身，舒适性下降。减振器阻尼也需要平衡：阻尼过小车身余振不断，阻尼过大则冲击刚性传递，可变阻尼悬架正是为了在不同工况下动态切换这种权衡。��Suspension uses springs and dampers to absorb road impacts: soft springs filter vibration thoroughly for comfort but allow large body roll and slow responses in corners, while stiff springs support the body and give quick steering response at the cost of transmitting road shocks. Damper tuning is a similar balance, too little damping leaves the body oscillating and too much makes impacts feel harsh. Adaptive dampers exist precisely to shift this trade-off dynamically with driving conditions.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�650e4b6fbcce�body��缓存存放 CPU 近期将用到的数据：命中时直接从缓存取数（很快），未命中时则需到更慢的存储器取数并填入缓存。多级缓存（L1/L2/L3）在速度、容量与成本之间折中，越靠近 CPU 的级别越小越快。��A cache holds data the CPU will likely use soon: on a hit it is served fast, on a miss the data must be fetched from slower memory and loaded into cache. Multi-level caches (L1/L2/L3) trade off speed, size, and cost, with closer levels smaller and faster.�ans��src��2Patterson & Hennessy《计算机组成与设计》�8Patterson & Hennessy, 'Computer Organization and Design'��id�67abf61f15b5�body���传统编程是把每一步写死，环境一变就傻眼；强化学习让机器在试错中根据奖励自己摸索策略，更会应对不确定。像练骑车，摔几次后自己找到平衡。��Traditional programming hard-codes every step and fails when the world changes; reinforcement learning lets the machine explore and shape its own policy from rewards, coping with uncertainty. Like learning to ride—after a few falls it finds balance.�ans��src��9Sutton & Barto，《强化学习：导论》（第2版）�CSutton & Barto, 'Reinforcement Learning: An Introduction' (2nd ed.)��id�6a3e4026522f�body��)FinFET 的栅极只从三面环绕竖直的鳍形沟道，而 GAA 晶体管用纳米片或纳米线作为沟道，使栅极从四周完全包裹沟道。这种全环绕结构能更强地控制沟道电流，从而更好地抑制短沟道效应，是 3 纳米及以下先进制程的主流方向。�wIn a FinFET the gate wraps three sides of a vertical fin-shaped channel, whereas a GAA transistor uses nanosheets or nanowires as the channel so the gate surrounds it on all four sides. The all-around gate gives stronger electrostatic control of the channel, suppressing short-channel effects more effectively, and is the mainstream choice for 3 nm and smaller process nodes.�ans��src��]S. M. Sze 与 Kwok K. Ng 著《Physics of Semiconductor Devices》（半导体器件物理）�8S. M. Sze & Kwok K. Ng, Physics of Semiconductor Devices��id�6b205f21f289�body���燃料电池把燃料的化学能直接转化为电能，不经燃烧。氢气在阳极催化剂上分解为质子和电子，质子穿过质子交换膜到达阴极，电子被膜挡住、被迫经外电路流动做功；在阴极，氢离子、电子与氧气结合成水。单个电池电压只有约0.7伏，须串联成电堆使用。它的电效率可达50%到60%，高于内燃机，且零排放；瓶颈在于氢的制取与储运成本以及铂催化剂的高昂价格。�wA fuel cell converts a fuel's chemical energy directly into electricity without combustion. At the anode, hydrogen splits on a catalyst into protons and electrons; the protons cross a proton-exchange membrane while the electrons are blocked by the membrane and forced through an external circuit to do work. At the cathode, hydrogen ions, electrons, and oxygen combine into water. Each cell makes only about 0.7 V, so cells are stacked in series. Electrical efficiency reaches 50-60%, above internal combustion, with zero tailpipe emissions; the bottlenecks are the cost of producing and storing hydrogen and of platinum catalysts.�ans��src��Q美国能源部《燃料电池技术手册》（Fuel Cell Handbook）第6版,2001�<U.S. Department of Energy, Fuel Cell Handbook, 6th ed., 2001��id�6bfde0cb0bc1�body���石块抗压极强但几乎不能受拉，拱形恰好把力变成压力传到桥台，所以石桥天然合适。现代混凝土和钢材既能受压也能受拉，箱梁截面封闭、刚度大且便于工厂化预制，适合更大跨和更快施工。��Stone is great in compression but can't take tension, and an arch turns load into compression to the abutments—ideal for stone. Modern concrete and steel handle both, and closed box girders are stiff and prefabricable for longer spans and faster builds.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�6c4badf4ac27�body��谐波减速器利用柔轮（薄壁弹性齿轮）在波发生器作用下的可控弹性变形与刚轮啮合，单级即可达到数十到数百减速比、几乎零背隙。柔轮每转承受交变弯曲应变，长期在应力集中处萌生疲劳裂纹。�@A harmonic drive uses a thin-wall flexible spline whose controlled elastic deformation under the wave generator meshes with a rigid spline, giving single-stage ratios of tens to hundreds with near-zero backlash. The flexspline endures cyclic bending strain each turn, so fatigue cracks initiate at stress concentrations.�ans��src��AHarmonic Drive（哈默纳科）谐波减速器官方技术手册�+Harmonic Drive LLC, Technical Documentation��id�6c66efc923a5�body�ّ工程师把图纸编成G代码，控制系统按代码驱动机床三轴并读取编码器反馈实时纠偏，精度和重复定位都很高。�tA program drives the axes while encoders feed position back for correction, giving high precision and repeatability.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�6c78ad71caf9�body�٨电池车零尾气、安静、适合短途和城市；燃油能量密度高、加注快、适合长途和缺电地区。选择取决于路程、充电条件和用途。��Battery vehicles are clean and quiet, great for short city trips; liquid fuel packs more energy and refuels fast, suiting long hauls and remote areas. The choice depends on distance, charging access and use.�ans��src��>Larminie & Dicks，《燃料电池系统解析》（第2版）�9Larminie & Dicks, 'Fuel Cell Systems Explained' (2nd ed.)��id�6c7bdff33cce�body�ٷ它用卫星定位知道大致位置，再用激光雷达和摄像头识别车道线与障碍物，配合高精度地图不断修正路线，由电脑决定加速、刹车和转向。��It uses satellite positioning for a rough location, lidar and cameras to read lanes and obstacles, and a detailed map to refine the route while a computer controls speed, braking and steering.�ans��src��:Thrun、Burgard & Fox，《概率机器人学》（2005）�5Thrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (2005)��id�6d4318b78fb4�body��PEM 电解槽用固体聚合物膜传导质子，可在高电流密度下运行，动态响应快、启停迅速，适合配合波动性可再生能源。但其依赖铱、铂等贵金属催化剂且成本较高，而碱性电解槽虽便宜却响应慢、效率略低。�iA PEM electrolyzer uses a solid polymer membrane to conduct protons, allowing high current density, fast dynamic response, and quick start-stop, well suited to fluctuating renewables. However it relies on precious-metal catalysts such as iridium and platinum and is more costly, whereas alkaline electrolyzers are cheaper but slower and slightly less efficient.�ans��src��(Nature Energy（电解水制氢技术）�/Nature Energy (water electrolysis for hydrogen)��id�6d99dfa7112c�body���脱硫塔内用石灰石浆液从上喷淋，烟气从下上升，二氧化硫溶于水生成亚硫酸，与浆液中的碳酸钙反应生成亚硫酸钙，再经氧化空气强制氧化成硫酸钙（石膏）析出。气液两相逆流接触、浆液循环量大、塔内停留时间长，且石灰石价格便宜来源广，因此该工艺成为燃煤电厂主流，配合高效喷嘴和除雾器可稳定达到95%以上的脱硫率。�0In the absorber tower limestone slurry is sprayed downward while flue gas rises; SO2 dissolves in water to form sulphurous acid, which reacts with calcium carbonate to give calcium sulphite, and forced-oxidation air converts it to calcium sulphate (gypsum) that crystallises out. Countercurrent gas-liquid contact, high slurry circulation and long residence time make this the mainstream choice for coal-fired plants, and with efficient nozzles and mist eliminators removal efficiency is stably above 95 percent, aided by the cheap, abundant limestone reagent.�ans��src��?Crittenden 等，《水处理：原理与设计》（第3版）�ECrittenden et al., 'Water Treatment: Principles and Design' (3rd ed.)��id�6e5865445df4�body��压电效应指在机械应力下晶体产生电荷（正压电），反之施加电场会产生形变（逆压电），居里兄弟在 1880 年发现。同一片材料受力可发电、通电可振动，因此广泛用于点火器、超声探头和喷墨头。�3The piezoelectric effect yields electric charge under mechanical stress (direct) and strain under an electric field (converse), discovered by the Curie brothers in 1880. The same element generates voltage when stressed and vibrates when driven, so it serves in igniters, ultrasound probes, and inkjet heads.�ans��src��MCurie 兄弟《压电效应》(1880)；IEEE 超声铁电与频率控制学会�gCurie brothers, 'Piezoelectricity' (1880); IEEE Ultrasonics, Ferroelectrics & Frequency Control Society��id�6e77b4c2098d�body���反馈是把系统输出的一部分送回输入端，与设定目标比较产生纠正动作。负反馈能抵消偏离，使温度、速度等保持在目标附近，是大多数稳定控制的基础。��Feedback sends part of a system's output back to its input to compare with the target and produce correction. Negative feedback counteracts deviation, holding temperature, speed, and the like near the goal, the basis of most stable control.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�6ed167f8ecda�body�ف轴承用一排小钢球把滑动摩擦变成滚动摩擦，阻力小、磨损少，让轴和轮子转得更轻松也更耐用。٘Bearings replace sliding friction with rolling friction using steel balls, cutting resistance and wear so shafts and wheels turn easily and last longer.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�6f49a55a1271�body���反渗透在高于海水渗透压的外压下，迫使水分子透过半透膜而截留盐分与杂质，实现淡水和浓盐水的分离。其能耗主要取决于进水盐度与回收率，是主流的海水淡化方法。�Reverse osmosis applies pressure above seawater's osmotic pressure to drive water through a semipermeable membrane while rejecting salts and impurities, separating permeate from brine. Energy use depends mainly on salinity and recovery, making it the dominant desalination method.�ans��src��0《膜分离技术》（化学工业出版社）�2Baker, Membrane Technology and Applications, Wiley��id�70dede58f3dd�body���自动驾驶融合多种传感器：激光雷达发射激光束测距，得到三维点云；毫米波雷达利用多普勒效应在雨雾中测目标的距离与速度；摄像头提供车道线、交通标识、信号灯等语义信息。各路数据先经过时间同步和空间标定对齐，再交给感知算法做目标检测与跟踪。多传感器冗余是关键：摄像头怕逆光黑夜，毫米波雷达分辨不出低矮障碍，彼此互补才能在各种天气下可靠感知。�%Self-driving cars fuse multiple sensors: lidar fires laser pulses to build 3-D point clouds, millimeter-wave radar uses the Doppler effect to measure distance and speed through rain and fog, and cameras supply semantic details like lane lines, signs, and traffic lights. The data streams are synchronized in time and aligned in space through calibration, then fed to perception algorithms for detection and tracking. Redundancy is key: cameras struggle in glare and darkness, radar misses low obstacles, so the sensors cover each other's weaknesses.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�7339e8028d43�body���锂离子电池靠锂离子在正负极间往返嵌入脱出来储放电能，能量密度高、自放电低、寿命长且无记忆效应，因此广泛用于手机、电动车和储能系统。��Li-ion cells store energy by shuttling lithium ions between electrodes; they offer high energy density, low self-discharge, and long life with no memory effect, powering phones, EVs, and storage.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�7408105f3cc0�body�٫立交桥让不同方向的车流在不同高度交叉通过，彼此不发生平面冲突。它消除了红绿灯等待，提高了主干道的通行能力和安全性。��A grade-separated interchange lets conflicting traffic streams cross at different heights without meeting at one level. It removes signal waits and raises the capacity and safety of main roads.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�745201c4b848�body��,摄像头提供丰富的纹理与颜色信息，擅长识别车道、标志与分类，但在暗光和距离估计上较弱；激光雷达直接给出高精度三维点云与距离，对光照不敏感，却缺乏语义细节。两者融合才能获得既测距准确又语义完整的场景理解。�JCameras give rich texture and color, excelling at lane, sign, and object classification but weak in low light and ranging; LiDAR yields high-precision 3D point clouds and distances independent of lighting but lacks semantic detail. Fusing both yields scene understanding that is both metrically accurate and semantically complete.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�74cf64d722bf�body�ٮ弯矩是使构件弯曲的内力矩，剪力是使截面错动的内力。工程师绘制弯矩图和剪力图来判断梁在何处受力最大，从而决定截面尺寸。��Bending moment is the internal moment that bends a member, while shear force is the internal force that slides one section past another. Engineers draw moment and shear diagrams to find where a beam is most stressed and size its cross-section.�ans��src��E刘鸿文 主编,《材料力学》第6版,高等教育出版社,2017�NLiu Hongwen ed., Mechanics of Materials, 6th ed., Higher Education Press, 2017��id�775ac2759135�body��N非球面减少像差、精准控制光型防眩，同时提高照明效率。�^Aspheric surfaces cut aberration, shape the beam to avoid glare and raise lighting efficiency.�ans��src��(Hecht《光学》；SAE J576（车灯）�"Hecht, Optics; SAE J576 (lighting)��id�779f96c5b78c�body���根据帕斯卡原理，密闭液体把压强传到各处；用一个小活塞施加压强，连到一个大活塞上，面积变大了，推力就按倍数放大，于是能压或顶起重物。ٺBy Pascal's principle a confined fluid transmits pressure everywhere; a small piston's pressure acting on a much larger piston multiplies the force, letting it press or lift heavy loads.�ans��src��'White，《流体力学》（第8版）�"White, 'Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�77bd3f956c98�body�ٴ屈服强度是材料开始发生永久变形（不再恢复原状）时的最小应力。设计零件时通常要确保其工作应力低于屈服强度，以避免永久变形。��Yield strength is the minimum stress at which a material begins permanent deformation and will not return to its original shape. Designers keep working stress below yield strength to avoid permanent deformation.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�792beb9a7d8b�body�ٱ火箭靠姿控推力器或小喷口喷出气体产生反作用力来转向，原理和主发动机一样都来自牛顿第三定律：向后喷，自身就向反方向受力。��Rockets use small thrusters or gimbaled nozzles that eject gas to create reaction forces; like the main engine, this follows Newton's third law: push mass one way, the craft is pushed the other.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�794551328fc3�body���常见有面心立方（FCC）、体心立方（BCC）和密排六方（HCP）。FCC金属（如铜、铝）塑性好易加工，BCC（如铁、钨）强度高，HCP（如镁、钛）较难变形。��The main structures are FCC, BCC, and HCP. FCC metals like copper and aluminum are ductile and easy to form; BCC like iron and tungsten are strong; HCP like magnesium and titanium deform less easily.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�7a3171e64a86�body�ٺ海绵城市用透水铺装、下沉绿地、雨水花园等让雨水就地下渗、滞留和净化，而不是全部快速排走，从而削减洪峰、补充地下水并改善水质。��Sponge cities use permeable pavement, sunken green spaces, and rain gardens to absorb, detain, and clean stormwater on site instead of rushing it to drains, cutting flood peaks and recharging groundwater.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�7a89bdc995ba�body��,隔震层在建筑物与地基之间布置橡胶或滑动支座，把结构自振周期拉长到远离地震主能量频段，使上部结构随地面缓慢平动而非剧烈摇晃。这样输入结构的加速度被显著削弱，从而保护主体与内部设备，但需合理设计位移余量。�~An isolation layer of rubber or sliding bearings between building and foundation lengthens the structure's natural period away from the earthquake's main energy band, so the superstructure moves slowly with the ground rather than shaking violently. Input acceleration is greatly reduced, protecting the structure and its contents, though displacement capacity must be well designed.�ans��src��1ASCE 7-16；FEMA P-749《地震隔离与耗能》�4ASCE 7-16; FEMA P-749, Earthquake Protective Systems��id�7b2da6fc3a22�body�ٴ液压系统利用密闭液体（通常是油）来传递力和动力，基于帕斯卡原理实现力的放大。叉车、挖掘机和汽车刹车都广泛使用了液压技术。��A hydraulic system uses confined liquid, usually oil, to transmit force and power, amplifying force based on Pascal's principle. Forklifts, excavators, and car brakes all rely heavily on hydraulic technology.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�7cf97ff498bb�body��p压路机的影响深度有限，一次填得太厚下部就压不实，残留孔隙在通车后被车辆荷载逐渐挤密，造成不均匀沉降、路面开裂和车辙，所以每层松铺厚度通常控制在二三十厘米量级。压实还需要合适的含水量：太干时颗粒摩擦大难以靠近，太湿时孔隙水承担压力又难以排出，标准 Proctor 试验给出的最大干密度与最优含水量正是现场控制依据。检测时用灌砂法、核子密度仪或动力触探测出实际干密度，与最大干密度之比即压实度，规范按路基不同部位规定各自的最低要求。��A roller influences only a limited depth, so a thick lift leaves the bottom loose, and residual voids densify slowly under traffic into differential settlement, cracking and rutting, which is why loose lift thickness is generally held to roughly 20–30 cm. Compaction also needs the right moisture: too dry and grains resist rearranging, too wet and pore water carries the pressure without draining, so maximum dry density and optimum moisture content from the standard Proctor test become the field targets. Sand-cone, nuclear gauge or dynamic penetration measurements give in-place dry density, whose ratio to maximum dry density is the degree of compaction, for which codes set minimum values by embankment zone.�ans��src�٦ASTM,《Test Methods for Laboratory Compaction Characteristics of Soil Using Standard Effort (12,400 ft-lbf/ft3 (600 kN-m/m3))》,ASTM D698 (DOI: 10.1520/d0698-12r21)٣ASTM, 'Test Methods for Laboratory Compaction Characteristics of Soil Using Standard Effort (12,400 ft-lbf/ft3 (600 kN-m/m3))', ASTM D698, DOI: 10.1520/d0698-12r21��id�7da1c2c1c17c�body�٫起飞和降落时放下襟翼，让机翼面积变大、弯度增加，从而在低速度下也能产生足够升力并增加阻力减速，使短跑道起降更安全。٪Extended during takeoff and landing, flaps enlarge and curve the wing to make enough lift at low speed and add drag to slow down, enabling short-runway, safer operations.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�7daaa0ae3f6a�body���带宽指系统能较好地跟踪或衰减输入的频率范围上限，通常取增益下降到低频值 -3 dB 处。带宽越宽，系统响应越快、能跟踪更高频指令，但也可能放大噪声与敏感于未建模动态。�Bandwidth is the upper frequency limit over which a closed-loop system tracks or attenuates input well, usually the -3 dB point. Wider bandwidth means faster response and higher-frequency tracking, but also more noise amplification and sensitivity to unmodeled dynamics.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�7eb9a5e62d4a�body��n两个啮合齿轮的齿数比决定传动比：小齿轮带动大齿轮时，转速降低而力矩按同一比例放大，功率（转速乘力矩）基本保持不变。这正是变速箱和钟表的核心——一对齿轮换一档，多对串联就实现大减速。设计时还要保证两轮模数相同、压力角匹配，否则齿面会干涉甚至折断。��The tooth-count ratio of two meshing gears sets the gear ratio: a small gear driving a big one reduces the speed while multiplying torque by the same factor, keeping power (speed times torque) roughly constant. That is the core of gearboxes and clocks — one gear pair is one gear, and chains of pairs give large reductions. Designers must also match the module and pressure angle of the two gears, or the teeth will interfere and break.�ans��src��《机械设计基础》�Fundamentals of Machine Design��id�7ec1036dee90�body��%激光功率、扫描速度、扫描间距和层厚共同决定了单位面积能量输入（线能量/体能量）。能量过低会产生未熔合孔洞，过高则引发汽化与飞溅；合理匹配这些参数通常可获得 99% 以上的相对致密度，是 SLM 工艺优化的核心。�eLaser power, scan speed, hatch spacing, and layer thickness together determine the energy input per unit area (line or volumetric energy density). Too little energy causes lack-of-fusion pores, while too much causes vaporization and spatters; well-matched parameters typically yield above 99% relative density, which is the core of SLM process optimization.�ans��src���DebRoy、Wei、Zuback 与 Mukherjee,《Additive manufacturing of metallic components – Process, structure and properties》,Progress in Materials Science,2018 (DOI: 10.1016/j.pmatsci.2017.10.001)ٿDebRoy, Wei, Zuback & Mukherjee, 'Additive manufacturing of metallic components – Process, structure and properties', Progress in Materials Science, 2018, DOI: 10.1016/j.pmatsci.2017.10.001��id�7fa41f12c45e�body���低通滤波器允许低于截止频率的信号通过、衰减高频成分，用于去噪与抗混叠。一阶 RC 滤波器的截止频率由 f_c = 1/(2πRC) 给出，R 与 C 越大截止频率越低。��A low-pass filter passes signals below its cutoff and attenuates higher frequencies, used for denoising and anti-aliasing. A first-order RC filter's cutoff is f_c = 1/(2πRC); larger R or C lowers the cutoff.�ans��src��?《信号与系统》（奥本海姆，电子工业出版社）�Signals and Systems, Oppenheim��id�7fcd8b3e7f10�body���它们都用压缩机驱动制冷剂的蒸汽压缩循环，让制冷剂在低温侧蒸发吸热、在高温侧冷凝放热，从而把热量从冷端『搬』到热端。电能是用来做功搬运热量而不是直接产热，所以性能系数(COP)可以远大于 1，其理论上限由逆卡诺循环给出。Carrier 在 1902 年设计出首台现代空调，奠定了工程化的空气处理与制冷方法。��Both use a compressor-driven vapor-compression cycle in which the refrigerant evaporates and absorbs heat on the cold side and condenses and releases it on the hot side, moving heat from cold to hot. The electricity does work to transport heat rather than to create it, so the coefficient of performance can far exceed 1, with the reversed Carnot cycle as its theoretical ceiling. Carrier designed the first modern air-conditioning system in 1902, establishing engineered air treatment and refrigeration.�ans��src�ٰCengel 与 Boles《工程热力学》(Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach)；Carrier《合理焓湿计算公式》(Rational Psychrometric Formulae, ASME Transactions, 1911)�Cengel & Boles, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach'; Carrier, 'Rational Psychrometric Formulae' (ASME Transactions, 1911)��id�80d8ce6f1b6a�body���智能交通系统把摄像头、地感线圈和雷达等传感器连到控制中心，实时统计车流量并动态调整信号灯配时、发布诱导信息。通过均衡路网负荷和减少空等，整体通行效率提升、拥堵缓解。��Intelligent Transport Systems link cameras, loop detectors, and radar to a control center that counts traffic in real time and adjusts signal timing and guidance. Balancing network load and cutting idle waits raises throughput and eases jams.�ans��src��A美国交通部（USDOT），《智能交通系统战略计划》�@USDOT, 'Intelligent Transportation Systems (ITS) Strategic Plan'��id�80fc5caece06�body�٫氢气燃烧或与燃料电池反应只产水、不直接排碳，且能量密度高、可长期储存与远距离运输。难点在绿氢的制备成本和储运安全。ٺHydrogen burns or reacts in fuel cells producing only water, with no direct carbon, plus high energy density and storable transport. The hurdles are green-hydrogen cost and safe storage.�ans��src��aIEA,《低碳能源未来中的氢能》(The Role of Hydrogen in a Low-carbon Energy Future),2019�=IEA, The Role of Hydrogen in a Low-carbon Energy Future, 2019��id�825ded3cc3a0�body���CNC（计算机数控）机床由计算机按编程指令自动控制刀具与工件的相对运动，能高精度、可重复地加工复杂形状，广泛用于金属和塑料零件制造。ٿA CNC (computer numerical control) machine automatically drives tool and workpiece motion from programmed instructions, machining complex shapes precisely and repeatably in metal and plastic.�ans��src�ًAltintas，《Manufacturing Automation: Metal Cutting Mechanics, Machine Tool Vibrations, and CNC Design》（第2版，Cambridge，2012）فAltintas, 'Manufacturing Automation: Metal Cutting Mechanics, Machine Tool Vibrations, and CNC Design' (2nd ed., Cambridge, 2012)��id�834e4c92537f�body���在深度负反馈下，运放两输入端电压被强制几乎相等，称为虚短；又因为输入级阻抗极高，流入两端的电流近似为零，称为虚断。两者是分析放大电路的基础近似。��Under heavy negative feedback the two inputs are forced to nearly equal voltage (virtual short), and because the input impedance is huge, almost no current flows in (virtual open). These are the key approximations for analyzing amplifier circuits.�ans��src��-Nilsson & Riedel，《电路》（第11版）�0Nilsson & Riedel, 'Electric Circuits' (11th ed.)��id�8375471de6e5�body���BIM（建筑信息模型）是用三维数字模型整合建筑几何、材料和工期等信息的技术。它让设计、施工和运维各方在同一模型上协作，减少冲突和浪费。��BIM (Building Information Modeling) is a technology that integrates a building's geometry, materials, and schedule into a 3D digital model. It lets designers, builders, and operators collaborate on one model, reducing conflicts and waste.�ans��src��BEastman、Teicholz、Sacks & Liston，《BIM手册》（第3版）�;Eastman, Teicholz, Sacks & Liston, 'BIM Handbook' (3rd ed.)��id�84d5853554d0�body���输电损耗主要来自线路电阻发热，其大小与电流的平方成正比。输送功率一定时，电压升得越高电流就越小，损耗按平方关系急剧下降。所以发电厂把电压升到220千伏、500千伏甚至1000千伏特高压再送出去，长途输送效率可超过90%。但电压太高绝缘成本和电晕损耗又会上升，因此输电距离越长，才越值得用更高电压；超长跨海线路还会改用高压直流进一步降损。�Transmission losses are mostly resistive heating, which grows with the square of the current. For fixed power, raising the voltage cuts the current, and losses drop with the square of it. That is why plants step up to 220 kV, 500 kV, or even 1000 kV ultra-high voltage before sending power out, achieving over 90% efficiency over long distances. But higher voltage means more insulation cost and corona loss, so only longer lines justify it; ultra-long undersea links now switch to high-voltage DC to cut losses further.�ans��src��<Stevenson & Grainger，《电力系统分析》（第3版）�7Stevenson & Grainger, 'Power System Analysis' (3rd ed.)��id�85c2d5c79341�body���并行计算把大问题拆成可同时处理的子任务，由多个处理器核心一起算，相当于多人协作。适合大规模仿真、渲染和机器学习，但受任务依赖和通信开销限制。��Parallel computing splits a problem into subtasks run at once on many cores—like teamwork. It suits big simulations, rendering, and ML but is limited by dependencies and communication overhead.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�87082f7df8a5�body���常见有间歇（一批料反应完再出料）、连续（物料连续进出，稳态运行）和半间歇（一种连续加入、另一种分批）。选择取决于产量、副反应控制和传热需求。��Reactors run batch (one charge reacted then emptied), continuous (steady in–out flow), or semi-batch (one stream fed continuously). The choice depends on output, side-reaction control, and heat transfer.�ans��src��4Fogler，《化学反应工程原理》（第5版）�=Fogler, 'Elements of Chemical Reaction Engineering' (5th ed.)��id�886e05b3fe23�body���毫米波（如24至39GHz）频带极宽，可提供数十GHz的可用带宽，因而单载波速率远超中低频段，这是其最大优势。但毫米波波长短，绕射能力弱，穿透墙体、树叶的损耗大，传播距离短，甚至人体遮挡都会造成信号明显衰落。因此毫米波主要用于人流密集的体育场、车站等热点区域做容量增强，而广覆盖仍靠中低频段。��Millimetre-wave bands (e.g. 24 to 39 GHz) offer extremely wide spectrum, giving many tens of GHz of usable bandwidth and per-user rates far beyond sub-6 GHz, their biggest advantage. But the short wavelength diffracts poorly, suffers heavy penetration loss through walls and foliage, has short range, and even a human body in the path causes deep fading. That is why mmWave is mainly deployed in dense hotspots such as stadiums and stations for capacity boost, while wide-area coverage relies on lower bands.�ans��src��HRappaport《无线通信》；3GPP 5G 标准；Proakis《数字通信》�VRappaport, Wireless Communications; 3GPP 5G standards; Proakis, Digital Communications��id�892b39d2bd4e�body���单元操作是把复杂化工流程拆成若干通用的物理处理步骤，如传热、蒸馏、吸收、过滤、干燥，每类遵循共同的工程原理，便于设计、放大和标准化。��Unit operations break a process into generic physical steps—heat transfer, distillation, absorption, filtration, drying—each obeying common principles, which eases design, scale-up, and standardization.�ans��src��AMcCabe、Smith & Harriott，《化工单元操作》（第7版）�MMcCabe, Smith & Harriott, 'Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering' (7th ed.)��id�89f65d5a85dc�body��3混凝土抗压怕拉，钢筋补上抗拉能力。�>Concrete resists compression but not tension; steel adds that.�ans��src��/Neville，《混凝土的性能》（第5版）�+Neville, 'Properties of Concrete' (5th ed.)��id�8a49c19b9b1f�body�ٜ潜艇有可注水和排水的压载舱：注水变重就下沉，用压缩空气把水排出变轻就上浮，靠调节重量来控制停在任意深度。٘Ballast tanks fill with water to get heavier and sink, or are blown empty with compressed air to get lighter and rise; adjusting weight holds any depth.�ans��src��.Tupper，《船舶原理导论》（第5版）�6Tupper, 'Introduction to Naval Architecture' (5th ed.)��id�8a72b9e79554�body�ٽ风对高柔结构会产生静力推力和动力涡振、颤振，难以完全靠公式计算。风洞试验用缩尺模型实测风压分布与振动响应，验证并优化抗风设计。��Wind on slender structures causes static push and dynamic vortex-induced or flutter vibrations that are hard to compute exactly. Tunnel tests on scale models measure pressure and response to verify and refine the design.�ans��src��:Bisplinghoff、Ashley & Halfman，《气动弹性力学》�0Bisplinghoff, Ashley & Halfman, 'Aeroelasticity'��id�8d3d2c2451e6�body��G燃料爆炸推动活塞,经曲轴转为旋转动力,再驱动车轮。�>Fuel explosions push pistons, turning a shaft to drive wheels.�ans��src��Heywood，《内燃机基础》�2Heywood, 'Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals'��id�8dccdf42a746�body�ي冷却液降温、润滑并冲走切屑，保护刀具和工件、提升表面质量；干切虽可行但刀具磨损快、精度难保。�yCoolant cools, lubricates, and flushes chips to protect tool and finish; dry cutting wears tools fast and hurts accuracy.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�8debf7fdb038�body��预应力混凝土是在浇筑前或浇筑后对钢筋施加预拉、对混凝土施加预压，使构件在使用前就存在反向应力，从而抵消大部分工作荷载产生的拉应力。这样能推迟裂缝出现、提高刚度并跨越更大跨度。��Prestressed concrete is pre-compressed by tensioning steel tendons before or after casting, so a pre-existing counter-stress offsets the tension from service loads. This delays cracking, increases stiffness, and allows longer spans.�ans��src��E刘鸿文 主编,《材料力学》第6版,高等教育出版社,2017�NLiu Hongwen ed., Mechanics of Materials, 6th ed., Higher Education Press, 2017��id�8eca99951932�body���麦克斯韦在 1865 年预言电磁波存在并给出其速度等于光速，赫兹在 1887 年用实验产生并检测到无线电波，证实预言。这之后马可尼等人才能把电磁波用于跨距通信。��Maxwell predicted in 1865 that electromagnetic waves exist and travel at light speed; Hertz generated and detected radio waves in 1887, confirming it. Only then could Marconi and others use them for distance communication.�ans��src��~Maxwell《电磁场的动力学理论》(Philosophical Transactions, 1865)；Hertz《电波》(Electric Waves, 1893 英译本)ْMaxwell, 'A Dynamical Theory of the Electromagnetic Field' (Philosophical Transactions, 1865); Hertz, 'Electric Waves' (English translation, 1893)��id�9216877ebe34�body���锂离子电池的最佳工作温度通常在20至40摄氏度，高温会加速老化甚至引发热失控，低温则使内阻增大、可用容量和充电功率大幅下降。热管理系统通过液冷或风冷回路、加热膜或热泵实现加热与冷却：高温时把热量带出电池包，低温时先加热再允许大电流充电，使电池始终处于适宜温度区间，既保障安全也维持性能。��Lithium-ion batteries work best around 20 to 40 degrees Celsius: heat accelerates ageing and can trigger thermal runaway, while cold raises internal resistance and sharply cuts usable capacity and charge power. The thermal management system heats and cools through liquid or air loops, heating pads or heat pumps: it rejects heat from the pack in summer, and preheats before fast charging in winter, keeping cells in the optimal window for both safety and performance.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�92735cad3ea1�body���输送一定功率时，电压越高电流越小，而线路损耗与电流平方成正比，因此高压能大幅降低发热损耗。所以电站先用变压器升压，到用户端再降压。ٽFor a given power, higher voltage means lower current, and line loss grows with the square of current—so high voltage sharply cuts heating loss. Plants step up, then step down near users.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�9360c84270d0�body��W陶瓷几乎没有塑性变形能力，裂纹尖端的应力无法通过屈服被削平，构件强度由体内或表面最严重的那个缺陷决定，是典型的最弱链环问题。缺陷尺寸随机分布，同批试样的断裂强度离散很大，需要用韦布尔分布的特征强度与形状参数 m 来表征，m 越小说明缺陷分散越严重。由此还产生尺寸效应：体积越大越可能含有大缺陷，平均强度反而下降，所以陶瓷按允许失效概率取许用应力，并靠热压致密化和精细研磨减小缺陷，而不是去『提高屈服强度』。��Ceramics have almost no plasticity to blunt crack-tip stresses, so component strength is set by the single most severe flaw present, a classic weakest-link problem. Flaw sizes are randomly distributed, so measured fracture strengths scatter widely and are characterized by a Weibull characteristic strength plus a modulus m, where a small m means highly variable flaws. That also produces a size effect: larger volumes more likely contain a large flaw, so mean strength falls with size, and ceramic design assigns allowable stress from an accepted failure probability while hot pressing and fine polishing shrink flaws, rather than trying to raise a yield point.�ans��src��`Callister 与 Rethwisch，《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》（第10版）�VCallister & Rethwisch, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�94d29f04c40e�body�ٽ不是。失速指机翼攻角过大、气流分离导致升力突然大幅丧失，飞机下坠，发动机未必停止。恢复方法是降低机头、减小攻角让气流重新贴附。��No. Stall means the wing's angle of attack is too high and flow separates, abruptly losing lift—the plane drops, but engines may still run. Recovery is to lower the nose and reduce angle to reattach flow.�ans��src��}Anderson，《Fundamentals of Aerodynamics》（第6版）；FAA《Airplane Flying Handbook》(FAA-H-8083-3C) 高空运行章�|Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.); FAA 'Airplane Flying Handbook' (FAA-H-8083-3C), high-altitude operations��id�97337e9cd77f�body���一字适合早期单槽螺钉、结构简单；十字（菲利普）头有四个导向槽，螺丝刀容易居中且受力更对称，拧时更难滑出，因此普遍更不易打滑、效率更高。��Flat heads suit simple slotted screws; the cross (Phillips) head has four guiding slots that center the driver and share force symmetrically, so it's far less likely to slip out and is more efficient.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�9a28dd618427�body���污水慢慢渗过砂石和芦苇根系，根系供氧养活微生物降解有机物，砂石和植物还能吸附氮磷。它靠自然过程运行，几乎不耗电、好维护，适合农村和小社区。��Water seeps through gravel and reed roots; the roots supply oxygen for microbes that degrade organics, while gravel and plants adsorb nitrogen and phosphorus. Relying on nature, it uses almost no power and is easy to maintain—good for villages.�ans��src��8Kadlec & Wallace，《人工湿地处理》（第3版）�0Kadlec & Wallace, 'Treatment Wetlands' (3rd ed.)��id�9b6ed09cf4ea�body�ٓ用型砂按模样做出空腔，浇入铁水冷却后破砂取件，几乎不受形状复杂度限制；精度不如切削但适合大件小批。ّSand molding forms a cavity from a pattern; poured metal cools and the sand is broken away, shapes can be complex, good for big low-volume parts.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�9c1a8272d233�body���它衡量材料在弹性范围内抵抗拉伸或压缩变形能力的大小，等于正应力与正应变的比值。模量越大，材料越『硬』、越不容易被拉长，是结构选材和设计刚度的基本参数。�It measures a material's resistance to axial deformation within the elastic range, equal to normal stress divided by normal strain. A larger modulus means a 'stiffer' material that is harder to stretch, and it is a basic parameter for material selection and stiffness design.�ans��src��qBeer 与 Johnston《材料力学》(Mechanics of Materials)；Timoshenko《材料强度》(Strength of Materials)�NBeer & Johnston, 'Mechanics of Materials'; Timoshenko, 'Strength of Materials'��id�9c58c78cc0bd�body��y混凝土抗压强但抗拉弱，普通钢筋混凝土在受拉区埋入钢筋来承担拉应力；预应力混凝土先张拉高强钢筋或钢绞线并锚固，使混凝土预先受压，受荷时截面基本不出现拉应力。莫尼耶(Monier)与埃纳比克(Hennebique)奠定了钢筋混凝土工艺，弗雷西内(Freyssinet)则在 1928 年确立了预应力混凝土。��Concrete is strong in compression but weak in tension, so ordinary reinforced concrete embeds steel bars in the tensile zone to carry the tension. Prestressed concrete tensions and anchors high-strength bars or tendons to pre-compress the concrete, so service loads leave the section essentially free of tension. Monier and Hennebique founded reinforced concrete, while Freyssinet established prestressed concrete in 1928.�ans��src��{Nilson、Darwin 与 Dolan《混凝土结构设计》(Design of Concrete Structures)；美国混凝土学会(ACI) 318 规范�^Nilson, Darwin & Dolan, 'Design of Concrete Structures'; American Concrete Institute (ACI) 318��id�9cae27bf4bdf�body���三相电由三组相位相差120度的交流组成，传输同样功率可用更细的导线，且电动机运行更平稳、起动转矩大。单相只是其中一相，适合家庭小负荷。��Three-phase power uses three AC waveforms 120° apart; it delivers the same power with thinner wires and gives motors smooth, high-starting-torque operation. Single-phase is one leg, for small home loads.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�9d0dfdb6c8d6�body�٫锂电池在过高或过低温度下容量、寿命和安全都会恶化，热管理系统把电芯温度维持在适宜区间，并均衡单体间温差以防热失控。ٴLi-ion cells lose capacity, life and safety outside a narrow temperature band, so thermal management keeps cells in range and balances cell temperatures to prevent thermal runaway.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�9e5e66aaba2a�body���它以消除一切不增值的浪费（库存、等待、过量生产等）为目标，用准时化(JIT)和自働化把问题暴露在前道工序。大野耐一据此把交付周期与质量同时大幅提升。��It targets eliminating all non-value-adding waste (inventory, waiting, overproduction) using just-in-time flow and autonomation that surfaces problems at the source. Taiichi Ohno used it to simultaneously slash lead time and raise quality.�ans��src��d大野耐一《丰田生产方式》(1978)；Womack 与 Jones《精益思想》(Lean Thinking, 1996)�OOhno, 'Toyota Production System' (1978); Womack & Jones, 'Lean Thinking' (1996)��id�9fc2c5fe0bc7�body�ي风吹动叶片像风车一样旋转，叶片连着发电机的轴，转动切割磁感线产生电流，风速越大发出的电越多。ٛWind spins the blades like a windmill, the shaft turns a generator that induces current by moving through a magnetic field, and more wind means more power.�ans��src��(Burton，《风能手册》（第2版）�(Burton, 'Wind Energy Handbook' (2nd ed.)��id�9ffcfe511113�body��_广义上盾构机也是一种TBM，但在工程习惯里两者分工不同：盾构机主要用于软土地层，通过盾壳支护土体并同步拼装管片衬砌；TBM通常指岩石掘进机，靠盘形滚刀挤压破碎岩石，多配锚杆、喷混凝土等支护。选择取决于地层：软土用盾构，硬岩用TBM，也常组合使用。��In a broad sense a shield machine is a type of TBM, but in engineering practice they differ: shields excavate soft ground while supporting the soil with a steel shield and assembling segmental linings as they advance, whereas TBMs generally mean rock-boring machines that crush hard rock with disc cutters and use rock bolts and shotcrete for support. The choice depends on the ground, shields for soft soil and TBMs for hard rock, and the two are often combined.�ans��src��CMaidl、Herrenknecht & Anheuser，《机械化盾构隧道技术》�>Maidl, Herrenknecht & Anheuser, 'Mechanised Shield Tunnelling'��id�a1732aade4bc�body��矿化利用富含钙、镁的硅酸盐或工业废渣（如钢渣、粉煤灰）与二氧化碳反应生成稳定的碳酸盐，如碳酸钙、碳酸镁。生成物化学性质稳定、无泄漏风险，可就地用于建材或回填，是实现永久封存的一条安全路径。�PMineralization reacts CO2 with calcium- or magnesium-rich silicates or industrial residues such as steel slag and fly ash to form stable carbonates like calcium and magnesium carbonate. The products are chemically stable and leak-proof, and can be used in situ as building materials or backfill, offering a safe permanent-storage route.�ans��src��%Nature Materials（碳矿化材料）�2Nature Materials (carbon mineralization materials)��id�a1f14f2bb7de�body�ٍ顶部装永久轨道的擦窗机吊下吊篮或机器人沿立面作业；高层严禁人直接悬挂乱擦，靠绳索系统保障安全。كA building maintenance unit on the roof lowers gondolas or robots along the facade; safety rope systems replace risky free hanging.�ans��src��+《玻璃幕墙工程技术规范》JGJ 102�8Technical Code of Glass Curtain Wall Engineering JGJ 102��id�a246131c2621�body���数控系统把零件程序翻译成各轴的位置指令，伺服系统带动工作台或主轴按指令运动，插补器在相邻坐标点之间实时计算中间点，使刀具走出直线、圆弧等轮廓。开环系统只发指令不检测实际位置，精度受步进电机丢步影响；闭环系统用编码器或光栅反馈实际位置并不断修正偏差，定位精度高，是精密加工的主流配置。�/A CNC system decodes the part program into axis position commands, servos drive the table or spindle accordingly, and the interpolator computes intermediate points between coordinates in real time so the tool traces lines, arcs and other contours. An open-loop system only sends commands and never checks actual position, so accuracy suffers from stepper motor lost steps; a closed-loop system uses encoders or linear scales to feed actual position back and continuously correct errors, giving high positioning accuracy and is standard in precision machining.�ans��src��-国际标准化组织（ISO 6983，G代码）�ISO 6983 (CNC G-code standard)��id�a42b87107d3d�body��功率因数 = 有功功率 / 视在功率 = cos φ，反映电能被有效利用的程度。功率因数低意味着传输相同有功功率需要更大电流，从而增加线路损耗和电压降落，因此供电公司会对低功率因数用户加收费用。�Power factor equals real power divided by apparent power, or cos φ, reflecting how effectively electric energy is used. A low power factor means larger current for the same real power, raising line losses and voltage drop, so utilities penalize low-power-factor customers.�ans��src��V电气与电子工程师协会（IEEE）IEEE Std 1459；Saadat《电力系统分析》�1IEEE Std 1459; H. Saadat, 'Power System Analysis'��id�a51af13b00f5�body���火箭靠动量守恒获得推力，不依赖任何外部介质。燃料在燃烧室内反应生成高温高压燃气，经喷管加速后高速喷出，喷出的气体带走向后的动量；根据动量守恒，火箭必然获得等大反向的动量增量，于是向前加速。推力等于每秒喷出的质量乘以排气速度，喷管做成先收敛后扩张的形状，正是为了把燃气加速到超音速、最大化排气速度。��A rocket accelerates by conserving momentum, needing no external medium. Fuel reacts in the chamber into hot high-pressure gas, which the nozzle accelerates and ejects rearward; the expelled gas carries backward momentum, and momentum conservation forces the rocket to gain an equal and opposite forward momentum. Thrust equals the mass flow rate times the exhaust velocity, and the convergent-divergent nozzle exists precisely to push the gas past the speed of sound and maximize that velocity.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�a5ee0ff2862f�body���稳定性指系统在扰动后能否回到平衡或跟踪期望，不发散。劳斯判据由特征多项式系数构造表格，无需求根即可判断闭环极点是否全在左半平面，从而判定线性系统稳定与否。�Stability means a system returns to equilibrium or tracks the setpoint after disturbance without diverging. The Routh criterion builds a table from characteristic polynomial coefficients to judge, without root-finding, whether all closed-loop poles lie in the left half-plane.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�a6dde3f73c3f�body�ٓ穹顶是三维的拱，把重量沿曲面分散到四周基座，主要承受压力，因此可以用薄壳覆盖大跨度而无需内部柱子。ٙA dome is a 3D arch that spreads weight along its curved shell to the base as compression, so a thin shell can roof a wide span without interior columns.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�a736b5fd0d71�body�ٙ飞轮是一个转动的重轮子，靠惯性把能量存起来再平稳释放，能削平发动机转速的忽快忽慢，也用于回收制动能量。ٜA flywheel is a spinning heavy wheel that stores energy in its rotation and releases it smoothly, flattening speed fluctuations and recovering brake energy.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�a812bafe9615�body�ٴ热交换器让两种流体隔着导热壁面流动而不混合，热量从高温侧传到低温侧。常见形式有管壳式、板式等，广泛用于空调、发电和化工。��A heat exchanger lets two fluids flow past a conducting wall without mixing, so heat moves from the hot side to the cold. Shell-and-tube and plate types are common in HVAC, power, and chemical plants.�ans��src��+Cengel，《传热与传质》（第5版）�*Cengel, 'Heat and Mass Transfer' (5th ed.)��id�a84d0fac0bdf�body���预应力混凝土在浇筑前或浇筑后对钢筋施加拉力，使混凝土预先受压。这样能抵消使用时的拉应力，从而减小裂缝、提高刚度并允许建造更长跨度的梁和桥梁。��In prestressed concrete, steel tendons are tensioned before or after casting so the concrete is pre-compressed. This offsets tensile stress in service, reducing cracks, increasing stiffness, and allowing longer-span beams and bridges.�ans��src��B《混凝土结构设计原理》（中国建筑工业出版社）�=Lin & Burns, Design of Prestressed Concrete Structures, Wiley��id�a92e047be9fd�body���PLC（可编程逻辑控制器）是专为工业环境设计的耐用计算机，按编写的逻辑循环扫描输入并控制输出。它广泛用于流水线、机床和楼宇设备的自动顺序控制。�A PLC (Programmable Logic Controller) is a rugged computer built for industrial settings that scans inputs and controls outputs by written logic in cycles. It is widely used for automated sequence control of production lines, machines, and building equipment.�ans��src��VIEC 61131-3（PLC）；ISO 3691-4（AGV 安全）；Groover《自动化生产系统》�zIEC 61131-3 (PLC); ISO 3691-4 (AGV safety); Groover, Automation, Production Systems, and Computer-Integrated Manufacturing��id�aaa51ecc6894�body��I传统设计受限于减材与铸造的可加工性，常需拆分多个零件再装配；DfAM 利用增材可成型任意复杂几何的特点，鼓励零件一体化、功能集成与随形冷却流道等。设计师还需考虑支撑结构最少化、悬垂角度和热变形，使设计同时从性能与可制造性出发。�Conventional design is constrained by machining and casting, often requiring parts to be split and assembled; DfAM exploits arbitrary complexity to encourage part consolidation, functional integration, and conformal cooling channels. Designers also minimize supports, respect overhang angles, and account for thermal distortion, optimizing for both performance and manufacturability.�ans��src��jGibson、Rosen & Stucker，《增材制造技术：从快速原型到直接数字化制造》（第2版）�{Gibson, Rosen & Stucker, 'Additive Manufacturing Technologies: Rapid Prototyping to Direct Digital Manufacturing' (2nd ed.)��id�aba261851ab1�body��与错误和反馈直接相关的原则包括：系统状态可见性（及时反馈）、防错（在行动前防止错误发生）、以及错误诊断与恢复（用平实语言说明问题并给出解法）。它们共同降低操作失误与挫败感。�Heuristics directly about errors and feedback include visibility of system status (timely feedback), error prevention (stop errors before they occur), and help users recognize and recover from errors (plain-language diagnosis and fix). Together they cut mistakes and frustration.�ans��src��$Nielsen Norman Group 可用性原则�)Nielsen Norman Group Usability Heuristics��id�ac60a5b94619�body�ٽ雨水花园是下凹并种有耐涝植物的浅坑，承接屋顶和路面的雨水，通过土壤渗透和植物蒸腾滞蓄径流、过滤污染物，减轻市政管网和河道压力。ٿA rain garden is a shallow planted depression that catches roof and street runoff, letting soil infiltrate and plants transpire it while filtering pollutants, easing storm sewers and streams.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�ad749f81deb2�body��#氢气在阳极催化分解为质子和电子，质子穿过膜到达阴极，电子则经外电路做功；阴极处质子、电子与氧气结合生成水。整个过程依赖膜的水管理、气体扩散与催化剂活性，任何一侧的水淹或干涸都会显著降低输出功率。�pAt the anode hydrogen splits into protons and electrons; protons cross the membrane to the cathode while electrons do work through the external circuit; at the cathode protons, electrons, and oxygen combine into water. The process depends on membrane water management, gas diffusion, and catalyst activity, and flooding or drying on either side sharply reduces output.�ans��src��>Journal of The Electrochemical Society（燃料电池输运）�<Journal of The Electrochemical Society (fuel cell transport)��id�aec30e37ff04�body���攻角是机翼弦线与来流的夹角，适当增大攻角能提升升力。但超过临界值后，上表面气流分离、湍流剧增，升力骤降而阻力猛升，飞机便失速下坠。��Angle of attack is the angle between the wing chord and the airflow; moderate increase raises lift. Past a critical value the upper flow separates into turbulence, lift collapses and drag spikes, so the aircraft stalls.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�b053c2ff0646�body���抽水蓄能利用电网低谷电能把水抽到上库，高峰时放水发电，实现大规模储能。它承担调峰、调频、调相、事故备用和黑启动等多种功能，是目前最成熟的吉瓦级储能方式。�Pumped storage uses off-peak electricity to pump water uphill and generates on demand, enabling large-scale storage. It provides peak shaving, frequency and phase regulation, emergency reserve, and black-start capability, and is the most mature gigawatt-scale storage.�ans��src��3《电力系统分析》（中国电力出版社）�"Power System Analysis, McGraw-Hill��id�b0fd63f43ec1�body���正向运动学由关节角求末端位姿，通过关节变换链直接计算；逆运动学由期望末端位姿反求各关节角，通常多解或无解，是轨迹规划的核心难点。��Forward kinematics computes end-effector pose from joint angles via the link transformation chain; inverse kinematics finds joint angles for a desired pose, often with multiple or no solutions, and is the core difficulty in trajectory planning.�ans��src��-《机器人学》（清华大学出版社）�Introduction to Robotics, Craig��id�b1e68f8ccc1b�body�ٺ智能交通系统用传感、通信和计算机技术优化道路、车辆和行人的协同，缓解拥堵和提升安全。例子包括自适应信号、电子收费和实时导航。��An Intelligent Transportation System uses sensing, communication, and computing to coordinate roads, vehicles, and people, easing congestion and improving safety. Examples include adaptive signals, electronic tolling, and real-time navigation.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�b3b18c0c5fe4�body���机械臂靠力/力矩传感器做闭环控制。六维力传感器装在腕部，同时测量三个方向的力和绕三个轴的力矩；指尖或夹爪上的触觉传感器则感知接触压强的分布。控制回路实时对比目标力与实际值，一旦超过阈值立即减小夹紧力。这就是为什么灵巧手能轻轻捏起鸡蛋，精密装配也能在接触瞬间感知碰撞而不损伤零件。��A robot arm controls grasp force through closed-loop sensing. A six-axis force/torque sensor at the wrist measures forces in three axes and torques about three axes, while tactile sensors on the fingers map the distribution of contact pressure. The control loop compares the desired and actual force continuously and eases off the instant it exceeds the threshold. That is how a dexterous hand can gently pick up an egg, and how precision assembly can sense contact without damaging parts.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�b3b45a490ab0�body���BIM是在三维数字模型上集成几何、材料、工期与成本等信息的协同平台，让设计、施工与运维各方共享同一数据源，减少冲突、优化进度并降低出错率。ٷBIM is a collaborative 3D model that embeds geometry, materials, schedule, and cost, giving design, construction, and operation teams one shared data source to cut clashes and errors.�ans��src��BEastman、Teicholz、Sacks & Liston，《BIM手册》（第3版）�;Eastman, Teicholz, Sacks & Liston, 'BIM Handbook' (3rd ed.)��id�b5b5ef98f1c1�body���沉降是地基土在建筑物荷载作用下被压缩而产生的向下位移。工程上通过加固地基、打桩、预压排水或选用合适基础形式来控制沉降，避免建筑开裂。��Settlement is the downward movement of ground caused by compression of soil under a building's load. Engineers control it by soil improvement, piling, preloading drainage, or choosing suitable foundation types to avoid cracking.�ans��src��8Das《土力学与基础工程》；ACI/API 桩基规范�JDas, Principles of Geotechnical Engineering; ACI/API pile foundation codes��id�b614a453bb3f�body���混凝土抗压能力很强但抗拉很弱，钢筋抗拉能力强。把钢筋布置在构件受拉区，由它承担拉应力，混凝土承担压应力，二者配合大幅提高了构件的承载能力。��Concrete is strong in compression but weak in tension, while steel is strong in tension. Placing rebar in the tension zone lets steel carry the pull and concrete the push, greatly boosting capacity.�ans��src��B《混凝土结构设计原理》（中国建筑工业出版社）�=Lin & Burns, Design of Prestressed Concrete Structures, Wiley��id�b6cd2c174c1f�body���预应力是在浇筑后给混凝土施加预先的压应力，常用张拉高强钢绞线实现。它抵消了使用时的部分拉应力，延迟裂缝出现，因而梁能做得更细长、跨越更大跨度。ٺPrestress applies a pre-compression—usually by tensioning high-strength steel strands—that offsets future tensile stress and delays cracking, so beams can be slimmer and span longer.�ans��src��?Lin & Burns，《预应力混凝土结构设计》（第3版）�BLin & Burns, 'Design of Prestressed Concrete Structures' (3rd ed.)��id�b7b9193fe892�body���材料强度有波动、载荷有冲击与超载、加工有误差，有限元算出的应力也只是模型值。安全系数等于失效强度除以许用应力，通常取1.5到4，把这些不确定性全部包进去。脆性材料在静载下取高系数，塑性材料可稍低，疲劳工况还要再乘修正系数。代价是更重、更费料，所以现代设计正越来越多用概率可靠度方法精细权衡。�Material strength varies, loads surge and shock, manufacturing has tolerances, and even a finite-element stress is only a model value. The safety factor equals failure strength divided by allowable stress, typically 1.5 to 4, wrapping up all that uncertainty. Brittle materials under static load take high factors, ductile ones can take lower, and fatigue adds further corrections. The price is more weight and material, which is why modern design increasingly uses probabilistic reliability methods to balance cost and safety.�ans��src��《机械设计基础》�Fundamentals of Machine Design��id�b7be1a093bc2�body���CFRP 以碳纤维为增强相、聚合物为基体，具有极高的比强度和比刚度、耐腐蚀、疲劳性能好。局限在于成本高、呈各向异性且较脆、抗冲击损伤容限低、回收困难。�␀CFRP uses carbon fibers in a polymer matrix, giving very high specific strength and stiffness, corrosion resistance, and good fatigue behavior. Limitations are high cost, anisotropy and brittleness, low impact damage tolerance, and difficulty of recycling.�ans��src��M矿物金属与材料学会（TMS）；Daniel & Ishai《复合材料工程》�nThe Minerals, Metals & Materials Society (TMS); Daniel & Ishai, 'Engineering Mechanics of Composite Materials'��id�b85bb2daf0b5�body�ٱ桁架由许多细长杆件在节点铰接组成，荷载主要通过杆件轴向受拉或受压来传递。它重量轻、刚度大，常用于屋顶、塔架和大跨桥梁。��A truss is made of slender members pinned at joints, carrying loads mainly through axial tension or compression in the bars. Light and stiff, it is used in roofs, towers, and long-span bridges.�ans��src��L《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012,中国建筑工业出版社,2012�hLoad Code for the Design of Building Structures GB 50009-2012, China Architecture & Building Press, 2012��id�b9c3d49d81c1�body���CT用X射线管围绕人体旋转扫描，对面的探测器接收穿过身体后衰减的射线，从数百上千个角度采集投影数据。计算机用滤波反投影或迭代重建算法，从这些投影解算出每个体素的X射线衰减系数，重建出断层图像。不同组织因密度差异衰减不同：骨最亮、软组织居中、空气最暗。与普通X光片把前后组织叠成阴影不同，CT能分辨同一层面的空间关系。�9A CT scanner spins an X-ray tube around the patient while detectors on the far side capture the attenuated beam, gathering projections from hundreds or thousands of angles. A computer reconstructs each voxel's X-ray attenuation coefficient from those projections using filtered back-projection or iterative reconstruction, producing tomographic slices. Tissues differ in attenuation by density: bone is brightest, soft tissue in between, and air darkest. Unlike a plain X-ray, which stacks tissues into overlapping shadows, CT resolves structures within a single slice.�ans��src��^Kak & Slaney《CT 原理》；Haacke 等《MRI 原理》；超声成像（Hendee & Ritenour）هKak & Slaney, Principles of Computerized Tomographic Imaging; Haacke et al., Magnetic Resonance Imaging; ultrasound (Hendee & Ritenour)��id�b9ddf61428bf�body�ٜ先加药让泥沙和杂质凝结沉淀，再经过沙滤去掉细小颗粒，最后用氯或紫外线杀菌，达标后才通过水管送到各家各户。٘Chemicals make suspended dirt clump and settle, sand filters catch fine particles, then chlorine or UV kills germs before the safe water flows to homes.�ans��src��?Crittenden 等，《水处理：原理与设计》（第3版）�ECrittenden et al., 'Water Treatment: Principles and Design' (3rd ed.)��id�bb3d167482e9�body���典型架构包括感知层、网络层、平台层和应用层。感知层用传感器、RFID、摄像头等采集物理世界的数据；网络层通过NB-IoT、LoRa、WiFi、5G等把数据传输到云端或边缘；平台层负责设备管理、数据存储与处理、规则引擎和消息路由；应用层面向智能家居、工业监控等具体业务，把数据转化为服务和决策。层与层之间通过MQTT、CoAP等协议衔接。��A typical IoT stack has perception, network, platform and application layers. The perception layer collects data with sensors, RFID and cameras; the network layer carries it over NB-IoT, LoRa, Wi-Fi or 5G to the cloud or edge; the platform layer handles device management, storage, analytics, rule engines and message routing; and the application layer turns the data into services and decisions such as smart home or industrial monitoring. Layers are linked by protocols such as MQTT and CoAP.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bbadd4a96cc3�body��机翼上表面弯曲、流线更密、流速更快、压强更低，下表面压强相对更高，形成向上的压力差；同时气流被向下偏转，按动量守恒也产生向上的反作用。伯努利与牛顿两种解释其实是同一件事的两面。�6The curved upper surface makes flow faster and lower-pressure while the lower surface stays higher-pressure, creating an upward pressure difference; at the same time air is deflected downward, giving an upward reaction by momentum conservation. Bernoulli and Newton describe the same phenomenon from two sides.�ans��src��tAnderson《空气动力学基础》(Fundamentals of Aerodynamics)；美国 NASA Glenn 研究中心《升力入门》�hAnderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics'; NASA Glenn Research Center, 'Beginner's Guide to Aerodynamics'��id�bbd54f608c6d�body���文丘里管依据连续性方程与伯努利方程，在渐缩段加速、喉部取压差推算流量。其流道平缓、无锐边，流动分离与湍流损失小，永久压损远低于突然收缩的孔板。�A Venturi meter applies continuity and Bernoulli: the throat accelerates flow and the pressure drop infers flow rate. Its smooth converging-diverging profile causes little separation or turbulence loss, so permanent pressure loss is far lower than a sharp-edged orifice plate.�ans��src��BASME MFC-7M《Measurement of Gas Flow by Means of Venturi Tubes》�=ASME MFC-7M Measurement of Gas Flow by Means of Venturi Tubes��id�bc3949106638�body�ٜ焊接用高温（电弧、火焰或激光）把金属接头熔化，有时加焊料，冷却后两边长成一体，比用螺丝钉更牢固、不漏气。٭Welding uses intense heat from an arc, flame or laser to melt the joint, sometimes with filler, so the pieces fuse into one solid mass as they cool, stronger and leak-tight.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�be4d9e4a3f5f�body���那层安全壳是纵深防御的最后一道实体屏障，由约一米厚的预应力钢筋混凝土外加钢制气密内衬构成。它的任务很明确：即使冷却剂管路破裂甚至堆芯熔毁，也能把高温高压的放射性蒸汽锁在内部，防止放射性物质泄漏到环境中。设计上要承受事故工况的压强与温度，还要经受地震、飞机撞击等极端事件的考验。燃料包壳、反应堆压力容器与安全壳构成三道屏障。�The containment is the final physical barrier in defense-in-depth: roughly a meter of prestressed concrete with a steel, gas-tight liner inside. Its job is unambiguous — even if a coolant pipe breaks or the core melts, it traps the hot, high-pressure, radioactive steam inside and prevents release to the environment. It must survive design-basis-accident pressure and temperature as well as extreme events like earthquakes or aircraft impact. Fuel cladding, the reactor pressure vessel, and the containment form three barriers.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�beeccdafe740�body��^Moore 在 1965 年观察到集成电路上的元件数大约每年翻一番，1975 年他把节奏修正为约每两年翻一番，这一趋势长期指引了芯片性能与成本走势。进入纳米尺度后受物理极限与光刻成本制约，密度增速明显放缓，产业转向多核、专用加速器和先进封装来延续性能提升。��Moore observed in 1965 that the number of components on an integrated circuit roughly doubled every year, and in 1975 he revised the pace to about every two years; the trend long guided chip performance and cost. At nanometer scales, physical limits and lithography costs have clearly slowed density scaling, so the industry now leans on multicore designs, specialized accelerators, and advanced packaging.�ans��src��XMoore《让电路元件更多》(Electronics, 1965)；英特尔(Intel)《摩尔定律》�dMoore, 'Cramming more components onto integrated circuits' (Electronics, 1965); Intel, 'Moore's Law'��id�c0c337d174a5�body���PID控制器根据误差的比例、积分和微分三项来调节输出，使系统快速且稳定地达到目标。机器人用它来控制速度、位置和姿态，是工业控制中最常见的算法。�A PID controller adjusts output from the proportional, integral, and derivative terms of an error, driving a system to its target quickly and steadily. Robots use it to control speed, position, and attitude, making it the most common industrial control algorithm.�ans��src��EK. Ogata,《现代控制工程》第5版,Pearson,2010,PID控制章节�QK. Ogata, Modern Control Engineering, 5th ed., Pearson, 2010, PID control chapter��id�c1634c414e9f�body���储能主要通过一次调频（秒级自动响应功率缺额）和二次调频（AGC 自动发电控制，分钟级）参与调频。电池储能响应快、精度高，可替代部分传统机组调频，降低煤耗与设备磨损。�Storage participates mainly through primary frequency regulation (sub-second automatic response to power imbalance) and secondary regulation (AGC, minute-scale). Battery storage responds fast and accurately, substituting some fossil units and reducing fuel use and wear.�ans��src�ٵOudalov、Chartouni 与 Ohler,《Optimizing a Battery Energy Storage System for Primary Frequency Control》,IEEE Transactions on Power Systems,2007 (DOI: 10.1109/tpwrs.2007.901459)ٰOudalov, Chartouni & Ohler, 'Optimizing a Battery Energy Storage System for Primary Frequency Control', IEEE Transactions on Power Systems, 2007, DOI: 10.1109/tpwrs.2007.901459��id�c2bf8b5a8efd�body���在孔、缺口、尖角等几何突变处，局部应力会远高于平均应力，称为应力集中，易成为裂纹起点。工程上用圆角过渡、避免尖角、开卸荷槽等来缓和。��At holes, notches, or sharp corners, local stress far exceeds the average—this is stress concentration, a common crack origin. Designers ease it with fillets, avoiding sharp angles, and relief grooves.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�c358dc37a392�body�پ碳纤维等复合材料比强度高、抗疲劳、耐腐蚀且可整体成形，能显著减轻机重、降低油耗并减少金属疲劳问题，波音787和空客A350机身大量采用。ټCarbon composites are light, fatigue- and corrosion-resistant, and can be molded in large pieces, cutting weight and fuel burn and avoiding metal fatigue—used widely on the 787 and A350.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�c7017361d198�body���热塑性塑料受热软化、可反复熔融重塑（如聚乙烯）；热固性塑料一次固化后交联成网，再加热不熔融只会分解（如环氧树脂）。这决定了它们的加工与回收方式。��Thermoplastics soften when heated and can be remolded (like polyethylene); thermosets cross-link into a network after one cure and won't melt again, only decompose (like epoxy). This dictates processing and recycling.�ans��src��3美国材料与试验协会（ASTM International）�ASTM International��id�c74a67a60ee2�body���膜分离用选择性半透膜让某些分子通过、挡住其他分子。反渗透是在高于渗透压的压力下把水压过膜，截留盐分得到淡水，广泛用于海水淡化和纯水制备。��Membrane separation uses a selective barrier that passes some molecules and blocks others. Reverse osmosis pushes water through a membrane against osmotic pressure, rejecting salt to make fresh or pure water.�ans��src��:ASHRAE Handbook—Fundamentals,ASHRAE,Atlanta 年度更新�8ASHRAE Handbook - Fundamentals, Atlanta, recent editions��id�c74f808cf393�body�ِ钢桥自重轻、可在工厂预制后现场快速吊装，对桥下交通影响小；混凝土更重、现场支模慢，适合跨度小处。�zSteel is light and prefabricated for quick lifting with little traffic disruption; concrete is heavier and slower to cast.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�c8e357969550�body��z当混合物沸点接近、易形成共沸物或组分热敏性高时，蒸馏难以或不宜实现分离，此时可以用萃取：选择对目标组分有较强亲和力的溶剂，使溶质在两液相间分配，从而从原溶液中转移出去。溶剂与料液必须高度互不相溶，才能在混合后分层形成两相，否则无法实现相分离和有效传质。��Extraction is chosen when components have close boiling points, form azeotropes, or are heat-sensitive and cannot be distilled economically. A solvent with strong affinity for the target solute is chosen so the solute distributes between two liquid phases and is removed from the feed. The solvent must be highly immiscible with the feed so the mixture separates into two clear phases, which is essential for mass transfer and phase separation.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006